window.AKK_APOCALYPSE_STOCKPILING_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_APOCALYPSE_STOCKPILING_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":201,"title":"Chapter 201: Dock Fishman Zombie","paragraphs":["\"But it smells so good, I really want to eat.\"","Mo Xing couldn't help but swallow.","\"Have this first.\"","Mo Chun took out a piece of bread.","\"When we get back, we'll have something good to eat.\"","Mo Xing reluctantly accepted it, opened the wrapper, and tried to take a bite.","Cold and hard, it really wasn't tasty...","He looked up towards Yun Xiaoxiao's direction, his eyes showing a hint of envy.","He took another bite.","Really... it was getting worse with each bite.","Finally, he simply gave up eating.","Smelling the aroma of meat while eating this barely palatable bread was like chewing on wax.","\"It's fixed, let's hurry on our way.\"","Fortunately, the car was quickly repaired.","The group got back into the car and continued driving forward.","When passing by Yun Xiaoxiao's spot, the siblings simultaneously glanced at the campfire area.","Then, their eyes widened in surprise at the same time.","\"Sister, there's a little girl sitting there, not a bad person.","She has a big tiger and...\"","\"A giant scorpion.\"","\"Yes, a giant scorpion. Sister, can scorpions really get that big?\"","\"No.\"","\"Wow, she's brave enough to grill meat alone in this pitch-black suburb, with two fierce beasts beside her. That's so cool!\"","Mo Xing tried hard to stick his head out the window, wanting to see more.","But the car sped away, not giving him much time to look.","Yun Xiaoxiao also noticed the few cars passing by on the highway.","But she didn't care; having eaten her fill, she just wanted to get some good sleep.","She extinguished the fire and returned to her space with her little darling and big beauty.","She collapsed onto her soft mattress and fell into a deep sleep.","The next day when she woke up, she stretched and looked eastward.","\"Let's go, time to depart.\"","The plane slowly ascended, flying towards the eastern sea.","Along the way, when encountering large factories, she would still stop briefly to collect supplies from inside.","Then, she continued heading east.","To save time, sometimes she even traveled at night.","One day, from far away, she saw a large expanse of blue appearing in the distance.","The sea!","Finally here!","She guided the plane to land at the harbor dock.","But as soon as she opened the plane door, an overwhelming stench hit her nose like a storm.","She quickly covered her nose with her hand.","Heavens, why was it so smelly!","When her gaze fell on the rotting fish carcasses piled in the fishing nets nearby, she suddenly understood.","This was the dock, which besides being a transit point for supplies, was also a huge seafood market.","Most people here made their living by fishing.","So both the variety and quantity of fish here were extremely vast.","After the apocalypse, with humans either fleeing or turning into zombies,","The freshly caught seafood was left unattended, naturally rotting and stinking after being exposed to sun and rain.","Though understandable, the stench was simply unbearable.","Yun Xiaoxiao took out several masks from her space.","She put them all on, layer after layer, and only then felt slightly better.","But the stench still crept through the tiny gaps in the masks.","The smell made her question her life choices.","She decided to finish this quickly!","So, she stored the helicopter in her space and darted towards a large container.","Just as she landed, a Fishman Zombie wearing a fisherman's hat, short sleeves, and loose shorts emerged from behind the container.","Its already dark skin, combined with long-term 'malnutrition' after becoming a zombie, now made it look like it had been dug out from a pile of mummies.","\"Roar!\"","As soon as it roared, Yun Xiaoxiao thrust her red-tasseled spear forward.","After dealing with this one, another zombie in dock worker's clothes lunged at her.","Yun Xiaoxiao showed no mercy, swiftly sending it on its way.","After dispatching several nearby zombies, Yun Xiaoxiao transformed her red-tasseled spear into a large cleaver and chopped open the container's lock.","\"Clank!\"","The lock fell to the ground, and Yun Xiaoxiao opened the door.","A thick wave of stench hit her.","Yun Xiaoxiao: !!","She quickly closed the door and ran to another container.","Fortunately, this container was filled with normal items.","Otherwise, she would have really questioned her life choices.","With the first experience under her belt, her mindset became much more stable afterward.","When encountering more containers reeking of stench, she could close them without changing expression.","Perhaps this is what people call getting used to something.","Think about it, sometimes this habit can be quite scary.","Something that was initially hard to accept becomes gradually tolerable after staying in that environment long enough.","So people really shouldn't stay in a comfortable environment for too long, or they'll gradually lose their desire to strive for better.","While Yun Xiaoxiao was busy searching through containers and collecting supplies, on a large fishing boat by the shore, the pile of rotting, stinking fish suddenly began to move.","Something seemed to be emerging from within.","Countless stinking fish carcasses slid down in waves.","Then, a sticky zombie emerged from the fish pile.","Its entire body was covered in yellowish slime.","Most striking were the scales covering its face, neck, and exposed hands and feet.","It stood up, raised its arms, and let out a long roar toward the sky.","Then, its gaze locked onto Yun Xiaoxiao, who was busy opening containers in the distance.","It roared wildly again, then began walking toward the shore step by step.","With each step, those disgusting slime left distinct footprints on the ground through its feet.","Yun Xiaoxiao had just finished storing everything from one container into her space and was about to leave when she noticed an unknown liquid dripping from above the container entrance.","She frowned.","That stuff wasn't there when she entered.","Her eyes narrowed, and she instantly vanished from her spot.","When she reappeared, she was on top of the container.","As soon as she appeared, the Fishman Zombie turned around and glared at her menacingly.","Yun Xiaoxiao's brows furrowed - it was actually a level five initial-stage zombie!","Her strongest power, the wood system, was only at level four peak!","While she was frowning, the Fishman Zombie had already roared and lunged at her.","Its speed was extremely fast!","Yun Xiaoxiao immediately became serious.","She couldn't afford even the slightest carelessness.","Her large eyes now burned with intense fighting spirit.","She quickly responded to the Fishman Zombie's attacks, trying to counter-attack, but found that not only was this Fishman Zombie quick to dodge, its scales were both slippery and hard, making it difficult to pierce through.","Most seriously, the slime on its body had corrosive properties!","Every time her vines shot out, as soon as they touched its body, the vine tips would mysteriously rot away.","If she hadn't cut off the vines quickly enough, that corrosive energy would have surely invaded her body rapidly."]},{"number":202,"title":"Chapter 202: Yun Xiaoxiao Pulls Carrots","paragraphs":["Yun Xiaoxiao's eyes revealed an unprecedented seriousness.","She was like a patient hunter, dodging the fishman zombie's attacks with quick movements, and striking fiercely when the opportunity arose.","After several intense battles, she managed to defeat it despite being one rank lower.","After digging out the green crystal core, Yun Xiaoxiao slowly exhaled.","She took out a bottle of evolution fluid and drank it to replenish her lost energy.","Her consumption during the battle was significant.","If not for repeatedly entering her space to take evolution fluid and spiritual spring water to replenish her strength, she might not have won so easily.","After tossing the crystal core into her space, she continued to rummage through the shipping containers.","She flitted around like a diligent little bee, flying from one place to another.","Perhaps due to the previous rainstorm, the dock looked quite dilapidated everywhere.","Some of the containers by the shore had been flooded, and the supplies inside were unusable.","Yun Xiaoxiao collected containers that were a bit inland.","As she rested on a container, on a small hill near the dock, someone quietly hid in the grass, looking at her through binoculars.","\"Look, there's a child over there!\"","The girl holding the binoculars exclaimed.","The woman next to her frowned, \"Let me see.\"","The girl quickly handed the binoculars to the woman beside her.","She raised the binoculars and her eyebrows furrowed even deeper.","\"Indeed.\"","\"Director, it's too dangerous for her to be there alone, should we go down and save her?\"","\"Yes, take a few more people.\"","As Yun Xiaoxiao was about to replace her dirty mask, she suddenly saw several figures stealthily moving among the vehicles and boats, heading in her direction.","Her narrow eyes observed calmly, showing no excessive reaction.","\"Little girl, come down quickly, it's dangerous here, we'll take you away.\"","When they got closer, a quiet-looking short-haired girl spoke to her in a low voice.","While speaking, she also kept an eye on the surroundings, as if afraid that zombies might suddenly emerge from somewhere.","Seeing that Yun Xiaoxiao didn't move, the girl became a bit anxious.","\"Little girl, don't be afraid, we are teachers from the orphanage on the hill, there are many children your age there, and we have food, you won't go hungry.","Don't stay here, we just saw a large number of zombies climbing out of the sea.","They are heading this way right now.\"","The girl spoke urgently in a low voice.","Seeing that her words were sincere, Yun Xiaoxiao stood up and looked behind her.","Sure enough, not far away on the coastline, many zombies were climbing ashore from the sea.","Probably zombies that were carried into the sea by the previous tidal surge.","Now that the tide had receded, those zombies were coming ashore again.","Yun Xiaoxiao frowned and then jumped down from the container.","\"Let's go, it's not safe here.\"","Seeing that Yun Xiaoxiao had finally come down, Tang Lu breathed a sigh of relief.","She signaled to her companions, and they quickly retreated along the route they had come from, heading towards the hill.","The hill here was barren, with only mud and stones.","Following the path along the hillside, they reached the top of the hill.","Unexpectedly, the top of the hill was a different scene.","The previously barren hill was now covered with lush grass.","Not far away, there was a wide lawn and an orphanage.","A four-story building shaped like a 'mountain' with a large courtyard.","At the front gate of the building, the archway was inscribed with the words 'Blue Sea Orphanage'.","Before Yun Xiaoxiao could enter, she saw many children standing in the courtyard.","From infants in swaddling clothes to children aged three or four, and even eight or nine years old.","They curiously peeked at her.","\"Let me introduce, this is our new friend, called...\"","Tang Lu was about to introduce Yun Xiaoxiao's name when she realized she didn't know it.","Before she could ask, Yun Xiaoxiao directly said, \"Yun Xiaoxiao.\"","\"Yes, Yun Xiaoxiao, a very nice name, you all have to get along well with her, don't bully her just because she's young, okay?\"","Tang Lu spoke gently to the other children, showing her teacherly demeanor.","Yun Xiaoxiao touched her nose, wanting to say that she wouldn't stay.","But she didn't get the chance.","As soon as Tang Lu finished speaking, several children surrounded her.","They introduced themselves to her in a lively chatter.","\"Hello, I'm Huanhuan.\"","\"I'm Tiantian.\"","\"And me, I'm Yinuo, we'll be good friends from now on, don't be afraid, the director and Teacher Tang are very nice.\"","\"...\"","Yun Xiaoxiao was a bit surprised by everyone's enthusiasm and genuine acceptance of her, wanting to be friends with her.","After all, in her previous life in the western base, she had encountered people who had escaped from orphanages.","Each of them was not easy to deal with, very adept at putting on a show.","At that time, she was truly five years old.","Once, those children stole biscuits from a neighbor and framed her for it.","If not for Lu Chen arriving in time, she might have been skinned alive by that man.","After being reprimanded by Lu Chen, those children didn't dare to treat her badly in front of him, but they always spoke sarcastically.","They formed cliques to isolate her, not allowing other children to play with her.","So she never had friends her age.","The children in this orphanage still retained their innocent nature, Yun Xiaoxiao guessed, probably due to the education of the director and teachers here.","So sometimes one shouldn't judge people or things by their preconceived notions, as reality can be biased due to certain reasons.","Although she couldn't respond to others' kindness with the innocence of a real five-year-old,","she also wouldn't coldly push people away.","So, she greeted everyone in a friendly manner.","Entering the orphanage, she found that besides the orphans, there were also some survivors.","The courtyard was filled with fresh vegetables.","Even behind the courtyard, there was a fishpond surrounded by a fence, filled with many fish.","It could be said that the place was almost self-sufficient.","Everyone was busy with their own tasks.","Even the children were helping out.","\"Xiaoxiao, why don't you try pulling some radishes?\"","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao standing alone, Tang Lu smiled and waved at her.","Probably wanting her to join in and not feel lonely.","The other children pulling radishes also enthusiastically called out to her, \"Yes, pulling radishes is fun.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao didn't expect to start working as soon as she arrived.","Seeing everyone's smiling faces inviting her, she found it hard to refuse.","So, she walked over and tried to pull one.","Due to not controlling her strength, the radish came out, but she... fell on her bottom.","\"Hahaha...\"","A burst of laughter immediately followed.","Yun Xiaoxiao: ...","She knew everyone wasn't laughing at her, but she still felt a bit embarrassed..."]},{"number":203,"title":"Chapter 203: Home Extortion","paragraphs":["Seeing this, Tang Lu hurried over to help her up.","However, Yun Xiaoxiao stood up by herself first.","\"I'm fine,\" she said, trying to maintain her composure.","Tang Lu smiled, \"You're very brave.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao coughed lightly, feeling a bit embarrassed.","This was the first time anyone had praised her like this.","Tang Lu didn't ask Yun Xiaoxiao why she was at the dock below the mountain, nor did she ask about her family.","For someone so young to survive, she must have had some exceptional qualities.","She also didn't want to probe into the child's wounds.","Moreover, she noticed that this child's eyes were different from other children's.","More composed, somewhat... unsuitable for her age.","Perhaps this was why she managed to survive alone in this apocalyptic world.","\"This clothing is quite new, put it on. The weather's getting cold quickly these days, don't catch a cold,\" Tang Lu brought out a jacket from the house.","It was bright with red and green colors.","Yun Xiaoxiao's face showed clear rejection, \"Actually, I'm not that cold.\"","Since the heavy rain, each day had been colder than the last.","The temperature was dropping particularly fast.","It was beginning to feel like early winter.","Earlier at the dock, she had been killing zombies and searching through containers, so she had taken off her outer layer for easier movement.","She hadn't thought about putting it back on afterward.","Tang Lu probably saw how thinly she was dressed and worried she might be cold, which was why she offered her the jacket.","However...","The floral pattern really wasn't to her taste.","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao's expression, Tang Lu understood what was going on.","As an orphanage teacher, although she hadn't been there long, she had studied psychology in college and could read people's micro-expressions to know what they were thinking.","She smiled reassuringly, \"The color might not be pretty, but it's very warm. Other children wear them too, don't worry, no one will laugh at you.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao: ...It wasn't about being laughed at, she simply didn't like it.","In the end, she reluctantly put on the floral-patterned padded jacket.","She had no choice. While she could face bad people with a cold expression, even kill them without blinking, she couldn't coldly reject people who were kind to her.","After all, it was just wearing clothes, not a big deal.","After spending some time with everyone, Yun Xiaoxiao learned from their conversations that the orphanage had gone through major upheaval after the apocalypse.","Originally, there had been over a hundred orphans in the institution.","But due to the zombie virus outbreak, many orphans were infected.","Some volunteers and teachers hadn't been spared either.","Fortunately, Director Mom had made decisive actions at the time, which allowed twenty-one orphans, three teachers, and two volunteers to survive.","However, they couldn't bring themselves to kill their once lovely children and former colleagues and friends.","So they dug a large pit not far from the orphanage and lured them all into it.","Hearing this, Yun Xiaoxiao frowned.","Keeping zombies nearby?","That was extremely dangerous behavior!","Those zombies weren't few in number, and if any of them mutated and devoured the others, gaining tremendous power, they could potentially climb out of the pit.","When that happened, the unprepared people in the orphanage would face disaster!","Just as she was about to bring this up, a car horn suddenly sounded at the entrance.","\"It's them!\"","\"They're back!\"","\"What should we do, Teacher Tang?\"","Hearing the sounds from outside, everyone stood up straight and looked toward the entrance.","Their expressions all became serious without exception, showing both anger and fear.","Director Mom also came out of the building.","She was in her fifties, and while time had left its marks on her face, it hadn't taken away her inherent grace.","Her kind face showed great dignity.","At this moment, her brows were tightly knitted as she strode toward the entrance.","Tang Lu and others followed.","The orphanage children huddled together, their eyes filled with fear.","\"What's happening?\" Yun Xiaoxiao asked curiously, seeing everyone's defensive posture.","The little girl called Tian Tian whispered, \"The bad guys are here.\"","\"Bad guys?\" Yun Xiaoxiao frowned.","\"Yes, they're really awful. Last time they came, they took lots of our vegetables and even took away the chickens and ducks we were raising,\" Tian Tian said.","After she finished, Huanhuan added, \"And they said they'd come back after a while, telling Director Mom to prepare what they wanted. If we can't hand over the goods, they'll catch us and cook us into soup.\"","As Huanhuan spoke, her whole body trembled.","Not just her, but all the other children were shaking as well.","\"So you just submit to them?\" Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow, watching several people carrying out two large baskets of goods.","It was obvious they were preparing to hand everything over.","A middle-aged woman nearby sighed.","\"What choice do we have if we don't submit?","Those people are ruthless and have weapons.","We're just women, children, and the elderly. Growing vegetables and raising animals is one thing, but if we tried to fight them, we'd probably be knocked down before we could even make a move.","Even if we wanted to escape, where could such a large group go?","The outside world is full of flesh-eating monsters. We might get torn apart by those creatures as soon as we leave this mountain.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao knew she was speaking the truth.","The orphanage was mostly filled with children and women, and though it was hard to admit, they were indeed a vulnerable group in this post-apocalyptic world.","Although there were some men here, they were clearly honest, simple folks who wouldn't stand a chance fighting against street thugs.","However...","\"If you don't resist, you'll have to hand over the fruits of your hard work, and over time, their demands might grow bigger. What will you do then?\"","\"Ah, in these times, who can predict the future? We can only take it one step at a time. At least everyone's still alive this way.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao narrowed her eyes.","She knew it wasn't reasonable to impose her own views on others.","This was their chosen way of life.","While she didn't agree with it, she couldn't say much more.","Meanwhile, Director Mom and the others had opened the main gate.","A pickup truck and an SUV were parked outside.","A group of men stood by the vehicles.","They all looked like troublemakers.","One was picking his teeth, another was smoking.","Perhaps due to the scarcity of cigarettes, three men were sharing a single cigarette, passing it between them.","\"Did you prepare what we asked for?\" asked their leader gruffly, a man wearing a leather jacket with a gold tooth.","Director Mom pointed at the two large baskets that had been brought out.","She seemed unwilling to say a single extra word."]},{"number":204,"title":"Chapter 204: Things Are Not Taken as Compensation","paragraphs":["Gold Tooth Man gave her a displeased look before walking toward the two baskets.","He inspected what was inside.","Then, his face showed clear dissatisfaction.","\"Didn't I say I wanted three fat chickens? Why is there only one scrawny little thing!\"","Director Mom maintained a calm expression, \"Last time you took all the mature chickens and ducks from the orphanage. What's left are only young chicks, and this one is actually among the bigger ones.\"","Gold Tooth Man cast a suspicious sidelong glance at Director Mom.","Seeing her expression remain unchanged, Gold Tooth Man snorted and swept his gaze across the courtyard.","Then, his attention focused on a thirteen-year-old girl standing next to Yun Xiaoxiao.","She was one of the older orphans.","Though young, she was quite pretty and already showing signs of becoming a beauty.","\"Since you can't provide the chickens, then let her come with us instead.\"","Gold Tooth Man broke into a lecherous smile.","His rat-like eyes stared brazenly at the girl, examining her without restraint.","The girl trembled in fear but tried to stay composed, saying firmly despite her shaking voice:","\"I won't go with you!\"","\"Heh, quite spirited for a little girl. That makes it... even more fun.\"","Gold Tooth Man signaled to his men behind him.","\"What are you standing around for? Take her!\"","As soon as he finished speaking, two men carrying weapons started moving forward menacingly.","\"We've given you everything you asked for, what do you think you're doing?!\"","Tang Lu angrily stepped in front of the two men.","\"You gave us stuff, but it's not enough. When it's not enough, we have to make up for it with people.","Of course, if you don't want her to come with us, you could come instead. Now that I look more carefully, you're not bad-looking yourself.\"","Gold Tooth Man's eyes were filled with lust, his face lewd.","He reached out to touch Tang Lu's face.","Tang Lu couldn't take it anymore and swung her hand to slap his face.","Gold Tooth Man hadn't expected Tang Lu to suddenly strike him.","So he hadn't prepared any defense.","\"Slap!\"","A solid blow landed squarely on his face.","Immediately, a stinging sensation spread across his cheek.","Gold Tooth Man puffed up the struck side of his face, his eyes turning cold.","\"You dare hit me? You bitch, since you won't take the easy way, I'll just take you right here in front of everyone!\"","As he spoke, he moved forward aggressively, intending to use force.","Director Mom hurried over to stop him.","\"Get lost, you old hag!\"","Gold Tooth Man pushed her with great force, sending Director Mom flying backward.","Just as she was about to hit the hard doorframe, a small figure suddenly appeared behind her, protecting her from the impact.","Everyone was relieved to see Director Mom unharmed, and only then did they clearly see who had saved her.","\"Xiaoxiao!\"","Tang Lu's lips moved in surprise.","Her eyes were filled with amazement and gratitude.","She didn't regret slapping Gold Tooth Man, but involving Director Mom had not been her intention.","When she saw Director Mom about to hit the doorframe, her heart had jumped into her throat.","She knew how hard that doorframe was, and the consequences would have been severe if Director Mom had hit it.","Thankfully, thankfully Xiaoxiao had saved Director Mom.","Otherwise, she would never have been able to forgive herself.","But... how had Xiaoxiao gotten there so suddenly?","She remembered her being at the back.","Gold Tooth Man glanced at Yun Xiaoxiao, slightly furrowing his brows.","Where had this little girl come from?","He hadn't noticed Yun Xiaoxiao before, so her sudden appearance didn't strike him as unusual - he assumed she had been standing there all along.","\"Heh, I didn't expect all the females in this orphanage to be such lookers. The old ones have their charm, the young ones their beauty, and even the little kids are pretty enough to catch the eye~\"","Gold Tooth Man's words, as he stared at Yun Xiaoxiao, were unbearably vulgar.","Everyone in the orphanage was furious.","He was completely inhuman!","To even lust after a child of just a few years!","Beast!","\"Are you even human? She's just a little child!\" Tang Lu was outraged.","She walked over and sheltered Yun Xiaoxiao behind her.","\"Well, looks like you really enjoy protecting others. Let me tell you, being kind doesn't put food on the table these days.\"","Gold Tooth Man sneered, \"Since you won't let me touch this one or that one, I'll do you a favor and just focus on you alone.\"","Hearing this, Tang Lu's brows furrowed tightly.","If he dared touch her, she didn't care if they both ended up dead.","She wouldn't let such a disgusting person touch her - death would be better!","She remained completely alert.","Seeing Tang Lu's resistance only inflamed Gold Tooth Man's desire to dominate.","He gave a crooked smile and started walking toward Tang Lu.","But as soon as he moved, all the orphanage residents rushed forward as one, forming a barrier in front of Tang Lu.","\"Don't you dare touch our Teacher Tang!\"","\"You big bully!\"","\"If you want chickens, we can raise them for you.","But you can't harm our people!","Otherwise, we'll fight you to the death even if it kills us.","Then you won't have chickens or even vegetables from our garden to eat!\"","Everyone spoke up one after another, shielding Tang Lu and the girl from earlier.","\"Heh, threatening me?\"","\"It's not a threat, it's just fact!\"","\"Well, well, aren't you all united.\" Gold Tooth Man sneered in displeasure.","\"But... some things aren't up to you!","You think you have what it takes to threaten me?\"","Gold Tooth Man paced back and forth in front of everyone, scanning the crowd with contempt in his eyes.","\"In this world, might makes right.","Let me tell you, if you offend me, living won't be possible, and dying won't be allowed.","You think you can die just because you want to?","Don't be naive - without my permission, even the King of Hell won't take you.","For those who don't obey, I have plenty of ways to deal with you, understand?","I'll count to three, and you'll all get out of my way!","Otherwise, I'll make you wish you were dead!\"","Having his plans repeatedly disrupted, Gold Tooth Man had lost his patience.","Seeing that people still wouldn't move aside, his anger exploded.","\"Go, teach them a lesson! Let them know who they can and cannot mess with!\"","He waved to his men behind him, and they immediately sprang into action.","They advanced menacingly toward the orphanage group.","They were holding weapons.","Just as those weapons were being raised threateningly, several ice balls flew through the air like scattered flower petals, striking all the knives and clubs with impressive force, sending them clattering to the ground.","The loud crashes echoed through the air!","Everyone was startled by this sudden turn of events.","Following the trajectory of the ice balls, they all looked in that direction, gradually clearing a path.","There stood Yun Xiaoxiao, looking at Gold Tooth Man's group with a hint of a smile.","On the tip of her right index finger, a ring of ice continued to spin, emanating cold air."]},{"number":205,"title":"Chapter 205: Mind Control Zombie","paragraphs":["“Was that ice ball you just cast?”","Gold Tooth Man squinted at Yun Xiaoxiao, his gaze inscrutable.","Yun Xiaoxiao looked at him as if he were an idiot, “Or else? It seems you’re not only a bad person, but your eyes aren’t very good either.”","She twirled the ice ring on her hand.","Gold Tooth Man: !!!","“Didn’t you want to see whose fist is harder? Come, compare your fist with my ice ball.” Yun Xiaoxiao said with a leisurely smile.","Gold Tooth Man: ......","That ice ball had just split a knife in half, and now he was supposed to compare his fist with it?","What a joke!","“Why aren’t you talking anymore? Weren’t you quite talkative just now? Weren’t you quite tough? Keep being tough for me to see, I haven’t had enough.”","Gold Tooth Man: !!!","This is too much!","Although Yun Xiaoxiao’s ice ball was terrifying, they weren’t without special abilities either.","He could breathe fire!","Hmph, he didn’t believe his fire couldn’t melt her ice!","With a sinister look, he unleashed a ball of flames towards Yun Xiaoxiao without a word.","Watching the flames approach Yun Xiaoxiao, he felt a sense of satisfaction.","Burn!","Burn her to death!","This brat’s mouth is too sharp, burn her to death!","As the flames were just inches away from Yun Xiaoxiao, he was secretly laughing.","But his smile froze abruptly.","Because...","Yun Xiaoxiao had summoned a ball of fire too!","And it was bigger and more ferocious than his.","When the two flames collided, his fire was instantly swallowed!","The raging fire rolled towards him, and he had no time to dodge. The sparks that touched his body immediately ignited!","“Ahhhh!”","In no time, he was engulfed in flames.","He screamed in agony, rolling on the ground.","His subordinates were all shocked.","One of them, a water-based ability user, tried to use water to save him.","But was knocked unconscious by Yun Xiaoxiao’s ice ball.","From then on, no one dared to move.","Soon, Gold Tooth Man stopped moving altogether.","A smell of roasted meat filled the air.","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao approach step by step, Gold Tooth Man’s subordinates fled in terror, trying to drive away.","But before the car could start, the tires were punctured.","The group was left in despair.","They looked at Yun Xiaoxiao as if she were a demon.","Heavens, when did this orphanage get such a terrifying figure?","Had they known earlier, they would never have dared to come!","“Little Miss, spare us, we were forced by Gold Tooth Man.”","“Yes, we weren’t willing, we’re all good citizens.”","“We were just following orders, it really has nothing to do with us.”","Hearing their unconvincing excuses, Yun Xiaoxiao opened her mouth slightly.","“Save those words for...”","Before she could finish ‘the King of Hell,’ a loud noise erupted from the ground not far away.","Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow and looked over.","The green earth seemed to be moving beneath, bulging up.","Then, ‘boom,’ the earth exploded.","A one-armed child zombie emerged from the ground.","Its other arm didn’t seem to have been bitten off by another zombie but appeared to be congenital.","Judging by its appearance, it was about fifteen or sixteen years old, a girl.","“It’s Little Xin!”","Someone exclaimed in surprise.","Zombie Little Xin slowly raised its head, revealing a grayish-white face.","It scanned the surroundings and then rushed over quickly.","Yun Xiaoxiao narrowed her eyes, ready to strike.","But Zombie Little Xin bypassed her and the others from the orphanage, heading straight for Gold Tooth Man’s subordinates.","“Ah!”","It moved fast, pouncing directly onto one of the men.","The man tried to block but was bitten on his raised hand.","Another man tried to attack it from behind.","It dodged quickly and then pounced back at the attacker.","“Ahhhh, help!”","“Don’t bite me!”","Although the group had some small abilities, they were no match for Zombie Little Xin, a level four early-stage zombie.","Soon, all of them were bitten by Zombie Little Xin.","Then, a strange scene occurred.","Those who were turning into zombies, as if by prior agreement, all walked towards the cliff edge.","And then...","Jumped off!","Everyone was stunned.","Clearly, they were controlled by some mysterious power!","Yun Xiaoxiao was also surprised as she looked at Zombie Little Xin.","When it didn’t attack them but only Gold Tooth Man’s subordinates, she knew it must be an intelligent zombie.","But she never expected it to be a psychic control zombie!","In her previous life, the zombie kings who led zombie armies were all psychic control zombies of at least level eight.","She never thought she’d encounter another one so soon after Tong Zhan!","Actually, this one was a bit different from Tong Zhan.","Tong Zhan had the appearance of a normal person.","But Zombie Little Xin was completely in the form of a zombie.","Yun Xiaoxiao narrowed her eyes, ready to eliminate the threat.","Such a zombie with the potential to become a zombie king couldn’t be left alive.","But before she could act, Zombie Little Xin looked fondly at the others from the orphanage and then lowered its head, walking back to the big pit from before.","As if it had never come out.","Yun Xiaoxiao frowned.","Could it be that it came out just to kill those scumbags?","Why would it do that?","Didn’t it want to eat humans?","“Ah, Little Xin was born with a defect, so her biological parents abandoned her at the foot of the mountain, and we took her in.","Because of her condition, no one wanted to adopt her.","So she stayed at the orphanage.","Usually, she spoke very little and liked to be alone.","Although we tried our best to comfort her, she still couldn’t open her heart.”","Director Mom looked towards the pit, sighing with heartache.","“When the disaster happened, many of the children and teachers at the orphanage turned into zombies, and the place was filled with danger and panic.","I took the survivors and hid in the storage room.","Although there was some food in the storage room, there was no milk powder for Little Bao.”","Director Mom glanced at a one-year-old baby being held.","“Little Bao also has a defect and was abandoned by his parents.","So Little Xin was very fond of Little Bao, volunteering to get the milk powder.","At that time, Little Bao was small and cried whenever he was hungry, and we were afraid it would attract zombies, so we agreed.","But we didn’t let her go alone.","Another teacher and I went with her.","It went smoothly at first; I used my phone to lure away some zombies and successfully got the milk powder from another building.","But on the way back, there was an accident.","At a critical moment, Little Xin shielded the zombies with her body, telling us to hurry and leave.","She’s such a silly child.”","As she spoke, Director Mom seemed to recall the scene and her eyes reddened."]},{"number":206,"title":"Chapter 206: The Manliest Man at Sea 02","paragraphs":["Hearing Director Mom's words and seeing the still earth pit, Yun Xiaoxiao furrowed her brows.","If the other party was a good zombie who didn't harm people but only protected those they cared about, she really wouldn't know how to bring herself to kill it.","Humans have good and bad, and so do zombies.","Although the probability is very, very small, small doesn't mean it doesn't exist.","Glancing at the earth pit once more, Yun Xiaoxiao silently withdrew her hand.","With a major threat resolved, everyone at the orphanage breathed a sigh of relief.","However, their gaze towards Yun Xiaoxiao had completely changed.","\"Xiaoxiao, how are you so amazing? Even more powerful than Ultraman in the cartoons!\"","Tian Tian approached Yun Xiaoxiao, full of admiration.","\"That ice just now was so cool!\"","Yinuo and a few other kids also gathered around.","They almost treated Yun Xiaoxiao like a little star.","Seeing the group of people laughing and playing together, Director Mom also smiled warmly.","\"Today, let's have a good meal. Come on, let's cook.\"","\"Director Mom, are we having meat today?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Can we have eggs too?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Oh yeah, that's great!\"","The little ones were the most excited.","Everyone else couldn't help but smile along.","The unpleasantness from earlier was swept away.","During dinner, Yun Xiaoxiao asked everyone if they wanted to leave and mentioned a better place where they could live.","But everyone looked at each other, seemingly reluctant.","\"Xiaoxiao, I know you mean well, but we've lived here for so long, and we don't have any plans to leave for now.\"","Director Mom smiled gently, voicing the thoughts of everyone.","\"We think this place is pretty good, with mountains and water. We've planted vegetables and raised chickens and ducks. If we want meat, we can go fishing.","We're also planning to cultivate the land outside and plant some grains.","Now that those bad guys are gone, this place is quite safe.","So, you don't need to worry about us. We're doing fine here.","Most importantly...\"","She glanced towards the direction of the gate, smiling softly without continuing.","But Yun Xiaoxiao could hear what she was thinking.","She was thinking: Little Xin and the others are still outside. If we leave, what will happen to them?","For their choice, Yun Xiaoxiao chose to respect it.","Inviting them was merely out of her appreciation for their good character. Whether they went or not was their freedom.","She didn't force them.","But she still kindly reminded them, as a return for their hospitality.","\"I hear the weather will get very cold soon. You should prepare accordingly.\"","Although they didn't quite understand why Yun Xiaoxiao said that, Director Mom and the others still kept it in mind.","The next morning, when they learned that Yun Xiaoxiao was leaving, everyone was very reluctant.","\"Can't you stay?\" Tian Tian pouted.","Huanhuan also said, \"Yeah, stay with us.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao shook her head, \"I still have some things to take care of. I'll visit you again if I get the chance.\"","Tian Tian and the others immediately looked glum.","In their hearts, they thought that once Yun Xiaoxiao left, she might never come back.","Although they hadn't experienced the dangers outside, just looking at the dock at the foot of the mountain was enough to know.","Even though Yun Xiaoxiao was powerful, it wouldn't be easy for her to come and go as she pleased.","For what everyone was thinking, Yun Xiaoxiao wanted to say:","She had a plane and could go anywhere she wanted.","It wouldn't take long to get from Rong City to here.","But she didn't explain much. Some things don't need words; seeing is believing.","She took out a small wireless radio from her backpack and handed it to Director Mom.","\"If you run into trouble, you can leave a message on this. Mention Blue Ocean Kindergarten, and I'll come if I know.\"","Her serious expression made Director Mom chuckle.","She took it and pursed her lips.","\"Alright, but we're not very good with these things. Can you teach us how to use it?\"","\"Sure.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao started fiddling with it.","This method was also taught to her by Lu Chen.","While tuning the frequency, she heard the self-narration of that man who called himself the most manly man at sea.","He was glad he hadn't been struck by lightning, blown away by the wind, or drowned by the water.","Yun Xiaoxiao suddenly remembered that his location seemed not too far from here.","She recalled that he had mentioned he was at an oilfield development area at sea.","Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow; her next destination was decided.","After teaching Director Mom and the others, Yun Xiaoxiao formally said her goodbyes.","Tang Lu even offered to see her off, but she declined.","So, everyone had to watch her leave.","Yun Xiaoxiao walked until they couldn't see her anymore before teleporting away.","Finding a secluded spot, she took out the helicopter.","Then, she flew along the coastline according to the map on her phone.","This map was one she had downloaded before the apocalypse.","She had downloaded maps of the entire country, each province, each city, and even some towns.","It turned out to be a very wise decision.","This trip to gather supplies had been greatly aided by it.","After flying for a long time, Yun Xiaoxiao finally spotted a landmark.","Immediately, she changed direction and flew towards the sea.","At that moment.","On an oil drilling platform at sea.","A man wrapped in a military coat was lying in a slouched position on a low platform.","Even though the platform was covered in moss and was dirty, he didn't care.","He reached out to pick his nose and yawned lazily.","Suddenly, the fishing rod trembled slightly. His action of picking his nose paused, and he quickly sat up.","He chuckled and rubbed his palms.","\"Here it comes!\"","He picked up the fishing rod and pulled it up.","Seeing it was just a small fish, his interest waned.","He took the fish off and threw it back into the sea.","\"Go find your mom. Remember, don't bite my bait before you grow up, okay? Be a good and sensible fish. Go call your uncles and aunts; they've grown up and can be eaten.\"","He muttered to himself.","If the fish could understand human speech, it would surely roll its eyes and curse loudly, \"You big idiot.\"","He re-baited the hook and threw the line back into the sea.","Then, he lay down again, bored out of his mind.","\"The sky is so blue today...\"","He rested his hands behind his head, crossed his legs, and gazed at the sky.","Suddenly, he sat up straight, rubbed his eyes, and stared at the sky not far away.","Convinced it wasn't an illusion, he was overjoyed.","There was a helicopter!","Heavens, how long had it been since he last saw a plane!","He had only seen them at the very beginning of the apocalypse.","But those planes either flew too high and disappeared or fell into the deep sea under his gaze.","After that, he hadn't seen any planes in this area.","This helicopter was flying so steadily, which meant there must be someone inside!","Realizing this, the man became excited."]},{"number":207,"title":"Chapter 207: Lure the Corpse into the Sea","paragraphs":["He hurriedly stood up from the ground and looked around.","Then, he frowned.","The only red cloth from before had been washed away by the heavy rain.","Seeing nothing else usable, he quickly took off his green military coat and began waving it.","\"Hey, friend! Over here, look over here!\"","\"I'm here!\"","He shouted excitedly.","From a distance, Yun Xiaoxiao spotted him.","She scanned the drilling platform and found a relatively large open space.","She immediately guided the helicopter down.","Seeing the aircraft actually descending, the man couldn't contain his joy.","He quickly put his military coat back on, grabbed the rusty railing, and ran upstairs.","Panting, he arrived at the main platform just as the helicopter was slowly touching down.","The powerful wind from the rotors nearly knocked him off balance.","He hurriedly steadied himself, his body hunched over in a rather comical pose.","Soon, the helicopter came to a complete stop.","He rushed over eagerly.","As the cabin door opened, he grinned and waved his hand in greeting.","\"Hey, friend, you...\"","Before he could finish the word, he froze.","Because...","He saw Yun Xiaoxiao calmly jump down from inside.","He stood on his tiptoes and looked at the helicopter from every angle - up, down, left, right - but couldn't see anyone else.","This completely shocked him.","\"Kid, did you fly this helicopter?\"","He asked in disbelief.","Yun Xiaoxiao shrugged, \"Who else? Do you see anyone else?\"","The man dumbly shook his head.","\"Holy crap, you really did fly it yourself!\"","Coming to his senses, the man slapped his thigh, unable to hide his amazement.","\"You're incredible! How old are you? And you can fly a helicopter!\"","The man couldn't stop expressing his astonishment.","But Yun Xiaoxiao looked him up and down and asked puzzled, \"Are you the manliest man on the sea?\"","The man immediately scratched the back of his head, somewhat embarrassed.","\"Hehe, that's me.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao's mouth twitched.","The manliest?","This skinny guy? What's manly about him?","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao's dubious expression, the man became even more embarrassed and gave a silly laugh.","\"I didn't think anyone would come, so I just said whatever, but I didn't expect...\"","That someone would actually come.","Being caught in such an obvious lie was indeed a bit awkward.","Yun Xiaoxiao: .......","Perhaps this was the gap between online and reality...","She didn't dwell on this issue and instead asked, \"Are you an employee at this oil well?\"","The man nodded, \"Yes, kid. I'm Zhang Qiang, a mechanical engineer at this offshore oil field.\"","\"Is everyone else gone?\"","\"They sure are. You have no idea how bad the situation was.\"","Once he started talking, Zhang Qiang couldn't stop.","Regardless of whether Yun Xiaoxiao wanted to hear it or not, he recounted everything that had happened.","The gist was that after the virus outbreak, it spread from person to person, and soon the drilling platform was overrun with zombies.","Some lucky ones, those near the ships, managed to escape by boat.","Some semi-lucky ones got on boats, but there were people who transformed on board, and those ships quickly became zombie ships.","Those who remained on the drilling platform were the extremely unlucky ones.","They couldn't escape, but they couldn't stay either.","To escape meant jumping into the ocean.","Even if they didn't encounter sharks, facing the hordes of zombies that had already fallen into the sea was no joke.","The moment you jumped in, a zombie might take a bite, and that would be the end of you.","But staying on the platform meant being surrounded by zombies everywhere, which was basically a death sentence too.","\"So how did you survive?\" Yun Xiaoxiao asked curiously.","After hearing his story, she thought it seemed impossible to survive in such dangerous circumstances.","\"Me? I was down there doing repairs at the time.\"","Zhang Qiang pointed to another tall iron frame that had fallen into the sea.","\"I was standing on that narrow ledge, hugging that big cylinder.","It's underneath the platform, and to get down there, you have to climb down slowly using those small metal plates.","But zombies can't operate like that.","At the time, one zombie spotted me and tried to eat me, lunging at me.","Due to the angle, it missed me and fell into the water instead.","I thought that might be a good way to deal with the zombies.","So, I deliberately made noise to attract them.","And without fail, all those zombies fell into the sea.","I stayed there for four whole days.","During that time, I didn't have a drop of water or a grain of rice.","I survived purely on fresh air and strong willpower.","On the afternoon of the fourth day, when I was sure no more zombies would come no matter how much noise I made, I finally climbed back up.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow.","This guy was quite clever.","\"I've been alone all this time.","If it weren't for the radio station where I could still hear information from other bases, I would have thought I was the only person left in the world.","You're the first living person I've seen in all these months.","You have no idea how excited I am.\"","Zhang Qiang looked at Yun Xiaoxiao eagerly.","But then he became puzzled.","\"By the way, kid, why did you come here alone in a helicopter?\"","\"Aren't you extracting oil here?\"","\"Yes, so, you came for the oil?\" Zhang Qiang was somewhat surprised.","Yun Xiaoxiao raised her eyebrows slightly, \"You guessed right, so where's the oil?\"","Zhang Qiang became even more confused, \"What does a kid like you want with oil?\"","\"To use it, of course. Is that so hard to understand?\" Yun Xiaoxiao was a bit exasperated.","Zhang Qiang: ......","I know it's for use, but a kid flying alone in a helicopter to the middle of the ocean looking for oil - that itself is strange, isn't it?","Though he thought this, Zhang Qiang still obediently pointed to the large storage tanks not far away.","\"Those tanks contain the oil we've extracted so far.","When we accumulate enough, oil tankers come to transport it to the mainland.","Besides these storage tanks, most of the oil is actually transported directly to the mainland's oil factories through underwater pipelines.\"","Zhang Qiang explained everything in detail.","As he spoke, he led Yun Xiaoxiao toward the storage tanks.","Throughout the entire time, he never treated Yun Xiaoxiao like an ordinary child.","After all, what ordinary child could fly a helicopter by themselves?","What ordinary child would come to sea looking for oil?","So, Zhang Qiang answered whatever Yun Xiaoxiao asked, and he answered very seriously.","After all, his chances of getting off this platform depended on this kid."]},{"number":208,"title":"Chapter 208: Know the person, know the face, but not the heart","paragraphs":["Yun Xiaoxiao approached the oil storage tank.","There were quite a few storage tanks in this area.","\"Are they all filled with oil?\" she asked.","\"That's right, all the ones on this side are filled.\"","Just as Zhang Qiang finished speaking, he saw Yun Xiaoxiao's small hand touch the tank.","In the next second, that oil tank vanished!","It literally disappeared into thin air!","Zhang Qiang's eyes widened, his mouth hanging open in shock for quite some time.","He was even more stunned when he saw that everything Yun Xiaoxiao passed by disappeared completely.","\"You... you... you...\"","He stammered \"you\" several times but couldn't form a complete sentence.","\"Where are the factories on land?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao turned her head calmly, staring at Zhang Qiang.","Zhang Qiang swallowed hard and pointed to the distance.","\"Over there, but I'll need to get closer to be certain.\"","He said this with ulterior motives.","He was worried Yun Xiaoxiao wouldn't take him along.","Yun Xiaoxiao had already seen through his thoughts, but didn't say anything about it.","\"Let's go.\"","She then walked straight toward the helicopter.","Zhang Qiang followed behind with a secretly delighted expression.","The helicopter took off again, flying toward the distance.","Zhang Qiang watched as his previous location grew smaller and smaller, a smile tugging at his lips.","How wonderful! He was finally leaving this godforsaken place!","While secretly rejoicing, he shifted his gaze to Yun Xiaoxiao, who was piloting the helicopter.","His eyes held a calculating look.","The helicopter flew over the sea surface for some time before arriving at a large oil refinery.","\"Yes, yes, this is it!\"","Zhang Qiang exclaimed excitedly.","As the helicopter began to descend, Zhang Qiang suddenly became nervous.","\"You're not planning to land, are you? Please don't - there are zombies down there. We'll die.","Let's get out of here quickly, it's too dangerous.\"","\"Leave? This is exactly where we need to be.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao's lips curled into a meaningful smile.","Watching the helicopter descend lower and lower, Zhang Qiang's panic became visible.","The helicopter had barely landed on the roof of a staff building when several zombies lunged toward them.","However, before they could get close, they were turned into Swiss cheese by a barrage of ice spikes.","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao take down so many zombies with a single move, Zhang Qiang was completely dumbfounded.","Who... or what kind of person had he encountered?!","Perhaps not even human, but a monster!","He had been harboring some complaints about Yun Xiaoxiao that he wanted to voice.","But now, he didn't dare utter a single word of them.","\"Aren't you coming out?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao turned to look at Zhang Qiang.","Zhang Qiang didn't really want to get out, but under Yun Xiaoxiao's gaze, he found himself complying without knowing why.","It was strange, but he always felt there was something frightening about this child's eyes.","Especially when she wasn't smiling, there was an intense sense of pressure.","\"So, what are we going to do now?\"","Zhang Qiang felt uncomfortable under Yun Xiaoxiao's constant stare and spoke first.","\"Send you to... your death.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao said with a slight smile, as casually as if she were commenting on the weather.","Zhang Qiang: !!","\"What did you say?!\"","He thought his ears must be playing tricks on him, unable to comprehend what Yun Xiaoxiao had just said.","Yun Xiaoxiao looked at him languidly, \"Didn't you rape a female colleague, then kill her, and use her flesh as fish bait?\"","Zhang Qiang: !!","How did she know?!","He hadn't mentioned any of this earlier!","When Yun Xiaoxiao had asked him earlier about how he had survived.","He had only told the first part of the story.","He had indeed lured many zombies away, making them fall into the sea.","After he left that position, he was almost the only person left on the entire offshore drilling platform.","He said \"almost\" because there wasn't only him.","At that time, he was starving, so he went looking for food.","That's when he discovered that a female colleague was still alive.","That colleague had locked herself in the cafeteria's storage room, lucky enough to escape the zombies' pursuit.","At first, he felt fortunate.","At least he wasn't alone anymore.","Moreover, she was someone he had been attracted to.","But he had never dared to pursue her before.","She was excellent, beautiful, and had a boyfriend who held a high position in the company.","So he had never expressed his feelings.","But after the zombie virus outbreak, her boyfriend died.","On the entire drilling platform, only the two of them remained.","He felt it was a heaven-sent opportunity.","So he was very good to her.","He also felt she might have some feelings for him.","So one night, he confessed his feelings to her.","But unexpectedly, she rejected him outright.","Said she had never liked him.","At that moment, he was heartbroken.","Combined with some alcohol, he went crazy and forced himself on her.","But she wouldn't cooperate at all, even bit him.","Yet he loved her so much that even then, he didn't kill her.","He just slapped her a few times and locked her up.","He even provided her with good food and drink every day.","All she had to do was sleep with him every night.","He thought that with time, she would surely fall in love with him.","Isn't there a saying that forced melons are sweeter?","But who knew she would be so vicious!","Once she almost destroyed his manhood!","He was so enraged that he smashed her head against the wall more than ten times.","When he realized there was blood everywhere, she had already stopped breathing.","He figured since she was dead anyway, it would be a waste to just throw the body away.","After all, food was limited on the drilling platform, and he didn't know how long it would be before someone came to rescue him.","So he used her flesh as fish bait for fishing.","He didn't think he had done anything wrong.","Wasn't everyone advocating for waste reduction?","\"I don't know what you're talking about.\"","Zhang Qiang tried to maintain his composure, pretending to be clueless.","\"If you don't understand, that's fine. You can just die now.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao simply ignored his act of playing dumb.","She despised men who degraded women more than anything else.","This type - she'd kill every single one she encountered!","Forcing himself on someone against their will, and using love as an excuse.","What kind of fucking love was that?!","However, at first, she really hadn't seen through this man who had acted like a fool on the radio.","She couldn't have guessed that his true nature was so disgusting.","When they first met, her impression of him, while not great, had been acceptable.","But...","It just goes to show that you can't judge a book by its cover.","Many times, a person's appearance can be extremely deceptive.","Because some people are very good at pretending.","\"What right do you have to kill me? Even if I did those things, what business is it of yours?!\"","Zhang Qiang glared at Yun Xiaoxiao, practically shouting."]},{"number":209,"title":"Chapter 209: On the Run Family","paragraphs":["Zhang Qiang was furious.","He had finally managed to escape from that godforsaken place with hope in his heart.","Originally, he thought he could leave everything behind and start a new life.","But unexpectedly, this strange child wanted to kill him!","He had no idea how she knew about what he had done in the past.","There was nobody else there at the time, and with endless ocean all around, there was no way she could have witnessed it herself.","Besides, even if he did kill someone, what business was it of this little brat?","She wasn't a police officer, so why was she meddling in this?","\"I'm certainly not a police officer. The police uncles are far too busy. There's no need for them to deal with scum like you.","Besides, don't forget, we're in the apocalypse now.\"","With order already collapsed, killing someone who deserved to die was simply something she felt like doing, nothing more.","Zhang Qiang: !!!","His face darkened as he secretly surveyed his surroundings.","\"Still thinking of running? Sorry, but you won't get the chance.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao's lips curled into a half-smile, and before Zhang Qiang could react, she struck swiftly.","With a swoosh, an ice-cold, sharp ice arrow pierced straight into Zhang Qiang's forehead.","Zhang Qiang's eyes immediately widened.","Feeling the bone-chilling cold and intense pain in his forehead, Zhang Qiang opened his mouth but couldn't utter a word.","Blood flowed down from his forehead along his cheeks, quickly turning everything crimson.","\"Thud!\"","He fell, completely lifeless.","Yun Xiaoxiao's expression remained unchanged, merely glancing at him briefly before looking away.","She surveyed the oil factory.","As far as the eye could see, there were zombies everywhere.","She targeted the location of the oil drums, continuously jumping between them in the middle of the factory.","She efficiently stored the oil-filled drums into her spatial storage.","Watching the remaining space in her storage grow smaller and smaller, a sense of satisfaction welled up inside her.","Just as Yun Xiaoxiao was engrossed in her collection, gunshots rang out from afar, growing closer.","Accompanying them was the roar of car engines.","\"Bang!\"","\"Bang! Bang!\"","The gunshots continued, getting closer to Yun Xiaoxiao.","In other words, they were getting closer to the factory.","At this moment, about fifty meters from the factory, a black SUV and a pickup truck were engaged in their own version of Fast and Furious.","The black SUV was speeding forward, seemingly fleeing for its life.","Several burly men stood in the back of the pickup truck, holding rifles, their faces gleaming with excitement like hunting dogs during a chase.","\"Roar! Roar! Roar!\"","They shouted into the wind like madmen.","One of them aimed his gun at the SUV's tires.","\"Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!\"","The SUV serpentined, weaving left and right continuously.","But under the continuous barrage, its right rear tire finally burst with a 'pop'.","The car immediately started wobbling but still pressed forward.","Just as it was two or three meters from the oil factory, another tire was shot out.","At this point, the car completely stopped moving.","The pickup truck also stopped.","The men all jumped down from the truck.","Their lips curled in satisfied smiles as they slowly approached the SUV.","Just as they were about to reach the SUV, both its front and rear doors opened simultaneously.","\"Run!\"","A middle-aged man shouted urgently.","Suddenly, something like a curtain appeared out of nowhere.","This curtain perfectly blocked the view of the people behind them.","\"Damn it, this thing again!\"","The people behind cursed angrily.","\"Shoot it!\"","Immediately, gunfire erupted.","\"Run, quickly!\"","The middle-aged man turned his head to see his wife and daughter still standing there, his face full of anxiety.","\"Dad, if you're not leaving, I'm not leaving either!\"","Zheng Yuner said resolutely.","\"Foolish girl! Do you know what will happen if you fall into their hands?!\"","Zheng Daye shouted in desperate anxiety.","\"They're monsters who would devour you whole. They came specifically for you this time. If they really catch you, it would be worse than death!","He Yan, quickly take her away.\"","He gave his wife He Yan a meaningful look.","He Yan looked at her husband with a heavy expression before finally dragging Zheng Yuner forward.","\"Mom, what about Dad...\"","Zheng Yuner was crying.","At this moment, she was filled with regret and self-blame.","Since the apocalypse began, their family had returned to their rural hometown from the city.","Their house was a two-story building, quite far from other houses, located halfway up a mountain and hidden by trees.","So, that place was relatively safe.","This morning, she had been picking mushrooms in the forest, planning to add them to their meal.","She had almost finished gathering enough, but seeing there were still many more, she thought about collecting extra to dry and make pickles, so she headed further down the mountain.","However, she didn't expect that group of bad people to be resting on the road at the foot of the mountain.","They spotted her immediately and started harassing her with crude remarks.","Their vulgar words made her want to snap back at them.","But considering she was alone and they looked fierce and threatening, she held her tongue.","She ignored them and turned to head home.","She thought that would be the end of it.","But unexpectedly, the group started calling after her and following her.","She panicked and quickly dropped the mushrooms, rushing home.","Because she knew the path well, she made it back quickly.","When her father saw her panicked expression, he asked what had happened.","After she explained, her father's expression became grave, and he immediately started packing, saying he needed to take her and her mother away.","At first, she thought her father might be overreacting.","Although the men had followed her, they hadn't caught up to her.","Perhaps they had given up and left.","But she hadn't expected that just as they finished loading their car and were preparing to leave,","those people actually found their way there!","If it weren't for her father's special curtain blocking those people, they would have been caught long ago.","But without her father present, the curtain couldn't last long.","Especially after he had already used it once, its effectiveness was greatly reduced.","Only with him present could the curtain remain.","Once he left, the curtain would immediately fail.","He Yan painfully looked at the man holding up the curtain, supporting a wall of life for mother and daughter, her eyes welling with tears.","\"Let's go. Your father will only be happy if you're safe.\"","She pulled Zheng Yuner along as they ran forward.","Seeing only the factory building ahead with open space everywhere else,","she led Zheng Yuner to climb over the wall and enter.","Fortunately, the wall wasn't too high.","With some effort, both of them managed to climb over.","In open spaces, no matter how they ran, they couldn't outrun the four wheels of their pursuers, and would eventually be caught.","Although there would certainly be man-eating monsters in this factory,","she would rather have her daughter eaten by those monsters than violated by those men!","Perhaps if they were lucky, they could find a place to hide.","Maybe if those people saw the monsters inside, they would give up the chase?"]},{"number":210,"title":"Chapter 210: Burnt but Not Dead","paragraphs":["Zheng Daye didn't last long before his strength was completely drained.","The curtain seemed to disintegrate like a white sheet set on fire.","And he was shot dead by one of the men.","The man who killed him sneered and kicked his body.","\"Weren't you pretty tough? Hmph, but you still died by my hand.\"","He looked ahead and said, \"Let's go, capture that mother and daughter.\"","\"Today, we can enjoy the feeling of having a mother and daughter together, hahaha...\"","\"What if the older one is too old?\"","\"Can't you do it at night? In the dark, it's all the same, you idiot.\"","\"Hahaha... That's true.\"","\"Come on, let's go catch them.\"","The group quickly ran forward.","\"Did they run that fast? Why can't we see them?\"","\"You're stupid, where can two women run to? They must have gone inside.\"","One man pointed to the white wall of the factory.","\"See that? There are footprints here, they must have gone in.\"","\"Hmph, those bitches can run, huh?\"","\"So what now, do we still chase them?\"","\"Of course, we have to chase them, or else all our efforts would be wasted.\"","\"But there must be zombies inside, isn't it unsafe?\"","\"What are you afraid of? Two women aren't afraid, what are you afraid of?\"","After a brief pause, the group all climbed over the wall.","But their luck wasn't good. As soon as they landed, the zombies attracted by the noise caused by Zheng Yuner and her group surrounded them.","\"Damn it!\"","One man almost got knocked down by a zombie. Cursing, he lifted his gun and shot the zombie.","But more and more zombies kept coming.","They didn't even have time to climb back over the wall.","So, the few of them raised their guns and fired at the charging zombies.","Yun Xiaoxiao, who was collecting oil drums not far away, heard the gunshots and looked over.","Then, she cursed.","\"F***! Who's the idiot firing shots in an oil factory!\"","Isn't this just asking to meet the King of Hell?","As she thought this, one of the men accidentally shot an oil drum.","Suddenly...","\"BOOM!!!!\"","The oil drum exploded, blowing up a group of zombies into pieces.","Flames shot into the sky, sparks flying everywhere.","The bad guys were horrified, unable to believe what they were seeing.","\"This is... an oil factory?!\"","But they realized it too late.","Just as they finished saying that, a massive explosion energy surged towards them.","Several nearby oil drums also exploded in succession.","And they had sent themselves straight to hell.","They died without even leaving a trace.","Yun Xiaoxiao, almost caught in the blast, cursed under her breath and quickly hid in her space.","However, the outside world was in chaos.","The entire oil factory was continuously exploding.","The sound was deafening, and thick smoke filled the air.","Even though those men were already dead, Yun Xiaoxiao really wished she could resurrect them just to kill them again.","Her oil hadn't been collected yet, and those bastards had ruined it all!","It was just so painful to think about.","She stayed in her space until the explosions outside completely stopped.","When she came out, she wore a gas mask.","She wasn't sure when she had collected it.","Just a moment ago, she had casually mentioned wanting the mask, and the next second, Bai (her companion) had brought it to her.","Wearing the gas mask, she stepped out of her space.","Looking at the ruins glowing with fire and smoke, she felt a pang of regret.","Finally, she sighed and prepared to leave.","But at that moment, she spotted a charred 'corpse'.","Calling it a corpse was accurate, as the body was hardly recognizable as human.","The flesh was completely blackened.","Yet, surviving such a massive explosion without being reduced to ashes was already a miracle.","What's more, besides being blackened, the body still had hands, feet, eyes, ears, mouth, and nose.","Most importantly, the right index finger twitched slightly.","Curious, Yun Xiaoxiao stepped closer.","She reached out and checked the person's breathing.","Then, her eyes lit up.","They were still alive!","Judging from the figure, the person should be a girl.","There were no other women among the group of men from earlier.","Which meant, this person wasn't with them.","Yun Xiaoxiao curiously examined Zheng Yuner.","Because when she first saw her, the girl didn't have any abilities.","But now, she had dual abilities.","It was as if these abilities had appeared out of nowhere.","And they were quite strange.","One was physical enhancement, and the other was explosion manipulation.","After observing for a while, she took out a bottle of spiritual spring water, pried open Zheng Yuner's mouth, and poured it in.","Then, she waited quietly.","She was quite curious if the spiritual water would have any effect on her.","After about twenty minutes, Zheng Yuner's right index finger twitched again.","Then, she slowly opened her eyes.","Her eyelids were burned and stuck together in some places.","It took a lot of effort to open them.","The process was very difficult.","Yun Xiaoxiao clearly saw her body trembling.","Yet, she bore the pain without a single sound.","When she saw Yun Xiaoxiao, she was surprised.","But thinking about the cool water that had flowed into her mouth when she was half-conscious, she immediately understood that it must have been this little sister who fed it to her.","The water felt very refreshing, and she gradually felt the fresh air again, which had been getting weaker before.","Without that water, she might not have woken up.","She wanted to say thank you, but her lips were stuck together.","With great effort, she managed to open her mouth and said her thanks.","Then, she remembered something and immediately turned to look around.","Even though the movement caused her already broken body to hurt even more, she didn't care.","But when she saw the empty surroundings, just ruins, she couldn't hold back anymore.","\"Mom!\"","She cried out in grief.","At that time, her mother had been right beside her.","Now that she was gone, it was clear what had happened.","It was her fault, she had caused her parents' deaths.","She lowered her head and cried silently.","Yun Xiaoxiao, from the girl's thoughts, roughly understood what had happened.","She pouted, thinking those men were truly deserving of death.","Even dying once wasn't enough for them.","Such people deserved to die a hundred times!","Seeing Zheng Yuner lost in her sorrow, Yun Xiaoxiao, though unable to empathize completely, felt some sympathy.","\"Sister, your father should still be outside. Do you want to go and bury him?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao's words reminded Zheng Yuner.","She quickly stopped crying and stood up.","Standing up pulled at her burned body, causing her to wince in pain.","Although, she didn't have eyebrows anymore...","At that moment, she also realized the state of her body.","\"What happened to me!\"","She was shocked."]},{"number":211,"title":"Chapter 211: Bomb Wherever You Want","paragraphs":["At this moment, Zheng Yuner's appearance could only be described as a pitiful sight.","Her hair was gone, her clothes were gone, her entire body was charred black, and her skin was wrinkled and shriveled.","Apart from her eyes, there was not a single part of her that was intact.","At first glance, she looked like an alien.","She looked down at her body and seemed to be shocked by her own appearance.","However, surprisingly, she didn't show any particular sadness or emotional breakdown.","After a brief moment of dazedness, she regained her normal expression.","\"This is also good. A beautiful appearance is sometimes not a treasure but a disaster,\" she murmured.","During her school days, she had been admired for her beauty, which had attracted the jealousy of a certain girl in her class.","The girl often teamed up with a few others to bully her.","Some boys would also block her way after school.","Her mother had even changed jobs to pick her up from school.","This time, she had been targeted by those scumbags because of her looks.","As a result, her parents had lost their lives one after another.","Therefore, beauty was not necessary for her; it was a burden.","Although she was startled when she first saw her appearance, she now felt more at ease.","Her parents were gone, but she was still alive.","Perhaps, this was a form of punishment.","Living on with this appearance made her feel a bit lighter.","Otherwise, she would have felt unworthy to continue living.","Yun Xiaoxiao was quite surprised by Zheng Yuner's composure.","Whether male or female, most people care about their appearance.","It was rare to find someone who could be so indifferent.","However, Yun Xiaoxiao thought this was a good thing.","A beautiful exterior is merely a shell, while a rich inner world and strong abilities are what women should truly value.","Only by doing so can one's emotions not be easily swayed and one's self-protection enhanced, avoiding harm from others.","After Zheng Yuner buried her father's body, Yun Xiaoxiao looked at her.","\"Sister, what are your plans for the future?\"","Zheng Yuner shook her head.","With both parents gone and the world in such a despairing state, she was feeling lost.","\"Would you like to come with me?\"","Zheng Yuner glanced at Yun Xiaoxiao, her eyes filled with contemplation.","After a while, she nodded.","\"Okay.\"","Their conversation was simple.","Perhaps, they didn't need many words to understand each other's intentions.","Since the previous plane had been destroyed, Yun Xiaoxiao had to take out another one.","When the plane suddenly appeared out of thin air, Zheng Yuner's eyebrows raised, and her eyes showed a hint of shock.","But she quickly regained her composure.","This little sister probably had some special ability, just like her father.","The two boarded the plane one after another.","When she saw Yun Xiaoxiao skillfully operating the various buttons and the plane gradually rising, Zheng Yuner looked at her with admiration once again.","This little sister was truly extraordinary!","Afterwards, Yun Xiaoxiao piloted the plane towards the coal mine.","She had promised Xie Youcai and the others that she would pick them up in half a month.","She had also informed Lu Chen and the others about the time.","At this point, someone from the base should have already taken a helicopter there.","On the way, although she sped up, she still stopped at places with factories below.","This time, in addition to Little Cutie and Big Beauty, she had another helper.","Initially, Zheng Yuner didn't know how to use the energy within her.","She didn't even realize she had acquired supernatural abilities.","It was Yun Xiaoxiao who reminded her and taught her how to activate her powers. Only then did she discover that she had gained a powerful ability.","She could release explosive-like objects at will!","When Yun Xiaoxiao told her that in addition to her explosive ability, she also had a physical enhancement ability, Zheng Yuner was quite surprised.","Curious, she used a twig to poke her own body.","To her astonishment, her body felt like it was covered with a hard armor.","The twig broke without even piercing her skin.","Besides feeling a slight discomfort, she didn't feel much pain.","Excited, she grew even more fond of her new body.","Her explosive ability also became more proficient through repeated practice.","Watching Zheng Yuner's rapid progress, Yun Xiaoxiao felt a sense of satisfaction.","Two days later, they finally arrived at the coal mine area.","By the time they got there, Mu Yang and his team had already arrived.","\"Hi, long time no see, little one,\" Mu Yang greeted Yun Xiaoxiao with a smile, his demeanor as warm as his name suggested.","Then, his gaze fell on Zheng Yuner.","\"Who is this...?\"","\"This is Sister Yuner. Sister Yuner, this is Brother Mu Yang,\" Yun Xiaoxiao introduced the two.","Zheng Yuner was a bit reserved and only nodded slightly.","In other words, she didn't have much of a good impression of men right now.","Mu Yang smiled and didn't take her coldness personally.","After a brief greeting, he pointed to Xie Youcai and the group who were boarding the helicopters.","\"You left three helicopters here, plus the one you're on, that's a total of four.","It looks like we can't transport everyone in one go.","I plan to divide them into several batches. What do you think?\"","\"Yeah, that's fine. You decide,\" Yun Xiaoxiao gave Mu Yang full respect.","Most importantly, having someone else take care of things meant she could relax a bit.","She trusted Mu Yang quite a bit.","\"Little Base Leader, you're here!\"","Xie Youcai, who was busy organizing people to board the helicopters, turned his head and saw Yun Xiaoxiao.","Excitedly, he hurried over.","\"Yes, is the coal mining finished?\" Yun Xiaoxiao lifted her gaze.","\"Yes, yes, it was mostly done last night. We finished the last batch this morning,\" Xie Youcai replied respectfully, showing great deference to Yun Xiaoxiao.","This also surprised Zheng Yuner.","Although she knew Yun Xiaoxiao wasn't an ordinary child, she hadn't expected her to be the leader of a base.","So many adults treated her with such respect.","However, thinking about it, it seemed quite reasonable.","Under Xie Youcai's guidance, Yun Xiaoxiao went to the area where the coal was stacked.","It was right at the entrance of the mine.","It was a bit far from the staff accommodation area.","People over there couldn't directly see what was happening here.","\"Okay, just leave it here. Someone will come to collect it later,\" Yun Xiaoxiao said casually after a perfunctory look.","Of course, no one would come to collect it; she just didn't want too many people to know about her spatial abilities.","She planned to quietly collect the coal after everyone left.","Soon, the first batch of people boarded the helicopters and left.","The others stayed behind to wait.","Yun Xiaoxiao intended to stay and collect the coal, so she didn't leave either.","Bored, she took Zheng Yuner, Little Cutie, and Big Beauty down the mountain.","Earlier, from the plane, she had spotted what looked like a greenhouse area below.","It was worth checking out to see if there was anything worth collecting."]},{"number":212,"title":"Chapter 212: This is too extravagant","paragraphs":["Walking to a secluded spot, Yun Xiaoxiao grabbed Zheng Yuner's hand and teleported together to the foot of the mountain.","In front of them was a large area of plastic greenhouses.","As soon as they landed, a zombie dog came running towards them.","At the sound of the dog's bark, Yun Xiaoxiao reflexively wanted to flash into her space.","But before she could act, Zheng Yuner fired an energy ball, which directly turned the zombie dog into ashes.","Soon after, more zombies began to emerge from the white greenhouses or behind them, rushing towards Yun Xiaoxiao and Zheng Yuner.","The two of them, along with their two beasts, took positions at four corners, crushing all the zombies that came at them.","After no more zombies appeared, Yun Xiaoxiao and Zheng Yuner opened one of the greenhouses.","Inside, amidst the lush green leaves, clusters of red, ripe strawberries hung, looking extremely tempting.","Strawberries!","So many strawberries!","All of them were big and red, looking delicious.","Yun Xiaoxiao licked her lips.","Before the apocalypse, when gathering supplies, she hadn't stockpiled strawberries because they weren't in season yet.","And she particularly loved the taste of strawberries.","This trip was definitely worth it!","Before Yun Xiaoxiao could act, Little Cutie beside her was even more impatient.","It used its tentacles to grab a strawberry and started munching.","Big Beauty, on the other hand, remained calm.","Although it had gone through a tough period and had to eat bark and grass for a while,","it was, after all, a carnivore.","Since following Yun Xiaoxiao, it had meat at every meal, and its taste buds had become quite picky.","It didn't want to try this unappetizing fruit again!","Big Beauty stood proudly, looking straight ahead, even showing a bit of disdain for Little Cutie.","What's so good about this red fruit? Meat is what's delicious.","As it turned its head, it noticed a small figure sneaking around in the corner.","It glanced over and saw Yun Xiaoxiao popping a strawberry into her mouth.","Then another.","Her cheeks were puffed up, and she looked utterly delighted.","Big Beauty: ......","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao enjoying her strawberries so much, Zheng Yuner was also tempted.","She picked one and ate it.","Hmm, it was indeed sweet.","Growing this well without any care was quite impressive.","Although strawberries should ideally be soaked in saltwater before eating, they couldn't be too picky at this point.","As the saying goes, \"If it's not clean, it won't make you sick.\"","After satisfying her craving, Yun Xiaoxiao wasn't about to leave the rest behind.","She uprooted the plants, roots and all.","This place was a strawberry plantation.","From now on, the people in their base could enjoy strawberry freedom.","They worked for several hours, and by the time they finished collecting from the last greenhouse, it was completely dark.","Just as they were about to head back, a red laser beam shot towards them.","Seeing the source of the light, Yun Xiaoxiao frowned.","When the laser beam scanned again, she grabbed Zheng Yuner and instantly disappeared.","In a second-floor room of a nearby house, the man holding the laser pointer rubbed his eyes in surprise.","He looked again at the spot where Yun Xiaoxiao and Zheng Yuner had just stood.","\"Huh, where'd they go?\"","He muttered, puzzled.","\"What's up?\"","Inside the room, a man playing poker without looking up, asked while puffing on a cigarette.","After finishing his cigarette, he spat out the butt and cursed.","\"Damn, this cigarette's gone again, can't last long!\"","\"Liang Ge, I just saw two people, but in the blink of an eye, they disappeared.\"","\"Could it be that you're seeing things?\"","\"No way, I can see pretty far now. The strawberry fields are only about a thousand meters from here. There's no way I could have mistaken it.\"","\"Were you looking for us?\"","Before the man finished speaking, a ghostly child's voice echoed in the room.","The men inside were startled.","They all looked towards the corner where the voice came from.","With the power out, the room was lit only by kerosene lamps, making the light dim.","Yun Xiaoxiao and Zheng Yuner had appeared in a dark corner, unnoticed by the men.","Now that they could see the two shadowy figures clearly, the men playing cards stood up, their eyes full of caution.","\"Who are you?!\"","Liang Chao squinted and asked.","\"You just shot a laser at us, and now you're asking who we are? Don't you think it's rude to shoot at people without knowing who they are?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at them.","\"Uh... sorry about that.\"","A boy with a mole on his nose scratched his head, feeling embarrassed.","\"Usually at night, I just habitually use the laser to check the surroundings to see if it's safe.","I accidentally pointed it at you the first time.","But we haven't seen any living people for a long time.","So when I saw you, I was surprised and kept it on for a bit longer.\"","He awkwardly explained.","Seeing that he wasn't lying, Yun Xiaoxiao's irritation lessened a bit.","Her eyes scanned the room and noticed something under one of the poker table's legs.","She took a closer look and saw it was a level four crystal core!","A level four crystal core used as a table leg?","Were they that extravagant?","Yun Xiaoxiao coughed lightly and looked at the boy with the mole.","\"Although you didn't do it on purpose, it did affect us. So, how about this, I won't ask for anything else, just give me this little thing, and we'll call it even.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao pointed at the crystal core under the table leg.","Calling it a \"little thing,\" she did so with a straight face.","\"You want this?\" Liang Chao asked, puzzled.","Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow. \"What, you don't want to give it?\"","\"No, I mean, what's so fun about it? It's just a bit brighter than a rock.","If you like it, we have plenty more in the yard. You can take them all.\" Liang Chao shrugged nonchalantly.","Yun Xiaoxiao: !!","Were they that rich?","Well, these five were all ability users, and their powers weren't weak.","But they were strong and didn't know the value of crystal cores, which was a bit strange.","So, what method did they use to enhance their abilities?","Since Yun Xiaoxiao could hear their thoughts, she knew they weren't lying.","Letting them go to the yard wasn't a trap.","So, Yun Xiaoxiao decided to follow them and check out the yard.","However, as soon as they stepped out of the shadows, the men's gazes focused on Zheng Yuner.","The boy with the mole couldn't help but exclaim, \"My god!\"","Clearly, he was shocked by Zheng Yuner's appearance.","Earlier, she had been in the shadows and wearing a hat, so they couldn't see her face clearly.","But now, as she stepped into the light, the condition of her face and neck was fully visible.","Realizing his rudeness, the boy quickly apologized again.","\"Uh, sorry, I didn't mean to... I just...\"","Before he could finish, Zheng Yuner calmly shook her head.","\"It's fine.\"","Her calmness made the men even more embarrassed."]},{"number":213,"title":"Chapter 213: Then I won't be polite.","paragraphs":["\"Let's go, I'll take you to the courtyard to get them.\"","Liang Chao picked up the kerosene lamp and led the way towards the stairs.","The courtyard was an ordinary farmhouse yard, with a water pool on the right side near the gate.","\"They're in here,\" Liang Chao said, pointing to the bottom of the pool.","By the faint light of the kerosene lamp, Yun Xiaoxiao saw the colorful crystals at the bottom of the pool.","Most of them were level one or two, with a few level three and four crystals.","There weren't many level three and four crystals, but there were plenty of lower-level ones.","The entire pool probably contained several thousand crystals.","\"Did you find all these yourselves?\" Yun Xiaoxiao asked in surprise.","Liang Chao nodded. \"Yes, we accidentally discovered these shiny things inside the zombies' heads and thought they looked pretty, so we brought them back and threw them into the pool.\"","\"But is there really that many zombies around here?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao asked this because she found it strange.","This was just a small village at the foot of a mountain.","Other than the strawberry plantation, this area was mostly scattered farmhouses.","Logically, there shouldn't be too many zombies.","So, where did this group of people get all these crystals from?","\"There aren't many here, but there are plenty on the other side of that mountain,\" Liang Chao said, pointing to the mountain where Xie Youcai's coal mine was located.","\"There are several large warehouses over there, serving as logistics hubs for major online shopping platforms like JD.com and Taobao. There were tens of thousands of employees working there.","We occasionally go there to find some food, and if we encounter zombies, we kill a few.","At first, we just thought these shiny things were pretty, but later we discovered they work well as fuel.","Every time we cook, we throw a few into the stove, and the fire burns much stronger.","So, after that, we started taking these crystals whenever we killed zombies.","We use what we need for cooking and throw the rest into the pool.","It looks nice, and we keep them for future use.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao: ...Using crystals as firewood!","And they even used them to prop up table legs earlier!","This was truly...","Yun Xiaoxiao's mouth twitched.","She had an overwhelming urge to tell them the real purpose of the crystals.","But thinking about the crystals' true function, it gave her another question.","Since they didn't know the real use of the crystals, they probably hadn't consumed any.","So, how did they improve their abilities?","From her observation, the lowest ability level among them was at the peak of level two.","The highest, Liang Chao, had already reached the middle stage of level three.","She voiced her question.","\"Are you talking about the strange power in our bodies?\" Liang Chao asked.","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded.","\"Well, it's no secret,\" Liang Chao said, quite straightforward.","\"It was probably due to some wild berries we ate before.","It was quite a coincidence. Once, we went to the warehouses on the other side of the mountain to look for supplies. We didn't find any, and we almost got bitten by zombies.","Luckily, we managed to escape.","While we were resting, we found a patch of wild plants.","Most importantly, those plants, which looked like grass, were covered in bright red berries.","They looked a bit like strawberries, but they were small and round, about the size of a fingertip.\"","Liang Chao gestured roughly and continued.","\"We were hungry and had nothing to eat, so we picked and ate those berries.","They weren't as sweet as strawberries, but they had some flesh, so we ate quite a few.","As we ate, we noticed something strange.","At first, we felt a burning sensation in our stomachs, like being roasted by fire.","That feeling didn't last long.","Then we realized that the strange energy we had exhausted had returned, and its power was even stronger than before.","We knew it must have been the effect of those berries.","We originally wanted to pick all the berries, but we were worried they might spoil if we kept them too long.","And if we ate them all at once, we weren't sure if there would be any side effects.","So, we didn't pick them all at once. Instead, we went back every few days to eat some and pick a few more.\"","Hearing this, Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow.","No wonder these people didn't go to the strawberry plantation.","With those berries full of strange energy, who would bother with ordinary strawberries?","\"Do you still have those berries?\" Yun Xiaoxiao asked.","Liang Chao shook his head and quickly explained, \"It's not that we're afraid you'll eat them. It's just that those berries haven't been growing lately. We haven't had any for over ten days.\"","Because there were no berries, and they still had some food at home, they hadn't rushed to the warehouses for supplies.","This also led to them running out of tobacco.","Not having any cigarettes was driving them crazy.","Looks like they'd have to go out tomorrow.","\"By the way, as compensation for him using the infrared laser on you earlier, you can take as many of these shiny things as you want. They're not worth anything anyway,\" Liang Chao said.","Yun Xiaoxiao's big, round eyes fixed on Liang Chao, then slowly curved into two crescents.","\"Really?\"","\"Of course.\"","\"You won't regret it?\"","\"Why would I regret it?\"","They're just prettier than stones, not diamonds or gold.","Besides, even diamonds and gold aren't worth anything now.","A pound of rice is much more practical.","\"Since you say that, I won't be polite,\" Yun Xiaoxiao said with a kind smile.","However, this smile made Liang Chao and the others feel like they were about to lose big.","But they couldn't figure out how these things from zombies' heads could make them lose out.","Yun Xiaoxiao took out several large sacks from her backpack and then took off her shoes, stepping into the pool to pick up the crystals one by one and throw them into the sacks.","Zheng Yuner helped her.","In no time, all the crystals in the pool were picked up.","Looking at the bulging sacks, Yun Xiaoxiao smiled cheerfully at Liang Chao and the others.","She took out ten bottles of evolution fluid from her pocket.","\"This is for you.\"","She couldn't be too unfair. These evolution fluids were her compensation to them.","They were high-level evolution fluids corresponding to their current strength, which would help them advance.","\"What's this?\"","Liang Chao and the others looked curiously at the small bottles in Yun Xiaoxiao's hand.","Yun Xiaoxiao gave them a cute smile.","\"This is called evolution fluid. It can be used to enhance the abilities of an evolver. It works the same as those berries you mentioned. Do you want to try it?\"","Looking at Yun Xiaoxiao's innocent face, Liang Chao picked up a bottle of evolution fluid and examined it from side to side.","\"Alright, I'll try it.\"","After a moment, he unscrewed the cap and drank it down.","His companions watched him.","\"Brother Liang, how is it? Did it work?\""]},{"number":214,"title":"Chapter 214: Lost Several Hundred Million in an Instant","paragraphs":["All eyes were on Liang Chao, filled with anticipation.","After finishing his drink, Liang Chao patiently waited to feel the changes in his body.","After a while, he looked up in surprise.","\"It really works! It seems even better than that fruit!\"","Hearing this, the others' eyes lit up.","They all eagerly opened their bottles and drank.","\"Can we drink a second bottle?\" Liang Chao excitedly asked Yun Xiaoxiao.","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded. \"Yes, you can.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, Liang Chao hurriedly downed another bottle.","\"I feel like the energy in my body has increased a lot!\"","\"Me too, me too!\"","\"This stuff is amazing!\"","\"...\"","Everyone was thrilled.","Liang Chao looked at Yun Xiaoxiao, his eyes gleaming.","\"Little sister, do you have more of this? Can we trade other items for some more?\"","After all, strength was everything.","Without strength, even finding supplies was a difficult task.","They naturally wanted to become stronger.","Yun Xiaoxiao rubbed her chin, a sly glint in her eyes.","\"Here's the deal,\" she said. \"You take us to the fruit tree seedlings. I don't need much, just half of them.","In return, I'll give each of you five bottles of Evolution Liquid.","And in the future, I'll supply it indefinitely.","As long as you give me what I need, I'll have it delivered to you.\"","She had considered that many bases might find the journey to Yun City too far and dangerous to buy Evolution Liquid.","So why not change her approach?","As long as those bases had crystals, she could deliver the goods.","After all, she had planes, which made it quite convenient.","Moreover, her supplies were already abundant.","The base was also vigorously developing production.","Even the vegetables and fruits grown by Da Bai in her space, due to the time difference, were piling up and almost becoming too much to consume.","So, besides selling Evolution Liquid, she also planned to sell supplies.","While preserving more human combat power, she could also obtain more crystals to exchange for system rewards, developing the base into the strongest fortress in the apocalypse.","Then, she could truly retire.","Just thinking about it made her feel delightful.","She hoped to enter her retirement life before she turned fifteen.","When they heard Yun Xiaoxiao wanted half of the seedlings, Liang Chao and the others were a bit reluctant.","But when they heard her offer afterward, their eyes widened.","\"You can really supply Evolution Liquid indefinitely and even deliver it to us?!\" the man with a mole on his nose asked skeptically.","\"Of course, I never lie,\" Yun Xiaoxiao replied without batting an eye.","\"What do you need in exchange?\" Liang Chao asked, frowning.","\"That... I'll tell you after we get the seedlings,\" she said.","Liang Chao: ...","Due to time constraints, everyone agreed to set off early the next morning.","They offered a room on the second floor to Yun Xiaoxiao and her companion.","\"Liang Ge, how much Evolution Liquid do you think that little girl has on her?\"","After Yun Xiaoxiao and her companion went to their room, Liang Chao and the others gathered in one of the rooms.","The Short Fat Man couldn't help but ask curiously.","\"What, do you have some idea?\" Liang Chao glanced at him sideways.","The Short Fat Man chuckled. \"There are only two of them, a woman and a child. Don't you think we should...?\"","\"I'm telling you, either keep that little scheme of yours to yourself, or get the hell out!\"","Liang Chao glared at the Short Fat Man, his eyes full of warning.","\"I've said it before, whether you live or die, whether you have food, it all depends on your own abilities. Don't pull any cheap tricks like killing and stealing.\"","After being reprimanded, the Short Fat Man's eyes cleared up a bit.","\"I understand, Liang Ge. I was wrong before. I won't have such thoughts anymore.\"","\"Now, all of you, go back to sleep and get some rest. Tomorrow, after we help them get the seedlings, we'll head to the warehouse to get some food.\"","\"Yes.\"","Hearing the footsteps inside the room, Yun Xiaoxiao quietly slipped away.","Earlier, when they were downstairs, she had overheard that the Short Fat Man among them had some thoughts.","So she wanted to see if they would act on them.","Fortunately, Liang Chao had a good character and quickly stopped his companion's dangerous thoughts.","Otherwise, she might have been tempted to kill again.","The night passed peacefully.","Early the next morning, they set off.","Seeing the missing large sacks of crystals in the yard, Liang Chao and the others were surprised for a moment.","They exchanged glances.","They all thought of the same possibility from each other's eyes.","These two were indeed not ordinary.","Not only could they teleport from thousands of meters away, but they could also take things without anyone noticing.","Ordinary people couldn't do such things.","Under Liang Chao's lead, Yun Xiaoxiao followed them to the back of the mountain.","She hadn't noticed before, but behind the mountain was a large warehouse area.","\"This is it,\" Liang Chao pointed to a lush patch of seedlings.","As agreed, Yun Xiaoxiao harvested half of them.","After picking, she directly threw them into her space.","Although she didn't want to expose her space in front of too many people, she had already taken the crystals earlier, so hiding it wouldn't make much difference. The other party probably already guessed.","Besides, these people would likely only meet her once.","Whether they knew or not didn't matter much.","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao take the seedlings away, Liang Chao and the others' eyes flickered, but they quickly returned to normal.","Yun Xiaoxiao took out the agreed-upon Evolution Liquid from her bag and handed it to them.","\"By the way, you said we could trade for more Evolution Liquid in the future. How exactly? What do we use to trade?\" Liang Chao asked.","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled. \"About once a month, I'll have someone come to your place. All you need to prepare is... crystals.\"","\"Crystals? What are those?\" Liang Chao asked again.","\"Crystals... you've actually seen them before.\"","\"We have?\"","\"Yes, they're those shiny things at the bottom of your yard's pond.\" Yun Xiaoxiao smiled innocently.","Liang Chao and the others: !!!","What?!","Even after Yun Xiaoxiao and her companion left, Liang Chao and the others hadn't recovered.","In just a few seconds, they felt like they had lost several hundred million.","Such precious things, and they had been using them as firewood and table mats!","Most importantly, they had handed over all of them!","They had become the epitome of fools and suckers...","The group was so frustrated that they almost wanted to pound their chests.","Meanwhile, on the other side, Yun Xiaoxiao successfully collected all the coal from the mining area into her space.","Following that, the remaining three helicopters, carrying the last batch of mining area employees, flew towards Yun City.","However, they didn't know that at the same time, a major incident had occurred in Yun City."]},{"number":215,"title":"Chapter 215: Something Went Wrong at the Base","paragraphs":["The helicopter slowly descended over the helipad of Yun City.","From a distance, Yun Xiaoxiao saw Mu Yang talking to someone.","The person was facing away from her, so she couldn't see their face.","Mu Yang's eyebrows furrowed deeply after listening to what the person had to say.","Then, he quickly walked towards her.","This was the first time Yun Xiaoxiao had seen him with such a grave expression.","Hearing Mu Yang's thoughts, Yun Xiaoxiao frowned.","Ling Jing is missing?","Zhong Mingsheng is severely injured?","What on earth happened?!","As soon as the plane landed, Yun Xiaoxiao quickly opened the cabin door.","Mu Yang approached her, his voice heavy.","\"Bad news, something's happened at the base.\"","\"Let's talk while we walk,\" Yun Xiaoxiao said, her small face creased with worry, as she hurried towards the base.","Mu Yang walked beside her, explaining all the information he had gathered.","It seemed that everything was fine until noon today.","It wasn't until Nie Yizhou went to deliver food to Ling Jing that they realized something was wrong.","Ling Jing's room was wide open, empty inside.","Not far from the door, Zhong Mingsheng lay in a pool of blood, while Fan Wenying was unconscious, having hit the corner of a wall.","\"How are Zhong Lao and the others?\" Yun Xiaoxiao asked.","\"Grandma Fan has already woken up, but Zhong Lao was just resuscitated and is still unconscious.\"","Although the base didn't have a professional surgeon, Ye Shuyuan had some knowledge in this area.","Plus, she possessed a healing ability, so she could handle simple injuries.","Zhong Mingsheng had lost a lot of blood, which looked terrifying, but his wounds weren't fatal.","However, being older, his recovery would naturally be slower than that of a young person.","So far, there were no signs of him waking up.","\"What about the assailant?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao's eyes turned serious.","Whoever dared to cause trouble in her base was really asking for it!","The system only detected threats to her and kicked them out of the base.","But it wouldn't interfere with threats to others in the base.","Still, since the attacker could commit the crime within the base, they must have been someone allowed in.","Who could it be?","Mu Yang: \"According to the surveillance footage, only Zhong Lao's younger brother and sister-in-law were seen entering and leaving the research institute at that time.\"","Could it be them?!","Yun Xiaoxiao narrowed her eyes, a murderous glint in them.","She shouldn't have agreed to let them stay just because of Zhong Lao's request!","However, she also felt some confusion.","Zhong Huainong and his wife, Wu Changlan, were a bit cunning and sharp-tongued.","But they didn't seem like the type to commit murder.","Since entering the base, they had been obediently cleaning the hospital, without any other malicious intentions.","Moreover, if not for Zhong Mingsheng and his wife's plea, they wouldn't have been allowed into the base in the first place.","Logically, they should have been grateful to Zhong Mingsheng and his wife, so why would they stab Zhong Mingsheng and push Fan Wenying into a corner?","This was completely unrecognizable behavior.","But how could they have such deep grudges against Zhong Mingsheng and his wife?","Also, why did they take Ling Jing?","\"Have they been caught?\" Yun Xiaoxiao asked.","\"Yes.\"","\"Where?\"","\"They've been brought back to the base.\"","\"Where were they found?\"","\"In the bushes at the fork in the road. They were found unconscious.\"","Upon hearing this, Yun Xiaoxiao frowned.","Unconscious?","\"Ling Jing wasn't with them?\" she asked again.","Mu Yang shook his head, \"No.\"","Full of doubts, Yun Xiaoxiao grabbed Mu Yang and quickly teleported away.","After disappearing for a second, she reappeared, grabbing Zheng Yuner, who was still in a daze, and they vanished again.","When they reappeared, they were at the hospital.","In the spacious cafeteria, Zhong Huainong and his wife sat on the ground, wailing with tears and snot.","\"We're innocent! We really didn't do it, we have no idea what happened!\"","Wu Changlan wailed loudly, her voice filled with grievance.","\"You say we stabbed my brother, how is that possible? I've only ever killed chickens, I've never killed anyone. How could I do something like that? You don't even have clear evidence that it was us!\"","Zhong Huainong also cried out in utter frustration.","Lu Chen frowned.","Due to the lack of surveillance, there was only one camera installed at the entrance of the research institute.","So no one knew what had happened upstairs at the time.","Nie Yizhou crossed his arms, \"But during that time, only you two were seen entering and leaving the research institute, and you also pushed trash out of the base.\"","\"But that doesn't prove it was us!\" Zhong Huainong retorted.","\"Don't tell the truth, do you believe I'll kill you right now?\" Xiao Feng snarled, his face full of impatience.","Zhong Huainong and his wife were both frightened by his aggressive demeanor, shrinking their necks simultaneously.","Zhong Huainong was almost in tears.","\"We're telling the truth! Even if you kill us, we can't confess to something we didn't do.","The police still need evidence to act, you can't just wrong innocent people!\"","\"Still not admitting it, look at the blood on your clothes, isn't that evidence?!\" Xiao Feng glared at him.","Zhong Huainong looked down at his hem.","There was indeed a clear bloodstain there.","\"I don't know! I really don't know where this blood came from, I have no memory of it.\"","Zhong Huainong clutched his head, feeling on the verge of a mental breakdown.","Yun Xiaoxiao, who had just walked in from outside, overheard the conversation.","But after hearing it, her mood only grew heavier.","Because, Zhong Huainong and his wife were indeed not lying.","A person's words might not be true.","But what they think is definitely the most real.","But this still doesn't make sense.","At that time, only they had the opportunity to commit the crime.","And they were found far from the base, in a direction opposite to where the trash was dumped.","Why would they go there?","Also, how do you explain the bloodstains on his clothes?","Yun Xiaoxiao's footsteps attracted the attention of the others.","Nie Yizhou quickly said, \"Little ghost, you're finally back.\"","Before they could catch up, Ye Shuyuan walked in with a sheet of A4 paper.","\"The blood comparison results are out.\"","\"How is it, is it Zhong Lao's?\" Nie Yizhou asked eagerly.","The moment they brought Zhong Huainong and his wife back, they had Ye Shuyuan test the blood on his clothes against Zhong Mingsheng's.","Everyone looked at Ye Shuyuan.","Ye Shuyuan nodded, \"Yes.\"","At this, Xiao Feng grabbed Zhong Huainong by the collar.","\"What do you have to say now?\"","\"I...\" Zhong Huainong felt utterly speechless, \"I really don't know!\"","He was almost in despair.","At that moment, Yun Xiaoxiao suddenly asked, \"Where did you go this morning?\""]},{"number":216,"title":"Chapter 216: Dr. Strangefix","paragraphs":["Zhong Huainong was taken aback.","He didn't know why Yun Xiaoxiao would ask such a question.","But he didn't dare to ignore her inquiry, so he quickly replied, \"We went out to dump the trash this morning.\"","Initially, Yun Xiaoxiao had restricted their movements to the hospital area.","Desiring to prove themselves and earn the freedom to move around the base like everyone else, they had volunteered to handle the base's trash collection.","Every morning, they would wake up early, drive the trash truck, and empty the trash bins across the base.","Then, they would transport the trash to a landfill built outside the base and dump it there.","\"Did you encounter any strange people during your outing?\" Yun Xiaoxiao continued to ask.","As she spoke, Lu Chen and the others seemed to recall something, their expressions subtly changing.","\"There was one, actually!\"","Before Zhong Huainong could speak, his wife, Wu Changlan, jumped in to answer first.","\"This morning, right after we dumped the trash at the landfill and were about to head back, a man approached us asking for directions. He said he was going to some place... I can't remember the name. Anyway, since we didn't know, we didn't engage further with him.","What was strange was that even after we drove off, he remained standing there.","From the rearview mirror, we could see his eyes following our vehicle.","At that moment, I felt a chill run down my spine.","His gaze was unsettling.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow. \"Do you remember what he looked like?\"","\"Two eyes, one nose, one mouth,\" Zhong Huainong counted off.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others: ......","Wu Changlan slapped Zhong Huainong's arm, disdainfully said, \"That's not helpful at all!\"","She thought for a moment, then continued, \"He appeared polite, had a slender build, and his skin was unusually pale, almost sickly. He looked to be in his mid-thirties.","Oh, and his hair was completely white.\"","Hearing this, Yun Xiaoxiao narrowed her eyes.","This description... it sounded somewhat familiar...","Suddenly, her eyebrows shot up.","That's right, the eccentric doctor Xiu Jie, who was known for his obsession with studying zombies in her previous life, fit this description.","She had learned about him from others, who described him as a strange man who captured zombies with special abilities for research.","In the end, he had lost control and been killed by a zombie king.","Calculating his age, he would be about thirty-four now.","He also had white hair and a sickly appearance.","If this man was indeed Xiu Jie, then it was highly likely that he was behind this incident.","Xiu Jie was a rare psychic control-type ability user.","Not only could he control zombies, but he could also manipulate humans.","It was likely that he had already begun subtly controlling Zhong Huainong and Wu Changlan's minds when he first encountered them.","Moreover, Ling Jing's unique physique was exactly the type Xiu Jie favored.","Therefore, it was highly probable that Ling Jing had been taken by him.","But...","If Xiu Jie's goal was to abduct Ling Jing, it meant he must have known about Ling Jing's special physique.","However, the only ones aware of Ling Jing's special physique were Yun Xiaoxiao and Lu Chen and the others.","Based on her understanding of them, they would never disclose such information to outsiders.","This left Yun Xiaoxiao puzzled.","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao deep in thought, Lu Chen looked at her.","\"Do you have a suspect?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao was impressed by Lu Chen's keen observation.","She nodded. \"Yes. Let's go now. We need to find Ling Jing.\"","If the suspect was indeed Xiu Jie, then he would likely be at a small town hospital not far from the Western Base.","Since she couldn't figure it out, the only option was to go and see for herself.","\"What about these two?\"","Nie Yizhou pointed at Zhong Huainong and Wu Changlan.","\"Don't kill us, we're innocent!\"","Seeing their attention shift back to them, Zhong Huainong and Wu Changlan immediately pleaded.","Yun Xiaoxiao frowned. \"Let them go. Have them continue cleaning the base.\"","They weren't lying.","In essence, they weren't at fault.","They had merely been used as pawns.","Right is right, and wrong is wrong.","She wouldn't let her preconceived notions about them lead her to wrongfully punish them and expel them from the base.","It wasn't necessary.","Hearing Yun Xiaoxiao's decision, Zhong Huainong and Wu Changlan quickly thanked her.","\"Thank you, Base Leader, for your fair judgment!\"","Yun Xiaoxiao showed no superfluous expressions, but rather said to Lu Chen and the others, \"Let's go.\"","Since they only had a rough idea of the location, they spent a lot of time searching.","Four days later.","They arrived at a place called Moxi Town.","This was a tourist town, beautifully constructed.","Outside the town was a large river with clear water.","On one side of the riverbank was lush green mountains.","On the other side was the town.","Along the riverside near the town, a long corridor had been built, lined with various shops.","There were stalls selling roasted corn, barbecue, milk tea, cold noodles, and cold skin...","However, at the moment, most of the food on display in these shops had spoiled and emitted a foul odor.","Zombies dressed in various outfits wandered aimlessly throughout the town.","The once bustling town had lost its former vibrancy, now reduced to a desolate and decaying state.","Crossing the bridge over the river, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others drove from the main road onto a side road.","The car stopped, and Mu Yang built a metal platform. He then used a telescope to scan the town.","\"How is it? Did you see the hospital?\" Nie Yizhou asked eagerly.","Mu Yang didn't answer immediately but continued looking.","Then, he moved the telescope back slightly.","\"Found it!\"","He handed the telescope to Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"Take a look, little one.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao took the telescope and, following Mu Yang's indication, looked toward the right front of the town.","Due to the height of the metal platform, they had a clear view of every part of the town.","In the right front of the town stood a hospital.","However, this hospital was quite different from the rest of the town.","While zombies elsewhere were roaming randomly, here, they stood like lifeless wooden stakes along the hospital's outer wall.","At first glance, they resembled human-shaped dolls placed there.","It was the first time they had seen zombies so obediently following orders.","\"Yes, it should be here.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao put down the telescope.","At that moment, in the underground chamber of the hospital on the opposite side.","Ling Jing was bound to a specially designed hospital bed with several chains.","The bed was anchored to the ground, and the chains were embedded in the walls.","In front of the bed, a man in a white lab coat, wearing white gloves and glasses with white frames, narrowed his long eyes as he gazed at the unconscious Ling Jing, a slow smile spreading across his face."]},{"number":217,"title":"Chapter 217: Didn't Anyone Tell You That I Hate Getting Needles the Most","paragraphs":["He looked at Ling Jing as if admiring a piece of art.","Beside the hospital bed, there was a lean man.","His hand bore a snake-shaped tattoo.","At the moment, he was chained to the wall, unable to move.","\"You told me that if the information I provided was correct, you would let me go. Now that you've brought him back, isn't it time to set me free?\"","As soon as the man spoke, Xiu Jie looked up and chuckled lightly.","\"Let you go? Do you think I'm that easy to deal with?\"","\"You want to go back on your word?!\" The man furrowed his brows.","Xiu Jie shrugged, his tone dismissive.","\"So what if I do? What can you do to me?\"","The man's chest heaved with anger. \"You damn...\"","His words cut off abruptly, and his movements froze.","Then, his eyes began to lose focus.","When his head drooped, Xiu Jie let out a disdainful snort and turned back to Ling Jing.","He fetched a glass of transparent liquid, pried open Ling Jing's mouth, and fed it to him.","In no time, Ling Jing, who had been unconscious, slowly opened his eyes.","However, his gaze was unfocused, blank.","Xiu Jie gave Ling Jing a satisfied look, then walked over to the man chained to the wall and unlocked the chains binding him.","He then led the man to Ling Jing's bedside.","Grabbing the man's arm, Xiu Jie rolled up his sleeve and placed it near Ling Jing's mouth.","\"Go on, take a bite. Let me see if it really can cause mutation.\"","Xiu Jie's eyes gleamed with excitement, tinged with a hint of obsessive madness.","But Ling Jing just lay there, motionless.","Not even glancing at him.","Just as Xiu Jie thought Ling Jing wouldn't cooperate and was about to use mental attacks to force him, Ling Jing tilted his head and glanced at the man's arm before taking a bite.","\"Ahhh!\"","The man, who had been numbed by Xiu Jie's control, was instantly awakened by the pain.","He struggled to pull his arm away, but Ling Jing held on tightly.","In the end, due to the excessive force, a whole chunk of flesh was ripped off the man's arm.","He clutched his arm and cried out in pain.","He felt the agony piercing his soul.","At that moment, he regretted it deeply!","He regretted telling this deranged doctor about Ling Jing being a zombie who maintained a human appearance!","Yes, he was the one who, by chance, witnessed Ling Jing biting someone at the rice factory and had been spared by Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","Later, he went to Yun City Base but was turned away at the gate.","They said they had to wait for the base leader to return to determine if he could enter.","While waiting, he happened to see Ling Jing entering Yun City Base.","He also caught a glimpse of people from the rice factory inside the base.","Worried about being recognized, he quietly slipped away.","After wandering for a while, he accidentally arrived at this small town.","But he was captured by this deranged doctor's subordinates.","He was shocked to discover that the doctor was researching zombies!","Moreover, he wanted to use him as a human test subject, injecting serum extracted from mutant zombies' brains into his body!","It was utterly insane!","Would he even survive the injection?","He was terrified.","In a desperate move, he immediately thought of Ling Jing.","If the doctor was so obsessed with studying zombies, he would surely be interested in Ling Jing.","So, he struck a deal with the doctor, offering information about Ling Jing.","But the doctor broke his promise!","As he felt changes rising within him, the man felt both furious and helpless.","Soon, his pupils began to dilate.","His irises shrank, and the whites of his eyes became more prominent.","\"Roar!\"","In no time, he had completely transformed into a mindless zombie.","He let out a roar and lunged at Xiu Jie.","Xiu Jie stood still, his gaze fixed on the zombie.","Just as the man was about to reach Xiu Jie, he suddenly stopped.","Though his mouth twitched and he let out low, guttural sounds, he didn't take another step forward.","It was as if he had been instantly frozen.","Xiu Jie smiled in satisfaction.","\"It really works.\"","He walked to the door and pressed a button.","Soon, someone arrived at the door.","He pushed the transformed zombie toward him.","He ordered, \"Take him out.\"","\"Yes!\"","After the person left, Xiu Jie closed the door again and walked toward the hospital bed.","But before he could get close, there was another knock on the door.","He frowned, annoyed, and opened the door.","\"What is it?\"","\"Doctor Xiu, someone has broken in!\"","\"Deal with them! Get out of here and stop bothering me!\"","Xiu Jie said with an irritated expression.","Afterward, he slammed the door shut.","How annoying, even such a small matter had to disturb him.","It was delaying his research!","He frowned and walked back, approaching the hospital bed. He picked up a syringe, squeezed out some liquid, and pressed on Ling Jing's right wrist, ready to inject.","But just as the needle was about to pierce Ling Jing's skin, a sharp pain struck his head.","He quickly focused his mental energy to resist.","Then, he looked surprisedly at Ling Jing on the bed.","\"You...!\"","The previously blank-eyed Ling Jing now had clear, alert eyes.","His captivating blue eyes sparkled with a mix of mischief, allure, and ruthlessness.","He gripped the chains binding his body and pulled hard.","\"Bang!\"","The chains snapped!","He slowly rose and walked toward Xiu Jie.","Then, he grabbed Xiu Jie's neck with one hand and lifted him off the ground.","\"What, you still want to inject me? Didn't anyone tell you I hate needles the most in this life?\"","Ling Jing gave Xiu Jie a wicked look, tightening his grip.","Xiu Jie's face turned a deep shade of purple, struggling to breathe.","Although Xiu Jie had some skills and had even researched zombie cores, extracting a crude evolution serum, when it came to actual strength, ten of him wouldn't be enough to take on Ling Jing.","Ling Jing's physique was unique, and he couldn't be judged by conventional standards of ability.","Moreover, he was also a psychic.","So Xiu Jie's proud abilities were nothing in Ling Jing's eyes.","Xiu Jie's eyes widened with reluctance.","Why hadn't anyone told him that the person in front of him was also a powerful psychic?!","\"Let... let me go, and I can... help you return... to normal.\"","Xiu Jie managed to squeeze the words out of his throat.","Seeing Ling Jing's eyes flicker, he thought he was on the right track.","He quickly continued, \"Although you still maintain a human appearance and... sanity, the zombie virus in your body is... spreading more and more.","The occasional episodes where you lose control and become... disoriented are likely... signs of the virus worsening.","Let me go, and I promise I will... find a way to remove the remaining virus from your body, allowing you to... return to being a normal human!\"","Xiu Jie spoke haltingly.","Beneath his desperation, a hint of cunning lurked."]},{"number":218,"title":"Chapter 218: Gossip","paragraphs":["Ling Jing smirked wickedly.","\"Is that so? Should I thank you too?\"","He glanced sideways at Xiu Jie.","\"Do you really think I'm that stupid to let you keep sticking needles in me?","If you were lying to me, saying you've developed a vaccine, and then injected me with some poison, wouldn't I be dead for sure?\"","\"No, no, I... mmph...\"","Before Xiu Jie could say anything more, a strong sense of suffocation hit his neck.","He struggled to pry Ling Jing's hand off, but it was as hard as iron, completely unmovable.","His legs kicked wildly, and his breathing grew weaker and weaker.","When Yun Xiaoxiao entered, she saw Xiu Jie, just having breathed his last, being casually tossed to the ground by Ling Jing like trash.","Their eyes met.","Neither spoke.","But the next moment, both of them moved almost simultaneously!","Fortunately, Yun Xiaoxiao's mental defenses were quick, or she would have been turned into a fool right then and there.","The vines she shot out were also swiftly dodged by Ling Jing.","In an instant, a massive wave of black fog surged towards Yun Xiaoxiao.","Filled with intense dark power, it brought an inexplicable sense of terror and oppression.","Yun Xiaoxiao frowned, quickly teleporting before the black fog could engulf her, appearing behind Ling Jing.","She unleashed a layer of ice at his body.","Ling Jing seemed to sense it and moved away just in time.","In the blink of an eye, the two had exchanged several rounds.","\"Pfft~\"","A burst of gas escaped from Yun Xiaoxiao's body.","Ling Jing was instantly frozen in place!","Yun Xiaoxiao closed in, swinging a hand knife towards the back of Ling Jing's neck.","With all her strength, Ling Jing immediately collapsed, unconscious.","\"Ugh~ What's that smell?\"","At that moment, Nie Yizhou just walked in.","He waved his hand in front of his nose.","Yun Xiaoxiao: ...","Some questions don't need to be asked so explicitly!","Earlier, as soon as she entered, she noticed Ling Jing's gaze was off.","His expression was cold, as if looking at a stranger.","There was even a hint of aggression.","This wasn't the usual Ling Jing.","She had suspected that Ling Jing might have developed another personality, just as Zhong Mingsheng had predicted.","Previously, she had been looking for an opportunity to spar with Ling Jing.","Coincidentally, she had also learned of Ling Jing's intent to attack her.","So she took advantage of the situation to make her move.","But she hadn't expected Ling Jing's strength to have increased so much.","They had actually fought to a draw.","So, as the saying goes, comparing oneself to others can be infuriating.","This was a stark example!","Although she had many advantages, she couldn't match someone with a special physique and extraordinary talent.","Of course, with her spatial cheat, Ling Jing definitely couldn't beat her.","She could just wear him out over time.","But she didn't have a masochistic tendency and wasn't planning to exhaust herself to death.","So after a brief spar, she chose the quickest and most effective method.","Her stinky fart ability, though unpleasant, was effective!","She glanced at the already dead Xiu Jie and felt a bit of sympathy.","Whether in his previous life or this one, he had played with fire, inviting trouble upon himself, leading to his own demise.","That was quite unique.","Actually, Xiu Jie was also a talented individual.","In his previous life, besides the evolution serum developed by the northern base, Xiu Jie had also developed one.","But his serum had too many impurities and obvious side effects, so it was eventually phased out.","\"What happened to him?\"","Nie Yizhou pointed at the unconscious Ling Jing on the ground.","Lu Chen and a few others also entered at that moment.","Yun Xiaoxiao briefly explained the situation about Ling Jing developing a new personality.","Afterward, everyone's expressions grew serious.","After looting everything of value from the hospital, Yun Xiaoxiao and her group hurried back to the base.","On their return, Zhong Mingsheng had already woken up.","He apologized to Yun Xiaoxiao, admitting that it was indeed his brother, Zhong Huainong, who had stabbed him.","Although he felt something was off with his brother and sister-in-law's behavior, as if they didn't recognize them,","they had indeed taken Ling Jing away and caused a lot of trouble for Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","So he couldn't defend them anymore.","He told Yun Xiaoxiao to handle the matter as she saw fit, without considering his feelings.","He had no face to ask for leniency.","If it weren't for his pleading with Yun Xiaoxiao to take in his brother's family, this disaster wouldn't have happened.","Yun Xiaoxiao briefly explained Xiu Jie's ability to control people.","She also mentioned her arrangements for Zhong Huainong and his wife.","Zhong Mingsheng was immensely grateful, repeatedly thanking her.","Although he had said it himself, Zhong Huainong was still his brother.","Knowing they could stay, he was very happy.","He promised that after recovering, he would focus on research.","Yun Xiaoxiao didn't pressure him, telling him to prioritize his health.","There was no rush; he could start research after fully recovering.","Meanwhile, she had all the items from the northern research institute stored in the hospital's research building.","This would facilitate Zhong Mingsheng's follow-up research.","As for Ling Jing...","He woke up the same night they returned to the base.","Surprisingly, he had returned to normal.","This left Yun Xiaoxiao and the others feeling a bit awkward, fully prepared for a confrontation.","But as long as he was fine, that was what mattered.","Otherwise, she would have had to figure out how to deal with him.","She just hoped this normal state would last longer.","Long enough for Zhong Mingsheng to develop a treatment plan.","In the following days, Yun Xiaoxiao was busy arranging for Xie Youcai and others to start mining coal near Jin Xiaoqing's place.","She also brought a lot of supplies to Jin Xiaoqing's family, asking them to prepare meals for the workers.","Lu Chen's training of the guard team had yielded significant results, with many now capable of independent missions.","So some of the guard team was also assigned to the mining area.","Lei Ming led his team to execute this mission, responsible for ensuring the workers' safety.","Before they knew it, the time for the western base's symposium was almost here.","Yun Xiaoxiao planned to leave in a couple of days.","\"What are you two grinning about?\"","From a distance, Yun Xiaoxiao saw Nie Yizhou and Xiao Feng standing by the plaza, whispering to each other with mischievous smiles.","\"Hey, kid, come take a look.\"","Nie Yizhou waved at her.","The smile on his face clearly said he had just gotten some juicy gossip.","Curious, she walked over.","Following their gaze, she saw Zheng Xin'er, the new leader of Yangcheng Base, holding a flower and offering it to Lu Chen.","She was smiling brightly, saying something.","That's right, Zheng Xin'er, the new base leader of Yangcheng Base, had come to their place early because she was also heading to the western base.","She said she wanted company on the journey and planned to travel together.","She also wanted to exchange for some evolution serum.","After seeing the internal scene of Yun City, they had marveled at it.","Immediately, they paid the accommodation fee and checked into the base's hotel.","Yun Xiaoxiao happily pulled out a handful of melon seeds, munching and enjoying the show.","\"We don't hog the fun, right?\"","Nie Yizhou naturally grabbed some melon seeds.","Yun Xiaoxiao generously offered some to Xiao Feng, \"Want some?\"","Xiao Feng shook his head.","\"Don't mind him, let's eat.\" Nie Yizhou pulled Yun Xiaoxiao.","Then, the two squatted on the ground, eating melon seeds and watching the drama.","Their actions were indeed a bit... shady."]},{"number":219,"title":"Chapter 219: Can't Even Get a Small Advantage","paragraphs":["Xiao Feng glanced indifferently at the two people squatting on the ground.","A hint of disdain flashed through his eyes.","How... childish...","Just as the three of them were enjoying their melon-eating session, Lu Chen turned around and walked towards them.","Zheng Xin'er's face showed a flicker of disappointment, but she quickly regained her smile.","As soon as she looked up, she saw Yun Xiaoxiao and the others, so she also walked over.","She was a bit faster than Lu Chen.","So, although they weren't in sync, they arrived almost simultaneously.","\"Why are you looking at me? I'm not here for you. Can't I come to see our Xiaoxiao?\"","Zheng Xin'er gave Lu Chen a sideways glance and walked up to Yun Xiaoxiao.","She fished a candy out of her pocket.","\"Xiaoxiao, this is very sweet, for you.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao reached out and took it, her gaze shifting between Zheng Xin'er and Lu Chen, a teasing smile playing on her lips.","\"Sister Xin'er, what's going on with you two?\"","Zheng Xin'er casually swept her hair back and laughed frankly.","\"Nothing much, just that I like him, but he doesn't like me.","I'm beautiful and capable, so if he doesn't like me, it's his loss.","I don't feel any pity for myself.","It's hard to find a three-legged frog, but two-legged men? There are plenty out there.\"","Lu Chen: ......","Yun Xiaoxiao and Nie Yizhou struggled to suppress their laughter.","After the brief interlude, the plan to head to the western base was set in motion.","Those going included Lu Chen, Ling Jing, Nie Yizhou, Xiao Feng, and Zheng Yuner.","Mu Yang stayed behind to handle base affairs.","Meanwhile, Zheng Xin'er led seven others from her base to join Yun Xiaoxiao's group.","Zheng Xin'er hooked her arm around Zheng Yuner's shoulder, smiling charmingly and full of allure.","\"Sister, look, our names are only one character apart. Isn't that a special kind of fate?\"","Being suddenly draped over the shoulder, Zheng Yuner reflexively wanted to resist.","But hearing a female voice, she stopped her actions.","She was surprised that someone would willingly touch her like this.","In the base, although Yun Xiaoxiao had made it clear that no one dared to look at her with strange eyes,","few people were willing to take the initiative to get close to her.","She turned her head to look at Zheng Xin'er.","The other woman was very beautiful, a true beauty.","Her personality was bold and her whole being exuded a wild charm.","Such a person was striking, making it hard not to be drawn to her.","Even as a woman, it was easy to be captivated by the smile on her face.","Zheng Yuner nodded slightly, politely saying, \"Yes, it does seem quite fated.\"","\"The weather has been getting colder lately. Do you have any thick clothes? If not, I have an extra one here that you can wear.\" Zheng Xin'er smiled.","Zheng Yuner shook her head, \"No, thank you. Xiaoxiao has already given me many clothes to change into, but still, thank you.\"","\"What are you thanking me for? Women should help each other out.","Ah, if it weren't for so many people relying on me, I'd love to move to your base.","The environment and conditions there are really great.\"","Zheng Xin'er exclaimed.","Zheng Yuner pursed her lips, \"Yes, I feel very fortunate.\"","From the moment she landed on the base's helipad, she had been in a state of shock.","In awe, she also felt grateful for how fortunate she was to have met Yun Xiaoxiao and been able to live in such a secure base.","It was hard for her to imagine that this base had all the amenities—water, electricity, gas—and even had shopping malls, supermarkets, markets, clothing stores, shoe stores...","If it weren't for knowing that zombies were rampant outside, she might have thought she was still in some peaceful city before the apocalypse.","After preparations were made, the group set off.","A motorhome and two SUVs sped out of the base, heading down the main road.","However, by that evening, snow began to fall from the sky.","\"My goodness, it's snowing?!\"","Nie Yizhou stared at the hexagonal crystals landing on the windshield, his eyes wide with surprise.","He rolled down the window and stuck his hand out.","Then, he carefully examined the snowflakes on his sleeve, his face full of astonishment.","\"It really is snow!\"","Xiao Feng also glanced out the window, his expression serious.","\"That likely means the extreme cold weather is about to set in.\"","At the same time, everyone who saw the snow felt heavy hearts.","Some who had previously doubted the coming of the extreme cold spent the night sleepless.","Because of the snow, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others decided not to continue traveling at night.","They found a two-story house by the roadside.","The door was locked.","Originally thinking they might have to deal with zombies inside, they were surprised to find no zombies when they opened the door.","The owner of the house must have been out at the time.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others quickly tidied up and started preparing dinner.","Zheng Xin'er and her group took out boxed meals to eat.","These were purchased when they were in Yun City.","For them, who often ate instant noodles on missions, being able to eat boxed meals outside was a rare luxury.","\"What are you guys having tonight?\"","Zheng Xin'er had just finished preparing her boxed meal when she walked over to Yun Xiaoxiao's group.","\"We're just having something simple,\" Yun Xiaoxiao replied, carrying a box of beef out of the motorhome.","Behind her, Lu Chen was taking out a small generator from the vehicle.","Nie Yizhou held an induction cooker, and Ling Jing carried a pot.","Zheng Yuner wasn't idle either; she set up a small table and brought out various side dishes from the motorhome, arranging them on the table.","Xiao Feng also brought out a cleaned rabbit and started preparing the seasoning.","The aroma wafted from the pot...","Zheng Xin'er, who was nearby, was already dumbfounded.","She looked at Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"You said something simple... is this... hot pot?!\"","Yun Xiaoxiao shrugged, \"Yeah, once the broth is ready, just drop the ingredients in and cook them.\"","She thought this was much more convenient than stir-frying.","It really was a simple meal.","Zheng Xin'er's mouth twitched.","While that might be true, compared to their boxed meals, this was anything but simple!","Ah, indeed.","There's a huge gap between people.","As a base leader, she really lived a somewhat shabby life.","The aroma from the hot pot made Zheng Xin'er and her companions feel their boxed meals weren't as tasty.","It just felt like... something was missing.","Sister Xin'er, why don't you come over and join us for some?","Just as Zheng Xin'er and her group were struggling to enjoy their meals, a pleasant voice rang out.","Zheng Xin'er looked up to see Yun Xiaoxiao smiling brightly at her.","She was immediately touched to the core.","Xiaoxiao sister was so thoughtful!","\"Sure, sure, I was already craving it from the smell.\"","\"Then come on over, I'll charge you a bit, three level one crystal cores per person or one level two crystal core, how about it?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao spoke in a very agreeable tone.","Zheng Xin'er, who was excited to move forward, twitched her mouth.","Of course...","This little girl's \"cheap\" wasn't easy to take.","She was cunning, but it was hard to dislike her.","\"Deal.\"","Zheng Xin'er agreed without hesitation.","For food, a few crystals were nothing.","After eating, they could just kill a few more zombies to get more."]},{"number":220,"title":"Chapter 220: The Car Almost Got Hit","paragraphs":["The snow fell all night and stopped by the next morning.","Many people thought it was just a false alarm and still clung to a bit of luck.","But Yun Xiaoxiao knew that this was just the appetizer.","The real heavy snowstorm had not officially begun.","For the next two days, they kept moving.","During this time, they encountered some small groups of zombies.","But everyone in this group was no pushover, and they dealt with them very efficiently.","\"We should be able to reach the territory of the Western Base in about half a day,\" Lu Chen said, glancing at the map.","\"Let's pick up the pace then. We should try to get there before nightfall,\" Yun Xiaoxiao suggested.","So, the speed of all three vehicles increased.","\"Screech!\"","Suddenly, as they passed a junction, a modified red sedan came barreling down a slope.","Fortunately, Xiao Feng reacted quickly and swerved the car just in time, otherwise, they would have collided head-on.","Zheng Xin'er's two cars also slammed on the brakes, narrowly avoiding a chain-reaction pile-up.","\"Can you even drive, you idiot?!\"","From the red sedan, a green-haired boy with earrings stuck his head out of the window, glaring at Xiao Feng.","The other party was at fault first, yet he had the audacity to curse. Xiao Feng's temper flared.","He was about to get out and settle things with the guy.","Nie Yizhou was also furious. \"Let's go, teach him a lesson! How dare he drive recklessly and then yell!\"","It's a rule of the road: when turning, yield to oncoming traffic!","The guy didn't slow down while turning at a downhill junction, and on top of that, he had the nerve to blame others. Anyone would be furious.","Yun Xiaoxiao was still unaware of what was happening when she heard Xiao Feng and Nie Yizhou's indignant voices.","She, along with Lu Chen, Ling Jing, and Zheng Yuner, got out of the car.","As soon as they stepped out, they saw a red sedan parked a few meters in front of their car.","The door opened, and a green-haired boy and a heavily made-up girl got out.","Seeing Xiao Feng and Nie Yizhou storming towards them, the green-haired man showed no fear.","\"What, you think you can start a fight? Do you know who my dad is? Be careful he... Whoa, you're serious!\"","Before the green-haired man could finish his sentence, Xiao Feng hurled a fireball at him.","The green-haired man quickly dodged, but some of the hair at the back of his head still got singed.","A nasty burnt smell filled the air.","The heavily made-up woman beside him shrieked and immediately hid behind the car.","His beloved hair was burned, and the green-haired man was furious.","\"You dared to burn my hair!\"","\"You like it, don't you?\" Nie Yizhou asked with a grin.","Then, turning to Xiao Feng, he said lazily, \"I think we should burn it all off. A bald head would definitely grab attention, don't you think?\"","\"I think that's a great idea,\" Xiao Feng agreed.","Green-haired man: !!!","How dare these people not know who he is?!","They were being so disrespectful!","And they wanted to burn his precious hair!","He quickly pulled out a gun and aimed it at Xiao Feng.","But before he could fire, a figure suddenly appeared next to him.","With a sharp chop to his wrist, the gun slipped from his hand.","He stared at Nie Yizhou, who had appeared out of nowhere, in astonishment.","\"You... how did you get here?!\"","\"That's a secret,\" Nie Yizhou said with a smirk.","With the gun gone and realizing how powerful Xiao Feng and Nie Yizhou were, the green-haired man began to panic.","As the two men closed in, he backed away while warning, \"I'm telling you, if you dare touch even one hair on my head, my dad won't let you off!\"","But his warning was treated as nothing more than hot air by Xiao Feng and Nie Yizhou.","They continued to close the distance, cracking their knuckles, ready for a good fight.","But just then, the roar of several cars came from the slope.","The green-haired man's eyes lit up.","He immediately became cocky. \"You're done for! My dad's here! Hah, let's see if you still dare to... Ow! Ow! It hurts!\"","Before he could finish, Xiao Feng and Nie Yizhou pounced on him, punching him repeatedly.","\"Kid, don't be so arrogant. It's easy to get beaten, you know,\" Nie Yizhou said, patting his face.","\"And stop relying on your dad all the time. It just makes you look like a useless waste.\"","\"Hey, isn't that the young base leader's car?\"","At the same time, inside a green armored vehicle, the driver exclaimed in surprise.","\"Base leader, look, is that the young base leader being beaten up?\"","Wang Dahai had been resting with his eyes closed when he suddenly heard his subordinate's words.","He quickly opened his eyes.","Through the car window, he clearly saw his precious son being pummeled on the ground.","His eyes darkened instantly.","Who dared to lay a hand on his son?!","\"Drive over there quickly!\"","He commanded coldly.","The driver didn't dare delay and sped down the slope.","After a series of screeching brakes, a green armored vehicle and several modified sedans came to a stop by the roadside.","The door of the armored vehicle opened, and a middle-aged man with a furious expression stepped out.","\"What are you doing?!\"","He bellowed in a deep voice, \"Release my son at once!\"","At the sound, Xiao Feng and Nie Yizhou gave Wang Qingdong one last kick before standing up to look in the direction of the voice.","\"So, you're his dad,\" Nie Yizhou said with a chuckle, crossing his arms.","Wang Dahai frowned.","He wasn't sure what Nie Yizhou meant by that.","All he knew was that they had beaten his son.","He looked stern and raised his hand, signaling his men to draw their guns.","Instantly...","\"Swish, swish, swish~\"","A dozen men emerged from the cars behind.","Each one held a gun, aiming it at Xiao Feng and Yun Xiaoxiao's group.","But before they could pull the trigger, several more cars arrived from behind Yun Xiaoxiao's group.","Seeing the insignia on the cars, Wang Dahai frowned and signaled his men to hold their fire.","Jiang Huai's car stopped behind Zheng Xin'er's.","\"Xiaoxiao!\"","Long Zhe jumped out of the car and happily walked up to Yun Xiaoxiao.","Jiang Huai followed closely behind.","He greeted Yun Xiaoxiao, Lu Chen, and the others.","It was then that he noticed Wang Dahai.","\"Hai Ge, long time no see,\" he said with a smile."]},{"number":221,"title":"Chapter 221: Stupid and Arrogant","paragraphs":["Wang Dahai and Jiang Huai were old acquaintances.","The two of them met in the army.","Jiang Huai had joined the army long before Wang Dahai.","However, due to his hot-tempered and reckless nature, he had violated military discipline multiple times and was eventually discharged.","It was said that later, he started his own security company, which turned out to be quite successful.","After a brief exchange of pleasantries, Wang Qingdong grew impatient.","He tugged at Wang Dahai, \"Dad, you have to stand up for me! Look at what they did to me, I'm almost disfigured! And my hair, look, it's almost burned off.\"","It was then that Wang Dahai remembered there was still an unresolved matter.","\"Sorry, Jiang Huai, just a small issue. Wait for me over there for a moment, and we'll catch up properly later.\"","Jiang Huai looked at him with confusion, then at Yun Xiaoxiao and the others, who were being glared at by Wang Dahai.","\"Brother Dahai, is there some kind of misunderstanding here?\"","He wanted to mediate in good faith.","However, as soon as he finished speaking, Wang Qingdong retorted unhappily, \"What misunderstanding? They beat me, that's the truth! Dad, you have to avenge me!\"","Jiang Huai glanced at Wang Qingdong as if he were an idiot.","If it weren't for Wang Dahai's sake, he wouldn't have bothered saying that.","He didn't say it to save Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","Rather, he had a gut feeling that Wang Dahai and his group wouldn't be a match for Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","After all, Wang Dahai was an old acquaintance, and Jiang Huai didn't want to watch him walk into a trap.","But who would have thought that not only was Wang Dahai reckless, but his son was even worse.","Stupid and arrogant.","Wang Dahai, however, still had some sense.","After Jiang Huai's reminder, his anger was somewhat suppressed.","Jiang Huai had been one of the best recruits in several intakes, physically strong, intelligent, and prudent in his actions.","If even he thought there was a misunderstanding, then it was indeed worth clarifying first.","Although Wang Dahai doted on his son, he also knew what kind of person Wang Qingdong was.","Earlier, he had been so enraged by the sight of his son's bruised face that he lost his cool.","But Jiang Huai's arrival disrupted the rhythm, allowing him to calm down.","Moreover, Jiang Huai seemed to know those people.","Out of respect for Jiang Huai, he didn't want to make a move at this moment.","So, he frowned and looked at Wang Qingdong.","\"What exactly happened? Tell me clearly, and don't lie!\"","His tone was stern.","His already fierce face looked even more intimidating.","Wang Qingdong pouted, glaring angrily at Jiang Huai.","It was this guy meddling in the middle!","\"Speak up!\" Wang Dahai glared again.","Initially, he didn't think his son was at fault, but now, seeing his son's behavior, Wang Dahai wasn't so sure.","This was exactly how his son would act when he was trying to justify his mistakes.","\"I didn't do anything wrong, I just went a bit fast down the slope.\"","Wang Qingdong pouted, clearly dissatisfied.","\"Their speed wasn't slow either, and they almost crashed because of me.","They just started beating me without saying a word, obviously they're the ones at fault!\"","\"Ha, was that fast? You were practically flying!\"","Nie Yizhou scoffed.","\"It was a downhill turn, and you were drifting? You think you're in the right?","Even if you had a better attitude afterward and apologized, this matter would have been over.","We wouldn't have held it against you.","After all, anyone can speed sometimes.","But you? Not only did you not admit your mistake, you started cursing and acting tough, as if we were soft targets to be bullied?\"","From the conversation and the positions of the vehicles, as well as the skid marks on the ground, Wang Dahai and the others understood what had happened.","He immediately grabbed Wang Qingdong's ear.","\"You little brat, I've told you to slow down every time!","This beating wasn't in vain, you deserved it.\"","Wang Qingdong: !!!","Is this really my dad?","\"Don't look at me like that, you're spoiled by your grandparents!\" Wang Dahai glared at him.","\"If you don't change your temper, you'll suffer a big loss someday.\"","\"And what about you? Your temper isn't any better.\"","Wang Qingdong muttered under his breath.","\"What are you mumbling about?\" Wang Dahai's eyes widened.","Wang Qingdong pouted, \"Nothing.\"","\"Alright, this matter was my son's fault first, but you've already beaten him, so I think we can call it even, what do you say, everyone?\"","Wang Dahai looked at Xiao Feng and Nie Yizhou.","The two shrugged, \"Sure.\"","It was always better to avoid making enemies.","After all, you couldn't just kill someone because you didn't like them.","The son might not be great, but the father seemed reasonable.","Although his initial attitude was a bit off-putting, his protectiveness was understandable.","With the misunderstanding cleared up, the groups continued on their way together.","Their destinations were the same.","They were all heading to the Western Base for a meeting.","\"Jiang Huai, do you know them?\"","To catch up, Wang Dahai and Jiang Huai got into the same car.","Wang Qingdong was sitting in the passenger seat.","By \"them,\" he meant Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","Jiang Huai nodded, \"I've had a few encounters with them.\"","\"What's their background?\" Wang Dahai asked.","Although he sometimes acted impulsively, it didn't mean he was stupid.","If he were, he wouldn't have built a security company into such a large scale.","And after the apocalypse, his strong execution led him to establish a base.","After calming down, he had carefully observed those people.","He had a gut feeling that each of them was extraordinary.","Even the little kid looked unusual.","Auras were a strange thing.","Some people seemed untrustworthy at first glance, while others appeared calm and reserved.","And some people just had an innate, overwhelming presence.","It was like the difference between seeing a rabbit and a tiger.","\"Does your base listen to the radio?\" Jiang Huai asked.","\"Yeah, why?\" Wang Dahai was puzzled.","\"They're from Yun City Base.\"","\"You mean that Yun City that claims to have some kind of evolution serum and sells supplies?\"","\"That's right.\"","\"It's them!\" Wang Dahai was surprised.","He asked belatedly, \"Are they really that strong?\"","\"Yes, among them, I have no confidence in beating at least three of them.\"","Jiang Huai spoke frankly.","He didn't feel embarrassed to admit he might not be a match for them.","His attitude was very candid.","This made Wang Dahai even more shocked.","He had long known about Jiang Huai's capabilities.","Being able to manage so many psionics at Rongsheng Base showed that his psionic level must be quite high.","Yet, even he admitted he couldn't beat three of them.","One he could understand.","Three?","Was that too exaggerated?","Were they really that powerful?"]},{"number":222,"title":"Chapter 222: Arrival at the Western Base","paragraphs":["Although Jiang Huai had already sensed the unusual nature of the other group, his attitude made him realize even more deeply the true strength of these individuals.","He felt a sense of relief now.","Fortunately, he hadn't acted rashly earlier.","Otherwise, the situation could have escalated in unpredictable ways.","\"Brother Jiang Huai, are you exaggerating their strength? In my opinion, they're just average,\" Wang Qingdong said dismissively, leaning back in the passenger seat.","\"Just average? And yet you got beaten so badly! Don't you have any self-awareness?!\" Wang Dahai roared, nearly bursting Wang Qingdong's eardrums.","Wang Dahai continued to berate his son with a mix of frustration and disappointment. \"If only you'd put more effort into learning martial arts and shooting! But no, you just waste your time chasing women or hanging out with your worthless friends at bars. Your brain is probably already mush!\"","Wang Qingdong: !!","Look who you're talking about!","Before you criticize me, why don't you take a good look at yourself!","Of course, he dared not speak these words aloud.","His father's fists were not to be taken lightly.","They might be even more brutal than the beating he had just received.","He pursed his lips and remained silent.","The convoy moved swiftly forward.","As the sky began to darken, they finally caught sight of a large military training camp nestled at the foot of a mountain.","The camp was vast, surrounded by earthen walls reinforced with metal.","A deep trench had been dug outside the walls.","Beyond the trench, a barbed wire fence had been erected.","The barbed wire was studded with sharp spikes, many of which were stained with dried blood.","Some spikes even had remnants of decaying flesh from zombies.","On the tall walls, guards patrolled at regular intervals.","Even along the barbed wire, sentries kept a watchful eye.","These guards stood tall and alert, their expressions serious, showing no signs of laxity.","The disciplined and solemn atmosphere made it clear that these were well-trained professionals, not just random civilians pressed into service.","Seeing the familiar base gate, Yun Xiaoxiao's eyes flickered with a subtle emotion.","This was the place where she had spent the most time in her previous life.","Those five years here were the most stable and peaceful she had known.","It was here that she learned to read and write, and where she trained with Lu Chen in various killing techniques.","However, this place had also brought her much unhappiness.","The zombie siege, for instance, had shattered her peaceful existence.","Lu Chen's death, the destruction of the base, and the tragic demise of many friends...","Noticing Yun Xiaoxiao's unease, Lu Chen frowned.","He suddenly recalled that Yun Xiaoxiao had once mentioned the place where she died in her previous life...","He glanced up at the base gate in the distance.","It seemed to be the Western Base!","He now understood the source of her emotional turmoil.","\"It's all in the past,\" he comforted her.","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded. \"Yes, it's all in the past.\"","Ling Jing, standing nearby, raised an eyebrow.","His gaze shifted between Yun Xiaoxiao and Lu Chen, his eyes filled with scrutiny and curiosity.","There must be some secret between these two that others were unaware of.","The convoy came to a halt at the base gate.","A man in a military coat, holding a rifle, approached the barbed wire fence.","He asked Yun Xiaoxiao and the others about their identities, his expression serious.","Upon learning that they were guests from major bases, he quickly stepped aside to inform the base using a walkie-talkie.","Soon, the gate opened.","A military jeep emerged from within.","The vehicle drove through the gate, crossed the bridge over the trench, and stopped in front of the barbed wire fence.","A man in a green military coat stepped out.","\"Hello, I'm Hao Ren from the Western Base.\"","\"Hao Ren? Ha! That's good, at least not a bad guy,\" Nie Yizhou chuckled quietly from the back.","Xiao Feng, standing next to him, gave him a look of disdain.","\"Can you be serious for once?\"","\"How am I not being serious? Tell me, what part of me isn't?\" Nie Yizhou retorted.","\"I can't be bothered to argue with you. It's a waste of breath,\" Xiao Feng rolled his eyes.","\"You think I care to talk to you? Your temper stinks like rotten eggs.\"","Xiao Feng: !!","If not for the inappropriate setting, the two would have surely engaged in a \"friendly\" sparring match.","\"Please follow me inside. The meeting will begin tomorrow, so for now, I'll take you to your accommodations to rest,\" Hao Ren said humbly.","Of course, before entering, they had to go through the routine check to ensure the safety of the base's inhabitants.","After confirming that everything was in order, they were allowed to proceed.","Everyone got back into their vehicles and followed Hao Ren into the base.","Inside the base, in addition to the original barracks, several new buildings had been constructed.","Unlike the earthen structures, these were brick buildings similar to the barracks.","The base had expanded far beyond the original military training camp, covering a much wider area.","Survivors within the base lived in an orderly manner.","Some were washing clothes, others were making small crafts, chopping wood, cooking, running, practicing martial arts, or training with crossbows and other weapons...","The survivors' lives were well-organized.","Almost everyone had a task to fulfill.","Even the children participated, running and undergoing basic training.","Yun Xiaoxiao's gaze fell on a few children running on the playground.","She raised an eyebrow.","She recognized them; they were the ones who had ostracized her back then.","However, she had never taken them seriously.","Ostracizing her? As long as she didn't care, it didn't matter.","In fact, it was she who looked down on them.","After all, in the face of absolute strength, everything else was insignificant.","In her previous life, as a member of the base, she had to follow the rules and train alongside the other children.","Lu Chen, in order to obtain more supplies, often had to go on missions and couldn't always be by her side.","So, most of her time was spent training on the playground or practicing on her own.","Only when Lu Chen returned would he give her additional training.","However, she had a high level of comprehension and a strong learning ability.","Lu Chen usually only had to teach her once or twice for her to grasp the essence.","The rest was up to her to explore, train, and practice.","As a result, whenever these people tried to cause trouble for her, they would end up crying after being beaten by her.","Over time, they stopped bothering her.","Of course, they also ostracized her even more.","The past, like fleeting clouds, passed before Yun Xiaoxiao's eyes.","Although there had been some minor conflicts with these people in her previous life, now they seemed trivial.","After all, the images of their tragic deaths still lingered in her mind.","Seeing these familiar faces alive and well brought a sense of relief to Yun Xiaoxiao's heart.","Soon, they passed through the training area and arrived at a five-story white building.","\"Your rooms are upstairs. Please follow me,\" Hao Ren said, leading Yun Xiaoxiao and the others into the building.","After showing them to their rooms, he added, \"Please take some time to rest. We've prepared dinner for you, and someone will notify you shortly and guide you to the dining area.\""]},{"number":223,"title":"Chapter 223: Dark Clouds Looming, Disaster Approaching","paragraphs":["After Hao Ren left, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others moved some essential supplies from the car into the room.","They had to maintain appearances.","Otherwise, if they brought nothing yet had an endless supply of food and goods, it would inevitably arouse suspicion.","The hallway was divided into many small rooms.","Each room contained only a bunk bed and a small cabinet.","Nothing else was provided.","The far right of each floor housed the public restroom and washing area.","Yun Xiaoxiao shared a room with Zheng Yuner.","After tidying up, everyone took a breather when someone knocked on the door.","It was the person Hao Ren mentioned, coming to notify them about dinner.","Thus, everyone descended the stairs and gathered downstairs.","Upon reaching the ground floor, they realized they weren't the only ones notified; there were many unfamiliar faces.","Roughly counting, there were about a hundred and twenty to thirty people.","These were likely from other bases.","It seemed that quite a few bases had come to attend this meeting.","A large group of people gradually made their way to the dining location.","It wasn't far from their residence, just on the second floor of the base's cafeteria.","Yun Xiaoxiao was somewhat familiar with this place.","The second floor was off-limits to ordinary survivors.","Only those with status and abilities within the base could freely access it.","In her previous life, Lu Chen, due to his outstanding abilities, had significant privileges.","So occasionally, he would bring her here for a better meal.","The tables in the cafeteria were arranged in several long rows.","Many chairs were placed on both sides of each row.","\"Please feel free to take a seat; the dishes will be served shortly,\" Hao Ren greeted everyone with a smile.","As Yun Xiaoxiao and her group were about to find a seat nearby, a large man pushed them aside and plopped down in the spot they had intended to occupy.","He then looked at them with a challenging smile.","\"Sorry, but I think this seat suits my temperament better.\"","\"Hmm, indeed, it does suit you,\" Yun Xiaoxiao smiled, her eyes scanning him from head to toe.","\"Uncle, you're covered in dark clouds, and disaster is imminent. Just like the fate of this seat, you will...\"","She paused, her lips curling into a smile.","\"Meet an untimely death.\"","As soon as the words left her mouth, the stool beneath the large man 'crash' broke into two pieces.","He fell flat on his face.","Seeing his disheveled appearance, Yun Xiaoxiao calmly withdrew her gaze and walked towards the corner seat.","Nie Yizhou chuckled behind her.","This unlucky fellow dared to provoke the little ghost. Didn't he know she had a small heart and always sought revenge?","\"What did you say?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao stopped and glanced at Nie Yizhou.","Nie Yizhou, who had been gloating, froze and quickly waved his hands.","\"Nothing, I didn't say anything. I was just praising how capable you are.\"","He scratched his head and laughed awkwardly.","Yun Xiaoxiao stared at him, making him feel uneasy.","Why did he always feel that the little ghost could read minds? Every time he thought of something, she seemed to catch it.","This wasn't the first time...","It was really strange...","After everyone was seated, the dishes were quickly served.","The meal was decent, at least there was meat.","In the apocalypse, providing meat for so many people simultaneously was quite generous for the Western Base.","However, during the meal, a dark gaze occasionally glanced towards Yun Xiaoxiao's direction.","Yun Xiaoxiao treated the person as air.","The angrier the other person became, the more delicious her meal tasted.","It was like a unique side dish.","She even smiled at the large man.","This made the large man even angrier.","He slammed his chopsticks down with a 'thud,' making the table shake.","Just as he was about to stand up, a man next to him stopped him.","After whispering something, the large man snorted and sat back down.","\"Hello everyone, I was busy with something earlier and arrived a bit late. Please forgive any oversights,\" a middle-aged man in a military coat strode up the stairs.","He had a straight posture and a serious expression, clearly a man of few words.","He apologized and greeted everyone.","This man was the leader of the Western Base, Peng Shaowei.","\"Why did you gather us here? What exactly do you want to discuss?\"","Sun Jian, the large man sitting at the front, asked loudly.","\"Brother, please don't be impatient. Two more bases haven't arrived yet, so tonight everyone should eat, drink, and rest well.","The meeting will officially begin tomorrow afternoon.\"","\"What's the point of beating around the bush? I...\"","Sun Jian wanted to say more, but the man next to him pressed his hand down again.","He frowned, though somewhat displeased, he didn't erupt.","Peng Shaowei's arrival slightly livened up the atmosphere.","The meal was, overall, a pleasant experience.","Most people had arrived today and were tired from the long journey.","After dinner, everyone bid farewell and returned to rest.","However, as soon as Yun Xiaoxiao and her group descended the stairs, a cold snort sounded behind them.","They turned around to see Sun Jian glaring coldly at them.","He then quickly walked past them, spitting on the ground.","Yun Xiaoxiao and her companions' expressions changed.","Before they could even seek revenge, the other party was already rushing to meet their end!","The most impulsive among them, Xiao Feng, immediately launched a fireball towards Sun Jian.","Sun Jian's eyes widened in shock and quickly dodged.","But the fireball was extremely fast, and just as he was about to be hit, an invisible force suddenly deflected the fireball.","The fireball grazed past Sun Jian and landed on the ground.","A large patch of grass instantly turned to ashes.","Yun Xiaoxiao and her group narrowed their eyes, looking at the man beside Sun Jian.","This man's strength was quite impressive.","However, this didn't mean Yun Xiaoxiao and her group would let this go.","Sorry, none of them were the type to swallow their pride!","Yun Xiaoxiao instantly vanished from her spot.","Seeing her move, Lu Chen and the others lowered their hands.","Forget it, let her handle it alone.","It wouldn't be good to make the opponent lose too badly.","After all...","They were so 'kind.'","Sun Jian and the man beside him frowned as Yun Xiaoxiao disappeared.","\"Don't look, I'm here.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao's voice sounded from behind them.","At the same time, she kicked towards Sun Jian.","Despite the significant size difference, her small leg packed terrifying power, sending the over 200-pound Sun Jian crashing to the ground.","Then she stepped on his face.","In her hand, she held a large cleaver, aiming at Sun Jian's abdomen.","\"Don't move, or else I might get scared, and this knife could end up inside you.\"","Her lips curled into a mischievous smile, exuding an aura of wickedness."]},{"number":224,"title":"Chapter 224: Don't You Want to Slap Him","paragraphs":["Liao Yongchang narrowed his eyes.","\"Little girl, there's no big deal here. Why go to such extremes?\"","He hadn't expected that the strength of a five-year-old child could be so terrifying.","She was like a ghost, appearing and disappearing unpredictably, making it impossible to guard against.","\"No big deal? If it were you, could you stand a cockroach jumping around on your head without wanting to slap it dead?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow, her posture relaxed.","Sun Jian, the burly man who had been compared to a cockroach, was seething with anger.","But with someone's foot on his face and a knife pressing against his abdomen, he could only seethe silently.","It was a joke—his life was in someone else's hands. Unless he didn't want to live anymore, he had no courage to be defiant now.","The commotion here had attracted many onlookers.","Liao Yongchang and his group's faces turned a deep shade of purple.","Clearly, Yun Xiaoxiao was mocking them!","He secretly observed Yun Xiaoxiao, as well as Ling Jing and Lu Chen, who were standing nearby with relaxed expressions, and his eyes narrowed again.","These people seemed to be anything but easy to deal with.","Even the youngest among them was this formidable, so what about the others?","The fire-based psychic from earlier wasn't to be underestimated either.","If it came to a real fight, he wasn't confident he could win against them.","\"So, what do you want?\" Liao Yongchang asked coldly.","Yun Xiaoxiao chuckled. \"My demands are quite simple. This man has a foul mouth, so let him reward himself with two hundred slaps to his own face. And...","Call me 'grandma.'\"","Liao Yongchang: ......","Sun Jian: !!!","This was practically rubbing their faces in the dirt!","Seeing Liao Yongchang's rapidly changing expression, a cryptic smile flickered in Yun Xiaoxiao's eyes.","Although she really wanted to kill, this was the Western Base.","She had to give Peng Shaowei some face.","Killing opportunities were plenty; there was no need to rush.","However, some lessons still needed to be taught.","Otherwise, others might really think the people from Yun City were pushovers.","Of course, she had her own plans.","While achieving a deterrent effect, she also wanted everyone to understand their strength, making it easier for her to proceed with her future plans.","Her purpose here wasn't just to attend the meeting.","Attending the meeting was one thing, but she had more important goals.","Sun Jian, of course, didn't want to call her grandma or slap his own face.","Just as the tension on the scene was reaching its peak, Peng Shaowei and Hao Ren arrived on the scene.","Seeing the two approaching from a distance, Yun Xiaoxiao's lips curved into a smile, and she gave Ling Jing a meaningful glance.","Ling Jing immediately understood her intent.","His brows furrowed as he looked at Sun Jian, who was still sprawled on the ground.","In an instant, Sun Jian's face contorted in pain.","Seeing this, Yun Xiaoxiao lifted her foot.","Sun Jian immediately sat up from the ground, his hands uncontrollably slapping his own face left and right.","The sound of slaps echoed loudly.","Surrounding onlookers gasped in astonishment.","They could clearly see that Sun Jian's expression was one of extreme reluctance.","Yet his actions were completely out of his control, slapping himself again and again.","It was obvious that he was being controlled by something!","Everyone turned their gazes toward Yun Xiaoxiao and her group, their eyes filled with shock and scrutiny.","By the time Peng Shaowei and the others arrived, Sun Jian had almost finished slapping himself.","Although he hadn't yet called her grandma, Yun Xiaoxiao didn't bother to push the matter further.","After all... there's always tomorrow.","Waving at Peng Shaowei and the others, Yun Xiaoxiao and her group turned and left gracefully.","Peng Shaowei, having been informed of the situation by his subordinates, didn't harbor any hostility toward the arrogant Yun Xiaoxiao and her group. Instead, he felt a sense of admiration.","After all, guests were guests.","He couldn't ignore Sun Jian and the others completely.","He briefly consoled them and then dispersed the onlookers.","The matter was thus left unresolved.","Back in their room, Sun Jian kicked the bed in frustration.","\"Brother Chang, I can't swallow this!\"","His eyes were bloodshot.","\"I've told you countless times before, you need to rein in your temper, but you just won't listen,\" Liao Yongchang said, his face dark.","\"Inside the base, no matter what you do, I can protect you.","But outside, there are many powerful individuals we can't afford to provoke.\"","\"But are we just going to let this go? You didn't miss how arrogant they were earlier.","They practically trampled all over our dignity!","Look at how the other bases are looking at us now. Thinking about it makes me feel so suffocated.\"","Liao Yongchang naturally remembered the humiliating scene.","He narrowed his eyes. \"Of course, we can't just let this go.","But we can't beat them on our own.","Tomorrow, the people from Xiangrui Base will arrive.","When we team up with them, we'll definitely be able to defeat those people.\"","Sun Jian's eyes lit up.","\"Exactly! The people from Xiangrui Base aren't to be underestimated!\"","He was filled with excitement, already imagining the scene of kicking Yun Xiaoxiao like a ball.","Xiangrui Base?","Yun Xiaoxiao, standing outside the door, furrowed her brow slightly.","The name sounded familiar...","Oh, right!","That was the base from her previous life where the psychics massively used crystals.","leading to psychics turning into zombies, causing a massive base-wide upheaval, and eventually self-destruction.","Because the incident was so shocking, her impression of it was quite deep.","If that was the case, she really wanted to meet those people.","She wanted to see how powerful psychics who directly consumed crystals were.","Yun Xiaoxiao pursed her lips, quietly coming and then quietly leaving.","No one knew she had been there.","Time quickly moved to the next afternoon.","Originally, there were two bases that hadn't arrived.","But one of the bases had already arrived in the morning.","Now, only Xiangrui Base was still missing.","As the scheduled meeting time approached, everyone was getting impatient.","\"Base Leader Peng, is it really appropriate for us to wait for just one base?\"","\"Exactly, why should we wait for just one of them?\"","\"What if they encountered some danger on the way and got delayed?\"","\"Everyone faces dangers on the road. They should have anticipated this and left earlier.\"","Peng Shaowei glanced at the time on his watch and frowned.","Just as he was about to say they shouldn't wait and should start the meeting,","he heard a series of footsteps coming from the staircase.","The meeting was still being held in the second-floor cafeteria.","\"Oh~ Looks like everyone's here.\"","A childish voice, belonging to a young boy, slowly rang out.","Then, a group of people walked up.","Leading them was a little boy, about seven or eight years old.","His head was held high, giving him an air of superiority.","His gaze was sharp and defiant.","\"Sorry for being late,\" the tall young man behind the boy said to Peng Shaowei, nodding slightly.","Though his words were apologetic, his face showed no hint of remorse."]},{"number":225,"title":"Chapter 225: Look Again, I'll Gouge Your Eyes Out","paragraphs":["Their attitude displeased many people.","They were late, yet they acted as if they were superior.","It was truly unlikable.","Peng Shaowei also frowned subtly, though he didn't say much, instead pointing to a few empty seats.","\"Since you're here, take your seats first. Let's get down to business.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, a boy around seven or eight years old walked to the third seat in the second row.","\"Keep staring, and I'll gouge your eyes out!\"","He said without hesitation to a middle-aged man in his forties.","The man immediately stood up, his face full of anger.","Anyone would be furious to be publicly scolded by a child out of the blue.","Peng Shaowei rubbed his temples and, just as a fight was about to break out, intervened in time.","\"Everyone, I gathered you here to discuss matters, not to fight.\"","His tone grew more serious.","With his intervention, the middle-aged man huffed and sat back down.","The boy also sneered nonchalantly and returned to the side of the young man.","After everyone was seated, Peng Shaowei began to speak.","\"That kid was pretty cocky, huh?\"","During Peng Shaowei's speech, Nie Yizhou lightly nudged Yun Xiaoxiao's arm and whispered softly.","Yun Xiaoxiao also casually glanced at the boy.","He certainly had the capital to be arrogant.","At just seven or eight years old, he was already a dual-element ability user with water and fire elements.","Moreover, his ability level was at the middle stage of the third tier.","The middle-aged man earlier was only at the initial stage of the second tier.","When it came to a fight, the outcome was clear.","Although the cores of zombies contain potent energy, different people absorb it differently.","This has nothing to do with age, only with talent in cultivation.","After sizing him up, Yun Xiaoxiao was about to look away.","But just as she was about to, the boy also looked over at her.","He even gave her the middle finger.","\"What the hell? Is this guy crazy or something?\"","He really was indiscriminately provoking everyone.","How has he survived this long?","If it weren't for the inappropriate setting, Yun Xiaoxiao would have definitely taught him a lesson in how to behave.","She rolled her eyes and stopped looking at him, focusing instead on listening to Peng Shaowei.","Peng Shaowei's main point was that, with the apocalypse upon us and dangers everywhere, only by uniting could humanity survive the cracks.","According to his observations, zombies continuously grow stronger.","So the best solution is to eliminate them before they evolve into the most powerful forms.","Only then can we eliminate the threat for good.","But this task alone is beyond their single base.","That's why he gathered all the bases from the western region, hoping everyone could brainstorm and come up with the best solution.","Of course, he didn't force anyone.","Those who wanted to participate could, and those who didn't could leave freely.","After all, although he had notified everyone, many small bases hadn't come.","Perhaps due to insufficient strength to handle the dangers along the way.","Or maybe their bases lacked radios and didn't receive the message.","So this initiative was based on a voluntary principle.","After all, once implemented, there would undoubtedly be casualties.","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone started whispering among themselves.","\"Mr. Base Leader Peng, I understand your intentions, but this task seems extremely difficult to carry out. Everyone's strength varies, and even if we wanted to support it, we might be powerless.\"","A man spoke up first.","Following his lead, others also voiced their concerns.","\"Yes, the weather changes every day, and it looks like winter is approaching. Didn't someone predict that the world would enter a long period of global freezing soon?","As the saying goes, 'Supplies must precede the army.'","We don't even have basic supplies reserved, how can we find the energy to kill all those zombies?\"","\"This brother is right. The number of zombies far exceeds that of living humans. How could we possibly kill them all with just our strength?","The ideal is full, but reality is harsh.","It's too difficult to implement.\"","The words of a few represented the thoughts of most.","Of course, there were also those with different opinions.","\"I think Base Leader Peng's suggestion is reasonable. The evolution speed of zombies is too fast.","If we don't kill them now, by the time they become even stronger, there will be no place for humans to survive.\"","Jiang Huai said with a furrowed brow.","Wang Dahai nodded. \"Jiang Huai is right. I think as long as we have supplies as logistical support, we must eradicate the zombies. Who wants to live surrounded by those man-eating creatures, unable to sleep soundly?\"","\"Who doesn't want to kill all the zombies? But firstly, it's uncertain whether everyone's strength can even kill those mutated zombies. Secondly, we can't possibly go hungry while killing zombies, can we?\"","Someone also raised their doubts.","This gained the agreement of many.","After everyone had voiced their thoughts, Peng Shaowei turned his gaze to Yun Xiaoxiao and her group.","\"Friends from Yun City, don't you have anything to say?\"","His steady gaze carried a hint of shrewdness and wisdom.","Suddenly being called out, Yun Xiaoxiao and her group snapped out of their relaxed state and sat up straighter.","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled at Peng Shaowei.","It seemed this man had been watching them all along.","Interesting...","However, her purpose here was the same.","So, she didn't mind Peng Shaowei's little scheme.","She stood up and looked around at everyone present.","\"Base Leader Peng is right. If the zombies aren't eradicated, humans will never have a peaceful life.\"","She spoke with a deeper tone.","As she thought of her past life, countless bases were swallowed by zombie armies led by intelligent zombies.","Combined with mutated plants and animals, human survival became increasingly difficult.","So, Peng Shaowei's approach was correct.","Eliminate the zombies before they grow stronger.","The fewer enemies humanity has, the greater the chance of survival.","As for everyone's concerns about whether our current strength can kill large numbers of zombies and the matter of supplies, Yun City can provide some assistance.","Earlier, we mentioned over the radio that we have a liquid that can enhance an ability user's strength, called Evolution Fluid.","Once everyone takes it, they can rapidly improve their ability levels.","As for supplies, we can also sell them.","Yun Xiaoxiao said with a smile.","\"Kid, big talk can cost you your jaw.\"","Someone immediately voiced their skepticism."]},{"number":226,"title":"Chapter 226: Zombie Siege","paragraphs":["Many people have heard of the Yun City Evolution Liquid over the radio.","However, most people are skeptical.","Coupled with the long journey, few have gone to exchange for it.","The fundamental reason is that they simply don't believe such a liquid exists.","Moreover, resources are the most scarce commodity now.","Who would keep something valuable and then foolishly sell it to outsiders?","Besides, how much could she possibly have?","Even if she had a lot, would it be enough for so many people to consume?","Therefore, many believe that Yun Xiaoxiao is exaggerating.","\"If you want to know if the Evolution Liquid works, why not pick someone to fight me and see for yourself?\" Yun Xiaoxiao chuckled lightly.","As soon as she said this, many people recalled the fight she had with Sun Jian yesterday.","The scene of her grinding Sun Jian under her feet and forcing him to slap his own face was vividly etched in their minds.","Everyone looked at each other.","No one wanted to fight her.","Winning wouldn't mean much, but losing to a child would be too embarrassing.","Furthermore, given her cruel methods, if she got upset again and made them publicly slap their own faces, that would be no laughing matter.","Just as everyone fell silent, Yun Xiaoxiao slowly turned her gaze toward the boy in the front corner.","She gently pursed her lips and pointed at him.","\"You.\"","Her tone was casual.","But those familiar with her, like Lu Chen and a few others, knew this little girl was seeking revenge.","The boy had given her the middle finger earlier, and she wouldn't let that slide.","Tang Yanchi didn't expect Yun Xiaoxiao to single him out.","He looked down at her arrogantly.","\"You want to fight me?\"","His gaze seemed to say she was overestimating herself.","\"Are you scared?\" Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow.","Tang Yanchi was immediately provoked.","He stood up arrogantly. \"What a joke! I'd never be afraid of you! Let's fight, but don't cry later!\"","\"Don't worry, I won't cry.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled meaningfully.","The destructive power of an Evolver is immense.","To prevent the house from being destroyed, Peng Shaowei moved the match to the training ground.","\"Which of these two kids do you think is stronger?\"","Watching the two stand on the training ground, one on the left and the other on the right, everyone couldn't help but wonder.","\"That's obvious, it's Xiaoxiao.\"","Long Zhe was full of trust.","\"You know that little girl?\"","\"Yes, so I believe Xiaoxiao won't lose!\"","\"That's not certain. Tang Yanchi is the youngest son of the Xiangrui Base commander.","He's said to be as talented as his older brother.","And he has two abilities, which makes him very powerful.\"","\"Right, and he's only a child, but his methods are extremely cruel. Anyone who offends him usually ends up in a bad way.\"","\"No matter how strong he is, he's not as strong as Xiaoxiao.\"","Long Zhe frowned, not wanting to talk to the two who were doubting Yun Xiaoxiao.","On the other side,","Zheng Xin'er walked up to Zheng Yuner.","\"Sis, let's cheer for Xiaoxiao together.\"","Zheng Yuner gently pursed her lips. \"Xiaoxiao will win.\"","In the apocalyptic world where entertainment was scarce, this rare opportunity to watch a show excited everyone.","Besides people from various bases, even those from the Western Base who had some free time came to join the fun.","The training ground was surrounded by people, with onlookers packed in layers.","Everyone was whispering and discussing the match.","Inside the ring,","Tang Yanchi glanced at Yun Xiaoxiao with a look of certainty.","Yun Xiaoxiao, on the other hand, looked at him calmly, her posture relaxed.","The battle was about to begin.","Just as both were waiting for Peng Shaowei to say \"start,\" Hao Ren suddenly approached Peng Shaowei with a serious expression and whispered something in his ear.","Peng Shaowei's face immediately changed.","Listening to their thoughts, Yun Xiaoxiao's brows furrowed tightly.","How could this be?!","This shouldn't be happening at this time!","\"Everyone, I'm sorry, but there's an urgent matter I need to inform you about.\"","Peng Shaowei immediately stood up, his voice low and serious.","Everyone looked at him, puzzled.","Only Yun Xiaoxiao turned her gaze toward the right side of the base gate, her mood heavy.","\"Just now, I received a piece of news.","A large number of zombies are heading toward our base from the southwest.","The number of zombies is conservatively estimated to be at least 110,000.","They are currently about two kilometers away from the base.\"","As soon as this was said, the entire place erupted in commotion.","Everyone's faces turned grim.","So many zombies!","Including people from other bases, the entire Western Base might have about 10,000 people.","This number would have to exclude many elderly, children, and those without any combat ability.","After deducting these, the actual number of people who could fight was at most around 8,000 to 9,000.","Using 8,000 to 9,000 people to fight against an army of 110,000 to 120,000 zombies.","And among these 8,000 to 9,000 people, not everyone was an Evolver.","The chances of winning...","Everyone's mood turned extremely heavy.","No one was paying attention to Yun Xiaoxiao and Tang Yanchi's match anymore.","When their lives were at stake, who had time to care about this?","\"Here, I sincerely ask everyone to stay and help the Western Base in this crisis, to work together and overcome this difficulty.","Of course, we still adhere to the principle of not forcing anyone.","If anyone wants to leave, we will not stop them.\"","After saying this, Peng Shaowei strode toward the southwest wall of the base.","The people left behind looked at each other, seemingly waiting for someone else to make a decision.","\"What should we do? Should we leave?\"","Some hesitated, asking those around them.","\"I want to leave, but who can guarantee we won't run into the zombie horde on the way out?\"","\"That's true. If we really run into them, we'd be dead before we even knew what hit us.","It's better to stay here, at least there's a wall, and we'll be facing them together with many others.\"","\"Yeah, leaving now would be too cowardly.\"","\"What kind of situation is this? We came here looking for a way to survive the apocalypse, and now we're facing a zombie siege. What bad luck!\"","\"Now I understand what Peng Base Commander was saying earlier. If our own base were to face something like this, or even worse, what would our chances of survival be?\"","After someone raised this question, everyone fell silent.","Because they had all thought of the same answer.","An answer they didn't want to face.","Tang Yanchi walked up to Yun Xiaoxiao.","He snorted. \"Today you're lucky!\"","Just as he was about to leave, Yun Xiaoxiao called out to him.","\"The winner hasn't been decided yet. Are you just going to leave?\"","\"Then what?\" Tang Yanchi frowned.","With the current situation, how could they still have a match?","\"How about we change the way we compete?\" Yun Xiaoxiao smiled mysteriously.","Tang Yanchi looked down at her, his chin raised. \"How?\""]},{"number":227,"title":"Chapter 227: Retreat Hurry","paragraphs":["Yun Xiaoxiao pointed towards the southwest direction.","\"Let's compete to see who can kill more zombies. The winner gets all the crystal cores collected by the loser.\"","Tang Yanchi shook his head, \"I think since we're testing whether your base's evolution serum is effective, it would be better to compete as teams rather than individuals.\"","\"How about this: you lead your base's people, and I'll lead ours. We'll see which team can kill more zombies. The reward remains the same: the winning team gets all the crystal cores collected by the losing team.\"","As soon as this was said, everyone around them gasped.","Xiangrui Base had ten members, while Yun City only had six.","This was clearly an attempt to win by sheer numbers.","Too cunning!","Everyone thought Yun Xiaoxiao wouldn't agree, since it was obviously unfair.","But to their surprise, Yun Xiaoxiao nodded.","\"No problem, let's do it your way. You lead your base, and I'll lead mine.","Just... you better not go back on your word later.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled meaningfully.","Tang Yanchi proudly lifted his head, \"I would never go back on my word!\"","\"Brother Jiang Huai, why are you shaking your head?\" Wang Dahai looked at Jiang Huai puzzled.","Jiang Huai raised his chin, indicating the direction of Tang Yanchi and his group.","\"Those people have already fallen into that little girl's trap and are still gloating about it.\"","\"But Xiangrui Base has more people,\" Wang Dahai still didn't quite understand.","Jiang Huai chuckled lightly, \"Does having more people always guarantee absolute advantage? Throughout history, how many military victories were achieved by the smaller force?\"","\"You mean, Yun City's people are stronger than Xiangrui's?\"","Jiang Huai smiled mysteriously, \"You'll see soon enough.\"","On the other side, Peng Shaowei was in the midst of urgent deployment.","Many soldiers in military uniforms quickly boarded military trucks.","The trucks one by one left the base.","When Yun Xiaoxiao and the others arrived at the city wall, they saw the trucks that had left the base now parked in front of the barbed wire.","Every few meters, there was a small platform.","On these platforms, cannons were being quickly set up.","The remaining soldiers successively set up their firearms, aiming forward, ready for battle.","In addition, some soldiers carried out bundle after bundle of dry firewood from the trucks and threw them into the large ditch between the barbed wire and the city gate.","Once the firewood was thrown, someone would pour gasoline over it.","Of course, besides outside the city, there were also many people on the city wall seriously looking forward.","Most of them were psychics from the western base.","There were also some snipers aiming their guns at the barbed wire.","Yun Xiaoxiao narrowed her eyes.","In her previous life, Peng Shaowei had also deployed like this.","Back then, there were even more weapons.","The psychic's strength was also higher.","But ultimately, they still failed.","The main reason was that the zombie horde's strength was much higher then, with over twenty or thirty sixth or seventh-tier zombies.","There was also a powerful intelligent zombie controlling them from behind.","That kind of combat power increased severalfold.","Yun Xiaoxiao gazed towards the southwest, her fighting spirit burning like a raging fire.","Although it wasn't the same as her previous life, it seemed that only by winning this zombie siege could she finally let go of her lingering obsession.","At this moment, in the southwest direction of the base, thick smoke billowed, as if thousands of troops were charging forward.","The roar was deafening, shaking the earth.","\"My god, how can there be so many zombies!\"","Many people couldn't help but exclaim.","Hearing about it was one thing, but seeing it with their own eyes was another.","The intense visual impact made everyone feel as if a mountain was pressing down on their hearts.","Tens of thousands of zombies were rushing towards the base.","One thousand five hundred meters...","One thousand meters...","Eight hundred meters...","The distance grew closer, and everyone's mood grew heavier.","This was a battle for life and death.","Win, and live.","Lose, and die!","\"Boom!\"","\"Boom boom!\"","The cannons below had already started firing.","The shells, carrying the wrath of thunder, tore through the sky and landed in the dense zombie horde, exploding with a deafening roar.","The sound was terrifying, making people tremble.","Countless zombies were blown to pieces.","Limbs mixed with dirt and dead branches rose into the air and scattered.","But even after the bombardment, there were still countless zombies rushing forward.","They were like fearless martyrs, charging forward without regard for the shells or bullets.","Soon, a large portion of zombies broke through the shelling and reached about two or three hundred meters from the barbed wire.","\"Bang bang bang!\"","Hundreds of guns fired at the zombies in the front lines.","Rows of zombies quickly fell.","But still, some zombies dodged the bullets and charged forward.","Their numbers were too great; when those in front died, others immediately took their place.","In no time, the vanguard of zombies had reached the barbed wire.","Some zombies stepped on other zombies' bodies quickly climbed the barbed wire.","In the blink of an eye, the barbed wire was filled with zombies.","Seeing that it was impossible to stop them, Hao Ren grabbed a megaphone and shouted.","\"Fall back! Quickly! Cover!\"","The soldiers in front of the barbed wire quickly boarded military trucks, which sped back to the base.","The snipers on the city wall shot the zombies that were about to climb over the barbed wire, giving their comrades time to retreat.","As soon as the people below retreated, the zombie horde outside had already broken through several sections of the barbed wire.","The zombies rushed forward like a flood.","The wooden bridge over the ditch was pulled back.","\"Light the fire!\"","Hao Ren gave the order again.","\"Boom!\"","The entire ditch was instantly engulfed in flames.","The first zombies to approach fell into the ditch and were consumed by the fire.","Even so, the zombies behind them still rushed forward without fear.","Some zombies engulfed in flames even jumped out of the ditch by stepping on other zombies' bodies, lunging towards the city wall.","More and more zombies surged forward.","The ditch was almost filled.","But these zombies seemed endless, stepping on each other, clawing and climbing like a human pyramid.","In addition, some mutant zombies, like geckos, could directly grip the city wall and climb up.","Their speed was extremely fast, and they soon climbed up.","Peng Shaowei's men quickly opened fire.","But these zombies were not only fast but also very agile, dodging bullets and moving quickly through the hail of gunfire.","\"No good, we're running out of bullets,\" Hao Ren's eyes showed concern.","Peng Shaowei stared at the at least fifty to sixty thousand remaining zombies below, his eyebrows tightly furrowed.","\"Now, we can only fight it out.\"","He waved his hand, and all the psychics from the western base prepared to strike.","Meanwhile, Yun Xiaoxiao nodded at Lu Chen and several others.","Everyone immediately understood her intent.","The final showdown, now begins!"]},{"number":228,"title":"Chapter 228: The Spotlight Has Been Stolen","paragraphs":["Yun Xiaoxiao and Nie Yizhou disappeared from the spot with Lu Chen and the others in an instant.","\"Huh, where did they go?\"","The people standing around Yun Xiaoxiao and the others were startled when they suddenly vanished.","Tang Yanchi and his brother Tang Jun also looked over.","Both of them frowned simultaneously.","\"Look! They're down there!\"","Someone exclaimed in surprise.","Tang Yanchi and the others immediately looked down.","They saw Yun Xiaoxiao and the group standing on the far right of the zombie horde.","In front of them, a wall of ice had been erected, blocking most of the zombies.","At the moment, Yun Xiaoxiao and the six others, along with two beasts, were each displaying their unique abilities, continuously killing the zombies.","Fast and ruthless!","They looked like killing gods.","Behind them, piles of zombie corpses lay.","After clearing the encircled zombies, they would expand their territory and continue killing.","\"Wow! Are they taking the zombie horde too lightly? It's like they're chopping cabbage in their own backyard!\"","\"I've never seen such a maneuver before; it's truly eye-opening!\"","\"Look at that giant scorpion and tiger; they're incredibly brave!\"","\"With such strength, can Xiangrui Base win?\"","Everyone was awestruck by Yun Xiaoxiao's boldness and formidable strength.","Of course, they also began to wonder who would come out on top in the end: Yun Xiaoxiao's group or Xiangrui Base.","\"Brother, they're cheating! They even have a giant scorpion and a tiger!\"","Tang Yanchi was extremely dissatisfied.","\"How is that cheating? Didn't you say it was a competition between Xiangrui Base and Yun City Base?","That scorpion and tiger are part of their base too.","You also have four more people than them.","You can't just think about taking advantage, can you, little brother?\"","Zheng Xin'er crossed her arms and raised an eyebrow with a smile.","Being called out by Zheng Xin'er, Tang Yanchi's face turned gloomy.","The continuous praise for Yun Xiaoxiao from the crowd only made his expression worse.","Damn it, all the attention has been stolen by the other side!","Since birth, he had been a favored child, gifted with extraordinary talent.","After the apocalypse, he awakened his abilities, surpassing everyone else.","Apart from his brother, he was ahead of everyone.","He was always the one being looked up to.","But now, he was being upstaged by a little girl younger than him.","This was something he couldn't accept!","Hmph, if they can do it, so can I!","\"Brother, let's go down too!\"","He was now eager to show off his skills.","Tang Jun glanced at Yun Xiaoxiao's group and also frowned slightly.","He immediately drew a large circle in front of his chest.","Instantly, the wind rose and clouds swirled, and a huge energy gathered in front of him.","He enveloped this energy around Tang Yanchi and the other four.","With a wave of his hand, Tang Yanchi and the others floated from the wall to the far left of the zombie horde.","After Tang Yanchi and the others landed, Tang Jun gathered another wave of energy and moved himself and the other four over.","They imitated Yun Xiaoxiao's method, encircling and attacking.","However, anyone with eyes could see which side was more powerful.","Moreover, Yun Xiaoxiao's group seemed to have inexhaustible energy and endless moves.","The more they fought, the fiercer they became.","Their teamwork was also incredibly harmonious, as if they had undergone countless practical collaborations.","Zombies in their hands were like docile chicks, waiting to be slaughtered.","Peng Shaowei's eyes lit up.","From the first moment he saw Yun Xiaoxiao's group, he felt they were extraordinary.","Unexpectedly, they were this formidable!","They also gave him new ideas.","He immediately gathered the remaining people and imitated Yun Xiaoxiao's method, starting to break through the outer circle of the zombie horde.","Of course, a portion of people remained on the wall to deal with zombies that managed to breach the defenses.","The real battle officially began!","Yun Xiaoxiao, while killing zombies, kept an eye around her.","Suddenly, her eyebrows lifted.","Found it!","In such zombie sieges, there was usually an intelligent zombie controlling them.","As long as it was killed, the other zombies would immediately become disorganized.","Even if their numbers were large, their overall combat power would at least be reduced.","Clearing them out would naturally become much simpler.","So from the beginning, her target was that intelligent zombie.","\"You guys hold the fort,\" Yun Xiaoxiao said to Lu Chen and the others.","\"Be careful,\" Lu Chen frowned.","\"Don't worry, nothing will happen.\"","After saying that, Yun Xiaoxiao suddenly disappeared.","A second later, she appeared on top of a zombie's head.","She stepped on the zombie's head, holding a large saber, and slashed fiercely at an old zombie with a short stature.","The old zombie seemed to be caught off guard by Yun Xiaoxiao's sudden appearance.","And such a swift attack.","It hurriedly retreated, using its mind to control a few zombies to block in front of it, becoming its shield.","Then, without hesitation, it turned and ran.","More and more zombies rushed toward Yun Xiaoxiao.","But Yun Xiaoxiao only sneered, disappearing again in the moment when the zombies pounced.","The old zombie ran while occasionally looking back at Yun Xiaoxiao's direction.","Seeing that Yun Xiaoxiao had disappeared again, it was puzzled, when suddenly it felt an icy chill enveloping it.","It was horrified, its white pupils showing the panic of a normal person.","Just as it was terrified, its entire body was frozen.","A large saber descended from the sky, cutting vertically from its head down.","\"Snap!\"","It was instantly split in half.","With its death, the previously determined zombies suddenly lost their core, their eyes dulled, and their movements slowed.","Although the intelligent zombie behind the scenes was dead, the zombie army's numbers were indeed quite large.","So it still took a lot of time to clean them up.","Of course, many people were sacrificed during this period.","Some mutated zombies sneaked onto the wall, biting people, causing a brief chaos.","To preserve the lives of most, Peng Shaowei had to painfully throw those who had mutated off the wall.","There were also people fighting outside who were accidentally scratched or bitten.","In the end, after counting, the Western Base lost a total of 236 people.","Other bases didn't suffer as much, with only about ten people.","After all, those who came to the Western Base were all selected from various bases.","Their strength was definitely better than average.","It was understandable that the number of sacrifices was smaller.","Although the base was saved, everyone should have been happy.","But thinking of the companions who died, no one could bring themselves to feel happy.","\"I think what Base Leader Peng said is right. The Western Base has cannons and guns, as well as so many well-trained soldiers. Even they found it difficult to deal with the zombie siege.","If such a scenario were to happen in our own bases, would we even survive?\""]},{"number":229,"title":"Chapter 229: Who Won","paragraphs":["After the man finished speaking, everyone fell silent.","Because they had automatically imagined the scene of tens of thousands of zombies attacking the city in their minds, replacing it with their own base.","Their base's walls were not as sturdy and high as those of the western base.","They didn't have those deep trenches and barbed wire fences.","Nor did they have an abundance of guns and ammunition.","Not to mention the overwhelming combat power of a large number of soldiers and reinforcements from other bases.","Even with all these advantages, the western base had nearly been overrun.","What about their own base?","The thought of tens of thousands of zombies trampling over their base, savagely tearing apart the people inside, made them shudder and break out in a cold sweat.","At that moment, they suddenly remembered Peng Shaowei's zombie cleanup plan.","\"Base Leader Peng, my Dahai Base is willing to join your zombie cleanup plan!\" Wang Dahai spoke up first.","\"You're right, the zombies must be eliminated as soon as possible, or the consequences will be dire.","They already pose such a terrifying threat, and if they grow any stronger, it will be a catastrophe for humanity.\"","Wang Dahai's words echoed the thoughts of many.","\"Yes, our Glory Military Base will join too!\"","\"Count us in!\"","\"Yangcheng Base is in!\"","\"Rongsheng Base has no objections.\"","\"...\"","Agreement rang out one after another.","Everyone expressed their willingness.","At this moment, the air seemed to grow warmer with passion.","Everyone was unprecedentedly united!","\"Base Leader Peng, tell us what to do, and we'll follow your lead,\" Wang Dahai spoke again.","All eyes turned to Peng Shaowei.","But Peng Shaowei changed the subject.","\"We'll discuss the specific plan later, because there's still one important matter we haven't completed.\"","\"What matter?\" Wang Dahai asked.","Peng Shaowei turned his gaze toward Yun Xiaoxiao and Tang Yanchi and their teams.","\"Didn't the friends from Yun City and Xiangrui Base still have a match to determine the winner?\"","With Peng Shaowei's reminder, everyone remembered the duel between Yun Xiaoxiao and Tang Yanchi.","\"Oh right, which side killed more zombies?\"","\"I'm curious too.\"","Everyone's interest was piqued.","Although they had initially witnessed the formidable strength of Yun Xiaoxiao and her team, later everyone was busy dealing with zombies themselves, so they didn't pay much attention.","Thus, they didn't know if Tang Yanchi's team had managed to catch up.","\"Now, I'll have someone count the number of zombies each side killed. What do you think?\"","Peng Shaowei looked at both sides.","Yun Xiaoxiao had no objections.","Having Peng Shaowei oversee it would be more fair and convincing.","Tang Yanchi's side also had no issues.","So, Peng Shaowei had Hao Ren take his men to make the count.","Earlier, Yun Xiaoxiao and Tang Yanchi had agreed that Yun Xiaoxiao's team would sever the right hand of the zombies they killed, while Tang Yanchi's team would sever the left hand.","So overall, it was easy to distinguish.","Everyone eagerly awaited the results.","After all, this would determine if the evolution serum from Yun City was truly effective.","Although Rongsheng Base and Yangcheng Base had already vouched for it, seeing is believing.","The effectiveness could only be proven on the battlefield.","After about twenty minutes, Hao Ren returned with two sheets of paper.","\"How is it? Which side won?\"","Wang Qingdong, Wang Dahai's son, couldn't wait to ask.","\"Yeah, what's the result?\"","Everyone waited for the final answer.","Peng Shaowei nodded at Hao Ren, \"Go ahead and announce it.\"","Hao Ren nodded and held up the two sheets of paper for everyone to see.","\"Everyone, the data in my right hand is from Yun City, and the left hand is from Xiangrui Base.","After careful verification, we confirmed that Xiangrui Base killed a total of five thousand eight hundred and ninety-six zombies.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, murmurs broke out around him.","\"Nearly six thousand zombies, wow, that means each of them killed about six hundred zombies?\"","\"Incredible strength! No wonder Xiangrui Base is so proud.\"","\"I'm convinced, no wonder they have the confidence to be arrogant.\"","Listening to the surrounding discussions, Tang Yanchi's face was full of pride.","This was just normal for them; these people were overreacting, truly lacking insight.","He looked challengingly at Yun Xiaoxiao.","See that? This is our strength!","Don't think you can win just because you made a big splash at the start. You were just pandering to the crowd!","\"Wait... if I'm not mistaken, Yun City killed... one, ten, hundred, thousand, ten thousand... twenty-one thousand one hundred and eleven zombies!\"","A man who was a bit closer to Hao Ren widened his eyes in shock and exclaimed.","\"Yes, the friends from Yun City indeed killed twenty-one thousand one hundred and eleven zombies.\"","Hao Ren confirmed the man's statement.","The moment the words left his mouth, the entire place fell into a brief silence.","Aside from the initial wave of zombies wiped out by bombs, bullets, and fire, there were about seventy to eighty thousand zombies left.","And Yun Xiaoxiao's team, with just six people and two beasts, had eliminated a quarter of them!","\"Am I going deaf? I think I'm hallucinating!\"","Someone patted their ears, doubting they had heard correctly.","Others also looked incredulous.","\"My goodness, are they even human? I mean that in the most sincere and earnest way possible, expressing my genuine astonishment.\"","I suddenly feel like a total waste. Just a moment ago, I was proud of myself for killing thirty zombies, but look at them—on average, each person killed over two thousand six hundred zombies!","\"I'm depressed, seriously, don't try to comfort me, it won't help...\"","\"I just thought Xiangrui Base was impressive, but compared to Yun City, they really don't measure up.\"","\"Hey, don't say that so loudly, it'll hurt their feelings.\"","\"...\"","Everyone chimed in with their thoughts.","Their gazes toward Yun Xiaoxiao and her team were filled with admiration.","For Peng Shaowei, this result didn't come as a surprise.","Others might not have noticed, but he had been on the city wall the whole time.","Although he was busy killing zombies himself, he had kept an eye on Yun City's situation.","If the commotion from other areas was like a small stone dropped into a lake, theirs was like a giant boulder crashing into it.","The damage to the zombies was incomparable.","However, even though he understood this, he couldn't just state it outright.","Only concrete data could make people believe.","And now, everyone was thoroughly impressed.","Listening to the surrounding discussions, Tang Yanchi's face fell.","He glared at Hao Ren, his tone sharp.","\"Are you sure you didn't make a mistake in your count?\""]},{"number":230,"title":"Chapter 230: You're Fat and Your Skin is Thick","paragraphs":["\"No,\" Hao Ren frowned slightly, his tone indifferent.","Being doubted, and in such a disrespectful tone, naturally, he wasn't pleased.","However, considering the reputation of the Western Base, he refrained from snapping back.","Not snapping back didn't mean he was without temper.","\"If you have doubts about the tally, we can all go outside and count again,\" he suggested.","At this, Tang Yanchi's face darkened.","He lifted his chin proudly.","\"Everyone knows that zombies vary in levels, and the difficulty of dealing with them varies as well.","If the over twenty thousand zombies they killed were all low-level, and all of ours were high-level, how would that be calculated?\" Tang Yanchi stared sharply at Hao Ren and Peng Shaowei.","\"He's obviously just trying to be unreasonable,\" someone muttered under their breath.","\"Mmm, I think so too. It was agreed beforehand that the competition would be based on the number of zombies killed, and now he's bringing this up, tsk tsk...\"","\"But I think his concerns are valid too. Dealing with a powerful zombie indeed takes more time, which means fewer zombies killed,\" Sun Jian, who was already displeased with Yun Xiaoxiao, scoffed.","But someone immediately retorted.","\"That's just sophistry. A competition is a competition!","How can you question the fairness of the rules after the results are out?","If it was unfair, why didn't he raise it at the beginning?","I think some people just can't accept losing and keep looking for excuses.\"","\"Since there are objections, why not just dig out the cores and compare the number of high-level cores? That would settle it,\" Yun Xiaoxiao suggested casually, her hands crossed and her smile breezy.","Her attitude was overly calm.","Peng Shaowei looked at Yun Xiaoxiao appreciatively.","This young girl's maturity and intelligence were indeed beyond many adults.","He signaled to Hao Ren, \"Let's do as the young lady suggests.\"","To avoid further disputes, Hao Ren specifically 'invited' Tang Yanchi to come and watch the process.","Of course, besides Tang Yanchi and Yun Xiaoxiao, people from various bases also came along for the spectacle.","One by one, the cores were dug out from the zombies' heads.","It was somewhat relieving to watch.","Tang Yanchi's group had killed fewer zombies.","So the digging started from their side.","In the end, they counted one third-level core, five hundred and fifty-seven second-level cores, and three thousand four hundred and twenty-nine first-level cores.","Actually, the first-level cores didn't need to be compared.","The main focus was on the number of second-level cores and above.","After collecting from one side, everyone moved to the location where Yun Xiaoxiao and her group had been.","Hao Ren organized the manpower.","Everyone watched intently.","Every time a second-level core was dug out, the crowd's spirits lifted.","\"How many second-level cores have been dug out now?\" someone excitedly asked their companion.","\"It seems like there are about five hundred and fifty now.\"","\"Hahaha, looks like Xiangrui Base is about to be thoroughly embarrassed. We haven't even dug through half of these zombie heads yet, and the number of second-level cores is almost surpassing theirs.\"","\"But it seems that Yun City hasn't unearthed any third-level crystal cores yet.\"","\"What's the rush? There are still so many zombie heads to dig through, maybe I'll find one before I even finish speaking... Oh my, did I jinx it? I just mentioned it and we found one!\"","\"It's really a third-level crystal core!\"","Everyone grew more and more excited.","Digging through zombie heads was just like opening mystery boxes, always filled with surprises.","Suddenly, someone exclaimed.","\"Heavens, what did I see?! Everyone, look over there!\"","Following the shout, everyone turned to see one of Hao Ren's men, wearing rubber gloves, pulling a blue crystal from a zombie's head.","\"A fifth-level crystal core!\"","\"No way, is it really a fifth-level crystal core?!\"","The crowd immediately erupted into excitement.","No wonder everyone was so astonished.","Such high-level zombies usually evolved from areas heavily infested with zombies, places people normally wouldn't venture into.","Moreover, it hasn't even been a year since the apocalypse began, and fifth-level zombies were extremely rare.","It was normal for people to have never seen one.","In fact, this fifth-level crystal core was from the head of the intelligent zombie that had led the attack on the city.","Yun Xiaoxiao had deliberately not taken it, choosing instead to kill it and bring it back to her camp.","After all, it would end up hers in the end.","Whether she took it sooner or later didn't matter.","With the appearance of the fifth-level crystal core, the earlier third-level core instantly lost its luster.","Tang Yanchi's face soured completely.","Because his face had been 'swollen' with defeat.","Now, no excuse would suffice.","Someone had killed a fifth-level zombie, what more could be said?","Tang Yanchi clenched his fists, fuming silently.","Peng Shaowei, although expecting the appearance of the fifth-level core, was still somewhat surprised.","What mattered most was that he seemed to recall that the zombie had been killed by that young girl!","He couldn't help but take another look at Yun Xiaoxiao.","Yun Xiaoxiao gave him a slight smile, as if asking, \"Is there something you need?\"","Her straightforward gaze made Peng Shaowei feel as if he was the one with something to hide.","Embarrassed, he cleared his throat and turned to the others.","\"Now, no one should doubt the strength of Yun City, right?\"","Everyone shook their heads.","A joke, how could there be any doubt!","\"So, the evolution fluid from Yun City is indeed effective.\"","Peng Shaowei's eyes grew serious.","\"If we truly wish to eradicate the zombies, then the first step is to enhance our own abilities.","That way, we can have the means to kill zombies, instead of just sending ourselves to death.","So, I hope to cooperate with Yun City, for them to provide the evolution fluid to help us improve.","I wonder if our friends from Yun City would be willing to help with this?\"","As everyone looked over, Yun Xiaoxiao shrugged.","\"I've said this before, we have no problem, as long as you exchange crystal cores for it, we have as much evolution fluid as you need.\"","\"Still need to exchange crystal cores? Since killing zombies is our common goal, can't Yun City sponsor us out of goodwill?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao looked at the burly man, Sun Jian, with a half-smile.","\"I never thought someone as chubby as you could have such thick skin. Why don't you just share all the supplies from your base with everyone?\"","\"You!\"","Sun Jian was furious.","This girl actually called him fat and mocked his thick skin!","\"What do you mean 'you'? Don't think just because you stutter you're in the right.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao looked around coolly and warned,","\"We do have a lot of evolution fluid, but let me kindly advise everyone, we people from Yun City don't have the best tempers.","If anyone thinks about using violence to rob us, don't blame me for not warning you—we really enjoy killing.","Anyone dares to come and rob, we kill on sight!","Don't believe it? Just try...\""]},{"number":231,"title":"Chapter 231: Little Sister, What Are You Laughing At","paragraphs":["Yun Xiaoxiao may be small in stature, but her words carry an undeniable dominating force.","With just a few sentences, she managed to intimidate those who were secretly plotting.","No one doubted the authenticity of her words.","Yesterday evening, when she dealt with Sun Jian, she showed no mercy, truly embodying the image of a \"poisonous little pill.\"","The people behind her also looked far from easy to deal with.","\"You can rest assured, as allies, our Western Base will naturally guarantee your rights and safety.","Anyone who harbors ill intentions and makes underhanded moves will be pursued to the fullest extent by our Western Base.","Once discovered, accountability will be ensured!\"","Peng Shaowei confidently assured everyone.","He even glanced specifically at Sun Jian and his group, clearly issuing a warning.","Yun Xiaoxiao raised her eyes slightly. Peng Shaowei was indeed impressive, with a clear and perceptive mind.","Hearing Peng Shaowei's words, the burly Sun Jian frowned deeply.","He exchanged a glance with Liao Yongchang.","The latter closed his eyes and gently shook his head.","Sun Jian immediately felt a surge of frustration.","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at him indifferently but said nothing.","Afterwards, she discussed the details of the collaboration with Peng Shaowei and other base leaders.","The results were mostly within her expectations.","For all bases wishing to purchase Evolution Serum,","Evolution Serum up to Level 3 would be sold at an 80% discount off the original price.","Meaning, one could exchange 40 crystals of the same level for a vial of Evolution Serum.","For Evolution Serum up to Level 6, the discount would be 70%.","And for those above Level 6, the discount would be 60%.","This pricing was quite reasonable.","Although the price was lower than before, Yun Xiaoxiao supported the Zombie Clearance Plan wholeheartedly.","It was only natural to show some sincerity.","Moreover, no matter how low the price, she would still be the one profiting.","After all, a single crystal could produce a vial of Evolution Serum.","Everything else was pure profit.","In addition to Evolution Serum, she also listed various supplies on a detailed inventory.","Each item was marked with its price.","Of course, these supplies would also be purchased with crystals.","She had plenty of both supplies and Evolution Serum.","What she lacked was crystals.","Her pricing received no objections from the others.","Even if there were any, they were ignored.","After settling this, Peng Shaowei began to outline his plan.","He proposed selecting combat-effective individuals from each base to form a joint force.","Then, starting from points and extending to lines and surfaces, they would systematically reclaim areas occupied by zombies.","\"This will be a very difficult battle, and there will undoubtedly be sacrifices.","So, our principle remains the same: voluntary participation.","You can return to your bases and discuss this with your people.","However, those who participate will receive preferential treatment in terms of supplies and other benefits.\"","Peng Shaowei explained slowly.","\"Additionally, every time we reclaim an area, the collected supplies and crystals will be distributed according to the number of participants from each base and their contributions, striving for fairness and justice.\"","\"When do you anticipate this operation starting?\" someone asked.","Peng Shaowei replied, \"We'll give everyone half a month to select personnel and prepare. Half a month later, we'll gather here again to begin our first campaign.\"","\"During this half-month, I'll also arrange for some explosives to be prepared.\"","To further refine the plan, everyone returned to the second floor of the cafeteria for a meeting.","The meeting lasted for several hours.","It wasn't until around 11 p.m. that it concluded.","Many subsequent issues were thoroughly discussed.","Just before the end, Hao Ren arrived with his subordinates.","They placed several large baskets on the ground.","Inside the baskets were all kinds of crystals.","Hao Ren handed a list to Peng Shaowei and whispered a few words.","Peng Shaowei nodded and then looked at the others.","\"Gentlemen, these are all the crystals collected today, excluding those from Yun City and Xiangrui Base.","We've calculated the total amount each base should receive based on their strength level and number of participants.","The details are recorded on this list.","Please pass it around and review it. If there are no issues, we'll proceed with the distribution according to the list.\"","Peng Shaowei gestured to Hao Ren, who immediately took the list and handed it to Jiang Huai.","Jiang Huai glanced at it and shook his head.","\"No problem, it seems fair.\"","He then passed it to Wang Dahai, and it continued to circulate among everyone present.","Yun Xiaoxiao could sense that some people were not entirely satisfied, feeling they had received less than they deserved.","But no one voiced any objections on the surface, all saying it was acceptable.","Yun Xiaoxiao chuckled softly.","\"Little girl, what are you laughing at?\" someone asked, puzzled by her sudden laughter.","Yun Xiaoxiao looked back at him leisurely.","\"Aren't you feeling like your base got shortchanged?\"","\"I... I didn't!\" the man stammered, flustered.","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at him. \"Even if you did, what's there to be flustered about?","If you really feel you got less, you can speak up.","We value long-term cooperation, so it's better to express any dissatisfaction early.","Otherwise, if negative emotions build up over time, they might explode later, and that would be scary.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled meaningfully.","Small conflicts are easy to resolve.","What's terrifying is when small conflicts are not addressed, accumulating into a mountain of grievances.","By then, resolving them would be nearly impossible.","She didn't want any hidden \"time bombs\" during their collaboration.","\"I...\" the man frowned.","He was unsure how Yun Xiaoxiao knew his thoughts.","But he indeed felt a bit dissatisfied.","Just as he didn't know how to express it, Yun Xiaoxiao pointed out two other individuals.","The two, caught off guard, initially felt awkward but quickly became more candid, immediately voicing their concerns.","Seeing this, he had no choice but to speak up.","Afterward, he indeed felt much more relieved.","It turned out that his share had indeed been calculated with a minor error.","Peng Shaowei immediately made up the difference from his own share of crystals.","As for the other two, they had simply misunderstood the calculations.","After Hao Ren's explanation, they also understood and their grievances were resolved.","Thus, it's better to clarify things face to face.","Keeping things bottled up can lead to misunderstandings.","What might start as a small issue could eventually escalate into an unsolvable problem.","Peng Shaowei looked at Yun Xiaoxiao with appreciation.","\"What Xiaoxiao just pointed out is correct. Since we are all part of the same alliance now, absolute trust is essential.","So, if anyone feels something is amiss, it's important to speak up and discuss it together.\"","After distributing the crystals, Peng Shaowei pointed to the remaining ones.","\"These were originally meant for our Western Base.","But I'd like to contribute them all to purchase food for our first operation.\""]},{"number":232,"title":"Chapter 232: Speak up if you have something to say, let it out if you have gas","paragraphs":["Upon hearing this, everyone was stunned.","Since the Western Base had the most participants and contributed the most, they naturally received the largest share of the crystal cores.","The combined total of all the other bases multiplied by two probably wouldn't even match their amount.","Yet now, Peng Shaowei was proposing to use all these crystal cores to purchase supplies.","These supplies would be used for the logistical support of the alliance's first operation!","This was undeniably... a selfless act of dedication.","Especially in this apocalyptic world where everyone was scrambling to snatch whatever they could from others.","Seeing everyone's astonishment, Peng Shaowei explained.","\"If it weren't for everyone's help during the zombie siege, we alone would have struggled to win.”","This statement was factual.","Their strongest assets—cannons, bullets, and fire trenches—had only managed to eliminate a portion of the zombies.","Without the other bases' members staying behind to fight alongside them, the outcome would have been uncertain.","Even if they had managed to hold off the attack, the casualties would have been horrifying.","\"Moreover, it was our base that initially proposed and organized the zombie cleanup plan. Since everyone has been so supportive, isn't it only right to contribute some crystal cores as startup funds for the plan?\"","Peng Shaowei smiled, unconcerned about the magnitude of the contribution.","Everyone was impressed by his magnanimity.","At the same time, they were even more convinced.","With such a righteous person steering the alliance, the joint operations were undoubtedly feasible!","At the end of the meeting, representatives from various bases flocked to Yun Xiaoxiao and her team to discuss purchasing evolution serums.","In a flash, Yun Xiaoxiao and her companions were surrounded.","Watching Yun Xiaoxiao being the center of attention, Tang Yanchi frowned.","\"Should we buy some too?\"","Someone asked Tang Jun.","Before Tang Jun could respond, Tang Yanchi shot an annoyed glare at the inquirer.","\"Buy what? We can directly consume crystal cores to enhance our abilities. Why waste them on buying evolution serums?\"","\"But... Yun City claims that the evolution serum is more effective than directly consuming crystal cores and doesn't harm the body at all,\" the questioner said, looking conflicted.","\"Actually, I've been feeling my temper getting out of control lately, and my chest feels like it's burning.","I wonder if it's because we've consumed too many crystal cores, causing some side effects.","After all, those things come from zombie brains...\"","\"If you dare to exchange for evolution serum, don't even think about calling yourself part of Xiangrui Base anymore!\"","Tang Yanchi snorted and stormed off.","After glancing at Yun Xiaoxiao, Tang Jun also followed and descended the stairs.","A companion patted the disheartened man's shoulder.","\"Let's go.\"","\"But...\"","\"Don't 'but' anymore. Young Master Tang is naturally arrogant, and you've never seen him lose to anyone.","He's already in a foul mood after this major setback.","Praising Yun City's evolution serum in front of him is like rubbing salt in his wounds.","He won't give you the time of day.","Listen to me, don't mention anything about Yun City in front of him.","Otherwise, you'll have a tough time in the base.\"","The companion advised earnestly.","Afterward, he quickly caught up with the Tang brothers.","The man sighed quietly, rubbed his uncomfortable chest, and shook his head before following.","As soon as the Xiangrui Base members left, Sun Jian, Liao Yongchang, and their group also departed.","Yun Xiaoxiao merely glanced at their departure before returning her gaze, her eyes carrying a subtle, enigmatic smile.","Not far from the cafeteria.","Sun Jian and his group caught up with Tang Yanchi and his party.","At their calls, the Tang brothers stopped.","\"What is it?\"","Tang Jun's brow remained unmoved as he looked at them indifferently.","\"That girl from Yun City is too arrogant. She dared to disrespect Young Master Tang. It's infuriating!\"","Sun Jian complained indignantly.","Tang Jun frowned. \"What exactly are you trying to say?\"","Sun Jian glanced around, noticing people starting to exit the cafeteria. He pointed to a corner with a sly gesture.","\"It's not convenient to talk here. Let's move to that corner.\"","\"Spit it out if you have something to say, don't beat around the bush!\"","Tang Yanchi snorted, showing no regard for Sun Jian's feelings.","\"Just say it here. Don't waste our rest time.\"","Tang Jun's tone also carried a hint of impatience.","Though slightly annoyed, Sun Jian suppressed his anger for the sake of his plan to get back at Yun Xiaoxiao.","He leaned in and whispered, \"We also can't stand the people from Yun City. So, we thought we could team up with you to teach them a lesson...\"","Before he could finish, Tang Yanchi let out another cold laugh.","He looked Sun Jian up and down with disdain.","\"You? We lost to them, so what makes you think you can handle them?\"","\"But... we have you,\" Sun Jian said, forcing a flattering smile.","\"Hmph, I admit I'm not happy about losing, but I'm not a sore loser. Losing is losing. I wouldn't stoop so low as to seek revenge. What kind of people do you take us for?!\"","Tang Yanchi roared angrily.","\"Get lost, you trash!\"","With a bad temper, Tang Yanchi shoved Sun Jian aside and walked away.","\"Xiangrui Base doesn't act as anyone's pawn. You're barking up the wrong tree.\"","Tang Jun coldly eyed Sun Jian and Liao Yongchang.","The brothers didn't bother with the now-fuming Sun Jian and his group, turning their backs and leaving proudly.","As soon as their figures disappeared, Sun Jian couldn't hold back his anger any longer.","He kicked a pebble on the roadside.","\"Damn it, do they think they're so great? Their noses are practically in the sky!","If they're so strong, why did they lose to someone else?","Hmph, what a damn shame!\"","After venting his frustration, he looked at Liao Yongchang.","\"Liao Ge, since Xiangrui Base won't help, what do we do now?\"","Liao Yongchang snorted. \"What else can we do? Let it go!\"","\"But what about the beating I took? And our base's reputation? Are we just going to let that slide?\"","\"Then what do you want me to do?!\" Liao Yongchang snapped.","\"Do you want everyone to go die with you?!\"","Then, he softened his tone.","\"This time, consider it a lesson. Next time, control your mouth and temper when you're out. Don't cause trouble for me again.\"","Liao Yongchang left with his group, leaving Sun Jian alone.","Sun Jian lowered his head, clenching his fists.","Why should he let it go?","Was his beating just going to be in vain?","No way!","With the alliance, there would surely be opportunities to see that brat again.","When the time came, he would definitely...","He looked toward the cafeteria, his eyes filled with malice."]},{"number":233,"title":"Chapter 233: Mate Selection Criteria","paragraphs":["But he would never have imagined that he wouldn't even get that chance.","Early the next morning, various bases began to leave one after another.","Sun Jian, Liao Yongchang, and others also drove their vehicles out of the Western Base.","\"Huh, that car behind us looks like it belongs to Yun City, doesn't it?\"","A man looked puzzled as he glanced at the rearview mirror, where a peculiarly shaped RV was visible.","Hearing this, Sun Jian turned his head to look behind.","Then, he snorted.","\"Why bother with them? They go their way, we go ours. We're not on the same path anyway; we'll split up at the next intersection.\"","\"Yeah, you're right.\"","But a few minutes later, when their car turned into a side road, they realized something was off.","\"This isn't right. Why is Yun City's car still following us? They should have taken another road, right?\"","\"Maybe... they want to try a new route.\" Liao Yongchang also frowned.","Even he didn't quite believe what he just said.","At that moment, the RV behind them suddenly accelerated and overtook them.","It then stopped a short distance ahead, blocking the road in front of them.","\"Screech!\"","The sound of emergency braking rang out sharply.","Sun Jian and the others, caught off guard by the sudden stop, slammed headfirst into the front seats.","They looked disheveled.","\"What are they... trying to do?\"","The man who had earlier exclaimed quickly looked up and peered through the windshield at Yun Xiaoxiao and the others who had gotten out of the RV.","The group stood in different positions, leaning against the car.","Yun Xiaoxiao, however, sat leisurely on the hood of the RV, sucking on a lollipop and playfully teasing a black scorpion in her hand.","Her demeanor and stance were eerily reminiscent of the scenes in TV dramas where hoodlums block the road to rob passersby.","Liao Yongchang immediately realized that the other party might not be coming with good intentions this time.","He glared at Sun Jian.","\"Look at the mess you've caused!\"","As the base leader, he couldn't just let Sun Jian face this alone.","Otherwise, his authority in front of his subordinates would be compromised.","Though angry, he still had to get out of the car.","He approached Yun Xiaoxiao and the others, forcing a strained smile.","\"Ladies and gentlemen, may I ask why you've blocked our vehicle?\"","\"What would you do if someone kept trying to find opportunities to kill you behind your back?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled sweetly, answering with a question instead.","Her demeanor was like that of a diligent student eager to learn.","Liao Yongchang frowned deeply.","He didn't believe for a second that Yun Xiaoxiao was genuinely seeking his advice.","Intercepting them on the road and asking such a question made the implication quite clear.","\"Little girl, the misunderstanding from before has already been cleared up, and you've had your revenge, haven't you?\"","\"Yes, but would you leave a ticking time bomb by your side?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao licked her lollipop and raised an eyebrow.","Liao Yongchang's eyes flickered, then he pushed Sun Jian forward.","\"Apologize now!\"","He knew that if they didn't resolve this today, not only would Sun Jian suffer, but the rest of them might not leave easily either.","Previously, he hadn't fully understood Yun Xiaoxiao's group's strength.","But after the zombie siege, he had come to realize that Yun City was not to be trifled with.","Sun Jian resisted.","He stiffened his neck. \"Why should I apologize? Dream on if you think I'll apologize to a brat like her!\"","He hated her so much that he wanted to kill her; how could he possibly apologize?","\"Bang!\"","Before Sun Jian could finish his words, a bullet shot through his forehead without warning.","No one had expected this to happen.","The scene fell into a momentary silence.","Even the air seemed to freeze.","It wasn't until Sun Jian's body fell heavily to the ground that Liao Yongchang and the others snapped out of their shock.","They widened their eyes and looked toward the source of the bullet.","Their gazes met Lu Chen's ice-cold stare.","Their hearts skipped a beat.","That gaze was too cold, as if just a glance could freeze one's soul.","\"Well, do you want to avenge him?\"","A childish voice, tinged with mockery, slowly rang out.","Liao Yongchang and the others turned to look at Yun Xiaoxiao, who appeared relaxed.","For some reason, despite her smile, her beautiful eyes seemed even more dangerous.","Liao Yongchang's gaze flickered.","Though he hated to admit it, he felt a chill in his heart.","The people from Yun City were too dangerous!","He cared about his pride, but he cared more about his life.","He immediately shook his head.","\"Oh~\"","Yun Xiaoxiao's gaze was long and contemplative.","\"But he was from your base. His death—don't you want to seek justice for him?\"","\"This matter was entirely Sun Jian's fault.","I had advised him before to let it go.","But he was stubborn and hot-tempered.","Now that the matter is settled, I will make it clear here.","We will not pursue this matter.","If you don't mind, we would like to make friends with Yun City.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao studied Liao Yongchang for a moment, then suddenly smiled.","\"You're quite 'clever.'\"","Though she looked down on such people, having another 'friend' was always better than making another enemy.","With more people to help her gather crystals, she naturally wouldn't refuse.","After Yun Xiaoxiao and the others left, Liao Yongchang's subordinates looked at Sun Jian's corpse and asked, \"What should we do now?\"","\"What do you mean, what should we do?\"","Liao Yongchang frowned.","\"Bury the body to honor our previous camaraderie.","From now on, you must be careful with your words and actions. Don't be like Sun Jian and act foolishly, provoking those you shouldn't, harming yourself and dragging the base down. Do you understand?\"","\"Yes!\"","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others returned to the main road and continued their journey.","Zheng Xin'er, leading the people from Yangcheng Base, caught up from behind.","\"You guys are fast! I just went to the bathroom for a moment, and when I came out, you were gone.\"","Zheng Xin'er rolled down the passenger window and chatted with Yun Xiaoxiao and the others, smiling.","The two cars drove side by side.","Yun Xiaoxiao noticed that on the way back, Zheng Xin'er didn't actively talk to Lu Chen but instead communicated more with Zheng Yuner.","\"Chen Ge, you really don't like Zheng Xin'er, do you?\"","Nie Yizhou turned his head with a mischievous grin, clearly curious.","\"If you like her, go chase her yourself.\" Lu Chen glanced at him indifferently.","Nie Yizhou immediately protested, \"What? I don't like her!\"","He was just showing concern; how did it turn into his business?","\"Then what kind of girl do you like?\" Ling Jing lazily teased.","Nie Yizhou thought carefully, his face filled with dreams.","\"Of course... a top-heavy, angelic face, devilish figure, gentle personality, understanding, and extremely strong beauty!\"","\"Tch.\" Xiao Feng, who was driving, scoffed lightly.","\"What are you scoffing at?\" Nie Yizhou glared.","Xiao Feng raised an eyebrow. \"I know where you can find one. Want to know?\"","Nie Yizhou's interest was immediately piqued. \"Where? Where?\"","\"In your dreams.\"","Nie Yizhou: ......"]},{"number":234,"title":"Chapter 234: Something Happened to Ciwan","paragraphs":["Yun Xiaoxiao and the others were unaware that shortly after they left, something went wrong at the Xiangrui Base, which was about to depart.","\"What, hasn't he come out yet?\"","Tang Jun checked the time and frowned impatiently.","\"What the hell is he doing?!\" Tang Yanchi was also getting restless.","\"He said he had a stomachache and was in the bathroom. Should I go and hurry him up?\"","A man wiped the virtual sweat from his forehead and hurriedly bowed his head saying.","\"Then why aren't you going right now!\" Tang Yanchi snorted.","The man quickly ran upstairs.","He briskly walked to the bathroom door.","\"Knock knock knock~\"","\"Monkey, are you done yet? The two young masters are getting impatient. If you don't come out soon, you'll probably be punished later.\"","The man knocked on the door while urgently urging.","But after waiting for a while, there was no response from inside.","He frowned and muttered softly.","\"What's going on?\"","Suddenly, he heard some strange noises coming from the bathroom.","He frowned and pressed his ear against the door.","Inside the bathroom, a man with his pants down to his ankles was hanging his head low, his body convulsing like it was spasming.","If you looked closely, you would recognize that this was the same person who had asked Tang Yanchi and the others yesterday if they wanted to buy evolution liquid from Yun Xiaoxiao and the others, and who had already felt unwell.","His joints were dislocated and twisted, making some cracking sounds.","\"Monkey, what the hell are you doing? Everyone is waiting! Ahhhhh!\"","The door handle turned, and the door opened.","The man stuck his head in, displeased.","But at that moment, the boy called Monkey suddenly looked up, revealing a pale, lifeless face.","He howled and grabbed the man's head that had stuck in, biting into his neck.","Blood immediately splattered all over the bathroom.","Seeing that the person still hadn't come down, the brothers Tang Yanchi and Tang Jun became even more impatient.","So, they called two more people.","\"Go upstairs and tell them that if they don't come down soon, they never need to come down again.\"","The two men hurried upstairs upon receiving the order.","But soon, one of them came back in a panic.","\"Something's wrong, something's wrong!\"","The man shouted in panic.","\"What's the matter? Calm down!\" Tang Jun said unhappily.","\"Young Master Jun, something's wrong upstairs!\"","\"What?!\"","The few of them immediately got out of the car and ran upstairs.","When they got upstairs, they saw two zombies gnawing on another person on the ground.","From their vantage point, they could clearly see the faces of these three people.","\"Heaven! It's Monkey and the others!\"","\"How did they turn into zombies?!\"","\"Could it be that they were scratched by zombies yesterday?\"","While the group was shocked, Monkey and the others also noticed the commotion at the door.","Immediately, they revealed fierce expressions, roared crazily, and then charged over like demons.","Without batting an eye, Tang Jun and Tang Yanchi quickly and efficiently dealt with the two zombies.","They also sent their companion, who was about to mutate, to his rest.","Tang Jun crouched down and examined Monkey's corpse.","\"Brother, what are you looking at?\"","Tang Yanchi asked curiously.","Tang Jun frowned, \"He was the first one with a problem, so I want to see if he mutated because he was scratched by a zombie yesterday, or...\"","He didn't finish the rest of his sentence.","Because that was just his guess, a particularly bad guess.","In fact, yesterday when Monkey said he was losing control of his temper and felt a burning sensation in his chest, he took it seriously.","Because he occasionally had similar feelings.","Before Monkey mentioned it, he didn't notice, but after Monkey said it, he realized.","Not just him, but his brother and other people with abilities seemed to be getting more and more irritable, though he wasn't sure when it started.","He examined Monkey's corpse thoroughly but didn't find any scratches on him.","His mood froze...","Unaware of all this, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others traveled for two days and finally returned to Yun City.","\"Do you want to rest in the base for the night?\" Yun Xiaoxiao invited Zheng Xin'er.","Zheng Xin'er quickly waved her hand, \"No, I'd better hurry back. There's still a lot to do.\"","\"Alright, see you next time.\"","\"Okay, bye~\"","Zheng Xin'er flicked her hair, smiled brightly, and waved at Yun Xiaoxiao and the others as her car slowly started.","After the car left, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others also returned.","But just as they were about to reach the gate, a sudden roar of an engine came from the highway not far away.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others turned to look behind them and saw an off-road vehicle speeding towards the base.","Seeing the license plate, Yun Xiaoxiao's eyes flashed with surprise.","Wasn't that Ci Wan's car?","At this moment, Ci Wan's car was moving extremely fast.","Even when it met Yun Xiaoxiao's car, it didn't stop but drove straight past.","After an abrupt turn, it drove straight into the base.","Nie Yizhou straightened up.","\"Hey, why are they driving so fast? Are they in a hurry to be reincarnated?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao, however, frowned, feeling something was off.","\"Follow them,\" she said.","Xiao Feng pressed the accelerator, and the speed immediately spiked to the maximum.","They raced all the way and finally arrived at the hospital.","\"What's going on?!\"","Nie Yizhou's eyes widened in shock.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others also looked surprised.","Because in front of them, Sun Xiaoming with a shaved head and Wei Qian with an afro were hurriedly carrying the unconscious Ci Wan out of the car.","Ci Wan wasn't just unconscious; he was also seriously injured in multiple places.","Blood had stained his clothes red.","Sun Xiaoming and Wei Qian weren't in much better shape. Their clothes and hair were messy, and they had many wounds on their bodies.","The two of them carried Ci Wan and rushed towards the building where Ye Shuyuan and the others were.","Following closely behind them was Yang Jianhua, an uncle with his left hand hanging limp.","His hand was almost completely useless, and blood was dripping down continuously.","The four of them looked utterly miserable, clearly having gone through a life-and-death battle.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others quickly got out of the car and followed them.","They arrived at the ward door.","Sun Xiaoming and Wei Qian were anxiously looking at the operating room.","\"Brothers, why are you in such a state? What exactly happened?\"","Nie Yizhou walked over and patted Sun Xiaoming's shoulder.","Sun Xiaoming cried out in pain, and Nie Yizhou quickly let go.","\"Sorry about that, but how did you get so badly injured?\"","Seeing the arrival of the few, Sun Xiaoming immediately reddened his eyes.","\"It's all that shameless bastard Chang Li!\""]},{"number":235,"title":"Chapter 235: The Protective Yun Xiaoxiao","paragraphs":["Sun Xiaoming recounted their experiences, his eyes red from crying.","Originally, they set out on this expedition with the purpose of killing more zombies to exchange their crystal cores and boost their strength faster.","However, during their midday rest stop, they happened to encounter a few survivors who happened to be from Xiang City.","What was even more coincidental was that these survivors had passed by the base where Ci Wan and his group were staying.","According to the survivors, a few stakes had been erected in front of the base, and several corpses were hung on them.","The corpses, exposed to the sun and eroded by rain, were rotten beyond recognition and emitted a disgusting odor.","Initially, these survivors wanted to enter the base, but the sight of the corpses scared them and they hurriedly left.","They recounted their experience with expressions of lingering fear.","However, upon hearing this, Ci Wan and his fellows felt as if a tumultuous wave had swept through them.","As for who the corpses belonged to, they didn't need to guess; they knew right away.","That Chang Li would do such a thing was not surprising at all.","Outraged by what they heard and convinced that they couldn't allow the bodies of their loved ones to continue to endure such desecration, they decided to retrieve them and give them a proper burial.","After discussing, they hit the road with the aim of discreetly taking away the corpses.","But, to their surprise, it was all a trap!","The corpses indeed belonged to Ci Wan's father and his group, but it was a trap flawlessly laid out by Chang Li!","Part of the plan was to have Ci Wan and his group fall into the trap in their attempt to respectfully bury the corpses.","As soon as they arrived, they were ambushed.","Luckily, Chang Li was not at the base at that time.","Just his subordinates were there.","But there were too many of them, and they were not weak in terms of strength, Ci Wan's group suffered heavy losses.","If it hadn't been for Ci Wan staking his all to stop the pursuers, they probably wouldn't have been able to escape at all.","But Ci Wan had been seriously injured and lost consciousness, barely clinging to life.","They also lost one of their companions.","Sun Xiaoming choked up when he got to this part of the story.","“What happened to the corpses of Ci Wan's family members?” Yun Xiaoxiao asked.","Sun Xiaoming, his eyes welling up with tears, replied in a resentful tone, “They are still hanging on the stakes, we were discovered before we even got close.”","So, they didn't venture deeper.","If they had, every one of them estimated they wouldn't have made it back. They would have died there.","Hearing this, everyone frowned.","Yun Xiaoxiao suddenly looked up and asked, “Approximately how many people are there?”","Startled, Sun Xiaoming thought for a while, then replied, “I'm not completely sure but I guess there were around six to seven hundred people at Chang Li's side when we left.”","“How strong are they?”","“The most powerful ones are Chang Li, and his two deputies, a man and a woman. They are slightly stronger than sister Wan.","The rest have varying capabilities, some are pretty good, but not as good as sister Wan, probably around Wei Qian's and my level.","Of course, most of them are weaker than us, but they have numbers on their side.”","“Bad news, someone outside is picking a fight!”","Just as Sun Xiaoming finished his sentence, Liu Tao, riding a motorcycle, appeared below the building.","He shouted up at them.","This Liu Tao was the son of Liu Cheng, who escaped from the rice factory.","Both Tao Mi'er and I are now part of the guard team.","Hearing noises, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others peered through the window.","\"What's going on?\" Lu Chen asked, furrowing his eyebrows.","\"Captain, a lot of people suddenly showed up outside. They say they suspect the person they're after has entered our base and want to conduct a search,\" replied a subordinate.","\"What do they look like?\" Yun Xiaoxiao asked, narrowing her eyes.","After thinking for a moment, Liu Tao answered, \"The one leading them has slanted eyes and a mole on his right chin.\"","\"They're Chang Li's henchmen!\"","Sun Xiaoming clenched his teeth, fists trembling uncontrollably.","\"They dared to follow us here!\"","Yun Xiaoxiao lightly tapped her crossed arms.","She raised an eyebrow, looking towards the entrance.","\"Humph, perfect timing.","Do they think they can hurt the people of Yun City whenever they want?\"","As she spoke, a hint of cold intensity flashed in Yun Xiaoxiao's eyes.","Nie Yizhou also rolled up his sleeves, \"Exactly, if they dare hurt our people, we will take them down!\"","\"Let's go!\"","Xiao Feng was more straightforward, he was already eager to get downstairs.","Seeing them quickly head down, Sun Xiaoming and Wei Qian locked eyes, both witnessing the shock and gratitude in each other’s gaze.","When they first arrived in Yun City, they felt out of place.","After all, it wasn't truly their home.","However, over time, they had thoroughly acclimated to their surroundings.","They have decided to fully commit to staying here.","They started to actively integrate into this place.","They have never felt more at home than now!","At that moment, they really understood what it meant to be protected.","The other party was neither their family nor intimate friends, yet they were willing to stand up for them.","They were more comforting than family, more homely than home!","Their eyes reddened, just another glance at the still-lit operating room had newfound meanings to them, they took a deep breath and hurriedly followed Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","At the front gate.","Mu Yang was standing alone right at the front.","Several cars were parked in front of him, with a group of twenty or so people confronting him.","The atmosphere between the two parties was not exactly cordial.","\"We’ve already said that we suspect that you’re hiding the person we seek.","Just let us come in and search, we'll leave once we’re done.\"","The leader that had triangular eyes puffed his chest out arrogantly, speaking in an uncouth manner.","Mu Yang snorted coldly, \"Is Yun City some place you can simply search just because you say so?\"","\"Friend, give some face, you don’t want another enemy, do you?\"","\"Are you threatening me?\"","Mu Yang's gentle gaze was suddenly filled with cold ruthlessness.","\"How is this a threat? Let us in to search, and we won’t trouble you.\"","\"Go to hell, does our Yun City look like a place for you mongrels to run wild!","Look at yourself in the mirror, with that ugly face, rather than troubling us, you should be hiding at home. Do you even have the capability to trouble us?\"","As soon as the triangular-eyed man finished speaking, a coarse voice suddenly echoed.","Following that, several figures appeared by Mu Yang's side.","Originally insulted, Triangular eyes were filled with rage.","He was about to retaliate, but unexpectedly caught sight of Sun Xiaoming and Wei Qian.","He squinted his eyes, \"Sure enough, you're here!\"","Immediately after, he abruptly attempted to capture Sun Xiaoming and Wei Qian.","But no sooner had he moved, an enormous whip lashed out without warning.","\"Crack!\"","He was brutally whipped.","His entire body was flung away.","A bloody mark instantly appeared on the left side of his face.","\"Dare to touch my people!\"","Simultaneously, as he was thrown away, an incredibly domineering child's voice abruptly echoed!"]},{"number":236,"title":"Chapter 236: Yun Xiaoxiao's Baby Luck","paragraphs":["The Triangular-Eyed Man rubbed his aching face and looked up to see a small figure standing not far ahead.","Though she was tiny, her aura was so intimidating that it made his heart race.","Was it her who had just knocked him flying?","Damn it!","She had ambushed him!","Gritting his teeth against the pain, he struggled to his feet.","\"Let me tell you, don't meddle in other people's business. Do you know who we are?\"","His face suddenly darkened, contorting with anger.","\"Who you are doesn't concern us,\" Nie Yizhou scoffed.","\"Those two are people we're after. You'd better stay out of it, or the Base Commander won't let you off easy!\"","\"Oh~ is that so? Just my luck, I don't plan to... let him off either,\" Yun Xiaoxiao said with a leisurely smile.","As soon as the words left her mouth, her eyes turned icy.","Without giving the enemy any time to react, she charged forward.","Every move was aimed at taking their lives.","Nie Yizhou and Xiao Feng clenched their fists, ready for a big fight.","Sun Xiaoming and Wei Qian, who had been simmering with anger, now saw Yun Xiaoxiao and the others standing up for them. Their pent-up rage exploded, and despite their injuries, they immediately rushed forward, attacking anyone in sight.","However, they soon realized they had little to do.","Because Yun Xiaoxiao and the others were simply too strong!","In less than ten minutes, the Triangular-Eyed Man and his group were all dead.","The base's front gate was littered with bodies.","In that moment, they finally realized just how powerful the base they had joined truly was.","A strong sense of belonging washed over them.","\"Find a truck to drag these bodies out and dump them. Don't dump them too close; it'll pollute the environment,\" Yun Xiaoxiao said, glancing indifferently at the bodies.","Nie Yizhou chuckled. \"Don't worry, leave it to us.\"","He patted Xiao Feng's chest. \"Come on, let's go.\"","Xiao Feng nodded. \"Alright.\"","\"Little one, when are we moving out?\" Ling Jing asked, looking at Yun Xiaoxiao.","Yun Xiaoxiao knew he was referring to the previous base where Ci Wan had been.","She nonchalantly raised an eyebrow.","\"Let's wait until Sister Ci Wan wakes up.\"","Earlier, she hadn't planned to avenge Ci Wan.","After all, at the time, Ci Wan was just a stranger she had met once or twice. It wasn't worth picking a fight with an entire base over her.","But things were different now.","Ci Wan and her group were now part of Yun City.","Which meant they were her people.","Her people shouldn't be bullied by others.","And for the enemy to dare come to her base's doorstep and provoke them? That was clearly not putting them in their place.","They were nothing but clowns, and she might as well help clean up some trash in this world.","Call it doing a good deed.","As for why she wasn't leaving immediately...","It was because she wanted to wait for Ci Wan to wake up.","She believed Ci Wan would want to avenge herself.","And she would give her that chance to take revenge with her own hands!","With the matter at the gate resolved, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others went back to rest.","After a long journey, they were tired.","\"Hey, did you hear? Little Xue gave birth, and it's a boy,\" Nie Yizhou said excitedly as he returned from outside during dinner, sharing the latest gossip.","\"Liu Yi is all smiles these days, over the moon with joy.","He bought a lot of candy and hands it out to everyone he meets.","Tsk tsk, being a dad sure changes a man.\"","Nie Yizhou waved the candy he had just received, showing it off.","Just as he was about to unwrap it and eat it, a black shadow suddenly darted out, stepping on his shoulder and leaping down, snatching the candy from his hand.","He stared at his empty palm, then at the little creature sneaking to Yun Xiaoxiao's feet, peeling the candy wrapper. His frustration boiled over.","\"Hey, kid, can't you control your evil scorpion? It stole my candy!\"","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at him indifferently, then shrugged.","\"Go take it back yourself.\"","Meaning, whether you get it back or not is up to you; I'm not getting involved.","Nie Yizhou: .......","He glared at the little creature, which was already licking the candy and even glanced at him disdainfully. His expression was full of resentment.","What was the point of taking it back? To eat the scorpion's saliva?","He didn't want to get poisoned!","After dinner, Yun Xiaoxiao, with nothing better to do, grabbed two packs of diapers and two cans of formula and headed to Liu Yi's place.","The height of the diapers almost reached her own.","She dragged one in each hand, looking a bit comical.","Taking the elevator, she arrived at Liu Yi's door.","The door was open, and the place was lively.","Before she even got close, she could hear the sound of a baby crying and the chatter of people inside.","She walked in to see Tan Changbin and Lei Chunyan's family there.","Grandma Niu and Qin Zhi were also present.","\"Xiaoxiao's here!\"","As soon as Yun Xiaoxiao appeared, Qin Zhi noticed her.","Thanks to the treatment from Ye Shuyuan and Zhong Mingsheng, Qin Zhi's condition had been mostly controlled.","Now, as long as she took her medicine on time, she wouldn't experience the previous episodes of confusion and mistaking people.","Although she no longer saw Yun Xiaoxiao as her own child, she felt exceptionally warm and affectionate toward her.","She also loved her job at the hospital cafeteria.","She said that every time she cooked and saw everyone eating, she felt a sense of happiness and fulfillment.","At the sound, the others also turned to the door.","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao, everyone's faces lit up with smiles.","Xue Huaixue, who was holding the baby and trying to soothe him, immediately waved at Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"Xiaoxiao, you're back just in time. We were just discussing having you name the baby.\"","\"Me?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao pointed at herself, puzzled.","Wasn't that a bit off? She was only five years old. Did they really want her to name the baby?","What if she came up with something bizarre?","\"Yes, if it weren't for you taking us in, he wouldn't have been born safely. It's only right for you to name him,\" Xue Huaixue said with a gentle smile.","She held the baby forward a little. \"Want to hold him?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao's lips twitched.","Were these parents a bit too trusting?","Didn't they fear she'd drop the baby?","Seeing Xue Huaixue's expectant eyes, she felt a bit reluctant to refuse, so she walked over.","The baby, wrapped in a blanket, had a face that wasn't wrinkled at all. His skin was fair with a rosy tint, and his eyes were big and adorable.","Strangely, as soon as Yun Xiaoxiao approached, the previously crying baby suddenly stopped.","He stared straight at Yun Xiaoxiao and even giggled, \"Giggling.\"","Xue Huaixue's eyes widened in surprise.","Then she chuckled. \"Look how much he likes you.","We tried everything to calm him down before.","But now, not only does he stop crying instantly, he's even smiling at you.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao looked at the soft, squishy baby grinning at her and found it quite amazing."]},{"number":237,"title":"Chapter 237: Uncontrollable Admiration","paragraphs":["She reached out and gently teased the baby, who laughed even more heartily.","\"What about naming him Liu Yichen?\" she suggested, a faint smile playing on her lips as she continued to play with the infant.","\"Yi symbolizes radiance and brilliance, while Chen represents hope and vitality.","He is the first child born in our base, and we hope he grows up healthy and strong, becoming a pillar of the community.\"","\"That name is perfect!\" Xue Huaixue couldn't help but express her delight.","Liu Yi also nodded in agreement.","Initially, they had asked Yun Xiaoxiao to name the child as a way to show their gratitude for her help, considering the favor they owed her.","They hadn't expected a five-year-old to come up with a particularly impressive name, but the result exceeded their expectations.","They genuinely found the name pleasing, both in sound and meaning.","The couple was overjoyed.","As Yun Xiaoxiao played with Liu Yichen, she subtly glanced at Tan Lili, who was standing nearby.","Upon noticing Yun Xiaoxiao's gaze, Tan Lili quickly averted her eyes and lowered her head, feeling exposed and flustered.","Yun Xiaoxiao didn't confront her directly but continued chatting with the others.","Later, sensing the time was right, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others left the room, giving Liu Yi's family some private time.","Lei Chunyan's family lived next door to Liu Yi's.","Qin Zhi and Grandma Niu also resided in the same building.","Everyone dispersed and returned to their respective homes.","However, Yun Xiaoxiao left and then returned.","At Lei Chunyan's home.","As soon as she got back, Tan Lili's face fell, her unhappiness evident to anyone who saw her.","Lei Chunyan glanced at her and sighed quietly.","\"There are plenty of good men out there. Why...?\"","\"But I just like Yi Ge!\" Tan Lili's eyes welled up with tears.","\"What nonsense are you spouting!\" Tan Changbin scolded, frustrated.","\"Liu Yi is married, and he and Huaixue are deeply in love. Now they have a child. I'm telling you, you better drop those thoughts right now!","If this gets out, how will people see you? How will they see us?!\"","Tan Lili silently wept, murmuring to herself.","\"But is it wrong to like someone?","Yi Ge is so outstanding, and his personality is so kind. I can't help but fall for him.","What can I do? Emotions aren't something you can control!\"","\"Listen to her! Listen to what she's saying. A young girl like her, how shameless! How did I end up with a daughter like this?\"","Tan Changbin's chest heaved with anger.","He quickly drank some water to calm himself down, fearing he might lose his breath.","\"It's all your fault I turned out like this!\" Tan Lili's emotions surged.","\"If you hadn't taken them in, how could I have developed feelings for him?\"","\"Do you think you're in the right here?!","If you dare to disrupt someone else's family, become a homewrecker, I'll break your legs!","Listen to me, from today on, you're not leaving this room!","Only when you've let go of those thoughts can you step out.","Our family can't afford to lose face like that!\"","Tan Changbin's anger escalated.","The tension between father and daughter was palpable.","Lei Chunyan sighed again.","She didn't know what to say.","She led Tan Lili, still in tears, into the room.","\"Your dad is furious right now. Don't provoke him.\"","Inside, she gently patted Tan Lili's hand, speaking sincerely.","\"I understand that you're going through puberty and starting to like boys.","But in the future, we'll find someone your age, even more outstanding.","Forget about Yi Ge.","Not only is he much older than you, but he's also Huaixue's husband.","They've just had a lovely baby.","If people find out you like Liu Yi, how will they look at you?","Even our interactions with Liu Yi and Huaixue will become awkward.","The good relationship we have now will be ruined.","For the next few days, just stay in your room and calm down.","We're all doing this for your own good.\"","Lei Chunyan patiently advised her.","Seeing that Tan Lili remained silent and unresponsive, she didn't know what else to say.","Sighing once more, she closed the door and left.","Only when Tan Lili herself came to understand would things improve...","After Lei Chunyan left, Tan Lili lifted her head.","By now, she was in tears.","She slowly looked out the window.","Why...","Why couldn't anyone understand her?","Was it really wrong to like someone?","She didn't want this.","But Yi Ge lived next door, and she saw him every day.","Seeing his gentleness with Huaixue, his unique charm while working, she couldn't help but focus all her attention on him.","She often fantasized about what it would be like if the person he cared for and loved was her.","Yet, she knew it was wrong to like someone else's husband.","But she couldn't control it.","What could she do?!","She buried her head in the blanket and cried unrestrainedly.","After a while, she sat up, her gaze falling on a fruit knife on the bedside table.","Her eyes were complex, filled with tears.","She slowly picked up the knife and aimed it at her wrist.","She was too tormented, too overwhelmed...","Every day, she had to pretend indifference in front of others.","She had to force a smile while watching the loving couple.","It was a torment for her.","The guilt, her parents' lack of understanding, and the thought of never being with Liu Yi crushed her heart.","If living was this painful, then it would be better to...","She smiled bitterly, her hand tightening around the knife.","\"Bang!\"","At that moment, the door was kicked open from outside.","The sudden noise startled her, and her hand paused.","Lei Chunyan and Tan Changbin stood at the doorway, their eyes wide with shock.","They couldn't believe what they were seeing.","Lei Chunyan quickly squeezed past Yun Xiaoxiao and rushed to Tan Lili's side, crying.","\"Why are you so foolish? If you die, what will we do? Do you really want us to experience the pain of burying our own child?!\"","She snatched the fruit knife from Tan Lili's hand and threw it away, then anxiously looked at her bleeding wrist, frantically searching for something to stop the bleeding.","\"Why did you come in? Why won't you let me die?\"","Tears streamed down Tan Lili's face like pearls that had snapped their string.","\"It would be better if I died. Then everything would be over, no one would know, and you wouldn't lose face. And I wouldn't... be in pain anymore.\"","\"Do you really want to die that badly?\" Yun Xiaoxiao sneered.","\"If that's what you want, then I'll grant your wish. Come with me.\"","She grabbed Tan Lili, and in an instant, both disappeared from the spot."]},{"number":238,"title":"Chapter 238: Then You Slowly Die","paragraphs":["Tan Lili had no idea what had just happened.","She only felt a sudden dizziness, and her body became unexpectedly light.","There seemed to be a few brief pauses in between, each lasting only a second or so, followed by another wave of dizziness.","When she finally regained consciousness, her heart nearly leaped out of her chest in terror.","Because she found herself in a place overrun by zombies.","She had no idea where she was, only that it resembled an abandoned factory.","And she was standing on top of a small car.","The surroundings were pitch black, but she could still see the densely packed zombies on the ground.","They were roaring and pushing towards the car, stretching out their hands to grab at anything within reach.","Some had even started climbing up.","\"Ah!\"","Tan Lili's face turned pale as she was horrified by the sight.","Just as a zombie's hand was about to grab her foot, she let out a scream of panic and quickly jumped away.","Then she frantically dodged, her nerves on edge.","\"Didn't you want to die?\"","At that moment, a calm voice came from a tree nearby.","Tan Lili turned her head and saw Yun Xiaoxiao sitting leisurely on a branch, swinging her little feet, looking completely at ease.","She pursed her lips and said, \"This is the perfect opportunity. All you need to do is extend your hand or neck for them to bite, and you'll be meeting the King of Hell in no time. It's quick.\"","Tan Lili was on the verge of tears, \"I wanted to die, but I didn't want to be killed by zombies. I could have used a knife to commit suicide.\"","\"Do you think you have the right to die in my base and pollute the air?","People who don't cherish their own lives don't deserve to die in my base.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow.","\"This place suits you better. Die here.","Everyone will be at peace.","Don't worry, I'll inform your parents about your death.","They'll probably be heartbroken, but that's about it.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao's tone was as casual as if she were discussing what to have for dinner.","It seemed as if Tan Lili's life or death truly didn't matter to her.","\"Xiaoxiao, I don't mean I don't cherish life. I'm just really suffering.","I fell in love with someone I shouldn't have.","Every day, I watch him from afar but can't be with him, nor can I tell anyone I love him.","It feels like someone is constantly covering my nose, making it hard to breathe.","I'm afraid that if I continue living, I might do something that will embarrass everyone, including my parents.","I just can't hold on anymore...\"","Tears streamed down Tan Lili's cheeks uncontrollably.","\"Then just die. They seem quite interested in your flesh. If you jump down now, they'll pounce on you and bite into your flesh piece by piece. In a few seconds, you'll be free from your suffering. It's simple.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao shrugged, smiling in a way that could almost be considered friendly.","Tan Lili, however, couldn't help but imagine the gruesome scene of being torn apart by zombies as Yun Xiaoxiao spoke.","Despite her initial desire to die, the thought of actually being killed by zombies filled her with a sudden fear.","Especially when she pictured the zombies tearing into her flesh, her heart trembled.","At least for now, she didn't want to die.","Not like this.","\"Xiaoxiao, please, for old times' sake, can you take me away? I really don't want to die here.\"","She looked at Yun Xiaoxiao pleadingly.","Yun Xiaoxiao shook her little head, \"I don't save people who are determined to die.","In this apocalypse, so many people struggle to survive, barely able to find enough to eat or wear.","Yet you have the luxury to think about trivial matters.","It seems I've made life too comfortable for you, making you forget what era we're living in.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao's words made Tan Lili blush with shame.","She knew Yun Xiaoxiao was right.","Before coming to Yun City, her daily thoughts revolved around what to eat next, or whether zombies would suddenly break in and tear her family apart.","But after arriving in Yun City, life became too comfortable.","There was food, clothing, no zombies, no danger.","It was as if the apocalypse had never happened.","She had forgotten the harsh reality of the world.","At that moment, she felt utterly ashamed.","Just as she was feeling despondent, Yun Xiaoxiao tossed a large cleaver at her feet.","\"However, you can save yourself. Whether you live or die depends on you now.\"","\"I'm going to take a nap. You... take your time dying.\"","After saying that, Yun Xiaoxiao found a comfortable position on the branch and closed her eyes to sleep, looking utterly relaxed.","Tan Lili was stunned for a moment, then quickly picked up the cleaver.","As a zombie started climbing up, she mustered all her courage and swung the cleaver with all her strength at the zombie.","The first swing missed, and the zombie growled as it lunged at her again.","Even in the dark night, the zombie's grotesque face was clearly visible.","Tan Lili's heart raced.","She felt as if she were fighting for her life against the Grim Reaper.","All thoughts of love, despair, and wanting to die were cast aside.","All she knew was that if she didn't kill the zombie, she would be the one to die.","She realized that Yun Xiaoxiao truly had no intention of helping her.","And why would she?","While so many people risked their lives to find food and fought for survival, they had been living in the safety of the base, indulging in luxuries, and yet still complaining about trivial matters.","She cried as she swung the cleaver at the zombies climbing onto the car.","She cried not because of the horde of zombies surrounding her.","But because of the foolishness of her past self.","Because of the pain she had caused her parents.","Because of her own ungratefulness.","Although Yun Xiaoxiao claimed to be sleeping, she was actually keeping a close eye on Tan Lili's situation.","Seeing the change in the other girl's mindset, she gently curved her lips.","Still, as she had said before, whether Tan Lili lived or died was up to her.","At first, Tan Lili was clumsy and nearly got pulled off the car by the zombies several times.","She didn't know where she found the strength, but she kept going tirelessly from night until dawn.","By the time her arms were almost too weak to lift, she had managed to kill all the zombies.","The area around the car was piled with zombie corpses.","Her tears had long since dried up.","Her clothes were soaked with sweat and zombie blood.","But she didn't care.","She had become a machine, numbed by the act of killing zombies.","The place Yun Xiaoxiao had chosen was filled with low-level zombies.","Their numbers weren't overwhelming.","If Yun Xiaoxiao had taken action herself, she could have cleared the area in under fifteen minutes.","But Tan Lili had taken an entire night.","Still, she had managed to hold her own, eventually killing all the zombies.","Yun Xiaoxiao opened her eyes and glanced at Tan Lili.","\"So, do you still want to die?\"","Exhausted and sitting on the car roof, Tan Lili silently shook her head.","Life was so hard, and yet she had once thought of ending it so lightly. How foolish she had been!","\"Xiaoxiao, I understand your intentions now. I know I was wrong, and I know what I should do from now on.","I want to join the guard team. I want to go out with everyone to fight zombies.","I hope it's not too late.\"","She looked up at the sky, her eyes clearer than ever."]},{"number":239,"title":"Chapter 239: Afraid, Swearing to Be a Good Person (Extra Update)","paragraphs":["Everyone makes mistakes.","Tan Lili is only seventeen years old, a time when thoughts are still immature.","If this incident can help her wake up and change her ways, then she's not beyond redemption.","Yun Xiaoxiao has a good impression of Lei Chunyan and Tan Changbin.","Ever since they joined the base and started working in the fields alongside Feng Jin, the couple has become Feng Jin's right-hand man and woman.","They are hardworking and diligent.","Often, even after it gets dark and everyone else has gone to eat, the couple will still finish sowing the last seeds or applying the fertilizer before heading back to eat.","Such hardworking people are whom she doesn't want to see their only daughter go astray.","So when she first noticed Tan Lili's infatuation at Liu Yi's house, she took it seriously.","Her return was also meant to give her a warning.","But she didn't expect that before she could even give the warning, Tan Lili was already threatening to kill herself.","Bringing her out, she thought, if there's really no hope, then let her die.","As long as she doesn't die in the base and affect everyone's mood.","If she could come to her senses on her own, that would be a good thing.","This result is exactly what she wanted to see.","People cannot grow in a favorable environment; she wanted to wake her up.","To tell her, at this moment, what she should be thinking about.","Not all those miscellaneous thoughts.","\"Since you don't want to die anymore, let's go back,\"","Yun Xiaoxiao said, jumping down from the tree.","\"Sister Xiaoxiao, I've noticed...\"","Tan Lili drew out her words, her eyes filled with curiosity.","\"I've noticed that although you're young, you seem more mature than many adults.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao chuckled, \"Want to know why?\"","\"Why?\"","Tan Lili's eyes sparkled with genuine curiosity.","Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow, \"As long as you experience life and death for a long time and taste the darkness of human nature, even a little rabbit will gradually turn into a fierce wolf.\"","Tan Lili's heart trembled.","Although she couldn't fully understand the meaning behind Yun Xiaoxiao's words,","she could feel the desolation in her voice.","However, she was puzzled.","Isn't Xiaoxiao sister only five years old?","How could she have experienced life and death for a long time, and where did she experience the darkness of human nature?","At home, Tan Changbin and Lei Chunyan, who were anxiously waiting, were pacing back and forth.","\"Where do you think the little base leader took Lili?\"","\"Don't worry, the little base leader knows what she's doing; she won't do anything reckless.\"","\"I'm not worried that the little base leader will do something reckless; I'm worried that Lili is stubborn and won't listen to reason.\"","The couple sighed, unable to sit still or stand still.","They spent the entire night sitting in the living room, unable to sleep.","They also reflected on whether they had been neglecting their daughter, leading her to overthink.","Suddenly, the air rippled.","Two figures appeared out of thin air.","The anxious couple immediately stood up.","Seeing Tan Lili safe and sound, they both breathed a sigh of relief.","At that moment, Tan Lili suddenly knelt down.","Looking at her parents' bloodshot eyes, clearly having stayed up all night, her voice choked with emotion.","\"I'm sorry, Mom and Dad. Before, I was bewitched by my own delusions, thinking about all sorts of nonsense, making you worry.","Don't worry, I'll sort out my feelings from now on and work hard with Xiaoxiao sister.","Yi Ge is just a brother, and Huaixue Jie will always be my sister.","I'll treat them as family.","But just family, no more nonsense.\"","Lei Chunyan and Tan Changbin looked at Tan Lili in disbelief.","They opened their mouths, but for a moment, they didn't know what to say.","They had imagined many different scenarios, but never this one.","They didn't know why, after just one night, their daughter, who was previously stubborn and foolish enough to consider suicide, suddenly seemed like a different person.","There was only one possibility:","The couple looked at Yun Xiaoxiao simultaneously.","\"Little base leader, thank...\"","\"Alright, you guys can catch up; I'm leaving,\"","Before the couple could finish their thanks, Yun Xiaoxiao waved her small hand and walked out of the door nonchalantly.","Leaving behind a family of three with grateful eyes.","After leaving, Yun Xiaoxiao went to the first street.","The street was no longer as empty as it was at the beginning.","Now, many shops were open.","She stopped at a snack shop.","\"Good morning, little base leader!\"","The shopkeeper, a middle-aged woman, greeted Yun Xiaoxiao enthusiastically.","\"Auntie, I'll have a hand-pulled pancake with some ham and pork tenderloin.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at the handwritten sign on the shop and ordered a hand-pulled pancake.","\"Alright, wait a moment, it'll be ready soon,\"","The aunt responded enthusiastically, making the pancake with great skill.","Once done, she leaned out, handing the pancake to Yun Xiaoxiao.","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao about to swipe her card, she quickly stopped her.","\"No need, no need; you don't have to pay.\"","\"That won't do; I should pay.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled, swiping her card on the machine quickly.","She took a big bite of the pancake, eating without any regard for her image, while leisurely strolling through the morning market.","Since everyone hadn't started work yet, the street was bustling.","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao, people greeted her.","As she strolled, she arrived at the administrative office building.","Mu Yang was already inside.","She shared her plans with him.","Mu Yang immediately issued a notice and posted it on the bulletin board outside the administrative building.","Many people curiously gathered around.","The notice listed various crimes, such as theft, robbery, fighting, assault, and so on.","For each crime, there were corresponding punishments.","The lightest was being thrown into a zombie horde.","The heaviest was being crippled and then thrown into a zombie horde.","This meant that once a crime was committed, there was no chance of survival.","Seeing this, everyone shivered and silently vowed to be good people and never engage in evil deeds!","Taking advantage of the free time, Yun Xiaoxiao also went to the mountain.","Under the leadership of Xie Youcai and his son, the coal mining work was progressing smoothly.","Jin Xiaoqing's family was also helping out.","\"Today, the first batch of coal will come out,\"","Xie Youcai wiped the dirt from his face and said with a smile.","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded affirmatively, \"Well done. Today, everyone will have a good meal; let's have some meat.\"","She waved her hand, instructing Jin Xiaoqing and her brother to take people to the foot of the mountain to move things.","Hearing that there would be meat to eat, all the miners were excited.","They worked even harder.","While Yun Xiaoxiao was at the mine, Ci Wan in the hospital slowly opened her eyes.","\"Sister Wan, you're awake!\"","Sun Xiaoming, who was sitting beside her, immediately straightened up.","\"Mmm~\"","Ci Wan rubbed her slightly dizzy head, her memories gradually returning.","She looked around.","\"We're back?\"","Sun Xiaoming nodded and told her everything that had happened after she fainted.","Including the incident where the triangle-eyed man brought people to their doorstep and was dealt with by Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","(PS: I originally planned to rest after writing two chapters, but today it seems like everyone agreed to send gifts one after another, with quite a few large amounts. Plus, there's a little cutie's birthday, making me feel like I can't not add a chapter. So, I got up immediately to write another chapter.","Extra chapter delivered, love you all~)"]},{"number":240,"title":"Chapter 240: These Beasts","paragraphs":["After hearing the story, Ci Wan's slightly sunken eyes felt a burning sensation.","A warm spring seemed to have been injected into the stagnant lake of her heart.","\"Did Xiaoxiao really say she would help us avenge our enemies?\"","Her voice carried a hint of uncertainty.","Sun Xiaoming nodded, \"Absolutely true. She said it herself. She mentioned that once you wake up and recover, she'll lead us to exact our revenge!\"","Ci Wan was deeply moved, her eyes filled with a newfound determination.","Over the next two days, Yun Xiaoxiao spent most of her time in the space, handling some base affairs and enjoying her leisure time.","She exercised, read books, and savored delicious food.","Her days were leisurely and carefree, more comfortable than ever.","Although she had read many books in her previous life, the conditions back then were limited, and the quality of the books varied.","This time, she had collected many books herself.","Therefore, besides reading medical books, she also focused on studying military strategies.","The leisurely time quickly passed.","Two days later, Ci Wan had fully recovered.","Yun Xiaoxiao and her group prepared to set off, and two vehicles left the base in succession.","As they approached the base where Chang Li was located, the cars stopped.","\"Aren't we going further?\"","Sun Xiaoming curiously stuck his head out of the window.","Yun Xiaoxiao stepped out of the RV.","Her attire today was somewhat peculiar.","It looked tattered and dirty, resembling that of a homeless waif.","She gazed at the large farm below the distant hill and slowly smiled.","\"To capture the thief, you must first capture the king. Since we've come a long way, we should give them a big 'surprise.'","Chang Li isn't good at pretending?","Then we'll use his own tactics against him.\"","This was one reason.","The other reason was that the enemy had a large number of people.","They had only brought less than ten people.","As the saying goes, to subdue the enemy without fighting is the highest form of strategy.","If they could take out the entire group without lifting a finger, why exhaust themselves with a drawn-out battle?","\"Stay here and wait. Once you hear my signal gun, you can drive down.\"","This signal gun was scavenged from an abandoned prison and had never been used before.","\"I'll go with you.\"","Lu Chen expressed his concern.","Yun Xiaoxiao shook her head, \"No, Big Brother, you look too formidable. It would raise their guard. I'll go alone.\"","Hearing this, Lu Chen had no choice but to give up.","Watching Yun Xiaoxiao's departing figure, Nie Yizhou smirked.","\"The little devil is about to play the weak again. What a pity, I can't see it firsthand. It must be quite a spectacle.\"","On the other side,","Yun Xiaoxiao arrived alone at the farm's entrance.","Before she could get close, she noticed several large wooden stakes standing at the gate.","Each stake was adorned with rotting corpses, emitting a foul stench.","She merely glanced at them before proceeding toward the gate.","\"Halt! What do you want?\"","A few men at the gate stopped Yun Xiaoxiao and her group.","\"Uncle, I haven't eaten in days. Do you have any food?\"","Her dirty face was framed by a pair of innocent, wide eyes, her expression pitiful.","It was impossible to tell that she was a little devil capable of wreaking havoc.","The men exchanged glances.","One of them smirked, \"Want food?\"","\"Mm-hmm~\" Yun Xiaoxiao nodded obediently.","\"Then follow me.\"","He signaled to the others and led Yun Xiaoxiao inside.","The farm was vast.","As soon as they entered, they saw many people working in the fields.","Men, women, the old, and the young, all were present.","Despite the cold weather requiring sweaters and thick coats, some of them wore tattered shorts and singlets.","They shivered uncontrollably, barely able to hold their tools.","If they paused for even a moment, they would be struck with sticks or whips.","Several people Yun Xiaoxiao observed had wounds all over their bodies, a horrifying sight.","The entire farm was filled with people treated like slaves, forced to do exhausting and filthy work.","\"Damn it, trying to fake being sick, huh? Don't you want to live?\"","As they walked, a curse rang out from a distance.","Yun Xiaoxiao turned her head and saw an elderly man, about sixty years old, curled up on the ground.","He wore tattered summer clothes, his entire body covered in wounds.","Especially his hands, red and swollen, with many blisters.","Some blisters had burst, caked with mud.","The sight made her heart ache.","Next to the old man was a fierce-looking man.","He cursed and kicked the old man while swinging a stick, ready to strike.","The old man, like a withered leaf, was too weak to even beg for mercy.","Just as the stick was about to land on the old man, a thin ice needle shot swiftly and fiercely into the man's wrist.","\"Ah!\"","The man cried out in pain, and the stick fell to the ground.","He clutched his wrist, his face contorted in agony.","\"Who?! Who's attacking me!\"","The man angrily cursed.","He looked around, his gaze briefly landing on Yun Xiaoxiao.","But soon, he dismissed her.","The little girl looked like she might cry at a glance.","It couldn't be her.","Who could it be then?","He angrily scanned his surroundings.","\"What bad luck!\" He cursed again.","After kicking the old man one more time, he left, clutching his wrist.","\"What's wrong with him?\"","The man in front of Yun Xiaoxiao sneered, then turned to her.","\"Move faster! Stop dawdling!\"","His true nature was now fully revealed.","If she were a truly frail little girl, she might have been scared to tears by his roar.","But who was Yun Xiaoxiao?","She wasn't someone who could be intimidated by a mere shout.","She silently continued following him.","After walking a bit further, they arrived at a row of thatched cottages.","As they approached, a disheveled man emerged from the first cottage.","From inside came the sound of a woman sobbing.","From the second cottage, the sounds of a man venting and a woman pleading could be heard.","Yun Xiaoxiao, though she hadn't experienced such things, could guess what was happening inside.","\"Don't just stand there. Get in!\"","The man pushed Yun Xiaoxiao toward the last cottage.","The light dimmed as she entered.","When she could see clearly, Yun Xiaoxiao's eyebrows furrowed deeply.","Not only were there women inside, but there were also children!","Without exception, each had some charm.","Yun Xiaoxiao's gaze darkened, a fierce killing intent flashing in her eyes.","These beasts!"]},{"number":241,"title":"Chapter 241: Give You a Chance, Kill Him","paragraphs":["\"Uncle, I have a big secret to tell you.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao suddenly turned her head and said mysteriously to the man behind her with a smile.","The man frowned. \"What secret?\"","\"Come closer, I'll tell you.\" Yun Xiaoxiao beckoned with her hand.","The man, puzzled, walked into the house.","\"Speak.\"","\"You're too tall.\"","\"What a hassle!\"","The man impatiently bent down.","\"Now it's okay, right? Hurry up and tell me, what's the secret? If you dare to play tricks on me, I'll make sure you don't get away with it!\"","Yun Xiaoxiao moved closer to the man's ear, her smiling face instantly turning cold.","She spoke word by word, \"The secret is... you can die!\"","Her voice was as cold as if it had come from a thousand-year-old icy pool, chilling one's soul.","Before the words finished, a vine as thick as a wrist directly pierced into the man's heart.","The man didn't even have time to scream before his eyes widened, and blood spilled from the corner of his mouth.","In the next moment, he met the King of Hell.","Yun Xiaoxiao gestured for silence to the people in the room.","Those who were about to scream in shock immediately fell silent.","In another thatched hut.","On a wooden board supported by bricks.","A man was riding on a woman, indulging in his animalistic desires.","The woman beneath him had already lost her voice from screaming, but the man showed no mercy.","Just then, the man looked up and met a pair of ice-cold eyes.","He was startled and was about to shout a question when a knife was suddenly pressed against his neck.","He was so frightened that he didn't dare to breathe heavily.","\"Get off!\"","Yun Xiaoxiao barked.","The man scrambled off the woman.","As soon as he moved away, the knife slashed across, puncturing his throat and severing his vocal cords.","Before he could cry out in pain, Yun Xiaoxiao kicked him to the ground with a swift motion.","In her palm, a ball of ice quickly formed. With a blank expression, she swung the ice ball directly at the man's crotch.","\"Crack!\"","\"Ugh!!!\"","Something burst.","The man writhed in agony.","He wanted to scream but found that his throat couldn't produce any sound.","Yun Xiaoxiao handed a small knife to the woman who was already frozen in shock.","\"Here's your chance, kill him.\"","The woman stared blankly at Yun Xiaoxiao.","She took a deep breath, wiped the tears from the corners of her eyes, took the knife from Yun Xiaoxiao, and walked step by step towards the man who was silently howling in pain.","Her eyes were bloodshot, filled with endless hatred.","She raised the knife and stabbed the man fiercely.","The man tried to resist but found that several vines had bound his body.","He couldn't move at all!","The woman who had been toyed with just moments ago now stabbed him in the heart with one blow.","The man's eyes widened in frustration, but he could only feel his life slipping away.","The woman went crazy, stabbing him again and again.","Until the man was turned into a pincushion, his whole body drenched in blood, she collapsed to the ground, silently shedding tears.","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at her but didn't say anything.","Because she heard movement outside.","Outside, two men were sitting on the edge of the field, smoking.","Seeing that the man who had taken Yun Xiaoxiao inside hadn't come out, one of the men chuckled.","\"Hey, that guy probably couldn't wait and...\"","\"Let's go and take a look.\"","The other man pressed the extinguished cigarette butt into the mud and got up to head towards the thatched hut.","They were the ones in charge of guarding this place.","Those who came here to indulge were rewarded for their merits.","They had to keep an eye on things to prevent any loopholes.","The two men entered the hut where Yun Xiaoxiao was.","As soon as they stepped in, they felt something was off.","It was too quiet!","And...","Why did their backs feel like a cold wind was blowing?","One man turned his head to look behind him, but as soon as he turned 90 degrees, his neck suddenly felt cold.","Then, a sharp pain struck fiercely.","Before he died, he saw his neck and body... separate!","The other man turned in shock, just in time to see his companion's gruesome death.","Before he could scream, a red-tasseled spear was pressed against his chest.","\"Don't scream if you don't want to die. Now, I ask, you answer.\"","A devilish child's voice slowly spoke.","The man nodded vigorously, clearly terrified.","\"Where does Chang Li live?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao asked directly.","The man was stunned for a moment before realizing Yun Xiaoxiao was referring to their boss.","In the farm, no one dared to call this name directly.","So for a moment, he didn't react.","He quickly told Yun Xiaoxiao where Chang Li lived.","Yun Xiaoxiao knew he wasn't lying.","She asked him a few more questions, and after he answered the last one, the red-tasseled spear in her hand suddenly pierced into his chest without warning.","The man looked at the blade sticking out of his chest in disbelief.","\"You want to know why I killed you even after you answered my questions?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao, hearing the man's thoughts, coldly curled her lips. \"That's because... you deserve to die.\"","Saying that, she pushed the spearhead further in.","The man immediately vomited a mouthful of blood and died.","Pulling out the spearhead, Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at the others who were trembling in fear.","\"Don't run around, stay here and wait. Tomorrow, you'll be free.\"","After leaving these words, she disappeared.","The remaining people looked at the three bodies on the ground and silently shed tears.","Their chests rose and fell.","Could they...","Really regain their freedom?","Yun Xiaoxiao followed the detailed address given by the man and quietly arrived at the corner of a detached villa.","As soon as she appeared, she entered a space.","Then, using continuous teleportation and entering the space, she miraculously created an effect of invisible movement.","No one noticed that she had silently arrived inside the house.","At this time, there were three people in the living room.","A man with a turned-up mouth was leaning on the sofa, massaging his temples.","\"Still no news from Ci Wan's group?\"","His voice was hoarse, like the sound of a saw.","Standing beside the sofa were a man and a woman.","The man had a somewhat effeminate appearance, and the woman was very strong.","These should be Chang Li and his two subordinates.","The effeminate man lowered his head.","\"Yes, the people we sent out haven't reported back yet.\"","\"A bunch of good-for-nothings, can't even catch a few wounded people, what use are they!\"","Chang Li's brows showed displeasure.","\"Auntie, you're here!\"","Suddenly, a soft, childish voice sounded.","Then, a small figure happily rushed in from outside and hugged the strong woman's thigh.","The three were stunned.","Chang Li and his subordinate Xiong Wei turned their attention to the scene.","\"Jiaojiao, who is this child?\"","Chang Li frowned, looking at the strong woman Qiao Jiaojiao."]},{"number":242,"title":"Chapter 242: Hello, Sissy Uncle","paragraphs":["Qiao Jiaojiao was just about to shake her head and say she didn't know Yun Xiaoxiao.","But before she could, Yun Xiaoxiao beat her to it, \"Auntie, don't leave me behind. Didn't you say you were going to take care of me from now on?\"","\"When did I ever...?\" Qiao Jiaojiao looked utterly bewildered.","\"Auntie, who are they?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao didn't give Qiao Jiaojiao a chance to speak and continued to ask.","Qiao Jiaojiao actually glanced at Chang Li and Xiong Wei.","\"They are... Huh, why should I explain this to you?\" Qiao Jiaojiao furrowed her brows.","\"Oh~ So this uncle is a sissy,\"","Yun Xiaoxiao revealed an expression of sudden realization, looking at Xiong Wei who had a more effeminate demeanor.","\"Hello, sissy uncle.\"","Xiong Wei: !!!","\"Qiao Jiaojiao, is this how you talk about me?!\" Xiong Wei gritted his teeth in anger.","\"Oh, auntie, he called you a tomboy!\"","As soon as Xiong Wei finished speaking, Yun Xiaoxiao suddenly pointed at him and exclaimed.","Qiao Jiaojiao, who had been about to explain, clenched her fists upon hearing Yun Xiaoxiao's complaint.","She hated being called a tomboy more than anything!","\"Xiong Wei, are you asking for it?!\"","\"Do I look like I'm scared of you?! You're a tomboy, and you can't take what people say?!\"","Xiong Wei, already furious, didn't back down and retorted directly.","\"If you've got the guts, let's go outside and settle this!\" Qiao Jiaojiao rolled up her sleeves.","\"Let's go then!\"","Both of them were fuming, ready to head outside.","\"Have you two had enough?!\" Chang Li's face darkened.","He glared coldly at Yun Xiaoxiao, \"Who exactly are you? Why are you stirring up trouble between them?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao 'scaredly' shrank her neck and took a few steps back, looking cautious.","\"I'm not stirring anything up. I just heard what they said themselves.\"","\"But they didn't speak just now.\" Chang Li narrowed his eyes.","Yun Xiaoxiao tilted her head in confusion, \"They didn't say it with their mouths, but they thought it in their hearts.\"","Hearing this, Chang Li's eyebrows twitched slightly.","\"Thought it in their hearts? How do you know what others are thinking?\"","\"Right, uncle, didn't you just think, 'This little girl is talking nonsense'?\" Yun Xiaoxiao innocently widened her big eyes.","Chang Li's heart skipped a beat.","He had indeed thought that!","\"And now you're thinking, 'How does this little girl know what I'm thinking?'\"","Yun Xiaoxiao continued.","\"And you're also thinking, 'This is incredible, this little girl can actually read minds!'\"","After being repeatedly guessed right about his thoughts, Chang Li was completely convinced that Yun Xiaoxiao could read minds.","He beckoned her over.","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled and walked over.","\"Uncle, what do you need me for?\"","\"Stay by my side from now on, and I promise you good food and pretty clothes.\"","\"Really? That's great!\"","Yun Xiaoxiao happily revealed two little dimples.","\"Hmm~ Sissy uncle, why are you thinking that uncle is so gullible, believing a little kid's nonsense?\"","Suddenly, Yun Xiaoxiao looked curiously at Xiong Wei.","Xiong Wei was stunned, his heart trembling as he looked up and met Chang Li's displeased gaze.","He panicked, \"No, I didn't say that, she's making it up!\"","\"I'm not making it up. You just thought that one day you'd kill uncle and take over the farm.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao was ruthless in her teasing.","Of course, this was a lie, she was just making it up.","But Chang Li believed it without a doubt.","After all, every thought he had was accurately read by Yun Xiaoxiao.","Moreover, how could such a small child possibly lie?","There was no reason for her to lie.","So, Chang Li immediately grabbed Xiong Wei by the neck.","\"You want to usurp my position!\"","His eyes were cold and ruthless as he tightened his grip.","\"Cough, cough, cough...\"","Xiong Wei, with his neck caught, was struggling to breathe, his face turning red.","\"I... cough... I didn't...\"","Xiong Wei hurriedly tried to explain.","But Chang Li no longer believed him.","Anyone who threatened him deserved to die!","Chang Li's eyes were filled with murderous intent.","Seeing this, Xiong Wei's heart went cold.","He had risked his life for Chang Li, never complaining.","Chang Li ordered who to kill, and he did it.","For him, he had bathed his hands in blood.","But now, Chang Li believed a random brat over him.","Xiong Wei felt like his loyalty had been thrown to the dogs!","Who wanted to die?","Only a fool would want to die!","To save his own life, Xiong Wei had no choice but to fight back!","\"Hmph, still denying your disloyalty.\"","Seeing Xiong Wei strike out, Chang Li sneered coldly.","His killing intent grew even stronger.","The two exchanged blows, one trying to kill the other, the other desperately trying to protect himself.","But the boss was still the boss.","Within ten minutes, Xiong Wei lay lifeless on the ground.","\"Drag him out and feed the dogs!\"","Chang Li called over one of his men, expressionless.","The man quickly dragged Xiong Wei's body away.","\"Go and gather all the security team members.\"","Chang Li's cold gaze fell on Qiao Jiaojiao.","Qiao Jiaojiao was stunned, as if waking from a dream.","Her heart raced as she quickly nodded in agreement.","\"Yes!\"","Chang Li watched Qiao Jiaojiao's retreating back, his expression unreadable.","He would never allow anyone to play tricks under his nose.","If he found out, they all deserved to die!","Realizing Chang Li's intentions, Yun Xiaoxiao smiled faintly.","Perfect, just as she had planned.","Soon, Qiao Jiaojiao returned with the security team members.","They lined up and entered the living room one by one.","None of them knew what was going on.","But they had just heard that Xiong Wei was dead, so everyone was uneasy, not daring to meet Chang Li's gaze.","Before the men arrived, Chang Li had already spoken to Yun Xiaoxiao.","He said that when the men came, he would ask questions, and Yun Xiaoxiao only needed to respond accordingly after each answer.","If the answer matched what the person was thinking, she would nod.","If it didn't, Yun Xiaoxiao would just say what the person was actually thinking.","Yun Xiaoxiao confidently assured him that she would perform well.","As a reward, Chang Li had some dried fruit and water brought over for Yun Xiaoxiao to enjoy.","Yun Xiaoxiao didn't hold back.","She climbed onto the sofa, sat comfortably, and happily munched on the dried fruit.","No one could enjoy themselves more than she did.","Soon, the first person entered.","Chang Li asked directly, \"Do you have any complaints about me?\"","The man was so scared he hurriedly shook his head.","Chang Li looked at Yun Xiaoxiao, who nodded at him.","Chang Li then asked, \"Do you want to be the boss of this farm?\"","The man was even more terrified, almost kneeling.","\"No, no, I don't have that kind of qualification, not even with a thousand guts.\"","Chang Li looked at Yun Xiaoxiao again.","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded at him once more.","The first person, of course, she had to play along.","Otherwise, it would raise suspicion.","Fishing required a balance of tension and release to hook the fish, right?","The first person left, still shaken.","Then, the second person entered."]},{"number":243,"title":"Chapter 243: Tricked","paragraphs":["Chang Li's problem was the same, but this time, Yun Xiaoxiao did not nod in agreement.","Whenever the other person answered, she would deny their response.","The result was clear: the person was dragged out by Chang Li's men.","\"I'm being wronged! I didn't think that at all; the kid is lying!\" the man shouted as he was being dragged away.","But Chang Li paid no attention to him.","At this moment, all he wanted was to root out anyone disloyal to him; he had no time to listen to their cries of innocence.","As the saying goes, a liar would never admit to lying.","Denial is just a cover-up, making things worse with each word.","Chang Li had risen to power by overthrowing Ci Wan's father, using dirty tactics.","He knew best how some people could be two-faced, acting one way in public and another in private.","He feared that he might be brought down in the same way, so his paranoia was extreme.","Yun Xiaoxiao's provocation had unleashed his suspicions like a flood breaking through a dam; there was no stopping it.","Having complete faith in Yun Xiaoxiao's ability to read minds, he trusted everything she said without question.","Anything his subordinates said, he believed was just a desperate attempt to defend themselves.","As the saying goes, \"Better to kill a thousand innocents than let one guilty person escape.\"","Just one rotten apple could ruin his hard-earned power.","He would never allow such a person to exist!","And so, Yun Xiaoxiao let some people go, pointed out others, and left some in ambiguous situations.","In less than an hour, two-thirds of the security team had been targeted.","Some were killed outright.","Others were dragged out and beaten to within an inch of their lives.","Those who escaped unscathed deeply felt Chang Li's cruelty.","Everyone was on edge, the atmosphere oppressively tense.","After such a chaotic episode, Chang Li was exhausted.","He waved his hand, instructing Qiao Jiaojiao to arrange a place for Yun Xiaoxiao to stay, then went to rest himself.","Yun Xiaoxiao strolled out of Chang Li's residence with a leisurely gait, her mood quite pleasant.","Not bad, in less than an hour, she had decimated more than half of Chang Li's forces.","Without lifting a finger, all it took was a bit of clever talk.","But...","This wasn't enough.","Her eyes darted around, plotting her next move.","As she walked, she suddenly sighed.","\"Huh, that's strange. I clearly said some people were good, but why did Uncle say he would kill them later?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao muttered to herself.","But her voice was neither too soft nor too loud, just enough for Qiao Jiaojiao, walking ahead of her, to hear.","At the sound, Qiao Jiaojiao's steps faltered.","She turned sharply, \"Did you really say that?!\"","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded obediently, \"Yes, that's what Uncle was thinking just now.\"","Seeing the innocent and naive expression on Yun Xiaoxiao's face, Qiao Jiaojiao felt as if an elephant had stomped on her heart, her breath suddenly uneven.","If what this child said was true, then they were... doomed!","Who was Chang Li?","He was a master manipulator.","If he trusted this child so completely, it meant she truly could read minds.","Which meant...","Chang Li really intended to wipe them all out?!","The thought sent Qiao Jiaojiao's emotions into turmoil.","She felt as if she could be killed at any moment, just like Xiong Wei.","But she still had a lingering doubt.","\"Little one, why did you suddenly say I promised to take care of you? I've never met you before.\"","\"Oh, that...\"","Yun Xiaoxiao looked down in a wronged manner.","She whispered, \"I was just brought in and got beaten up. I was so scared, and then I saw you. You looked the kindest, so I...\"","Flattered by the compliment, Qiao Jiaojiao was quite pleased.","Taking into account Yun Xiaoxiao's wronged expression and her age, Qiao Jiaojiao didn't doubt her words for a second.","Instead, she began to worry about herself.","What if Chang Li really decided to make a move on her? What could she do?","Yun Xiaoxiao, of course, knew exactly what Qiao Jiaojiao was thinking.","She subtly tugged at the corner of her mouth, then gently pulled on Qiao Jiaojiao's sleeve.","\"Auntie, today I found out that many people in the base really respect you. They said the base couldn't function without you.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao even listed several names, acting as if she had heard it all firsthand.","With her fidelity detection system and excellent memory, she had already memorized the names of those who harbored disloyalty toward Chang Li.","That's why many of the people Chang Li had killed were actually loyal to him.","Those disloyal ones were the ones Yun Xiaoxiao had saved.","All for this moment, this act of sowing discord.","After all, if she claimed everyone was disloyal to Chang Li, it wouldn't be believable.","It was better to mix truth with lies, making it harder for him to discern.","The speaker had intentions, and the listener took it to heart.","Qiao Jiaojiao's thoughts began to race.","After leading Yun Xiaoxiao to her quarters, she quickly left.","Watching Qiao Jiaojiao's retreating figure, Yun Xiaoxiao's lips curled into a smile.","The real show was about to begin.","As the sky darkened, a group of people quietly made their way to the main gate.","\"Jiaojiao, is it true? Is Brother Li really going to wipe us all out?\"","\"What would I gain by lying to you?\" Qiao Jiaojiao frowned unhappily.","\"Let's go. Brother Li is too terrifying now. So many brothers have already died; just thinking about it makes me shiver.\"","\"Exactly, I don't want to work my butt off just to be suspected and killed like a worn-out donkey!\"","As they spoke, they began loading supplies into the vehicles.","But just as they were about to get into the cars and leave, Chang Li arrived with his men.","He glanced at the scene and roared in anger.","\"What do you think you're doing?!\"","The shout stunned Qiao Jiaojiao and the others.","They hadn't expected Chang Li to show up.","Panicked, they forgot to explain themselves.","Chang Li, already furious, saw their expressions and immediately decided to kill.","The little girl was right; these people really wanted to betray him and flee!","And they were taking his supplies with them!","Absolutely unforgivable!","The more he thought about it, the angrier he became. He aimed at Qiao Jiaojiao and struck.","His men also joined the fray, clashing with those who had planned to leave with Qiao Jiaojiao.","In an instant, screams and curses filled the air.","After a fierce battle, Qiao Jiaojiao and her group were completely wiped out by Chang Li's men.","Some of Chang Li's men also died in the fight.","In less than three hours, the number of Chang Li's remaining henchmen had dwindled from several hundred to less than thirty.","Everyone was exhausted, some seriously injured.","They were a shattered force, barely holding together.","Watching the spectacle from a distance, Yun Xiaoxiao crossed her arms and raised an eyebrow with a satisfied smile.","She pulled out a signal gun and aimed it at the sky.","\"Whoosh!\"","A bright light shot into the air, accompanied by a sharp sound.","As the light ascended, Nie Yizhou rubbed his hands together eagerly.","\"Alright, boys, it's our turn to step in.\"","With that, he grabbed Ling Jing, Ci Wan, and others nearby, and they vanished from the spot."]},{"number":244,"title":"Chapter 244: Auntie Has No Interest in Fighting You","paragraphs":["Inside the farm.","Chang Li and the others stared at the suddenly airborne flare gun, completely baffled, unsure of what had just happened.","Until Yun Xiaoxiao emerged from the shadows.","Observing the completely transformed aura of Yun Xiaoxiao, Chang Li's brows furrowed tighter and tighter.","What was going on?","Why did this kid give him such a different feeling now?","Moreover, why was the signal's launch point so consistent with the direction she had just emerged from?","As he was pondering this, Yun Xiaoxiao gave a slight smile towards the position behind them, as if she had seen something.","Puzzled, he turned his head, only to have his pupils suddenly widen.","Ci Wan?!","How could she be here!","\"Boom!\"","Suddenly, a gust of wind swept in.","A vine lashed out at him with incredible force.","Feeling the danger, he hastily dodged.","Yet, his arm was still pierced.","Clutching his arm, he looked up darkly, meeting a pair of radiant eyes.","His breath caught, and his gaze on Yun Xiaoxiao was almost feral.","\"You're working with Ci Wan?!\"","His voice, when he asked this, was squeezed out through clenched teeth.","\"You just figured that out?\" Yun Xiaoxiao shrugged, a bit helplessly said, \"Seems a bit late, doesn't it?\"","\"So everything you did before was just to sow discord between me and my subordinates?! All that talk about them betraying me was just a lie?!\"","\"What do you think?\" Yun Xiaoxiao retorted.","Seeing Chang Li's eyes blazing with fury, she smiled again.","\"Don't get mad, don't get mad. How can Ci Wan and the others get their revenge if you're already dead?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao's words only made Chang Li even more furious.","He conjured a whirlwind with his bare hands and launched it fiercely towards Yun Xiaoxiao.","Yun Xiaoxiao, however, raised an eyebrow and suddenly vanished from her spot.","When she reappeared, she was already behind him.","She kicked him with a swift motion.","\"Go over there, grandma has no interest in fighting you.\"","Chang Li hadn't expected Yun Xiaoxiao to suddenly appear behind him, so he had no time to defend himself.","Plus, Yun Xiaoxiao possessed a strength-based ability.","So this kick, swift and fierce, sent him staggering several steps.","If not for his quick reflexes, he might have fallen flat on the ground.","As soon as he steadied himself, he met the icy gazes of Ci Wan and Sun Xiaoming and the others.","\"Ci Wan sister, this scumbag is all yours. You can kill him with peace of mind, the others are ours.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao waved leisurely towards Ci Wan and the others.","As if the death of Chang Li and his men was a foregone conclusion.","\"Alright.\"","Ci Wan replied, her cold gaze sweeping over Chang Li.","She and Sun Xiaoming and a few others surrounded Chang Li.","The battle was about to erupt.","Chang Li's few subordinates wanted to go help, but a wall of earth suddenly appeared in front of them.","\"Hey, don't be in a rush. Your opponents? It's us.\"","A carefree voice sounded from the top of the earthen wall.","Looking up, they saw Yun Xiaoxiao standing atop the wall, hands crossed, leisurely looking down at them.","Before they could even react in surprise, screams began echoing around them.","Turning to look, their pupils widened in shock.","Their comrades were being burned by fire, crushed by giant earth balls, pierced through the chest by metallic weapons, struck by lightning, choked to death by black fog...","Different deaths, but all extremely gruesome.","It was as if rabbits had encountered hungry wolves, with no chance to resist, they were instantly wiped out.","Their hearts raced.","One of them looked at Yun Xiaoxiao and shouted in anger, \"Who are you? We have no grudge with you, why are you killing us?\"","\"Do I need a reason to kill?\" Yun Xiaoxiao smiled, but the smile was icy.","In the next moment, numerous ice spikes shot out rapidly, like a sky full of stars, directly towards the few.","The few panicked and tried to escape, but were instantly frozen.","\"Boom, boom, boom, boom!\"","Soon, they exploded.","Ice and flesh scattered across the ground.","Yun Xiaoxiao's eyes were deep.","From the moment you chose to aid the tyrant, your deaths were not innocent.","Having dealt with Chang Li's subordinates, Yun Xiaoxiao and Lu Chen and their companions did not choose to help Ci Wan, but stood quietly to the side and watched.","Chang Li was the heart demon of Ci Wan and the others. Only by letting them personally deal with it could they truly eliminate this tormenting heart demon.","At this moment, outside help would be inappropriate.","Chang Li had already expended some energy earlier and was injured on his arm by Yun Xiaoxiao.","Although he was stronger than Ci Wan and the others, it was only a matter of time before they defeated him.","Indeed, not long after, Chang Li was severely injured and knocked to the ground.","Ci Wan killed him decisively, not giving him any chance to catch his breath.","After Chang Li breathed his last, the gloom in Ci Wan's eyes dissipated significantly.","There was a sense of relief after avenging a great wrong.","After exchanging glances, they quickly walked towards the main gate.","Outside the gate, they together knocked down the wooden stakes.","Ci Wan walked to the side of one of the corpses and knelt down on both knees.","In the darkness, she silently shed tears.","No one went to comfort her, because everyone knew she needed time to process.","As everyone waited, a dense crowd emerged from the farm.","By the moonlight, one could still vaguely see the general appearance of the crowd.","Worn, revealing clothes, emaciated bodies.","Many hugged their arms and shivered.","They approached Yun Xiaoxiao and the others and bowed together.","Many couldn't hold back their tears.","\"Thank you, thank you for killing Chang Li and his gang, saving us from the fire and water.\"","\"Sob... we can finally live like humans.\"","Sun Xiaoming frowned, \"How did you all end up like this?\"","Many of them were familiar to him.","These were people that Ci Wan's family had helped.","\"Ah, ever since that scoundrel Chang Li rose to power, he didn't treat us as humans.\"","An middle-aged woman sighed, her tone heavy.","\"He forced us to work day and night, and if we took even a little break, we would be beaten.","Many didn't survive their brutal hands, dying from the beatings.","Of course, there were also those who froze to death, starved to death, or died from exhaustion.","Chang Li and his gang were simply inhuman!","They even forcibly took many young girls...\"","As the woman spoke, she couldn't continue and sobbed softly.","Although she didn't say much, from the snippets, everyone understood what had happened.","Apart from sighing, there was nothing more they could do.","The world was just so cruel.","However, now that the wicked Chang Li and his gang were dead, it also avenged those innocents who had suffered and died.","\"You... are you leaving?\"","One person cautiously looked at Sun Xiaoming and Wei Qian and several others."]},{"number":245,"title":"Chapter 245: Little Devil, You're Nosebleeding","paragraphs":["“Um... we absolutely don't want to impose on you, but...”","Uncle A rubbed his hands together, hesitating for a moment.","Finally, he spoke frankly.","“The farm can't go without a leader for a day. Since Chang Li and the others are dead, could Miss Ci Wan stay and take charge?","Most of us are just ordinary people. Without someone capable in charge, not only would we be unable to defend against zombies, but if another Chang Li II or III shows up, we're afraid we'll fall back into a new cycle of torment.”","The hellish life of being slaves, they truly didn't want to experience again.","Therefore, they could only hope that the strong group led by Ci Wan, whom they believed to be very capable, would take them in.","Plus, Ci Wan and her family had been very kind before, taking them in.","So they thought that Ci Wan would lead them to a new life.","This wasn't about right or wrong; it was just their survival instinct telling them they should do this.","Sun Xiaoming and Wei Qian exchanged glances, feeling a bit awkward.","They looked at Ci Wan, waiting for her decision.","Ci Wan didn't hesitate at all and directly shook her head.","“I'm sorry, but I have no obligation to take responsibility for your lives, nor do I have the ability to do so.”","As the saying goes, once bitten by a snake, one is scared of ropes for ten years.","Being kind once is enough.","Anything more than that is out of the question.","She also truly doesn't have the ability to support such a large group of people.","Most importantly, she has already sworn to follow Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","This promise, though not spoken aloud, is etched in her heart!","As soon as Ci Wan's words came out, those people all lowered their heads in disappointment.","But they didn't try to guilt-trip her with moral arguments.","Seeing this, Ci Wan's eyes flickered for a moment.","But in the end, she suppressed her thoughts and didn't approach Yun Xiaoxiao.","What she didn't want to do, she naturally had no reason to impose on others.","Although Xiaoxiao's base was large and capable enough, she understood the principle of \"do not impose on others what you do not desire.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao, who had already seen through Ci Wan's thoughts, slightly raised her eyebrows.","She was a clear-minded person.","She slowly looked at the group of people shivering in the cool breeze.","Perhaps Chang Li's gang had used up all the \"bad guy\" spots, because the remaining people who had been enslaved were all quite good-natured.","To be precise, they were just the most ordinary of ordinary people.","Others might think that such people were a waste of resources in a base.","But she didn't think so.","She had mentioned before that developing production was the foundation of survival.","Her base had many positions that needed people, especially hardworking ordinary folks.","“Would you be willing to start a new life in a different place?”","Yun Xiaoxiao suddenly spoke up, and everyone looked at her.","But they didn't understand what she meant.","However, Ci Wan and the others understood.","They were quite surprised that Yun Xiaoxiao was willing to take in these people.","This was, of course, something they were happy to see.","Sun Xiaoming immediately introduced Yun Xiaoxiao's identity and praised the goodness of Yun City.","Everyone's gaze toward Yun Xiaoxiao instantly changed.","Earlier, they had thought that Yun Xiaoxiao and the others were under Ci Wan's command.","But unexpectedly, Ci Wan was actually under Yun Xiaoxiao's command!","What was there to hesitate about? Everyone immediately nodded vigorously.","They were all filled with gratitude toward Yun Xiaoxiao.","There were still many crops in the farm that were about to be harvested.","Ci Wan and the others volunteered to stay behind, saying they would wait until the harvest was done before bringing the supplies and people back to Yun City.","Meanwhile, Yun Xiaoxiao and her group still had to head to the western base, so they left early the next morning.","Just before leaving, she took out many thick clothes from her space and handed them out one by one to the people on the farm.","Yes, she handed them out personally, face to face.","The idea of doing good deeds anonymously is just a myth.","Who remembers your kindness if you don't leave your name?","She didn't have the patience to be a living Lei Feng.","She had saved them, helped them, and she wanted them to remember it.","Not that she expected them to repay her in any way, but at least they could work and live steadily in the base, or increase their intimacy with her to earn some points, and maybe even reward her with some more abilities.","She wasn't helping people for free.","After handing out the clothes, she could clearly sense that many people's intimacy with her had reached over 90%.","Especially the people from the thatched hut she had saved earlier, each of them had 100% intimacy with her!","So, as expected, Little Di's voice rang out.","Ding! Congratulations, host!","Reward: Random Wind Element Ability!","Reward: Random Ability - Sense of Smell Ability!","As soon as Little Di's voice fell, a stench of manure suddenly rushed into Yun Xiaoxiao's nose.","Yun Xiaoxiao: !!!","Little Di, what kind of ability did you just reward me with?","It stinks!","Host, don't get excited, just get used to it.","Yun Xiaoxiao almost rolled her eyes to the sky.","What kind of bullshit is \"adapt and it'll be fine\"?","If you have the guts, try it yourself!","【Host, I can't smell it~】","Yun Xiaoxiao: !!!","She swore that if Little Di were in front of her, she would give him a big slap.","This kid is too annoying!","To avoid being overwhelmed by the stench, Yun Xiaoxiao stuffed two paper balls into her nostrils.","“Little brat, did you get a nosebleed?”","Nie Yizhou asked curiously.","Yun Xiaoxiao glared at him, her eyes full of murderous intent.","Nie Yizhou shivered and quickly hid behind Xiao Feng.","He poked out his head and pouted, saying, “I didn't do anything to you, okay?”","Yun Xiaoxiao rolled her eyes, but then suddenly remembered that Nie Yizhou also had the olfactory ability, and he seemed to have sealed it off himself.","She beckoned to Nie Yizhou with her little finger.","“What? Don't think you can trick me over, I won't believe you!”","“Who's tricking you? I really need you.”","“I'm not believing you.” Nie Yizhou shook his head vigilantly.","“Are you coming over or not!”","Yun Xiaoxiao put her hands on her hips, threatening fiercely.","\"Ouch~\"","As soon as Yun Xiaoxiao's voice fell, Nie Yizhou was thrown over by Xiao Feng.","Nie Yizhou was so angry that he jumped, “Xiao Feng, you're too unrighteous!”","Xiao Feng snorted and didn't even look at him.","Nie Yizhou pouted, then smiled at Yun Xiaoxiao.","“Little brat, no fighting, okay?”","Yun Xiaoxiao glared at him, “Who's going to fight you? I just want to ask how you sealed off your olfactory ability.”","“Oh, that!”","Nie Yizhou breathed a sigh of relief.","He beckoned to Yun Xiaoxiao.","“Come here, little sister, let me tell you.”","......","With this matter settled, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others returned to Yun City.","But just as they were about to reach Yun City, they saw three helicopters in the sky.","Everyone noticed them.","“Have we sent any helicopters on missions recently?” Ling Jing raised his eyebrows.","Mu Yang shook his head, “No.”","“Those aren't our base's helicopters.”","Lu Chen gazed at the sky, his expression darkening."]},{"number":246,"title":"Chapter 246: Someone Has Arrived from the Northern Base","paragraphs":["On the other side, three helicopters slowly descended from the sky above Yun City Airport.","\"This Yun City base looks quite large.\"","Inside one of the helicopters, the pilot was somewhat astonished as he gazed at the city surrounded by a hundred-meter-high wall.","Bai Ruo glanced indifferently, her eyes filled with disdain.","It's big, but who knows if it's just a facade.","After a while, the helicopters landed steadily.","Bai Ruo stepped out of the helicopter and walked over to Bai Hongting's side.","Just as she was about to say something, her eyes suddenly caught sight of a helicopter quietly parked nearby.","Strange, why does this helicopter look familiar?","Where have I seen it before?","She furrowed her brows slightly, trying to recall in her mind.","Suddenly, her eyes lit up.","\"That's it!\"","\"What's wrong?\"","Hearing this, Bai Hongting looked over.","Bai Ruo frowned, \"Dad, do you remember the time I went to the research institute to pick up research equipment but someone got there first?\"","Bai Hongting nodded.","\"Why bring that up suddenly?\" he asked.","Bai Ruo pointed to the helicopter, \"At that time, as we were leaving, we saw someone flying a helicopter away from the direction of the research institute.\"","\"You think that helicopter is this one?\"","\"Yes, exactly!\"","\"Helicopters all look pretty similar; maybe you got it wrong?\"","\"Impossible!\" Bai Ruo said resolutely.","\"I looked very carefully at the time. The serial number on that helicopter is exactly the same as this one. I couldn't have been mistaken!\"","Hearing this, Bai Hongting also looked over.","He knew that since the apocalypse, Bai Ruo had successively awakened three abilities: telescopic vision, spatial storage, and Wood Element.","If she said she had seen it clearly, then it was probably true.","\"Alright, since someone else got it first, it belongs to them. We have no reason to argue over it.\"","\"But that was clearly...\"","Bai Hongting interrupted her, \"If we were to collect supplies from some place and had already brought them back to our base, and then someone came saying they also wanted those supplies and demanded we hand them over, would that be reasonable?\"","Bai Ruo shook her head.","She understood the logic, but she just felt a bit uncomfortable.","\"Let's go, there are more important matters at hand.\"","Bai Hongting started walking towards the base's main gate.","Bai Ruo frowned but could only follow.","As they were about to approach, Liu Tao and Tao Mi'er blocked their path.","Today was their turn to be on duty at the gate.","\"Hello, this is Yun City Base. May I ask what brings you here?\" Liu Tao asked politely.","\"We are here to exchange for Evolution Fluid,\" one of Bai Hongting's subordinates replied clearly.","From the fact that these people arrived by helicopter, along with their different accents and aura, Liu Tao realized that Bai Hongting and his group were not ordinary.","However, he did not cower or grovel; instead, he pointed to the temporary rest area next to them with a composed demeanor.","\"Then please wait in the rest area for now. Our base leader and the key personnel are not in the base at the moment, so we cannot proceed with the exchange.\"","Normally, if Yun Xiaoxiao was not around, exchanging Evolution Fluid would be handled by Mu Yang.","But this time, Mu Yang had also left, and since Evolution Fluid was such an important item, others did not have the authority to handle it.","So they could only wait for Yun Xiaoxiao's return before they could exchange it with these people.","\"What? You want me to stay here?\" Bai Ruo was very displeased.","\"Do you even know how to treat guests?","We are your customers!","The customer is king, don't you know that?!","Even if you can't exchange the Evolution Fluid for now, shouldn't you at least let us wait inside the base?","How can you treat guests by keeping them outside and making them stay in such a shabby place?!\"","Tao Mi'er patiently explained, \"It's like this. Our base's main gate has some special properties.","First-time visitors to our base need to meet with the base leader and be approved before they can enter.","Even if we wanted to let you in, we couldn't.","We can only wait for the base leader to return.","The rest area is not a shabby place; it has been carefully constructed.","Although it's only two stories high, it's equipped with various daily necessities.","It can meet basic living needs.\"","\"What kind of nonsense is that? You can't enter without meeting your base leader? Who are you kidding?!\"","Bai Ruo found it ridiculous.","It sounded completely fake.","Besides, they were from the Northern Base!","When had they ever suffered such treatment!","\"Alright, this is someone else's territory. We should respect their rules,\" Bai Hongting said calmly.","Bai Ruo was a bit unhappy, but she didn't want to appear too spoiled in front of Bai Hongting, so she pouted and walked to the side.","Bai Hongting then looked at Tao Mi'er and Liu Tao.","\"Then may I ask when your base leader will return?\"","\"This... we're not sure...\"","Just as Liu Tao was about to say they weren't certain, he suddenly spotted a familiar RV.","His voice became more excited.","\"They're back!\"","Hearing this, Bai Hongting and the others turned their heads, following Liu Tao's gaze.","They saw a modified, flashy RV making a turn from a distance on the highway and heading towards the base gate.","Bai Ruo looked up, her lips pressed tightly together.","She wanted to see for herself who this base leader of Yun City was, to have such a big attitude!","The vehicle gradually approached.","Then it stopped.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others got out of the car.","At the sight of Yun Xiaoxiao, both Bai Hongting and Bai Ruo's eyes showed surprise and astonishment.","Isn't that Xiaoxiao, the little girl?","Isn't that the annoying brat?","How did she end up here?","Then, they saw Liu Tao and Tao Mi'er walk towards Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","They finally stopped in front of Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"Little Base Leader, these people are here to exchange for Evolution Fluid,\" Liu Tao said.","After he finished speaking, Bai Hongting and Bai Ruo were both stunned.","They had never expected that the base leader of Yun City would be Yun Xiaoxiao!","A five-year-old child leading such a large base?","Isn't that too exaggerated!","Earlier, they had thought it might be one of the men behind her who was the base leader.","Bai Hongting was only surprised for a moment before regaining his composure.","If it were any other child, he might have questioned it.","But having interacted with Yun Xiaoxiao before, while surprised, he thought it made sense upon reflection.","Many adults probably didn't have the abilities of this little girl.","He looked at Yun Xiaoxiao and revealed a steady smile.","\"Little girl, we meet again.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao leisurely smiled back, \"Yes, we meet again.\"","She wasn't surprised by Bai Hongting's arrival.","When she first saw them in the car, she had guessed their intentions.","Wasn't it just for the Evolution Fluid?"]},{"number":247,"title":"Chapter 247: Discrimination","paragraphs":["“Did you take the equipment from the research institute?!”","At that moment, Bai Ruo suddenly fixed her gaze on Yun Xiaoxiao.","Her voice carried a tone of suspicion.","Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow, calm and composed.","“May I ask what gives you the right to question me in such a tone?”","“I...” Bai Ruo was caught off guard.","She remembered what Bai Hongting had just told her and, for a moment, didn’t know how to respond.","She just found Yun Xiaoxiao’s face irritating for some reason.","In a moment of impulsiveness, she blurted out that question.","“Little girl, today we’re here to exchange for some Evolution Fluid. Is that convenient for you?”","Bai Hongting spoke up at the right moment, diffusing the awkward atmosphere.","Seeing Bai Ruo pouting in frustration, Yun Xiaoxiao raised the corners of her lips.","“Sure, how much do you want to exchange?”","“You’re not going to make us do this right here at the door, are you?” Bai Ruo frowned.","“Do you want to come in?”","“It’s not a matter of whether we want to or not. It’s a matter of your hospitality. How can you leave guests standing at the door?”","What a rude little kid!","And a base leader, too? She should step down already!","“We’ve already explained that our base’s gate is special, and it’s not like we’re deliberately leaving you out. Besides, there’s a waiting room, isn’t there?”","Liu Tao was irritated by Bai Ruo’s bossy attitude and couldn’t help but retort.","“Ha, do you really think we’re three-year-olds? Special gate, my foot...”","“Ruo Ruo!”","Bai Hongting frowned sternly at Bai Ruo.","This was the first time he had spoken to her so harshly in front of others.","Because Bai Ruo was the orphan of a comrade who had once saved his life, their relationship was not just that of father and daughter.","He also felt a sense of guilt and gratitude toward his fallen comrade when it came to Bai Ruo.","So, unless it involved a major principle-related mistake, he rarely got truly angry with her.","Instead, he patiently taught her the principles of how to conduct herself in the world.","Bai Ruo usually listened well and was a very obedient child.","But for some reason, today she had been saying a lot of rude things.","Her sarcastic tone was making everyone uncomfortable.","After Bai Hongting’s shout, Bai Ruo froze for two seconds.","Then her eyes reddened.","Seeing this, Bai Hongting inwardly sighed.","But he didn’t go to comfort her.","If a sapling grows crooked, you need to tie it with a stake to straighten it. The same goes for people.","He didn't want his fallen comrade's only child to grow up spoiled, willful, and rude.","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at her indifferently.","“Let’s go inside to talk, lest you accuse us of lacking hospitality again.","But first, let me make it clear.","Our base’s gate is indeed special.","It doesn’t like people with poor character and will attack them automatically.","So you’d better be mentally prepared.","I can’t control that, so if anyone gets hurt, don’t blame us.”","As she said the last three sentences, she deliberately glanced in Bai Ruo's direction, her eyes filled with a meaningfully ambiguous smile.","Bai Hongting and the others didn’t take her words seriously.","They just assumed it was her way of expressing displeasure at Bai Ruo’s rude remarks.","As Yun Xiaoxiao and the others approached the gate, it opened automatically.","Yun Xiaoxiao gestured for them to enter.","Bai Hongting and the others stepped inside.","As they marveled at the scene before them, a sudden cry of pain and the sound of a body hitting the ground came from behind them.","Everyone turned around.","They saw Bai Ruo lying on the ground, face up, struggling to get up.","The group was stunned and quickly ran over.","“Ruo Ruo, what happened to you?”","Bai Hongting hurriedly helped Bai Ruo to her feet.","Bai Ruo, her face contorted in pain, managed to straighten up.","“A strange force suddenly attacked me out of nowhere.”","She abruptly pointed at Yun Xiaoxiao.","“It must be them! They set a trap for me!”","“Ruo Ruo, don’t talk nonsense.” Bai Hongting frowned.","“They were all ahead of us just now. They didn’t touch you. Don’t falsely accuse people.”","\"But I got hurt, that's a fact!\" Bai Ruo was extremely wronged.","“I told you earlier, didn’t I? People with poor character get attacked by the gate. You just didn’t believe me.”","Yun Xiaoxiao crossed her arms and said lazily.","“Why did it attack you and not anyone else? Shouldn’t you reflect on yourself?”","She had known from the start that Bai Ruo harbored animosity toward her.","So the system wouldn’t let her in.","She had also deliberately mentioned that people with poor character couldn’t enter.","Provoking people? That was her specialty.","Who wouldn’t be annoyed being called out for having poor character?","Bai Ruo clenched her fists, her face clearly displeased.","Bai Hongting’s subordinates exchanged glances.","If Yun Xiaoxiao was lying, then why hadn’t they been attacked?","But if she wasn’t lying, then that would mean...","Ahem...","They quickly averted their gazes and straightened their expressions.","Since Bai Ruo couldn’t enter, Bai Hongting decided to conduct the exchange right at the gate.","He then took out all the crystals they had prepared.","Originally, they had planned to buy just one bottle to test its effectiveness before making a large purchase.","But after seeing Yun Xiaoxiao, he changed his mind.","A child so young being so powerful—if not for the miraculous effects of the Evolution Fluid, what else could it be?","Yun Xiaoxiao was like a living advertisement, leaving no room for doubt.","So he immediately had Bai Ruo take out all the crystals they had prepared from her space.","Bai Ruo was a bit reluctant, but remembering Bai Hongting’s stern tone earlier, she swallowed whatever she wanted to say.","Yun Xiaoxiao counted them.","No wonder they were from a large base—the crystals they brought were of high quality.","There were over a thousand Class 2 crystal nuclei, more than ten Class 3 crystal nuclei, and around seven thousand Class 1 crystal nuclei.","“Since this is our first transaction, we also follow the principle of fairness.","This first bottle is on the house, so you can try it and verify its quality.","If everything’s fine, we’ll proceed with the exchange.","Once handed over, there’s no returning it.”","Yun Xiaoxiao handed a bottle of Evolution Fluid to Bai Hongting.","Bai Hongting took it without hesitation and drank it down.","He felt the changes in his body.","Yun Xiaoxiao hadn't been stingy—she had given him a high-grade Class 2 Evolution Fluid.","After a while, he praised, “It’s indeed good.”","Thus, they exchanged the crystals for the Evolution Fluid.","All settled.","Due to Bai Ruo’s behavior, Bai Hongting’s plan to rest for the night before leaving was canceled.","“Then we’ll take our leave first. Until we meet again.”","Bai Hongting smiled at Yun Xiaoxiao.","Back when he and his wife had wanted to adopt this little girl as their daughter, the idea had been scuttled due to Bai Ruo’s opposition.","For many days after, his wife would inadvertently mention the little girl, worrying about how dangerous it was for a child to be out on her own.","She had often said they shouldn’t have let her leave so easily.","If his wife knew he had met the little girl again and that she was now the leader of a base, with so many people protecting her, she would surely be relieved.","“Let’s go, head to the Western Base.”","After boarding the helicopter, he instructed one of his subordinates.","In fact, besides exchanging for Evolution Fluid, there was another reason they had come here.","The Western Base had sent them a message saying they would soon launch a major offensive against the zombies.","When he first heard about it, he was surprised.","But upon further thought, he realized the Western Base’s move was indeed forward-thinking.","So he decided to go take a look."]},{"number":248,"title":"Chapter 248: Would You Believe It You Can Use Your Phone Now","paragraphs":["In Yun City.","To prepare for the arrival of extreme cold weather, Feng Jin was leading a team to set up plastic greenhouses.","The materials needed for this task were brought back by Lei Ming and his special abilities squad.","Meanwhile, the insulation work within the base was also in full swing.","With Mu Yang and Lu Chen handling things, Yun Xiaoxiao had taken a hands-off approach.","She entered her personal space to check the points on the shopping machine.","Currently, the intimacy points converted amounted to 15,369.","The points from crystal core exchanges totaled 10,678.","Adding them up, she had 26,047 points in total.","However, the base needed 40,000 points to upgrade again.","So, she fed all the crystal cores she had obtained from the Western Base, the ones brought back by the base's guard team after their missions, and the crystal cores used by Bai Hongting to purchase evolution serums into the machine.","In no time, the points on the machine displayed 45,862.","Yun Xiaoxiao pursed her lips and immediately clicked the upgrade button.","【Ding! Congratulations, Host! The base has been upgraded to Level 2!","Benefit 1: Any zombie within a 1,000-meter radius of the base, below Level 7, will be automatically attacked and exterminated!","Benefit 2: The base is now fully networked, allowing residents to enjoy various communication and internet conveniences!】","After hearing Little Di's announcement, Yun Xiaoxiao was so thrilled she almost jumped for joy.","\"Little Di, I love you!\"","【Aww, Host, don't fall for me. I'm not human, so I can't give you happiness.】","Yun Xiaoxiao: \"...","That was just an exaggerated expression of joy, you know!\"","【Oh~】","Yun Xiaoxiao: \"...","Fine, I won't argue with you, Little Di, since you've given such amazing rewards.","Previously, the base's defensive capabilities were quite limited.","It could only automatically expel threats within the base or attack enemies at the gate.","Although it could detect approaching zombies, it couldn't directly eliminate them.","But now, any zombie below Level 7 within a 1,000-meter radius will be wiped out.","This means the areas within 1,000 meters of the base can now be utilized.","Previously, due to the fear of ordinary people encountering zombies outside the base, the farmland had been left abandoned after harvesting the crops.","Now, however, those lands could be planned and used for other purposes.","Additionally, the whole city being networked means residents can now use phones to call, computers to surf the internet, and so on.","This could significantly improve communication speed, work efficiency, and the overall happiness index of life.","Yun Xiaoxiao decided to put all the idle communication devices in her space, like phones, iPads, and computers, to good use.","The next morning, people woke up to find several new shops had opened on the main street.","\"Did I see wrong? Are those... phones in the shop?\"","One person stood at the entrance of the phone store, rubbing their eyes in disbelief.","\"You're not seeing things! I saw them too!","Not only phones, but also iPads and computers!\"","As the shops were all next to each other, more and more people gathered, forgetting their breakfast as they curiously looked on.","At that moment, Yun Xiaoxiao and Nie Yizhou arrived.","\"It's the young base leader!\"","\"The young base leader is here!\"","\"Young base leader, now that communication networks are down, what's the point of these shops...?\"","Someone wanted to ask but swallowed the rest of their words.","What they meant was, without networks or signals, these phones and devices would just be decorations.","But they didn't dare to say it out loud.","Yun Xiaoxiao naturally understood everyone's doubts.","After all, the outside world had long since lost its network.","\"The city is now networked. From now on, everyone can call and surf the internet just like before.\"","Her words left the crowd in stunned silence.","They all thought they must have misheard.","Yun Xiaoxiao exchanged a glance with Nie Yizhou, who then took out his phone from his pocket and calmly dialed a number.","Who knew how shocked he was when Yun Xiaoxiao showed them the phone last night.","Seeing so many people equally astonished now, he felt a bit better.","Soon, Yun Xiaoxiao's phone rang.","She answered it in front of everyone, turning on the speaker.","Nie Yizhou also turned on the speaker.","They had a brief conversation.","After ending the call, Yun Xiaoxiao opened a web page and played an animated cartoon.","This nearly scared everyone to death.","The network was truly restored!","First water, electricity, and gas, and now the network.","What other surprises does this base have in store for them?","\"Oh my god, this is amazing! Who else gets it? I used to be glued to my phone, saying goodnight to it for two hours before bed. It's been months since I last touched one! I missed it so much!\"","\"Oh! My oppas, gege, wait for me! I'm coming to spoil you!\"","\"Bro, want to team up for King's Glory?\"","\"Nah, I'm playing PUBG.\"","\"...","Everyone excitedly expressed their joy.","Yun Xiaoxiao understood this feeling completely.","Although it's the apocalypse, and improving one's abilities and developing production are the priorities,","people can't be too tense all the time.","Proper rest and relaxation are essential to work harder when needed.","Of course, she understood the importance of being vigilant.","Providing phones and other communication tools wasn't to let people slack off.","She planned to set up a large display screen next to these shops.","It would loop footage from the outside world,","letting the base residents know how good their life was compared to others.","They shouldn't be daydreaming all the time.","She didn't want anyone making the same low-level mistakes as Tan Lili.","If someone didn't appreciate the good life here, she wouldn't mind throwing the lazy and useless out of the base.","\"If you want to buy things from these shops, work hard and earn points through your labor.\"","After Yun Xiaoxiao spoke, everyone noticed the prices of the items inside.","Instantly, they all looked like deflated balloons.","But soon, they were as motivated as if they had been injected with chicken blood (literally \"like injected with chicken blood,\" meaning highly motivated).","\"My phone baby, wait for me! Sister will come take you home soon.\"","\"I'm going to work hard! Strive to earn more points!\"","\"Let's go, back to work!\"","Thanks to these communication tools, the atmosphere in the base completely changed.","Although everyone had been working hard before, it wasn't as lively as now.","Time flew by.","Before they knew it, it was time for Yun Xiaoxiao and her team to head to the Western Base."]},{"number":249,"title":"Chapter 249: Stunning Entrance","paragraphs":["Western Base.","\"It seems Xiao Xiao and the others haven't arrived yet.\"","Long Zhe stood on tiptoe, straining to look outside the gate.","Seeing nothing but empty roads at the end, he felt a bit disappointed.","\"They have to transport supplies, so they should be delayed for a while,\" Jiang Huai patted his shoulder and teased, \"What, missing your Xiao Xiao sister?\"","\"Uncle, I don't!\"","Jiang Huai felt a bit guilty.","When people feel guilty, they tend to raise their voices first to gain the upper hand.","Jiang Huai didn't expose him but instead chuckled, \"Then you better work hard. Your Xiao Xiao sister is already so much more capable than you.","Look at that little face; she'll definitely be a beauty when she grows up.","There will probably be no shortage of suitors, so you, my boy, are in trouble.\"","\"Uncle, what are you even talking about? I don't have those thoughts!","And how old am I, how old is she?","You, an old bachelor, should take care of yourself first.\"","\"Hey, you little brat, feeling bold, aren't you?\"","The uncle and nephew laughed and joked.","Wang Dahai and his son Wang Qingdong walked over.","\"Jiang Huai, you guys arrived early.\"","Jiang Huai stopped 'disciplining' Long Zhe and turned to look at Wang Dahai.","He smiled, \"Not that early, just got here a moment ago.\"","\"By the way, how many people did you bring this time?\"","\"A thousand.\"","\"That many! No wonder it's a big base; we only brought three hundred.","Can't be helped; our base doesn't have many psychics, and we have to leave some to guard the base.","Can't have the front line fighting while the rear burns, right?\"","Wang Dahai chuckled innocently.","\"Look, those are the people from Xiangrui Base; they're here!\"","At that moment, someone shouted from the crowd.","Everyone looked outside.","A dozen large trucks had stopped at the gate.","Tang Yanchi and Tang Jun led the way, followed by a large group of people.","\"So many people, that must be around eight or nine hundred, maybe a thousand. No wonder it's a big base!","Apart from Rongsheng Base, I guess Xiangrui Base is the only one that can bring so many people at once.\"","\"That's right, I'm so envious.\"","While everyone was discussing, Peng Shaowei led Bai Hongting and the others out.","He looked at Hao Ren beside him, \"Is everyone here?\"","Hao Ren shook his head, \"Yun City Base is still missing.\"","\"Then let's wait a bit longer.\"","Hearing this, Bai Hongting raised an eyebrow.","Would that little girl also come?","Bai Ruo, standing nearby, felt irritated. Why does she run into her everywhere!","At this moment, everyone who had arrived gathered on the vast training ground of the Western Base.","The crowd was dense, everyone wearing different clothes, enthusiastically exchanging words.","\"Rumble~\"","Suddenly, a series of helicopter engine roars came from the distant sky.","Deep and powerful, with a strong sense of shock.","Everyone looked up.","In the distant, gray-blue sky, seven helicopters were flying in formation towards the training ground.","They were majestic, like soaring eagles, swiftly cutting through the vast sky.","In no time, under everyone's gaze, the helicopters stopped above the training ground, slightly off to the side.","The ground directly below was vacant.","The propellers kept spinning, as if the air was being stirred.","The helicopters descended lower and lower, and when they were about five meters above the ground, the cabin doors opened.","Many packages were thrown out one after another, all packed in gunny sacks.","Soon, a large pile accumulated on the ground.","\"Who are those people?\"","\"I'm not too sure.\"","\"You guys are so ignorant. The supplier of our action's supplies is Yun City Base, so they must be from there.\"","\"Too extravagant, transporting supplies with so many helicopters!\"","\"Isn't your focus wrong? I think it's more surprising that they have so many supplies!\"","\"Yeah, we usually collect so little that it's exhausting, and what we get isn't even enough to eat.","But others just bring supplies like they're tycoons for the first time, it's so envious.","\"Hey, where do they get so much stuff?","This is just the first batch. I heard that all the subsequent supplies needed will be provided by them. How much would that be?\"","Everyone was shocked watching the supplies fall from the sky.","Just as they were about to get numb, some frozen pork, chicken, and duck meat started falling too!","\"Holy crap! There's meat!\"","Someone blurted out a curse.","\"I haven't smelled the scent of meat in ages!\"","\"Is it too late to join Yun City Base now?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao, seeing the shock below, was unfazed.","She was constantly taking things out from her space.","One moment she teleported to this helicopter, the next to that one.","Being short and paying attention to her position, no one below noticed that Yun Xiaoxiao was 'operating in the dark'.","This was also why she didn't have the helicopters land on the ground.","With the size of the helicopter, it couldn't hold all the supplies needed this time.","So she came up with this method.","Peng Shaowei was also stunned for a while before shaking his head with a light laugh.","Although these supplies were what he had previously ordered.","Seeing them now, he was still shocked.","The visual impact was too intense.","Bai Ruo sneered coldly in her heart.","So eager to show off!","Tang Yanchi and Tang Jun also raised their eyebrows.","Tang Yanchi, being young, couldn't control his expression.","When he realized he was too surprised, he quickly straightened his face, reverting to a serious expression.","After a while, all the supplies were finally dropped.","Immediately after, nine figures jumped down from the helicopters.","They were Yun Xiaoxiao, Lu Chen, Ling Jing, Nie Yizhou, Xiao Feng, Zheng Yuner, Lei Ming, Tao Mi'er, and Liu Tao.","As soon as they landed, the seven helicopters slowly ascended into the sky and flew away.","\"You only have nine people?\"","Wang Qingdong, Wang Dahai's son, suddenly spoke up.","Everyone finally snapped out of their shock over the supplies and looked at Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","They whispered among themselves.","\"Right, why did they only send nine people? Among all the bases, they probably brought the least, right?\"","\"Exactly, even our small base brought nearly a hundred people. What's their deal? Don't want to contribute?\"","Hearing the murmurs, Yun Xiaoxiao just glanced indifferently.","Then she looked at the man closest to them who said they didn't want to contribute and smiled leisurely.","\"This uncle, is having more people something to be proud of? Don't end up with a hundred people killing fewer zombies than our nine, that would be embarrassing...\"","With just one look, Yun Xiaoxiao already knew his strength.","\"Arrogant!\"","\"Is it arrogance, or will you find out later?","However, there's one thing you need to pay attention to, and that is not dying too early, so you can see the results.\"","\"You!\"","The man was so angry he couldn't speak."]},{"number":250,"title":"Chapter 250: Rallying Cry","paragraphs":["\"Ahem...\"","Peng Shaowei cleared his throat.","Then, in a loud voice, he declared, \"Everyone, since we are all here, our mobilization assembly officially begins now!\"","His voice was powerful and full of grandeur.","All eyes were instantly drawn to him.","The crowd turned to face the front of the training ground, where a raised platform stood.","Peng Shaowei stood alone on the platform, exuding a calm and serious aura.","\"Fellow comrades, the zombie virus has invaded, and our fellow citizens have suffered greatly!","Once vibrant lives are now mere cold, lifeless shells.","They have occupied the city center, wreaking havoc on our homes.","Turning our once beautiful world into a desolate wasteland.","Leaving those who have managed to survive facing the constant threat of death.","They are not static.","On the contrary, they are growing increasingly violent and stronger!","If we do not eliminate them quickly, our chances of survival will diminish with each passing day.","I'm sure you've all heard about the major crisis we faced at the Western Base recently.","The zombie horde approached with overwhelming force.","If it weren't for the support of the other bases, our situation would have been dire.","This serves as a warning to all of us.","If we do not take action and launch a proactive attack,","When those zombies become even stronger, we humans will have no chance to even survive on the brink of extinction!","So...","This is the purpose of gathering everyone here today.","Let us work together, and no matter how difficult it gets, do not give up!","I believe that the new world is waiting for us just around the corner!","Brothers and sisters, let's fight with everything we've got!\"","Peng Shaowei's speech was passionate and full of vigor.","His words painted vivid images of the ruined cityscape in everyone's minds.","Scenes of loved ones and companions being bitten by zombies flashed before their eyes.","Many people's eyes reddened with emotion, their hearts swelling with determination.","They felt an overwhelming urge to go out and kill some zombies to vent their anger.","As Peng Shaowei finished his last sentence, the crowd roared in unison.","\"Fight with everything we've got!\"","The sound was thunderous, like the call to battle.","At that moment, everyone's hearts seemed to unite as one.","There was only one goal: to kill the zombies!","The mobilization assembly lasted for about an hour.","In addition to the inspiring speech, Peng Shaowei also explained the detailed battle plan using a chalkboard.","He divided all the participants into groups.","This time, the people from the various bases were mostly the main combatants from their respective bases.","Of course, no base would send all of its combat strength.","After all, each base still needed people to defend it.","However, even so, the number of participants in this operation was around twelve thousand.","Peng Shaowei's plan was to start from the Western Base, splitting the forces into two groups.","One group on the left and one on the right.","They would adopt a strategy of surrounding the cities from the countryside, starting with the easier targets.","First, they would take over a village, then a town, and finally a city.","Step by step.","This way, they could kill zombies, collect supplies, and improve their abilities simultaneously.","The plan was unanimously approved by everyone.","Finally, it was time to divide the teams.","This was something Peng Shaowei had carefully considered.","He had divided the participants based on the true strength of each base's reported personnel.","A total of 62 bases were participating.","Peng Shaowei's Western Base and Tang Yanchi's Xiangrui Base were grouped together.","Another 27 bases joined them.","Yun Xiaoxiao's Yun City and Jiang Huai's Rongsheng Base were grouped together.","The remaining 31 bases were assigned to their group.","Zheng Xin'er's Yangcheng Base, Wang Dahai's Dahai Base, and the Glory Military Base, which had previously mocked Yun Xiaoxiao for having a small group, were also in this group.","After the mobilization assembly, Peng Shaowei found Yun Xiaoxiao.","He discussed the matter of supplies with her.","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled, \"Don't worry, every seven days, someone will deliver the necessary supplies.\"","\"Good.\"","Peng Shaowei felt relieved.","Initially, when they were taking over smaller areas, it was uncertain whether they would collect enough supplies.","At this point, they needed Yun Xiaoxiao to ensure the food supply.","Otherwise, they might run out of energy before they finished killing the zombies.","With Yun Xiaoxiao's assurance, Peng Shaowei felt much more at ease.","Now, they just had to wait for the official battle to begin tomorrow!","\"Oh, right, this is Bai Hongting, the base leader of the Northern Base.\"","Peng Shaowei suddenly remembered the person behind him and quickly introduced him to Yun Xiaoxiao.","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded toward Bai Hongting.","\"Uncle Bai, it's nice to see you again.\"","\"Yes, it's good to see you again.\" Bai Hongting pursed his lips.","He didn't know why, but every time he saw this young lady, he felt a sense of closeness.","Peng Shaowei was surprised, \"You two know each other?\"","Bai Hongting smiled and recounted how he met Yun Xiaoxiao.","Of course, he omitted the part about wanting to adopt her as his daughter.","He didn't want Bai Ruo to feel upset.","Actually, things were fine the way they were now.","Back then, he wanted to adopt her as his daughter because he found her endearing, and another reason was seeing her alone and wanting to provide her with a safe place to stay.","But due to certain circumstances, that wish couldn't be fulfilled.","He had always felt a bit of regret.","But now, seeing the young lady so radiant and with so many people protecting her, he felt at ease.","\"I didn't expect you two to have such a connection.\" Peng Shaowei sighed.","\"Indeed.\"","Bai Hongting chuckled, \"Brother Peng, your speech today left a deep impression on me. I believe your plan is indeed necessary.","I would like to participate in tomorrow's battle to experience it firsthand.\"","\"That would be most welcome!\"","\"Then we'll join Xiaoxiao's group.\"","\"No problem.\"","Following that, Peng Shaowei gathered the leaders of the various bases together.","They discussed some details about tomorrow's operation.","Yun Xiaoxiao wasn't fond of such gatherings, so she sent Lei Ming instead.","He was the most suitable among them to attend.","Lu Chen was naturally quiet, and being there would probably feel worse than sitting in prison for him.","Nie Yizhou talked too much, which might affect others' perception of their base.","Xiao Feng had a bad temper, and she worried he might start a fight with someone.","Zheng Yuner, Tao Mi'er, and Liu Tao were too young and lacked experience dealing with important figures, so they wouldn't be able to hold their own.","Therefore, the responsibility fell on Lei Ming.","Mu Yang was managing the base, otherwise, he would have been a good fit too.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others strolled to the training ground, waiting for dinner.","Due to the large number of people, many stoves and large pots were set up on the training ground.","Peng Shaowei's idea was that since this was the last meal before the battle, they should have a good feast.","A good omen for the fight ahead.","At the moment, the training ground was packed with people.","Groups of three and two gathered together, chatting.","Suddenly, a blood-curdling scream rang out."]},{"number":251,"title":"Chapter 251: Don't You Want to Explain","paragraphs":["The sound was too mournful.","Everyone turned their heads to look.","In a corner of the training ground, a person suddenly went berserk and started biting another person.","Everyone's heart skipped a beat.","This scene was too familiar!","It was... the scene of a zombie biting a person!","\"What? How could there be a zombie in the base?!\"","\"Right, weren't we all checked when we entered?\"","\"The one biting seems to be from Xiangrui Base!\"","The crowd buzzed with discussion.","Meanwhile, people quickly took action, dealing with both the biter and the one who was bitten and starting to mutate.","Fortunately, this happened in a crowded place, allowing everyone to control the situation in time.","If it had happened in a secluded, less populated area, by the time someone noticed, the situation might have already spiraled out of control.","Hao Ren arrived quickly with a group of people.","As soon as he reached the scene, he began arranging for inspections.","\"There are no bite or scratch marks on his body.\"","After the inspection, Hao Ren's subordinate stood up and reported.","Hearing this, everyone felt a surge of doubt.","No wounds?","Then how did he turn into a zombie?","It seemed that only the initial wave of people turning into zombies was sudden.","After that, people usually only mutated after being scratched or bitten by a zombie.","Could it be that, just like the initial zombie virus outbreak, people might suddenly turn into zombies without any warning?!","The thought of this possibility made everyone's mood extremely heavy.","Because it meant that people would once again face a catastrophic disaster.","Everyone subconsciously distanced themselves from those around them, afraid that someone might suddenly turn into a zombie and lunge at them.","This caused the originally spirited group to lose their spirit.","If this was truly the case, was there even a point in fighting the zombies?","For a moment, everyone felt as if a heavy boulder was pressing down on their hearts, making them feel heavy, stifled, and extremely depressed.","Listening to the discussions around her, some from Xiangrui Base avoided eye contact, their eyes flickering with both fear and a hint of apprehension.","Yun Xiaoxiao narrowed her eyes.","Could it be that the esper in Xiangrui Base have already started showing signs of trouble?","If that was the case, then things were quite serious.","She looked at one of the people from Xiangrui Base, someone she vaguely remembered.","He was one of the people who had accompanied the Tang brothers during the last meeting.","At the moment, his fear was the most palpable.","Yun Xiaoxiao had a plan.","She walked over to him.","When she was close enough, Yun Xiaoxiao stared directly into his eyes.","\"Why are you so scared? Are you afraid we'll discover something?\"","The man was stunned, then hurriedly waved his hands.","\"No, no.\"","\"Denying it so quickly, there must be something wrong. His transformation into a zombie wasn't an accident, was it?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao locked her gaze on his eyes, her stare exuding immense pressure.","As soon as she finished speaking, the man's eyes widened in shock, as if his secret had been suddenly exposed.","After a moment, he realized his expression had been too revealing.","He quickly tried to cover it up.","\"I... I don't know what you're talking about.\"","\"Are you saying you don't know, or you don't want to say, or... are you afraid of revealing the truth and having everyone know?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao, who could hear his thoughts, was already certain that he was deliberately hiding something.","The reason was likely what she had guessed.","The man was on the verge of breaking down.","All eyes were on him, as if he were being roasted over a fire.","His already fragile psychological defense completely collapsed.","Just as he was about to spill everything, his eyes caught sight of Tang Jun and Tang Yanchi approaching.","He immediately pressed his lips together, not daring to speak.","Last time, Young Master Jun had warned them not to reveal the incident involving Monkey and the others.","He was relieved that he hadn't blurted out the truth earlier; otherwise, he would have been punished.","That little girl was too cunning.","He had almost been tricked into revealing everything!","He quickly scurried behind the Tang brothers, still shaken.","Seeing this, Yun Xiaoxiao's brows furrowed slightly.","\"Sorry, everyone, I scared you.\"","After Tang Jun spoke, he signaled his men to carry away the two corpses.","\"That's it? Aren't you going to explain to us?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao's eyes curved, but her smile vanished.","\"Explain what?\" Tang Jun's gaze darkened.","\"Do you think hiding the truth will keep everything calm and peaceful?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao's tone suddenly became severe.","\"Don't you know that your deliberate concealment could cost more lives?\"","Initially, she hadn't wanted to get involved.","But since this matter affected her own interests, she couldn't stand by and do nothing.","She didn't want to be fighting zombies only to have her allies turn into them.","Having more psychic zombies would just be adding unnecessary trouble.","She wasn't exactly idle.","If she had the time, wouldn't it be better to just eat, drink, and relax?","She sneered coldly, staring at the corpses on the ground.","\"This kind of thing must have happened in your base more than once, hasn't it?\"","At her words, Tang Jun's expression tightened.","Seeing his reaction, Yun Xiaoxiao smiled and continued.","\"I hear that if one consumes too many zombie cores, they become easily irritable, and eventually either explode or turn into a zombie, biting people everywhere.\"","She locked her gaze on Tang Jun's eyes.","\"It seems that Tang Base Leader already knew about this.\"","\"Is that true?\"","As soon as Yun Xiaoxiao finished speaking, Hao Ren narrowed his eyes and looked at Tang Jun.","Tang Jun stared at Yun Xiaoxiao for a moment before nodding.","\"Yes, we only recently discovered this.","I'm sorry, we weren't deliberately hiding it.","I've already ordered all psychics in the base to stop consuming cores on their own.","I thought that as long as they stopped, there wouldn't be a problem, but I didn't expect this to happen.\"","Hearing this, the crowd stirred.","\"Really? Consuming cores has such severe side effects!\"","\"Oh no, I tried a few before. Am I going to turn into a zombie?\"","\"This means that everyone in Xiangrui Base is at risk. Should they be excluded from tomorrow's zombie hunt?\"","Then we'd lose a lot of combat power.","\"Even if we lose combat power, it's better than having someone suddenly bite your neck during the fight.\"","\"But... besides Xiangrui Base, some others have also eaten cores. Should they all withdraw?\"","Just as the previous worry faded, a new one emerged.","The atmosphere at the scene became extremely oppressive.","Even Peng Shaowei and the other base leaders, who were in a meeting, rushed to the scene.","\"I have a solution, but I'm not sure if it will work. If you're willing, you can try it.\"","At that moment, Yun Xiaoxiao suddenly spoke up.","Hearing this, everyone turned to look at her.","\"What solution?\""]},{"number":252,"title":"Chapter 252: Treating a Dead Horse as if it Were Alive","paragraphs":["Yun Xiaoxiao took off her small backpack and rummaged through it.","Finally, she pulled out a square, transparent plastic box.","This was what she usually used to store calcium tablets and vitamin pills.","She held up the plastic box with a serious expression.","\"This is a new serum developed by our base, adjusted with a special method, and it might help with your symptoms.\"","As she spoke, she also took out a bottle of mineral water.","This water, of course, was no ordinary water, but spiritual spring water from her space.","The real thing that might work was the spiritual spring water, not the nutrient tablets.","Because she had noticed that crystal cores washed with regular water and those washed with spiritual spring water produced slightly different evolution serums.","The taste and effects were a bit different.","Plus, spiritual spring water had the ability to cleanse and strengthen the body, removing impurities.","So, she was just guessing that the spiritual spring water might alleviate the toxins in the bodies of those who had consumed too many crystal cores.","Also, when Ling Jing was bitten by Tong Zhan, he didn't turn into a zombie immediately.","One possibility was that he had a special physique.","The other possibility might have been due to the spiritual spring water he had consumed.","Of course, these were just her guesses and hadn't been substantiated.","There was also a chance it might have no effect at all.","The reason she brought out the nutrient tablets along with the water was to create a smokescreen.","Actually, she could have claimed to have water-based abilities and said the spiritual spring water was transformed by her abilities.","But if it turned out the spiritual spring water really worked, wouldn't that mean her 'water-based abilities' were too special?","She didn't want to become a target like a 'Tantalizing Treasure.'","The best way was to blur the focus.","Make everyone think it was just like the evolution serum, something that had been developed.","Simple and hassle-free.","\"Do you have a cup and a spoon?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao looked at Peng Shaowei.","Peng Shaowei signaled to his subordinates.","Soon, a teacup and a steel spoon were brought over.","Yun Xiaoxiao took them and crushed a tablet, placing it into the teacup.","Then, she unscrewed the cap of the mineral water bottle and poured about half a bottle into the teacup.","She stirred it with the steel spoon in a showy manner.","Afterward, she lifted the teacup.","\"Who's willing to try it?","I have to make it clear, I can't guarantee it will work.\"","Hearing this, everyone's expressions became strange.","They began to murmur softly.","\"Isn't she just using people as guinea pigs?\"","\"Exactly, and something concocted by a little kid just feels like she's making some kind of dark drink.\"","\"Uh... it's scary, what if it doesn't detoxify but makes things worse?\"","\"Well... it's hard to say...\"","\"Why are you all doubting? She doesn't seem like some clueless kid, am I the only one who believes her?\"","\"Yeah, you're right.","And didn't she say it was developed by their base?","I think it's probably not fake.","Besides, do we have any other options right now?","Better to try it than do nothing.\"","\"Who are you calling a dead horse?!\"","A member of Xiangrui Base heard the person behind him say that and immediately pulled a long face.","The man was stunned and quickly apologized with a smile.","\"Brother, don't be mad, I was just making a metaphor, not really calling you a dead horse.\"","\"Hmph!\"","Although the murmur was low, Yun Xiaoxiao still heard it.","However, she didn't care.","Even if the spiritual spring water couldn't detoxify, it wouldn't harm anyone.","If they wanted to believe, fine; if not, that was fine too.","After all, it wasn't her who would die.","Just as she thought no one would volunteer, Tang Jun stepped forward, picked up the teacup, and drank it all in one go.","Everyone knew about the bet between the Tang brothers and Yun Xiaoxiao's group last time.","So they all thought that Xiangrui Base and Yun City would never interact again, viewing each other as enemies.","This time, anyone could have stepped forward, but it definitely wouldn't be someone from Xiangrui Base.","But unexpectedly, Tang Jun was the first to step up.","Everyone was baffled, truly baffled.","After drinking it, Tang Yanchi immediately ran to his brother's side.","\"Brother, why did you drink it? What if she poisoned it?\"","As he spoke, he deliberately glanced at Yun Xiaoxiao.","Yun Xiaoxiao rolled her eyes.","What a drama queen!","She coolly curled her lips, \"Yeah, I poisoned it, your brother is about to die.\"","\"You really poisoned it!\"","Tang Yanchi was furious and was about to charge at Yun Xiaoxiao.","But before he could move, Tang Jun grabbed his collar.","\"Wait.\"","Tang Jun said in a deep voice.","Tang Yanchi steadied himself and looked at his brother in confusion.","He saw his brother frowning tightly.","Tang Yanchi clenched his fists in worry, silently vowing.","If his brother really died, he definitely wouldn't let her off!","At this moment, Tang Jun was carefully feeling the changes in his body.","His previously restless heart now felt like a cool spring had suddenly been injected into it.","The spring split into many tiny tributaries, spreading through his heart.","It was cool and very soothing.","His irritability gradually calmed down.","His eyes lit up.","\"Can I have another cup?\"","He looked at Yun Xiaoxiao expectantly.","As soon as he said this, everyone immediately realized.","The stuff worked!","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled lightly, glancing at the still dazed Tang Yanchi.","\"Of course, you can have another cup, but the trial drink is over. If you want more... that will cost you.\"","Tang Jun was taken aback, \"Cost?\"","\"Otherwise, do you think I look like the kind of selfless person?\"","Tang Jun's mouth twitched slightly.","Indeed, not at all, more like a stingy merchant.","\"How much do you charge?\" he asked.","\"The worth of one bottle of mineral water, that's... 500 primary crystal cores, or 100 secondary crystal cores, or 20 tertiary crystal cores.\"","Of course, if you have a Level 4 crystal nucleus, I'll give you a discount—just one Level 4 crystal nucleus for a bottle.","How about it, pretty cheap, right?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao's lips curled slightly, revealing two small dimples.","She looked innocent and harmless.","Heh, dared to call her a stingy merchant.","If she didn't act a bit stingy and cunning, wouldn't that be a waste?","\"Is that cheap? That's clearly extortion!\"","Who knows how many bottles it would take to detoxify!","Tang Yanchi's face turned red with anger.","\"You can also not buy it, I'm not forcing you.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao shrugged, looking indifferent.","This made Tang Yanchi even angrier.","The problem was, he didn't know how to argue back.","So angry!","Angry to death!","\"Can you make it now?\"","While Tang Yanchi was fuming, Tang Jun walked up to Yun Xiaoxiao and asked seriously.","\"Brother!\" Tang Yanchi frowned, \"She's asking for the sky, we shouldn't...\"","\"What's asking for the sky? Do you think your life isn't worth those crystals she mentioned?\" Tang Jun glared.","\"Don't you think your life is worth even that much?!\""]},{"number":253,"title":"Chapter 253: War Begins","paragraphs":["Tang Yanchi was taken aback by the shout.","Looking at his brother’s piercing gaze, he awkwardly kicked a small pebble at his feet.","“I... didn’t mean it like that,” he muttered.","Tang Jun shifted his attention away from him and back to Yun Xiaoxiao.","“Can you do it now? We can provide the water you’ll need for the process.”","He gestured for one of his subordinates to come over.","“He’s a water-based ability user. If needed, he can assist.”","Though his tone still carried a hint of arrogance, it was far more polite than before.","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled and nodded, “Of course. How much do you need?”","“Can you make enough for a thousand doses first?”","“Sure.”","With that, Yun Xiaoxiao extended her fair, delicate hand.","“Payment first, please.”","Tang Jun: “...Alright.”","In an instant, Tang Jun conjured a large pile of energy crystals.","Clearly, he was a spatial ability user himself.","He paid upfront for the crystals needed by everyone in their base.","Yun Xiaoxiao gave him a look of respect.","Though he was a bit arrogant, he certainly had a sense of responsibility.","After Tang Jun placed his order, hundreds more came to Yun Xiaoxiao to place theirs.","With the matter resolved, Peng Shaowei generously provided a room and had several barrels brought in.","Yun Xiaoxiao insisted on working alone.","After all, she had mentioned earlier that the water ratio was crucial.","Everyone understood—it was a secret formula, and she naturally wouldn’t want others to know it.","Once Tang Jun’s subordinate filled the barrels with water, Yun Xiaoxiao sent him out.","The door closed with a loud *bang*.","Nie Yizhou patted Ling Jing’s shoulder, “Hey, since when did our base have those detox pills?”","Ling Jing lazily raised his narrow eyes, “You actually believed that?”","“What do you mean?” Nie Yizhou was puzzled.","When Ling Jing didn’t respond, he turned to Xiao Feng.","“Xiao Feng, do you know what he’s talking about?”","Xiao Feng rolled his eyes, “It means you’re an idiot.”","“Hey, no need for personal attacks!”","Nie Yizhou hooked his arm around Xiao Feng’s neck and yanked him down.","But Xiao Feng retaliated with a punch to his stomach.","“Cough, cough... Xiao Feng, are you trying to kill your own brother?!”","......","An hour later, the preparation was complete.","Peng Shaowei had arranged for plenty of bowls and cups to be ready beforehand.","When Yun Xiaoxiao emerged, she had Hao Ren and the others assist her in filling the mineral water bottles and then pouring the contents into the bowls and cups.","These were then distributed to those in need.","The crowd had already lined up in an orderly fashion, so the scene remained calm.","Everyone eagerly drank the solution as soon as they received it.","After what had just happened, no one wanted to take any chances.","Who would want to die?","After drinking it, they felt the same as Tang Jun—refreshed and invigorated.","The burning sensation in their chests was gone, and they no longer felt suffocated.","“How many days do we need to drink this to completely clear the remaining toxins?” someone asked.","Yun Xiaoxiao shook her head, “I’m not sure. You know your bodies best. If you feel better, then it’s probably worked.”","Everyone nodded in agreement—that made sense.","They then asked Yun Xiaoxiao to prepare another batch for them the next morning.","Yun Xiaoxiao had no reason to refuse.","After all, who would turn down more energy crystals?","At the back of the crowd, Tang Yanchi watched Yun Xiaoxiao being surrounded by people. He pouted, seemingly sulking, and kicked a pebble at his feet.","Suddenly, a large bowl was thrust in front of him.","“Why are you hiding back here all alone?”","Tang Jun’s voice came from above him.","“What happened earlier is in the past. We Tangs aren’t the type to be sore losers.","That girl just helped us in a big way, saving so many of us.","If you’re still hung up on what happened before, that’s not very manly of you.","Didn’t you say you wanted to be a real man?”","“Of course I’m a real man!”","Tang Yanchi lifted his head defiantly.","“Then why are you hiding back here?”","“I...”","“Alright, drink this quickly. Otherwise, you’ll turn into a little zombie before you become a real man.”","Tang Jun’s voice carried a hint of affection.","Tang Yanchi stared at the bowl of water, his brow furrowed.","“Brother, does this really work?”","“Would I lie to you? Stop dawdling and drink it.”","After a moment of hesitation, Tang Yanchi finally gulped it down.","Instantly, a cool, refreshing sensation spread through him.","His eyes widened.","It really worked!","From that day on, Tang Yanchi no longer glared at Yun Xiaoxiao.","Instead, he began avoiding her whenever he saw her.","It was as if he was deliberately keeping his distance.","Yun Xiaoxiao noticed but didn’t think much of it.","Was it really that strange for him to avoid her?","---","The next day.","Everyone was up early.","After breakfast, Tang Jun and the others drank Yun Xiaoxiao’s special ‘antidote’ and gathered at the main gate of the Western Base.","On the left was one group, led by Peng Shaowei. On the right was another, led by Jiang Huai.","Bai Hongting and a few others were with Yun Xiaoxiao’s group.","The crowd was massive, resembling an ancient army preparing for battle.","Peng Shaowei had the food Yun Xiaoxiao’s group brought divided in half and distributed to both sides.","Starting today, the two groups would operate independently.","They would set out from the Western Base, one group heading left and the other right, moving in a radial pattern.","This would mark the beginning of the first major zombie extermination campaign!","No one knew how long this mission would take.","The mood was a mix of excitement and anxiety.","Perhaps, the next time they met, some of them would no longer be alive...","After another rousing speech from Peng Shaowei, the two groups began moving out in their respective directions.","As for the ‘antidote’ Tang Jun’s group needed, it was no longer a major concern.","After drinking it that morning, everyone already felt much better.","Still, to be safe, they asked Yun Xiaoxiao to prepare a few extra doses to take with them in the coming days.","However, they had already used up all their energy crystals and had to issue IOUs to Yun Xiaoxiao, promising to repay her later.","Yun Xiaoxiao, for once, was surprisingly lenient and didn’t press the matter.","After half a day of travel, Yun Xiaoxiao’s group passed through several villages.","The zombies they encountered were scattered and not particularly strong, so dealing with them wasn’t difficult.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s group didn’t even get a chance to act.","“Attention, everyone. Up ahead is a county called Danhong County.","The county is built along a large river, halfway up a mountainside.","It’s a minority county and a major tourist destination.","There’s likely to be a large number of zombies there.","The farmhouses are spread out, with some even built deep in the forests. The terrain is treacherous.","Everyone, stay alert!”","Jiang Huai’s voice echoed through every vehicle via the walkie-talkies.","For better communication, Peng Shaowei had prepared plenty of walkie-talkies, ensuring nearly every vehicle had one."]},{"number":254,"title":"Chapter 254: The Dazzling Few","paragraphs":["Jiang Huai's car led the way.","He glanced at the map while directing his team to move forward.","Every place they passed, he marked with a pen.","The long convoy drove steadily along the road.","Above them, three helicopters hovered in the air.","Two belonged to Bai Hongting and his team.","The third was specifically for scouting zombies.","Whenever zombies were spotted nearby, the people in the helicopter would notify everyone via walkie-talkie.","The convoy would then stop to eliminate the zombies.","After driving for about half an hour,","a massive bridge came into view.","The bridge was about 12 meters wide and nearly a kilometer long.","Thick stone pillars plunged into the river beneath, and multiple cables connected the north and south sides of the bridge.","Mountains flanked both sides, and this bridge was the only passage connecting the roads on either side.","On the other side of the bridge, clusters of houses built along the water were clearly visible.","The houses were distinctive, with uniformly colored exteriors.","At that moment, the nearly kilometer-long bridge was densely packed with wandering zombies.","There were at least four to five thousand of them.","Hearing the roar of the vehicles, they all turned their heads in unison.","Their grotesque, twisted faces lit up with the excitement of spotting prey.","In an instant, all the zombies began to move.","\"Boom—\"","The bridge trembled.","Coupled with the deafening roars of the zombies,","it felt like an earthquake had suddenly struck.","The noise was overwhelming.","All the vehicles came to an immediate stop.","Although the people in the helicopter had already informed everyone of the situation,","seeing it firsthand still made everyone gasp.","This wasn’t an open plain. The terrain here was unique—narrow roads, with mountains on one side and a cliff leading to a rushing river on the other.","And ahead was the bridge, the only available passage.","This meant they couldn’t use explosives.","Nor could everyone fight together.","Those at the front would face the onslaught of the zombie horde, and the danger would multiply exponentially.","Understanding the gravity of the situation, Jiang Huai quickly devised a strategy.","He ordered the strongest fighters to the front, as only their combined power could halt the zombie advance.","Everyone stood ready, their expressions grave.","This was their first true large-scale battle!","The zombie horde surged forward, the fastest one covered in squirming maggots. One maggot even wriggled in the zombie’s gaping, bloodied mouth, a nauseating sight.","It lunged straight at Nie Yizhou.","Nie Yizhou swung his blade, but the zombie dodged. Instead of hitting its head, the blade sliced through its stomach, cutting it in half.","Instantly, a flood of maggots burst from the zombie’s belly, scattering like a grotesque shower.","The stench was unbearable.","\"Ugh!\" Nie Yizhou nearly vomited.","\"What the hell! That’s disgusting!\"","Standing beside him, Xiao Feng waved his hand, and a burst of flames instantly engulfed the bisected zombie and the scattered maggots.","By then, the other zombies had closed in.","A small figure darted out at top speed.","Seeing this, Ling Jing, Lu Chen, Jiang Huai, and others immediately joined the fight.","A myriad of supernatural abilities erupted, waves of energy rippling out.","The zombies’ advance was halted.","\"The people from Yun City are... insanely strong!\"","Someone couldn’t help but exclaim.","Due to the unique terrain, many couldn’t participate in the battle.","But they weren’t idle, their eyes glued to the action.","After all, the fighters at the front were the best among them, and watching them was like getting a free lesson in combat.","But the more they watched, the more awestruck they became.","While the front-line fighters were the elite from various bases,","a few stood out even among them.","And without exception, they were all from Yun City!","One with fiery red hair unleashed a sea of flames.","Though others also had fire abilities, his was on another level.","His fire burned like the legendary Samadhi True Fire, incredibly destructive.","In moments, it would incinerate swathes of zombies, reducing them to ashes in an instant.","Another, who chattered nonstop while fighting, was also exceptionally skilled.","He could teleport in the blink of an eye, and his earth-based attacks were uniquely terrifying.","No one had ever seen earth refined into a massive spike before.","The spike shot out, impaling rows of zombies through their skulls.","Then there was a woman with burn scars on her body, her hands seemingly packed with explosives.","Wherever she pointed, explosions followed.","But she was careful, targeting only the zombies and sparing the bridge.","A burly man unleashed crackling bolts of lightning, instantly reducing any zombie it touched to charred remains.","A young couple, though not as powerful as the others, fought in perfect sync, their combined attacks devastating.","Countless zombies fell to their hands.","Of course, while these fighters were already top-tier,","they paled in comparison to three others.","The Cold-Faced Guy’s lightning attacks were even more ferocious than the burly man’s.","Moreover, his light-based ability, something they’d never seen before, was blindingly powerful.","Wherever he passed, zombies died by the hundreds,","falling in neat rows, as if cooperating in their demise.","Another, equally formidable, was a strikingly handsome young man with a lazy, sinister smile.","His black mist was eerie and deadly, carrying an aura of death.","Any zombie enveloped by the mist would be left with a shattered skull once it dissipated.","And his attacks weren’t limited to small areas—like the Cold-Faced Guy, his devastation was widespread.","The results were staggering!","These two were in a league of their own,","leaving even Jiang Huai of Rongsheng Base in the dust.","Yet, there was one who shone even brighter amidst their brilliance.","It was the Five or Six-Year-Old Girl who had already made a name for herself in the western base.","Now, she floated above the zombie horde, riding the wind.","The zombies below leaped desperately, trying to drag her down and devour her.","But what awaited them was an endless barrage of ice spikes.","The spikes, numerous and precise, rained down, piercing their skulls.","As if bored with ice, she then hurled countless wind blades.","The crescent-shaped blades flew swiftly, slicing through rows of zombie heads.","It was like cutting watermelons—quick and clean.","Watching this, one couldn’t help but feel a chill in their own head.","It was as if they could feel the pain..."]},{"number":255,"title":"Chapter 255: Want to have a competition","paragraphs":["\"No wonder they only brought a few people—their combat strength surpasses that of our entire base!\"","\"Exactly, we were too young and inexperienced. This is what they call effective numbers!\"","\"Who was it that said they didn’t want to contribute because they brought so few people?\"","Everyone started looking for the man who had made that comment the day before.","The man had already been overwhelmed with shame the moment he witnessed Yun Xiaoxiao and her team’s overwhelming combat prowess.","He, someone who didn’t even qualify to step forward and fight, had dared to criticize them earlier.","He wished he could just disappear into the ground.","Of course, the others only mentioned it in passing and didn’t dwell on the matter.","After all, many of them had shared the same thoughts at the time.","Now that reality had proven them wrong, as outsiders, they had no right to criticize.","Their attention had already shifted to another point.","\"Could it be that everyone from their base is this strong?\"","\"Very likely. Don’t they have that so-called evolution serum?\"","\"It seems their evolution serum really works.\"","\"Well, duh! Our base leader has been talking about it on the radio for a while now, but you all didn’t believe it.\"","One of Jiang Huai’s subordinates spoke with pride.","After all, he had drunk Yun City’s evolution serum!","Not just one bottle, but two!","These country bumpkins.","\"I have to buy some from them—no, not just some, but a lot!\"","\"Same here, I need to get stronger too!\"","At that moment, everyone became extremely eager to get their hands on Yun Xiaoxiao’s evolution serum.","Yun Xiaoxiao, however, was unaware of this.","At the moment, she was fully focused on killing zombies.","She didn’t know why, but once she started killing zombies, her inner warrior spirit was completely ignited.","The more she killed, the more energized she felt, and the more she wanted to keep going.","She was like a butcher, showing no mercy as hordes of zombies fell at her hands.","The zombies on the bridge seemed numerous, but under the brutal assault of Yun Xiaoxiao and her team, they were all wiped out in less than forty minutes.","This included some that had come running from the nearby county after hearing the commotion.","While others collected the crystal cores, Jiang Huai was busy jotting down notes in his notebook.","He recorded the number of participants from each base and their respective contributions.","After all, this would determine the distribution of crystal cores and supplies later, so he couldn’t afford to be careless.","\"Great job, Mi’er. You and Liu Tao worked really well together just now.\"","During the break, Yun Xiaoxiao handed two bottles of water to Tao Mi’er and Liu Tao.","They had mostly been training at the base until now.","This was their first real field mission.","But both of them had performed exceptionally well.","As the base leader, Yun Xiaoxiao naturally had to praise them.","Her intention in bringing them out was to give them more experience.","Among the younger generation at the base, they were considered quite talented and hardworking.","Their training results had always been outstanding.","That’s why Yun Xiaoxiao decided to bring them out for this mission.","Receiving her recognition made them both very happy.","Even though Yun Xiaoxiao was younger than them, like a little sister, they deeply admired her.","Getting her approval felt like receiving candy as a child.","Their excitement was something others couldn’t understand.","\"Little Base Leader, we’ll work hard and make sure we don’t let you or Yun City down!\"","Liu Tao thumped his chest with determination.","\"That’s right! We’re still weak now, but one day, we’ll become strong!\"","And prove that you didn’t make a mistake in saving us!","Tao Mi’er didn’t say the last part out loud, but her eyes were firm, as if making a solemn vow.","Yun Xiaoxiao, who could hear her thoughts, smiled slightly.","\"I believe in you. You’ll definitely get there.\"","The three of them shared a smile.","Once the crystal cores were collected, they cleared the zombie corpses blocking the road.","Then, the convoy continued forward, heading into Danhong County.","The distance wasn’t far, just about a kilometer.","The reconnaissance team on the helicopter had already warned them that the county was teeming with zombies, so they needed to be careful.","To reach Danhong County, they had to turn off the main road onto a side road and go down a slope.","The county was built along the water, with flat terrain.","It was a small plain nestled among the mountains.","The area wasn’t large, probably only a tenth the size of Rong City.","Inside the county, there were multiple streets and a riverside promenade.","Perhaps because it was a tourist city, there were quite a lot of zombies.","The convoy stopped at the entrance to the county.","Everyone got out of their vehicles, looking at the county with a determined air.","Especially those who hadn’t participated in the previous battle.","Watching Yun Xiaoxiao and her team slaughter zombies had filled them with excitement, and they couldn’t wait to join in.","Now, they finally had the chance to prove themselves.","No one wanted to be the one dragging the team down.","Based on the reconnaissance team’s observations, Jiang Huai quickly divided everyone into several teams.","The Rongsheng Base, with its large numbers, formed a team of their own.","The remaining bases were paired up or grouped together.","Since Yun Xiaoxiao’s team was so strong, they were assigned as a separate team.","Zheng Xin’er’s Yangcheng Base was also quite capable, so they took charge of a few smaller bases.","Wang Dahai and his group teamed up with a few other bases.","The last team was made up of the remaining bases, and this group had the most people.","\"Everyone, make sure you have your walkie-talkies on. Call for help if anything happens.\"","After Jiang Huai finished speaking, he gestured toward the county.","Everyone understood the signal.","Immediately, they charged toward their assigned areas.","Yun Xiaoxiao and her team moved forward, killing zombies as they made their way to a street.","This street was a food street.","Most of the buildings were two stories high, with living spaces upstairs and shops downstairs.","The signs along the street were colorful and varied.","There were traditional spicy pork intestine noodles, soul-shaking spicy chicken feet, duck blood hotpot, heartbreak cold noodles...","Countless food shops lined the street.","But now, everything looked dilapidated and abandoned.","The food that had been cooking in the pots had long since rotted and stank.","Many zombies were wandering the street.","Some female zombies still had withered flower crowns or cute fluffy hair clips on their heads.","Clearly, they had been tourists.","Others were wearing aprons and holding large metal spoons.","These were obviously the chefs from the shops.","When the zombies saw Yun Xiaoxiao and her team approaching, their previously vacant eyes suddenly lit up.","In an instant, they came to life, charging madly toward the group.","\"Killing zombies one by one is boring. How about we see who can kill the most?\" Ling Jing smirked.","\"Sure, what’s the bet for the loser?\"","Lu Chen seemed intrigued.","Nie Yizhou immediately protested, \"Hey, you two are just talking big. You’re not going to lose, so that means we’re the ones who’ll lose, right?\""]},{"number":256,"title":"Chapter 256: Zombie Rats","paragraphs":["“If you’re scared, just say so,” Ling Jing shrugged slightly.","Nie Yizhou was provoked. “Damn it, Xiao Feng just called us cowards. Let’s team up and take him down!”","“He called you a coward, not me. Why should I care?” Xiao Feng shot him a glance.","“How is it not about you?”","“I’m not a coward.”","“Damn it!”","Not wanting to be looked down upon, Nie Yizhou immediately declared,","“Who’s afraid of who? Let’s do it!”","“Whoever loses has to massage the others’ shoulders, knead their legs, and call them grandpa.”","“Deal! The one who backs out is a grandson!”","As soon as Nie Yizhou finished speaking, Yun Xiaoxiao darted out.","“Hey, kid, that’s not fair! Wait for me!”","With that, he also dashed forward.","The others quickly charged toward the oncoming zombies.","Even Lei Ming, Zheng Yuner, Tao Mi'er, and Liu Tao were swept up in the momentum, fighting the zombies with even more ferocity.","The group stood at one end of the street, exuding an overwhelming presence.","They managed to halt the surging tide of zombies and began pushing them back.","Just as they reached the middle of the street,","the window on the second floor of a fried chicken shop suddenly started rattling, as if it were about to shatter.","Although the sound was faint, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others heard it.","While dealing with the zombies, they glanced upward.","The glass window suddenly burst with a loud *bang*, shards scattering everywhere.","Immediately after, a swarm of dark creatures surged out, moving in a dense mass.","Their high-pitched *squeaks* filled the air as they poured out of the window,","scurrying down the wall and into the street.","“Crap, they’re zombie rats!”","Lei Ming narrowed his eyes, his expression serious.","These rats were clearly different from normal ones.","Their fur was pale and dull, with patches missing.","Their eyes glowed red, and their teeth were unnaturally sharp.","With their massive numbers, small size, and incredible speed, they were downright terrifying.","Xiao Feng immediately hurled a massive fireball at them.","The fireball ignited a cluster of zombie rats on contact.","But even as their bodies burned, a few of the rats still charged toward Zheng Yuner at breakneck speed.","Zheng Yuner had just finished off a zombie when she quickly turned to blast the approaching rats.","Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow and conjured an ice wall to block off the street, cutting off the zombies on the other side.","The immediate priority was to deal with these zombie rats.","“Everyone, be careful! Don’t underestimate these zombie rats!”","Yun Xiaoxiao’s tone was grave.","In her past life, before mutated plants and animals appeared,","the most troublesome threats were large hordes of zombies","and groups of animals infected with the zombie virus.","Like zombie rats, zombie bats, Zombie Dogs, zombie crows, and zombie wolves.","They were different from mutated animals.","Mutated animals underwent changes in ability and size.","Though they were extremely dangerous to humans,","they didn’t carry the zombie virus and could even be eaten.","But these zombie animals carried the deadly virus.","A scratch or bite from them would turn a human into a zombie, just like a human zombie’s attack.","What’s worse, they were smaller, faster, and more numerous than human zombies.","They were hard to defend against, and it was easy to get caught off guard.","That’s why, in her past life, many people would rather face human zombies than zombie animals like these rats.","And these zombie animals could also evolve.","If they encountered a high-level mutated zombie animal, it could be a death sentence.","The group immediately went into high alert.","They were even more focused than when dealing with a zombie horde.","After all, this was their first encounter with zombie rats, and on such a massive scale!","Nie Yizhou quickly erected square pillars beneath their feet, lifting them to a higher position.","“The higher you stand, the farther you see. You’re welcome,” Nie Yizhou grinned at the bewildered group.","As soon as he finished speaking, he hurled a massive dirt ball at the zombie rats on the ground.","“I’ll crush you!” he shouted with gusto.","Xiao Feng and the others, who were about to thank him, immediately rolled their eyes.","Their gazes were filled with mild disdain.","Can’t you be serious for once?","Thanks to Nie Yizhou’s sudden pillars, the swarm of zombie rats on the ground missed their targets, crashing into the pillars instead.","But they didn’t give up, quickly scaling the pillars with incredible speed.","It was as if they wouldn’t stop until they reached Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","Looking around, the entire ground, the shattered window, and the wall outside were covered in zombie rats.","A vast, dark sea of them, a truly horrifying sight.","However, aside from Tao Mi'er and Liu Tao, who were initially startled, the rest of the group remained calm.","Tao Mi'er and Liu Tao also quickly steadied themselves after being lifted by the pillars.","The nine of them began attacking the zombie rats beneath their feet.","Wave after wave of zombie rats were knocked off the pillars.","This went on for over twenty minutes.","“Damn, did we stumble into a rat nest? Where did all these rats come from?”","Nie Yizhou cursed as he fought.","Seeing that only a few zombie rats remained, the group prepared to finish them off quickly.","“Mi'er, there’s a zombie rat behind you. Be careful!”","Liu Tao shouted anxiously.","Due to the angle, he could see the zombie rat near Tao Mi'er’s heel but couldn’t attack it.","Doing so might harm Tao Mi'er as well.","Hearing this, Tao Mi'er quickly turned around.","But the zombie rat leaped onto her thigh, biting down before she could react.","Tao Mi'er panicked and immediately killed the rat.","But she still felt a sharp pain in her thigh.","Her heart sank.","Had she been bitten?","Her mind began to race.","Distracted, she failed to deal with the other zombie rats climbing up.","“Mi'er, stay focused!”","Yun Xiaoxiao, not far away, called out with a frown.","Tao Mi'er quickly snapped out of it and hurriedly dealt with the approaching rats.","But her movements were noticeably slower than before.","Yun Xiaoxiao frowned and swiftly moved to her side,","helping her fend off the zombie rats.","With their combined efforts, all the zombie rats were finally eliminated.","Nie Yizhou lowered the pillars, allowing everyone to return to the ground.","He let out a deep sigh.","“That was even more exhausting than fighting zombies. You couldn’t let your guard down for a second. Those little things were so fast, they’d be behind you before you knew it. It was insane!”","Nie Yizhou rambled on without a care, but the more observant members of the group noticed something was off with Tao Mi'er.","“Mi'er, what’s wrong?”","Liu Tao asked with concern, quickly moving toward her."]},{"number":257,"title":"Chapter 257: Oh no, this zombie is invulnerable to weapons","paragraphs":["\"Don't come any closer!\"","Tao Mi'er quickly called out to stop them.","She lowered her head, looking at her left thigh, her voice subdued.","\"I might have been bitten.\"","Hearing this, Liu Tao felt as if he had been struck by a club.","His expression was one of shock, and he asked uncertainly, \"Was it that zombie rat from earlier?\"","Tao Mi'er nodded.","Liu Tao's expression instantly looked worse than if he had been crying.","\"How could this happen...\"","Yun Xiaoxiao furrowed her brows.","In truth, there had always been a knot in her heart.","That knot was Feng Xiaoshi.","Feng Xiaoshi's death had made her reluctant to form new bonds with others.","Because if she formed attachments and emotions, and the other person suddenly died, it would inevitably bring her some sadness.","Even though it wasn't her fault.","Later, she established a base and recruited people.","That was because the system had offered too many rewards.","The number of people could be exchanged for points, and those points could be used to improve the base.","Moreover, reaching full intimacy could reward her with new abilities.","With so many benefits, she naturally couldn't refuse.","Recruiting people meant food and drink were essential.","Developing production had to be put on the agenda.","Since upgrading the base required cores and points, recruiting more people and selling supplies externally became necessary.","That, in turn, required further development of production.","It was like an endless cycle.","But she didn’t recruit people solely for points, new abilities, or base upgrades, disregarding their lives.","On the contrary, she felt that since they had chosen to follow her, she couldn’t guarantee their survival completely, but she wouldn’t skimp on necessary safety measures.","So before heading to the Western Base, she exchanged several sets of combat suits.","She gave them to Tao Mi'er and the others.","Those combat suits could withstand bites from level three and below zombies.","The zombie rats, though numerous, were not high-level, at most level one peak.","In theory, even if Tao Mi'er had been bitten, it shouldn’t have harmed her.","\"Mi'er, come here for a moment,\" she called out.","Tao Mi'er looked at her, puzzled, but then shook her head.","\"No, it's better not. If I turn into a zombie later, I might hurt you.\"","\"Who said you’d turn into a zombie?\" Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow.","Seeing Tao Mi'er stunned, she pointed at her body.","\"Before leaving Yun City, didn’t I give each of you a set of close-fitting clothes?","Those can withstand bites from level three and below zombies.","The zombie rats earlier weren’t strong, so even if you were bitten, as long as it wasn’t the same spot being gnawed on for half an hour, you should be fine.","I called you over to check your wound, so you can see for yourself.","That way, you won’t be left alone overthinking.\"","Hearing this, Tao Mi'er froze for a few seconds.","Then she finally processed what Yun Xiaoxiao had said.","In an instant, it was as if she had been thirsty for days and finally taken a sip of water—she came back to life.","\"Alright, I’m coming.\"","She hurried over with Yun Xiaoxiao into a noodle shop that had already been cleared of zombies.","\"See? No wound.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao pointed at the smooth, pale skin on the back of her thigh and smiled.","Tao Mi'er let out a sigh of relief, her face lighting up with joy.","\"There really isn’t one!\"","She had clearly felt the pain earlier.","It seemed the combat suit had indeed done its job.","\"That combat suit is so useful!\"","At that moment, she was infinitely grateful to Yun Xiaoxiao for giving her such a precious set of clothing.","She almost wanted to pick Yun Xiaoxiao up and kiss her.","Hearing her thoughts, Yun Xiaoxiao quickly took a few steps back.","No!","She didn’t like getting other people’s saliva on her!","Once they realized it was a false alarm, everyone relaxed.","\"Why are you crying?\"","Tao Mi'er frowned at Liu Tao.","Liu Tao hurriedly wiped the tears that had welled up in the corners of his eyes and defended himself, \"I’m not crying. There was just some wind earlier, and sand got into my eyes.\"","\"Oh~ sand in the eyes~\"","As soon as Liu Tao finished speaking, Nie Yizhou teased him.","He dragged out his words and leaned close to Xiao Feng, pointing at his own eyes.","\"Little Feng, I’ve got sand in my eyes too. Take a look, am I crying?\"","Xiao Feng rolled his eyes at him. \"I don’t see any sand, but there’s a rock. Want me to dig it out for you?\"","\"Heh... heh, no need for that.\"","Nie Yizhou quickly took several steps back, putting distance between himself and Xiao Feng.","With his antics, Liu Tao’s ears turned red.","But Tao Mi'er seemed oblivious and instead turned her attention to the ice wall.","\"Look, the zombies are about to climb over!\"","Everyone turned to see one of the zombies leaping down from the ice wall, claws bared.","Lu Chen was the first to act, smashing its head open.","\"Everyone, fall back!\"","Yun Xiaoxiao called out, then dispelled the ice wall.","In an instant, countless zombies came crashing down to the ground.","They piled on top of each other, forming a wall of zombies.","As soon as they hit the ground, they scrambled to their feet.","With gaping, bloody mouths, they howled and stumbled forward, charging at Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","Two or three zombies were knocked down by the sheer force of the others and were trampled repeatedly by the following horde, their heads eventually crushed.","The scene was truly gruesome.","Yun Xiaoxiao focused on the approaching zombies, quickly launching her attacks.","But in the next moment, a few unusual zombies appeared in her line of sight.","They were stepping on the heads of other zombies, moving on all fours like animals, their speed astonishing!","In the blink of an eye, they had darted from the back of the horde to the front.","They weren’t wearing clothes, but their bodies were covered in scales.","Their nails were longer and sharper than those of ordinary zombies, and they were all black.","Lei Ming immediately struck one with lightning.","Although it was hit, the zombie only let out a couple of agonized screams before quickly getting back up and launching another attack.","Meanwhile, a few other zombies nearby were caught in the lightning and died.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others exchanged glances.","These zombies couldn’t be killed by lightning!","Yun Xiaoxiao quickly summoned another ice wall to block the rest of the zombies.","But these scaled zombies were not only fast but also had incredible jumping ability. They quickly made their way over from the rooftops on either side.","A rough count showed there were about eleven or twelve of them.","Since these zombies were practically invulnerable, even attacking their heads had no effect.","The battle quickly reached a stalemate.","Only Ling Jing managed to take down two using his mental attacks.","But this also drained a lot of his energy.","Yun Xiaoxiao clearly noticed that his stamina seemed to be faltering.","Over on the other side, Tao Mi'er and Liu Tao were also struggling to hold on.","She knew they couldn’t keep this up for much longer!","She stared at the two scaled zombies in front of her, her gaze sharp and determined.","They had to find these zombies’ weakness, and fast!"]},{"number":258,"title":"Chapter 258: Emergency Distress Call","paragraphs":["The fatal weakness of most zombies is their head.","As long as you pierce their forehead, the zombie is usually done for.","However, these scale-covered zombies have a layer of hard scales on their exterior.","No one knows what these scales are made of.","They are like an impenetrable fortress, with top-notch resistance to attacks.","Even Yun Xiaoxiao's Lord Slasher could only leave some scratches on their bodies but couldn't completely break through the scales.","These zombies also feel no pain, so even under intense attacks, they still frantically charge at the group.","Yun Xiaoxiao, while attacking the two zombies in front of her, tried different points of attack to find their weakness.","Suddenly, her gaze shifted to Lu Chen's side.","Lu Chen's powerful attack knocked a scale-covered zombie to the ground.","The zombie lay on its back, limbs flailing in the air.","But it quickly flipped back onto its feet.","However, its foot stepped on some broken glass that had fallen from the building above.","Seeing the zombie's changed expression, Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow.","Found it!","\"Big brother, attack its feet!\"","\"The weakness is in the feet!\"","Yun Xiaoxiao and Lu Chen spoke almost simultaneously.","Lu Chen nodded at Yun Xiaoxiao and immediately launched his attack.","A powerful beam of lightning shot out, directly hitting the zombie's upper body.","The scale-covered zombie was sent tumbling to the ground.","At the moment it fell, a blade-like white light slashed across, precisely striking its feet.","\"Screech!\"","The zombie let out a painful howl, its scream piercing the sky.","Lu Chen followed up with another strike.","In the next second, the previously indestructible, unkillable scale-covered zombie was completely dead.","Everyone immediately realized that the zombie's weakness was indeed in its feet.","Thus, they all started attacking the feet of the other scale-covered zombies around them.","Swish, swish, swish...","In less than a minute, all the zombies were dead!","\"It was that simple?!\"","Nie Yizhou could hardly believe it, even as all the zombies lay on the ground.","After all, these zombies had been impossible to kill just moments ago.","Except for Ling Jing, whose special ability allowed him to kill two, no one else had managed to take down a single one.","Even Lu Chen and Yun Xiaoxiao, who were so powerful, had been helpless.","But now, these zombies had died so... casually...","Still, dead was good.","Exhausted, Yun Xiaoxiao reinforced the ice wall and handed out evolution fluid and spirit spring water for everyone to replenish their energy.","After a short rest, the ice wall was removed, and the group plunged back into the intense battle.","This time, there were no unexpected surprises.","Working in a coordinated rhythm, they cleared the entire street of zombies.","However, just as they were finishing up and collecting the crystal cores, the walkie-talkie suddenly crackled to life.","It was the largest group, sending out an urgent distress call. They had encountered a major problem.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others immediately stopped what they were doing.","They had already dealt with the zombies in their area, with only a few stragglers wandering in from other streets.","After exchanging glances, Yun Xiaoxiao and Nie Yizhou led the group, teleporting to the riverside promenade.","This area bordered a roaring river, with a long path paved with bluestone.","The roadside was lined with flowers, trees, and other greenery, as well as a row of wooden buildings.","These buildings were a series of shops, including mahjong parlors, cafes, KTVs, and other leisure venues.","As soon as Yun Xiaoxiao and the others landed, they heard a series of agonized screams.","The sounds were unmistakably human.","Looking up, they saw a fierce battle between humans and zombies not far away.","The group was using a strategy of containment and elimination—blocking most of the zombies while letting a few through to be killed first.","This method was the safest and most effective way to deal with large numbers of zombies.","By releasing zombies in controlled batches, they could minimize the danger and systematically eliminate the horde.","This strategy had been proven highly effective in situations with overwhelming numbers of zombies.","But now, it wasn't working.","Two massive zombies, each nearly three meters tall and as wide as they were tall, were swinging their thick arms, smashing through the barriers.","Their arms were as thick as elephant legs, and their sheer weight was likely greater than two elephants combined.","They stomped forward, using their bodies and arms to knock down the barriers.","Hordes of zombies poured through the broken gaps, charging at the human forces.","The humans were forced to retreat.","Some, caught off guard by the sudden onslaught, were bitten by the zombies.","The screams were heart-wrenching.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others didn't hesitate. They rushed forward.","Yun Xiaoxiao and Nie Yizhou worked together, summoning ice walls and earthen barriers to block the two high-level mutated zombies and the advancing zombie horde.","Thanks to their superior strength, the high-level zombies couldn't immediately break through the new walls.","The panicked humans, seeing the sudden appearance of these barriers, were overjoyed.","When they saw the powerful attacks raining down from the first ice wall, some were moved to tears.","With this strong reinforcement, the group regained their composure and returned to the fight.","The number of zombies on their side of the wall wasn't large, so Yun Xiaoxiao and the others turned their attention to the two behemoths.","Honestly, they were a grotesque sight.","The zombies' clothes had been torn apart by their massive bodies, revealing layers of grayish fat that hung in rolls.","Their entire bodies were just mountains of flesh.","They were incredibly strong, and every time they slammed into the ice wall, the structure trembled.","If it weren't for Yun Xiaoxiao's high level and the thickness of the ice wall, it would have been knocked down.","Working together, the group launched a coordinated attack on the two zombies.","Despite their ferocious appearance, these zombies only relied on their size and brute strength.","On the ground, they could easily crush people under their massive feet or send them flying with a single charge.","But Yun Xiaoxiao and the others had no such concerns.","They weren't fighting on the ground.","These zombies couldn't even reach them.","And such large zombies had their own limitations.","Their movement range and speed were restricted.","So now, the two zombies were completely on the defensive.","They weren't as durable as the scale-covered zombies, so it didn't take long before the once-ferocious fat zombies collapsed to the ground.","The zombies behind them weren't so lucky.","They were crushed under the weight of the two flesh mountains, dying without a sound.","With Yun Xiaoxiao and the others joining the fight, the tide of battle turned completely.","And when Jiang Huai arrived with reinforcements, the zombies along the riverside promenade were quickly wiped out."]},{"number":259,"title":"Chapter 259: The Twin Teenagers in the Cave","paragraphs":["The other teams were also systematically clearing out the zombies in their respective areas.","As they worked, a hint of darkness appeared on the horizon.","The teams that finished their tasks first split into two groups.","One group went to assist the other teams that hadn’t yet completed their tasks.","The other group went to areas that had been overlooked earlier.","Finally, before the sky turned completely dark, almost all the zombies in the county town had been cleared out.","Of course, there might still be a few stragglers.","But with nightfall, it wasn’t safe to continue, so everyone decided to conduct a thorough search first thing in the morning.","After resting, they found a relatively clean street and cleared out the zombies there.","A water-based ability user rinsed the street briefly.","A fire-based ability user then dried it quickly with flames.","After that, they sealed off both ends of the street.","Some people were tasked with setting up tents.","Others were responsible for starting a fire and cooking.","Those who had nothing to do gathered in small groups to chat.","The desolate county town was suddenly filled with the warmth of life.","“Huh, where are the people from the Northern Base?” Nie Yizhou suddenly asked, puzzled during the conversation.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others then realized that Bai Hongting and Bai Ruo were indeed missing.","Jiang Huai happened to pass by and replied, “The daughter of Base Leader Bai is in poor health, so they left early.”","When the teams were being divided, Bai Hongting and his group had descended from a helicopter, saying they wanted to help.","Bai Ruo had then directly joined Jiang Huai’s team.","At that time, the teams had already been formed.","Since their numbers were small, they went along with it.","But halfway through, Bai Ruo said she had lost the medicine she carried with her.","Everyone searched for a while but couldn’t find it.","It seemed Bai Ruo had a heart condition and needed the medicine to control it in critical moments.","So, Bai Hongting explained the situation to Jiang Huai and left with his people.","“Base Leader Bai said that upon returning, he would gather the bases in the north to launch a joint zombie eradication plan.","He would also contact the Eastern, Southern, and Central Bases to persuade them to join in,” Jiang Huai said, visibly excited.","After all, even if they managed to kill all the zombies in the entire western region,","if the other regions took no action, they would still be at significant risk.","As everyone knew, the population density in Hua Country decreased from east to west.","The western region was vast and sparsely populated, making it the least densely populated area.","If the other regions didn’t act, there was a high chance that large numbers of zombies could migrate westward.","So, it would be ideal if the other bases could join forces.","Yun Xiaoxiao didn’t feel much about Bai Hongting’s departure.","To her, Bai Hongting was just a respectable elder with both strength and grace.","In fact, she quite admired him.","However, his daughter really soured the impression.","At the same time.","On a mountain near Danhong County.","A group of people stood at the entrance of a cave, gazing at the flickering lights in the county town below.","“Look, those people are actually cooking and making fires in the town! Aren’t they afraid of attracting zombies?” a somewhat cute-looking boy exclaimed in surprise.","“With the way they went at it this afternoon, they probably killed most of the zombies,” another boy, who looked almost identical to the first, said casually with his arms crossed.","The two boys appeared to be around seventeen or eighteen years old.","At first glance, they looked like they were cast from the same mold, making it hard to tell them apart.","But upon closer inspection, while both had youthful, boyish faces,","the first boy had clear, innocent eyes,","while the second had a more serious demeanor, like a little old man despite his age.","“Killed most of them? I doubt it,” the first boy said skeptically.","He turned to a middle-aged woman beside him.","“Aunt Long, do you think they really could’ve killed all the zombies in our town?”","Aunt Long gazed thoughtfully at the glowing lights in the distance.","“It’s hard to say.”","Earlier that afternoon, when those people attacked the bridge, they had noticed them.","The zombies had been deliberately lured onto the bridge by them.","Their plan was to draw most of the zombies away from the town.","That way, they would have a better chance of scavenging for supplies in the town.","The weather was getting colder.","Their clothes were too thin, and they needed to find warmer ones in the town.","They were in a remote area.","Going outside would mean a long journey, and there were even more zombies out there.","That would be an unwise decision.","So, the best option was to lure the zombies away from the town.","If they were lucky, the zombies would either move away from the town along the bridge or fall into the ravine and be swept away by the swift river.","If luck wasn’t on their side and the zombies remained on the bridge,","they could still take a chance if the number of zombies in the town decreased.","However, halfway through their plan, they noticed a long convoy and helicopters heading their way.","Everyone quickly retreated to the mountain to hide.","This was the apocalypse; they couldn’t be sure if the newcomers were friend or foe.","They didn’t dare take the risk.","Back on the mountain, they kept a close eye on the group.","To their surprise, those people didn’t seem afraid of the zombies—it was as if they had come specifically for them.","Even with thousands of zombies on the bridge, they charged forward fearlessly.","What was even more terrifying was that they managed to wipe out all the zombies!","They were shocked to realize just how powerful those people were.","The dazzling array of strange abilities left them utterly stunned.","Although some of their own group had developed bizarre abilities after the apocalypse,","none of them had the same destructive power as those people.","Later, they saw the group head straight into the town.","They knew exactly how many zombies were in the town.","Just as they thought the group was walking to their doom,","they watched as the newcomers split into several teams and systematically moved through the town’s streets.","Clearly, they had come prepared.","Due to their vantage point, they could only vaguely see that the group was fighting the zombies in the town.","But it wasn’t clear who was winning or losing.","That is, until the fires lit up in the darkness.","“What if they took all the thick clothes in town?” the more serious of the twin boys frowned, worried.","Aunt Long sighed, “There’s nothing we can do. We’re no match for them.","Let’s get some rest and not overthink it.","If it comes to it, we’ll just have to search further away.”","The twin boys exchanged a glance but said nothing more.","The group then headed back into the cave."]},{"number":260,"title":"Chapter 260: I Want to Leave","paragraphs":["On the other side.","After the meal was prepared, Jiang Huai raised his water bottle toward the sky.","\"Before we eat, let’s all pay tribute to the brave brothers who sacrificed themselves today!\"","His voice was heavy, his expression solemn.","The others either bowed their heads in silence or gazed up at the pitch-black night sky.","A somber atmosphere hung over the scene.","Although the number of their fallen comrades was minuscule compared to the nearly hundred thousand zombies they had killed, these were friends and brothers who had fought side by side with them.","Even if only a little over a hundred had died, it was still a devastating blow to them.","Everyone also realized that the mission to eradicate the zombies was no joke.","It was incredibly difficult...","And death could come at any moment.","After a brief mourning ceremony, everyone finally began to eat.","Once the meal was over, they gradually returned to their tents to rest.","Around five in the morning.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others were deep in sleep when a sudden commotion erupted outside.","The argument was intense.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others quickly got dressed and went out to investigate.","They saw a large crowd gathered not far away, and the heated voices were coming from within.","As they approached, the voices became clearer.","\"Is it wrong for me to leave? You all have families in the base, fighting tooth and nail here to give them a better life, and you have something to look forward to. But I’m alone—no one depends on me. Why should I stay here and die?!\"","A sharp shout rang out, filled with anger and resentment.","Another voice immediately retorted, \"That’s just irresponsible. You joined voluntarily, swearing it was for the greater good of humanity. How is it now that you’re here to die?\"","\"That... that’s because I had no idea how brutal the reality of combat would be!\"","The man’s voice trembled slightly.","\"Do you know how terrifying it was when we were cornered today, and the zombies came charging at us?","Everyone around me was bitten to death! They’re all gone!","The agonizing screams keep echoing in my head every time I close my eyes.","I don’t want to die like them!\"","\"Stop being such a crybaby. We all fought today. People die every day in this apocalypse—it’s not like this is the only place where it happens.\"","A burly man spoke with disdain.","\"I’m also alone, with no one depending on me. There are plenty of others like us.","Do you think we’re all idiots?","Didn’t we know that fighting zombies would mean death?","If we don’t eliminate the zombies, humanity will forever live in fear, hiding like cowards.","That’s why Base Commander Peng united the major bases to strike first, before the zombies grow too powerful to stop.","Sacrificing a few to save the many.\"","\"I understand the logic, but why does it have to be me who’s sacrificed?!\" the man roared in frustration.","\"Once you’re dead, you’re gone. Why care about what happens to others?\"","The burly man snorted, \"If everyone thought like you, do you really think you’d survive on your own in the end?\"","Humanity is on the brink of extinction, and the world is becoming overrun by zombies. How easy do you think it’ll be to live a good life then?","We’re risking our lives to fight the zombies now precisely to give ourselves a chance to live properly.","\"It’s your business if you want to be heroes. I just want to survive. Is that wrong?!\" the man shouted indignantly.","Hearing this, the burly man couldn’t help but laugh in exasperation.","He felt like he’d never been so dumbfounded in his life.","\"Damn it, how did our base end up with such a coward like you?","Trying to desert before the battle even starts? Don’t want to die? Want to leave? Fine, I’ll beat you to death first!\"","Wang Dahai stepped out from the back of the crowd, his face filled with rage, ready to pummel the man.","Jiang Huai appeared just in time to stop him.","\"Brother Jiang Huai, why are you stopping me? This kind of coward who deserts before a battle only undermines morale. What’s the point of keeping him around?\"","Wang Dahai glared furiously at the man.","But Jiang Huai held him back.","\"If he wants to leave, let him go. This mission is voluntary—we’re not forcing anyone to stay.\"","He then scanned the others present.","\"If anyone else feels the same way, you’re free to leave with him.\"","His expression then turned stern.","\"This is your only chance. If you stay and then try to back out later, don’t blame us for being ruthless.\"","As a soldier, protecting the nation was a duty ingrained in his very being.","But he knew he could only demand this of himself and his fellow soldiers.","He had no right to impose such expectations on others.","Of course, he could let everyone make their own choice, but only once!","If anyone wavered after this, he wouldn’t hold back.","As soon as he finished speaking, murmurs broke out among the crowd.","In the end, over a dozen people expressed their desire to leave.","True to his word, Jiang Huai let them go.","Watching their retreating figures, the others were left with a lingering sense of unease.","\"A bunch of cowards!\"","\"Honestly, I think their perspective is too narrow.","The more zombies we kill, the more evolution serum we can exchange.","Once our strength grows, it’ll be harder for the zombies to kill us.","But they only focus on the possibility of dying.","If their strength doesn’t improve while the zombies keep getting stronger, won’t they die anyway?","I really don’t understand their thinking.\"","\"Forget it. Everyone has their own plans—you can’t force them.\"","\"But it really affects everyone’s morale!\"","\"Look at it this way: people like that would only be a liability in the group, constantly wavering.","If there’s a critical moment when they’re needed, and they back out, that could be fatal.","So them leaving now might actually be a good thing—ridding the team of dead weight.\"","\"That’s a fair point. Forget it, let’s not dwell on it.","I believe we’ve made the right choice, and that’s all that matters.\"","\"Exactly. Death can be as light as a feather or as heavy as a mountain. Even if we die in the end, contributing to humanity’s survival would make it worth it.\"","\"...\"","After this incident, most of them couldn’t sleep.","They gathered around a fire to chat instead.","Jiang Huai also called a meeting with the leaders of the various bases to discuss the plan for the next day.","First, they would search the town for any remaining zombies.","Second, they would gather any usable supplies in the town.","Additionally, there were some houses on the nearby mountain that might be harboring zombies, so they’d need to send a team to investigate.","By the time they finished discussing, the first light of dawn was breaking on the horizon."]},{"number":261,"title":"Chapter 261: Flowers Eating People","paragraphs":["After a simple breakfast, everyone packed up the tents, pots, and other utensils, storing them in the designated supply vehicle.","Following that, they split into groups to carry out their respective tasks.","Since supplies were of great importance to most people, nearly every team sent someone to oversee the process.","This ensured mutual supervision and prevented anyone from secretly hoarding supplies.","Especially in the various bases, those with spatial abilities would avoid suspicion and were assigned to other tasks.","For collecting supplies, Yun Xiaoxiao sent Tao Mi'er, Liu Tao, and Lei Ming.","Lu Chen led Xiao Feng and Nie Yizhou to clear out the remaining zombies in the city.","Meanwhile, Yun Xiaoxiao, Ling Jing, and Zheng Yuner headed up the mountain.","\"Xiao Xiaoxiao, Yuner, let's go together,\" Zheng Xin'er caught up to them, greeting them warmly.","With her joining, the atmosphere instantly became livelier.","Together, they walked toward the mountain cottages.","Suddenly, Ling Jing glanced toward a large tree to their left.","His eyes narrowed, and he summoned a dark mist, hurling it toward the tree.","The trunk shook.","\"Ouch!\"","Two figures suddenly fell from the dense branches, landing on a thick layer of dry leaves.","They looked almost identical.","Seeing this, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others quickly approached.","Information about the two automatically appeared in Yun Xiaoxiao's mind.","One was named Hua Ye, the other Hua Bai.","Hua Ye had a stern expression and possessed the abilities of invisibility and venom.","Hua Bai, on the other hand, looked clear-eyed and innocent, with abilities of long-distance vision and enhanced hearing.","Despite their abilities, both were at the lowest level.","It was clear they hadn’t consumed anything to enhance their powers.","\"What are you two doing sneaking around in the tree?\"","Seeing they were humans and not zombies, Zheng Xin'er raised an eyebrow in confusion.","\"We weren’t sneaking, we just wanted to see you...\"","Hua Bai started to explain but was quickly stopped by Hua Ye.","Hua Ye eyed Yun Xiaoxiao and the others warily, refusing to answer and instead asking,","\"Who are you, and why are you coming up the mountain?\"","\"You’re survivors from the town below, aren’t you?\" Ling Jing saw through their identity at once.","\"Yes, how did you...\" Hua Bai smiled brightly.","\"Idiot!\"","Hua Ye yanked him behind him.","\"Don’t just blurt everything out. How do you know if they’re good or bad?\"","\"We mean no harm. We’re just here to clear out the zombies,\" Zheng Xin'er explained.","\"Clear out zombies?\" Hua Ye frowned.","Coming all the way up the mountain just to kill zombies?","\"You must have seen us yesterday, right?\" Yun Xiaoxiao smiled faintly.","With Hua Bai’s long-distance vision and sharp hearing, he must have noticed when they broke through the bridge and entered the town the day before.","That’s why they were here waiting as soon as Yun Xiaoxiao’s group arrived.","As soon as Yun Xiaoxiao finished speaking, Hua Bai looked behind him.","Then, faint rustling footsteps could be heard in the distance.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others also looked up.","A large group of people, about twenty or thirty, was quickly descending from the mountain forest.","Leading them was a capable middle-aged woman.","They stopped beside the Hua brothers.","\"What’s going on?\"","The middle-aged woman, Aunt Long, looked at them with concern.","Hua Ye glanced at Yun Xiaoxiao and the others but said nothing.","Hua Bai, however, answered earnestly, \"Aunt Long, they’re the group from below. They said they’re here to kill zombies.\"","Hearing this, Aunt Long turned to Yun Xiaoxiao and the others, her eyes filled with surprise.","Then, she spoke kindly, \"Everyone, we’ve already cleared out the zombies in this area of the mountain.\"","In truth, she was deeply wary of Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","She feared they had ulterior motives for coming up the mountain.","So, she said this not only because it was true but also to signal that there was no need for them to go further.","\"Let’s go.\"","Understanding Aunt Long’s true intentions, Yun Xiaoxiao turned around first.","Since there were no zombies left, there was no point in wasting time here.","Thus, the group of several hundred people began descending the mountain.","Seeing them actually leave, Aunt Long and the others were slightly stunned.","Hua Bai murmured, \"It seems they really were just here to kill zombies.\"","Hua Ye frowned. Had he been mistaken?","\"Ahhh!\"","\"Help! Someone help!\"","At that moment, several screams suddenly echoed from further up the mountain.","Aunt Long and the Hua brothers froze, quickly turning their heads toward the direction of the cave.","\"Something’s wrong!\"","Aunt Long’s expression turned grave as she hurried back the way they came.","The Hua brothers and the others followed closely.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others also heard the screams.","Everyone stopped in their tracks.","\"Should we go check it out?\" Zheng Xin'er asked.","\"If it’s zombies causing trouble and we don’t stop it in time, there’ll be even more zombies.\"","Everyone agreed with her reasoning.","So, they also hurried toward the source of the screams.","They quickly made their way up the mountain through the forest.","Soon, they came across a cave hidden among the trees.","In front of the cave was a flat area, with stones piled on either side of the entrance.","Outside the stones was a wooden fence, but it was unusual—it was studded with sharpened wooden stakes.","The only way to access the cave was by two thick ropes hanging directly in front of the entrance.","Clearly, this was designed to keep zombies out, as ordinary zombies couldn’t climb ropes.","Now, screams continued to echo from inside the cave.","Many panicked people were rushing out, their faces filled with terror as they scrambled to grab the ropes.","Those who couldn’t reach the ropes even frantically climbed down the cliff face with their bare hands.","It was clear how terrified they were.","\"What’s going on?\" Hua Ye grabbed one of them and asked urgently.","By the time Yun Xiaoxiao and the others arrived, they saw this scene.","Though Hua Ye’s group had started first, both parties reached the cave almost simultaneously.","But now, Hua Ye and the others had no time to question why Yun Xiaoxiao’s group had returned.","Seeing their companions in such a state of panic, they were too worried.","\"There’s a flower in the cave that’s eating people! Run, or we’ll all die!\"","The person’s voice trembled with fear.","A flower eating people?","Hearing this, not only Hua Ye and the others but even Yun Xiaoxiao and her group were shocked.","Yun Xiaoxiao furrowed her brows.","Could it be that plants had mutated early?","No, the acid rain hadn’t fallen yet.","Plants shouldn’t have undergone large-scale mutations.","Then it must be... like Little Cutie and Big Beauty, only certain plants with unique traits had mutated.","As she pondered this, Aunt Long, the Hua brothers, and about a dozen others had already rushed toward the cave entrance."]},{"number":262,"title":"Chapter 262: Don't Go Down There, It's Dangerous It Could Be Deadly","paragraphs":["Yun Xiaoxiao's heart stirred, and she immediately followed.","She was curious about the man-eating flower and wanted to know what was really going on.","\"Where are you going?\" Ling Jing called out.","Yun Xiaoxiao turned her head, \"I'm going to check it out.\"","\"I'll go with you,\" Ling Jing said, feeling uneasy.","With that, he quickly caught up.","Zheng Yuner and Zheng Xin'er exchanged glances and hurried after them.","Before leaving, Zheng Xin'er instructed her subordinates,","\"Wait outside and take care of those who escape.\"","\"Yes!\"","The four of them moved against the flow, quickly entering the cave.","They expected it to be pitch black inside, but to their surprise, there were oil lamps lining the walls.","The light was dim, but it was enough to illuminate the surroundings.","People were continuously running out from the depths of the cave.","Each of them looked panicked, disoriented, and terrified.","Screams echoed from deep within the cave.","The group quickened their pace.","The cave passage was winding and long. After about ten minutes, they arrived at a spacious area.","The space was roughly the size of a basketball court.","It was filled with bedding, quilts, clothes, pots, pans, and other items, with several bonfires lit from dry wood.","The crackling fires illuminated the entire space.","But at that moment, there was no one in sight.","The place was in complete disarray, with things knocked over everywhere.","Yun Xiaoxiao didn’t see the Hua brothers or the man-eating flower.","Suddenly, a man tumbled out from behind one of the bonfires, seemingly appearing out of thin air.","After him, many more people rushed out.","Among them were a few of the superhumans who had been with the middle-aged woman earlier.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others raised their eyebrows and ran over.","Only then did they realize there was more to the area.","Next to the bonfire was a downward-leading hole, with a staircase descending further.","As Yun Xiaoxiao and the others prepared to go down, a young woman hurriedly tried to stop them.","\"Don’t go down there! It’s dangerous! People will die!\"","\"Thank you,\" Yun Xiaoxiao smiled and thanked her before turning to Zheng Yuner and Zheng Xin'er.","\"Sister Yuner, Sister Xin'er, you two stay here and provide backup.\"","If there was real danger, she could retreat into her space.","Ling Jing should also be able to escape without issue.","It wasn’t that she didn’t trust Zheng Yuner and Zheng Xin'er’s abilities, but she didn’t know the level of the man-eating flower and didn’t want to take unnecessary risks.","The two understood that Yun Xiaoxiao was worried about them.","With the situation inside still unclear, it was better for them to stay outside.","If something unexpected happened, they could quickly come up with a plan or seek help from Lu Chen and the others.","Seeing them nod, Yun Xiaoxiao immediately stepped onto the staircase and descended.","\"What...\"","The woman who had kindly warned them was left dumbfounded.","Why didn’t that child listen?!","It’s really dangerous down there!","The area at the bottom of the staircase was twice as large as the one above, and it was also in complete chaos.","There was an underground river running through the cave.","\"Hua Bai!\"","As Yun Xiaoxiao and Ling Jing reached the bottom, they heard Hua Ye shout.","His voice was filled with anxiety and worry.","The two looked in the direction of the voice and saw a pink trumpet flower, over two meters tall, standing tall above the water, swaying gracefully.","If viewed alone, the pink flower, green leaves, and vines were a breathtaking sight.","But at that moment, its enormous trumpet-shaped blossom had sucked in Hua Bai’s entire head.","Hua Bai’s body was still outside, struggling in agony.","Hua Ye, desperate, immediately released venom to attack the mutated trumpet flower.","But his level was too low. Before the venom could reach the flower, he was swatted away by a large green leaf and slammed into the stone wall.","Seeing this, Aunt Long and three other superhumans launched their attacks on the trumpet flower.","The three superhumans, like Hua Ye, were swatted away by the flower’s large leaves.","Only Aunt Long managed to dodge.","Her movements were clearly not those of an ordinary person.","She must have received specialized training.","With agile movements, she pulled out a large axe and swung it at the flower’s body.","The trumpet flower immediately swung its large leaf, trying to knock Aunt Long away as it had done to the others.","But Aunt Long seized the moment, grabbed the stem of the leaf, and swung her axe at the flower’s body.","The trumpet flower, realizing Aunt Long was a serious threat, quickly spat out Hua Bai to deal with her.","Hua Bai was thrown into the air, heading straight for the underground river.","Hua Ye wanted to catch him, but his entire body felt as if it had been dislocated. The pain was so intense that he stumbled as he tried to stand and fell back down.","\"Brother!\"","He shouted in desperation.","Although Hua Bai was his older brother, Hua Ye had always been resentful. They looked identical, and he was even smarter than Hua Bai, so why was he the younger brother?","Because of this, he had never called Hua Bai \"brother.\"","But now, the word slipped out.","His eyes were red as he saw Hua Bai was unconscious.","If he fell into the river while unconscious, it would undoubtedly mean death!","As he struggled to get up, a green vine shot out from behind him at incredible speed.","Just as Hua Bai’s body touched the water, the vine wrapped around his waist and yanked him back, pulling him away from the icy river.","Hua Ye turned around in surprise and saw a small figure standing not far behind him.","The vine had shot out from the palm of her right hand!","Hua Bai slowly landed on the ground.","Hua Ye was about to go to him when a pained groan suddenly rang out.","He turned sharply and saw Aunt Long’s body tightly wrapped in countless green leaves.","The leaves were tightening, as if trying to crush her to death.","Aunt Long’s face visibly contorted in pain.","The axe had fallen to the ground at some point.","At that moment, Aunt Long was like a fish on the chopping block, completely defenseless.","Seeing this, the others who had been knocked down earlier quickly got up and tried to save her.","But before they could get close, they were swatted away by the flower’s large leaves.","Two of them even coughed up blood and passed out on the spot.","Hua Ye gritted his teeth, forcing himself to stand.","His eyes were filled with determination as he tried to summon venom to attack the flower.","But instead of venom, he coughed up blood.","\"Go...! Don’t... don’t worry about me!\"","Aunt Long struggled to speak, using all her strength to shout.","\"No! You can’t die!\"","Hua Ye wiped away his tears and roared in defiance.","Aunt Long had saved many people, including him and his brother.","If it weren’t for her, many would have already died.","She had led the police team to pull them from the brink of death and brought them to this mountain.","Even in such danger, Aunt Long had risked her own life to save everyone, choosing to move against the flow without hesitation.","She had given so many people hope. He couldn’t just stand by and watch her die!","With a surge of determination, Hua Ye ran toward where Aunt Long’s axe had fallen."]},{"number":263,"title":"Chapter 263: How about you follow me instead","paragraphs":["Just as his hand was about to touch the axe, a tremendous force of suction struck him.","His pupils trembled.","This sensation was familiar; he knew exactly what it was.","Earlier, Hua Bai had been sucked in by it just like this.","And once fully swallowed by it...","His eyes darkened, and with the last of his strength, he gripped the axe.","He thought to himself, even if I die, I’ll chop down this cursed flower!","He didn’t know that his determination caught Yun Xiaoxiao’s attention, making her glance at him twice.","Just as he was about to be pulled in, a blazing inferno surged forward.","The cave was instantly illuminated by the flames, and the temperature rose several degrees.","The fire condensed into a fiery arrow, shooting straight toward the trumpet flower.","As the flames approached, the flower’s stem visibly trembled.","It immediately ceased its attack on the leaves, and even the petals that had wrapped around Aunt Long loosened.","Aunt Long fell from mid-air.","Fortunately, a cloud of black mist enveloped her, safely delivering her to Hua Ye’s side.","“Aunt Long, are you alright?” Hua Ye quickly asked.","Aunt Long shook her head, coughing uncomfortably a few times.","Then, she looked up in astonishment at Yun Xiaoxiao, who was battling the trumpet flower.","If she hadn’t seen it with her own eyes, she would never have believed that a child just a few years old could be so powerful!","Such a small body, yet it unleashed an immense energy.","Her moves came one after another, dazzling to the eye.","The mutated trumpet flower wasn’t about to back down either; its body suddenly doubled in size.","Though wood is naturally afraid of fire, it used its advantage in the underground river to evade the flames, retreating into the water like a coward.","Then, stealthily, it extended its green stems from the corners of the riverbed, swiftly attacking Yun Xiaoxiao.","Just as those stems were about to entangle her, Yun Xiaoxiao leaped into the air, hovering above the underground river.","She brought her palms together, summoning a massive storm, and hurled it fiercely into the river.","The storm churned the water, creating swirling eddies that dug deeper and deeper.","When she caught sight of the pink hue at the center of the vortex, Yun Xiaoxiao’s lips curled into a faint smile.","In the next moment, she drew Lord Slasher, flipped upside down, and plunged downward, aiming straight for that pink spot.","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao’s confidence, Ling Jing chose not to intervene.","He knew Yun Xiaoxiao had a strong fighting spirit.","She didn’t like others interfering during her battles.","So he decided to... support her with his thoughts.","A strange sound emerged from the riverbed.","The next moment, an unidentified object flew out from the center of the massive vortex, landing heavily on the ground.","Hua Ye, Aunt Long, and the others looked over in confusion, only for their eyes to widen in shock.","Wasn’t that... the “corpse” of the trumpet flower?!","She had actually defeated this terrifying flower in such a short time?!","Now, the once-mighty mutated trumpet flower, which had turned the entire cave upside down, lay weakly on the ground.","Its entire body was soaked, and a large puddle of water surrounded it.","If it weren’t for the flower’s faint, labored pulsations, everyone would have thought it was already dead.","Yun Xiaoxiao flew down from the river and approached the trumpet flower, ready to finish it off with a single strike. But suddenly, the flower stretched toward her.","“Be careful!”","“Watch out!”","Aunt Long and Hua Ye shouted in unison.","Ling Jing also rushed over but stopped midway.","Because...","The flower actually nuzzled Yun Xiaoxiao’s arm in a strangely human-like manner.","It was almost as if it was... acting coquettish...","The group was utterly dumbfounded.","The same flower that had just been killing without mercy was now acting cute?","This wasn’t some TV drama!","It was too absurd!","If someone had told them this story, they would never have believed it, no matter what.","But it was happening right before their eyes.","No matter how many times they rubbed their eyes, the scene remained the same.","They had no choice but to believe it.","Yun Xiaoxiao, who was about to deliver the final blow, also froze.","What... is going on?","Though surprised, she didn’t let her guard down.","This mutated trumpet flower clearly had human-like intelligence. If it was pretending to be weak to trick her, she’d be in serious trouble.","She disdainfully pushed it away with the back of her blade.","“Don’t try that. You’ve taken lives. You can only...”","Before she could say “die,” the trumpet flower suddenly swelled up.","She tensed, only to see a person being spat out from the flower.","Then, another.","“It’s Old Zhang and Hua Zi!”","One of Aunt Long’s companions spotted them immediately.","He was the closest and scrambled over, checking their breathing with his hand.","A look of sheer joy spread across his face.","“They’re alive!”","Hearing this, everyone’s expressions softened.","They had truly thought these two were already dead.","Now, knowing they were alive, Aunt Long and the others couldn’t contain their relief.","Yun Xiaoxiao also raised an eyebrow in surprise.","The next moment, she felt something nudging her.","She looked down at the fawning trumpet flower and couldn’t help but smirk.","She couldn’t understand why it was acting so submissive when she was about to kill it.","Was it... a masochist?","“You want to follow me?” Yun Xiaoxiao asked.","The trumpet flower immediately nodded its blossom, making its intentions clear.","“Why?” Yun Xiaoxiao frowned.","The flower tilted its head, unable to answer.","Well, it couldn’t speak...","Seeing how fearful the others still were of the trumpet flower, Yun Xiaoxiao decided to take it with her.","The flower had now shrunk back to its normal size.","It must have enlarged itself earlier to devour people.","Yun Xiaoxiao casually stuffed it into her small backpack.","Of course, that was just for show. The moment she zipped it up, she had already stored it in her spatial dimension, placing it in the spiritual spring water.","“Won’t it... suffocate in there?”","A man who had been injured earlier and was still spitting blood glanced curiously at Yun Xiaoxiao’s backpack.","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled sweetly. “Will it? I’ll check later.”","The man’s lips twitched.","Is that... even possible?","But since the trumpet flower had nearly killed them and their companions, its death wouldn’t be their concern.","“Thank you.”","Suddenly, a somewhat awkward voice of gratitude rang out.","It was Hua Ye.","He looked at Yun Xiaoxiao, a bit embarrassed.","Previously, his attitude toward Yun Xiaoxiao and her group hadn’t been the best, yet they had saved them without holding a grudge.","“If you really want to thank me, how about... you join me?”","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled, her eyes curved like crescents, radiating innocence."]},{"number":264,"title":"Chapter 264: Yun Xiaoxiao's 'Three No-Raise' Rules","paragraphs":["The Hua brothers, Aunt Long, and her dozens of subordinates were either highly skilled or possessed supernatural abilities. If they could truly recruit these individuals, the combat strength of the base would increase significantly. Although the base currently had a considerable number of people, there were not many with supernatural abilities. From a long-term development perspective, gathering more capable individuals was imperative.","“With you?”","Hua Ye’s eyes carried a trace of doubt. He recognized the two words individually, but when put together, he found them somewhat incomprehensible.","“That’s right.”","Yun Xiaoxiao pursed her lips and took out a phone from her bag. Inside was footage she had recorded of Yun City.","“Look, this is our base. If you’re willing, we’d be delighted to have you join us.”","The frames played one by one... There was Grandma Niu and others smiling as they wiped sweat amidst the flowers, Feng Jin and his team laboring in the fields, workers diligently doing their jobs, the bustling scenes of people shopping, and everyone chatting and laughing while eating in the cafeteria. There were even members of the guard team training under the sunset, sweat pouring down their faces...","Yun Xiaoxiao had even used drone footage to capture the entirety of Yun City.","It was practically a promotional video.","The effect, of course, was astonishing.","Hua Ye, Aunt Long, and the others were left dumbfounded, their emotions unable to settle for a long time.","“Is this all real?”","One of them murmured in disbelief.","“They’re not only eating meat heartily but even drinking beverages and leisurely shopping. This can’t be computer-generated, can it?”","It wasn’t that they didn’t want to believe it; it was just impossible to imagine such a “paradise on earth” existing after the apocalypse.","These scenes might have been ordinary before the apocalypse.","But in the post-apocalyptic world, they were anything but ordinary.","“Rest assured, what you’re seeing is all real,” Ling Jing lazily curled his lips.","He knew Yun Xiaoxiao wanted to recruit people, so naturally, he wanted to help.","It would be good to have more people assisting this little one, as his own health was deteriorating.","Perhaps, soon, it would be time for him to take his leave.","His gaze darkened slightly.","But Yun Xiaoxiao had heard all his thoughts.","She slowly looked up, frowning subtly.","However, her thoughts were interrupted by Aunt Long in the next moment.","“Little girl, thank you for saving us earlier.","The place in your video is indeed very appealing.","But I have two concerns.”","“Please, go ahead.”","“Do you only want a portion of us, or everyone?” Aunt Long asked with some worry.","Yun Xiaoxiao had saved them, and they owed her a debt of gratitude.","But if they were to abandon the others and leave just like that, her conscience would be uneasy.","She wasn’t sure if Yun Xiaoxiao only wanted capable individuals like Hua Ye or if she would also accept ordinary people without any combat abilities.","After all, Yun Xiaoxiao and her group were not only powerful but also seemed to be actively hunting zombies.","She feared Yun Xiaoxiao might prioritize ability above all else.","Understanding her concerns, Yun Xiaoxiao couldn’t help but smile. “I can’t guarantee that, as our base has a ‘three no-support’ rule.”","“Three no-support?”","“Yes, we don’t support the useless, the wicked, or the idle.”","“So, if I’m to take them in, they’ll have to pass an interview. Only those who qualify can come along.”","Aunt Long nodded in understanding.","She even felt a bit of admiration for Yun Xiaoxiao.","At such a young age, her mind was already so meticulous—truly remarkable.","She also knew that Yun Xiaoxiao’s reasoning was sound.","After all, the three types of people she mentioned would indeed eat away at the base like parasites.","But she was curious about how Yun Xiaoxiao would conduct the interviews.","“And your second concern?” Yun Xiaoxiao asked.","Aunt Long spoke frankly, “I don’t know how far your base is from here. We don’t have vehicles, so getting there would be quite difficult.”","“Don’t worry about that,” Yun Xiaoxiao said with a calm smile. “Someone will come to pick you up.”","“Pick us up?” Aunt Long was surprised.","“Yes, in a few days.”","With that, Aunt Long had no more concerns.","At that moment, Hua Ye exclaimed excitedly.","“Hua Bai, you’re awake!”","Gone was his previous composure; now he exuded a more youthful energy.","“Cough, cough, cough...”","Hua Bai coughed a few times and slowly opened his eyes.","His gaze was dazed, as if he didn’t know what year it was.","But soon, he regained his senses.","“What about the man-eating flower?!” he asked with worry in his eyes.","Hua Ye helped him sit up. “The flower has...”","He glanced at Yun Xiaoxiao. “...been dealt with. Don’t worry. How are you? Are you okay?”","“I’m fine, cough, cough, cough...”","Hua Ye: ......","“Idiot! If you’re hurt, just say it! Stop pretending to be strong!”","“I seem to remember someone calling me ‘brother’ before I passed out,” Hua Bai raised an eyebrow.","Hua Ye immediately became uncomfortable and retorted, “No, you must’ve misheard.”","“Really?”","“Yes!” Hua Ye gritted his teeth.","Hua Bai shrugged indifferently. “Alright, if you say so.”","“It’s not just me saying it—it’s the truth!”","“Oh~”","Hua Ye: !!!","Watching the two bicker, Aunt Long couldn’t help but chuckle.","Soon after, the group made their way out of the cave.","Since two others were still unconscious, Hua Ye and another man carried them on their backs.","Zheng Yuner and Zheng Xin'er, who had been waiting outside, finally breathed a sigh of relief upon seeing Yun Xiaoxiao and Ling Jing unharmed.","The sounds of the intense battle inside had been alarming, and if they hadn’t faintly heard Yun Xiaoxiao’s voice, they might have rushed in.","After exchanging a few words, everyone headed toward the cave entrance.","On the way, Aunt Long briefly explained their situation.","She was the leader of the special operations unit at the Danhong County Police Station. At the beginning of the apocalypse, she had sensed something was wrong.","However, the higher-ups at the time hadn’t realized the severity of the situation, treating those who had turned into zombies as rioters.","But as things spiraled out of control, Aunt Long, defying orders, began evacuating people with her team.","Yet, she had underestimated the speed of the virus’s spread.","Just as they had finished relocating the first group and were about to return for their families and friends, the virus erupted across the entire county.","Zombies ran rampant, biting anyone in sight.","The county quickly turned into a living hell.","They did their best to save as many residents as possible, moving them to the mountains.","But their efforts were limited, and in the end, only about two thousand people were rescued.","Later, near the cave, a new outbreak occurred when someone who had gone out for supplies was bitten by a zombie but didn’t inform the others.","What was left of the original two thousand dwindled to just two or three hundred survivors.","Aunt Long only mentioned their families once at the beginning and never brought it up again.","Without needing to ask, Yun Xiaoxiao could guess.","They had likely wanted to find their families but, due to the urgency of the situation, never got the chance.","Their families were probably... no longer alive."]},{"number":265,"title":"Chapter 265: Cleaning House","paragraphs":["\"By the way, why did you come to our town, and why are you so determined to wipe out all the zombies here?\"","After finishing her own story, Aunt Long looked curiously at Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","Yun Xiaoxiao briefly explained Peng Shaowei's plan.","Aunt Long and the Hua Brothers were visibly shaken.","They seemed both shocked and intrigued by the audacity of the plan.","\"It sounds almost like a fairy tale, but upon closer thought, it makes sense,\" Aunt Long said after a few seconds of silence.","Then, she asked earnestly, \"Can I join?\"","As soon as she spoke, the Hua Brothers and a few others also expressed their desire to participate.","\"Don't worry, there will be opportunities, but before that, it’s better for you to return to the base and improve your abilities,\" Yun Xiaoxiao replied.","The Hua Brothers exchanged glances, their expressions tinged with disappointment.","They knew Yun Xiaoxiao was saying this out of concern for their safety, but the underlying reason was their lack of strength.","\"It’ll probably take a long time to improve our abilities,\" one of them muttered gloomily.","Yun Xiaoxiao chuckled lightly. \"Don’t worry, it won’t take long.\"","Everyone took this as words of comfort, but not long after, when their abilities surged dramatically, they realized her words hadn’t been empty reassurance.","Soon, the group arrived at the cave entrance.","\"They’re over there,\" Hua Bai pointed to a spot about two hundred meters to the right of the entrance.","A crowd had gathered there.","No one was sitting; everyone stood anxiously.","When they saw Aunt Long and the others, their expressions eased with relief.","\"By the way, Xiaoxiao, didn’t you say you wanted to conduct interviews? I’ll have them line up,\" Aunt Long said with a smile.","Yun Xiaoxiao shook her head. \"No need, I’ll just ask a few simple questions.\"","After so many rounds of selecting people, she had already gained experience, and with the enhancement of her mind-reading ability, she no longer needed to interrogate each person individually.","She asked a few simple questions, and she didn’t even need them to answer.","As soon as she finished asking, the answers would appear in their minds.","She scanned them one by one, and everything became clear.","Combined with her remarkable memory, after just a few questions, she singled out several individuals.","Aunt Long was stunned.","The people Yun Xiaoxiao had picked out were precisely those who were lazy, deceitful, and had bad habits!","She had long wanted to get rid of them but had never mustered the resolve.","She looked at Yun Xiaoxiao in shock.","How had she identified them so accurately with just a few questions?","And those people hadn’t even answered a single word!","It was... simply miraculous!","The singled-out individuals had no idea why they had been called out by a young girl.","They exchanged confused glances.","\"Why did you call us out?\"","A woman in her fifties looked at Yun Xiaoxiao with displeasure.","She had a feeling that being called out wasn’t a good thing.","To spare Yun Xiaoxiao from being put on the spot, Aunt Long immediately stepped in. \"From now on, you no longer belong here. Please leave immediately.\"","\"On what grounds?!\"","As soon as Aunt Long finished speaking, a scruffy-bearded man roared angrily.","The others also glared at Aunt Long indignantly.","Facing their accusatory stares, Aunt Long’s patience wore thin.","\"You want to know why? Then I’ll tell you right now.\"","She pointed at the bearded man. \"You’ve repeatedly taken advantage of young girls while they were asleep!\"","Every time he had been caught before, he had denied it.","Without direct evidence, they had only reprimanded him and let him go.","But now that Yun Xiaoxiao had directly pointed him out, Aunt Long had no choice but to believe that all those incidents had indeed been true.","Knowing the man would try to argue, Aunt Long ignored him and, before he could speak, pointed at the fifty-something woman.","\"You, as an elder, have been shamelessly lazy. At just over fifty, you’ve used your age as an excuse to avoid work, lying around all day, yet you’re the first to rush for food when it’s time to eat!\"","Then, she went on to expose the flaws of the others.","Her words cut deep, leaving them speechless.","Under the scrutinizing gazes of the crowd, the group shot Aunt Long a final glare before slinking away.","Yun Xiaoxiao watched them leave and looked up at Aunt Long. \"You can’t underestimate petty people. Even though they’ve left, they might hold a grudge and come back. It’s best to station some people at the cave entrance to guard against any mischief.\"","Although Mu Yang would arrive in a few days with supplies and could arrange for these people to leave, it was still better to be cautious.","After all, they would soon be leaving the town themselves and wouldn’t be able to protect the base.","They could only rely on themselves to stay vigilant.","Aunt Long nodded seriously.","Yun Xiaoxiao gave a few more brief instructions before heading down the mountain with Zheng Xin'er and the others.","Aunt Long also led her people back into the cave to tidy up.","Earlier, everyone had been focused on escaping, and the inside of the cave had been left in disarray.","\"Aunt Long, do you really think someone will come to take us away?\" Hua Bai asked.","Aunt Long looked in the direction where Yun Xiaoxiao had disappeared and smiled softly.","\"Yes, they will.\"","---","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others returned to the town, where Jiang Huai had already begun distributing crystal cores and supplies.","The supplies were mostly common food and daily necessities.","It was clear that everyone had voluntarily left behind items they thought they wouldn’t need, and the distribution was fair, with no objections from anyone.","Bases with space ability users had their ability users store the items.","Those without space ability users found a truck in the town to load the supplies.","Yun Xiaoxiao still chose not to reveal her space ability and instead found a truck.","Perhaps space ability users at this stage didn’t think much of exposing their abilities, believing that the team needed them.","Some might even flaunt it intentionally.","After all, compared to combat abilities, space abilities seemed somewhat limited.","They were only useful for storing items and nothing else.","If they didn’t show their value and seek protection from others, these space ability users might have already perished.","But what they didn’t realize was that this could one day lead to their downfall.","Especially in the later stages of the apocalypse, when food became increasingly scarce.","Space ability users would become prime targets for many.","Because once they were killed, everything in their space would be revealed.","Some might not dare to kill openly, but behind the scenes, it was a different story.","So exposing one’s space ability in front of strangers was extremely dangerous.","Yun Xiaoxiao wasn’t naive enough to make that mistake.","After everyone had organized their supplies, they continued on their journey."]},{"number":266,"title":"Chapter 266: The Method is Good, but the Difficulty is Too High","paragraphs":["However, no one noticed that shortly after the convoy left, a small figure disappeared from one of the vehicles.","That person was none other than Yun Xiaoxiao.","She had gone back to collect the supplies that others had discarded.","Things like heavy vases, ceramics, phones, and computers—items that others had deemed useless.","It didn’t matter if others didn’t want them; she wasn’t picky.","As long as she found them useful, she took them all.","In the following days, Yun Xiaoxiao and her team advanced triumphantly, conquering several small towns.","The number of villages and small factories they overran was countless.","Of course, during this time, they also rescued some survivors.","Some of them chose to join the zombie extermination force immediately.","Thus, a separate unit was formed specifically to recruit these stragglers.","The rest were properly settled by Jiang Huai, who arranged for them to stay in a plains town that had already been cleared of zombies.","Out of humanitarian concern, they were also left with some supplies.","“Tomorrow, we’ll attack Gong City. This afternoon, everyone should rest well and wait for the evolution serum and supplies from Yun City.”","After clearing a village of zombies, Jiang Huai ordered everyone to take a break.","Not far from them was a city that could truly be considered large.","It was nothing like the small town of Danhong County.","Although it wasn’t as big as Rong City, it was at least two-thirds its size.","The number of zombies inside was not to be underestimated.","This was going to be a tough battle, the first major challenge they had faced in many days.","So Jiang Huai wanted everyone, who had been in constant combat, to rest well and recharge.","That way, they could be in top condition for the battle tomorrow.","Moreover, today was the agreed-upon day for Yun City to deliver supplies.","Although they had collected a lot of supplies along the way, edible items were not particularly abundant.","Some places had already been looted, and some of the things they found had gone moldy or spoiled.","With so many people and the constant effort of killing zombies, their consumption was high, and food was naturally in demand.","So, in the end, what remained wasn’t much.","Therefore, in the early stages, supplies from Yun City were essential.","Most importantly, they needed the evolution serum to enhance their abilities!","With that, everyone set down their equipment and set up camp.","Yun Xiaoxiao and her team also lit a large bonfire.","The smoke rose into the sky like a small gray snake.","This was done to signal Mu Yang and his team, letting them know their exact location.","It had all been arranged in advance.","“Huh, it’s snowing?!”","“Oh, it really is! Brr~ it’s so cold~”","“Come on, let’s go get some extra clothes.”","Just after lunch, light snow began to fall from the sky.","Yun Xiaoxiao looked up, watching as scattered snowflakes drifted down, adding a sense of tranquility and chill to the world.","She reached out her hand and caught one of the snowflakes.","In no time, the crystal-clear snowflake melted in her small palm.","Yun Xiaoxiao furrowed her brows, a hint of seriousness crossing her face.","The weather had changed...","They had to speed up!","At that moment, the sound of helicopter rotors echoed from a distance.","“Brother Yang is here!”","Nie Yizhou excitedly looked toward the helicopters approaching.","After a while, the helicopters landed slowly.","Mu Yang stepped out of the first helicopter.","Yun Xiaoxiao and her team went over to greet him.","The doors of the other three helicopters also opened, and the guards began unloading the supplies as previously agreed.","At the same time, Jiang Huai and the leaders of other bases arrived.","They brought a large number of zombie crystals to exchange for the evolution serum.","Thus, the scene became bustling.","On one side, they counted the crystals, and on the other, they distributed the serum.","This went on for over an hour.","After all the bases had left satisfied with their evolution serum, Yun Xiaoxiao and her team finally had a chance to talk to Mu Yang.","Mu Yang said that everything at the base was fine.","Ci Wan had also returned to the base with the people from the farm.","Mu Yang had arranged accommodations for them and assigned jobs based on their skills and preferences.","Now everyone was settled.","Ci Wan and the others had originally planned to come, but Yun Xiaoxiao had already instructed them to stay behind.","They were to assist Mu Yang in maintaining order at the base and continue training the guards.","That’s why Ci Wan and the others hadn’t come this time.","After exchanging a few pleasantries, Mu Yang prepared to leave for Peng Shaowei’s location.","Yun Xiaoxiao also handed him a map she had drawn, asking him to pick up Aunt Long and the others on the way back.","Of course, they might not be able to take everyone in one trip.","Mu Yang would have to arrange that himself.","At the same time, Yun Xiaoxiao boarded one of the helicopters.","When she came back down, she was dragging two large black bags.","“Be safe on the road.”","Yun Xiaoxiao waved goodbye to Mu Yang with a smile.","Mu Yang glanced at the two black bags.","He didn’t recall those being on the helicopter...","But he didn’t ask. He knew Yun Xiaoxiao must have her reasons.","After waving farewell, he boarded the helicopter.","Once Mu Yang and his team had left, Jiang Huai sent someone to notify Yun Xiaoxiao and her team to attend a meeting.","It had been agreed earlier that they would discuss the plan for the attack on the city the next afternoon.","By the time Yun Xiaoxiao and her team arrived, the leaders of the other bases were already present.","The meeting was held in the village committee office.","After everyone was seated, Jiang Huai got straight to the point.","He asked everyone to share their thoughts.","“Leader Peng distributed a lot of explosives earlier, and we haven’t used them yet. I think this is the time to use them,” someone suggested immediately.","Others also voiced their opinions.","“Yes, I agree. The explosives should be used.","There must be a lot of zombies in Gong City, and there might even be many high-level mutated zombies.","If we continue clearing the streets one by one as before, I’m afraid the casualties will be heavy.”","“But once the explosives are used, they’re gone, and we don’t have many.","The city has so many areas—how can we be sure that using explosives will kill all the zombies?”","“Also, if we use explosives, won’t the supplies in the city be destroyed?","And if there are still survivors in the city, wouldn’t we be endangering their lives?”","Everyone debated fervently, voicing their concerns.","The main point of contention was whether or not to use explosives.","Just as the discussion reached a stalemate, a child’s voice chimed in.","“Why not lure the zombies out of the city and blow them up in one place?”","As soon as the words were spoken, Wang Dahai slapped his thigh.","“Right! That way, we won’t have to worry about wasting explosives or damaging supplies!”"]},{"number":267,"title":"Chapter 267: Drones Take the Stage, the Wind Rises and the Clouds Soar","paragraphs":["\"But what method can we use to lure the zombies out of the city, and who will be responsible for this task?\" Zheng Xin'er raised the crucial question.","The method was a good one, but the difficulty was undoubtedly immense.","Zombies aren’t obedient children who go wherever you tell them to go.","Moreover, who would dare take the risk of luring the zombies?","Just imagining the scene of driving at breakneck speed while being chased by tens of thousands of zombies is enough to make one’s legs tremble.","And how many people would it take to lure all the zombies from every street out of the city?","If they were to bomb the zombies, they would surely choose an open area to gather them all together and blow them up in one go.","That way, the bomb’s effect would be maximized, and nothing would go to waste.","So yes, the difficulty was no small matter.","Everyone had thought of these challenges, and thus they all frowned in silence.","After all, they didn’t know how to solve this most effectively.","Just then, Yun Xiaoxiao took out a plastic bag from behind her and leisurely pulled out a drone and a phone from inside.","She then opened another black bag.","A bloodied chicken leg was revealed, tied securely with a rope.","The rope ran through the center of the chicken leg, firmly in place.","With deft hands, Yun Xiaoxiao attached the chicken leg to the drone.","She then turned on the phone’s music and placed it into a mesh pouch, which she tied to the bottom of the drone.","Under her control, the drone slowly ascended.","The plane circled and soared above the village committee, the rousing music stirring the blood of the people.","“If we do this, do you think we can lure the zombies out of the city?”","A faint smile slowly appeared on Yun Xiaoxiao’s lips.","The others: !!!","Of course, there was no need to say it!","It would definitely work!","Zombies primarily rely on their hearing and sense of smell to move.","Wherever there’s noise and the scent of blood, they’ll head straight for it.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s trick was nothing short of brilliant.","By combining both elements, the zombies were bound to fall for it!","However...","They were puzzled—how did Yun Xiaoxiao’s phone still have power after so long in the post-apocalyptic world?","Only Zheng Xin'er, who had been to Yun City after it regained electricity, understood the reason.","Seeing the others’ shocked expressions, Zheng Xin'er felt an inexplicable sense of satisfaction.","She remembered how she, too, had been like a country bumpkin entering a grand palace, utterly amazed.","Thinking about it now, she found it amusing.","Now that so many others shared her astonishment, she felt a sense of balance.","Still, someone raised a concern.","“But with only one drone and one phone, it’s not enough, is it?”","“Don’t worry, Mu Yang just sent us a lot more—about twenty or so.”","Yun Xiaoxiao’s explanation clarified why she had suddenly produced the drone and phone.","The moment the snow began to fall, she knew they had to speed up their efforts to eliminate the zombies.","Because the cold wave might arrive soon.","They had to kill as many zombies as possible before the world froze over.","Once the ice set in, the entire world would become a vast expanse of white.","The zombies would be buried under layers of snow, making it extremely difficult to kill them.","First, you’d have to expend great effort to dig them out, and then kill them.","And there was no guarantee you’d even find them.","Moreover, by then, without extreme protective measures against the cold, people would freeze to death outside.","Let alone digging out and killing zombies.","It simply wasn’t feasible.","If they waited for the snow to melt before killing the zombies, the difficulty would increase severalfold.","Because while the zombies would be frozen under the snow, once thawed, their strength would rise significantly.","They would be far more formidable than before the freeze.","That’s why she came up with this plan.","Compared to killing them one by one, this method would be much faster.","“But is the battery life sufficient? Will it run out halfway through?” someone else asked, still skeptical.","Yun Xiaoxiao looked at the person and said, “The batteries are fully charged. Any other questions?”","The person quickly waved their hands. “...No, no more.”","For some reason, even though the other party was just a child, her smile made him feel uneasy.","The pressure she exuded was overwhelming.","Although Jiang Huai was the leader of the group,","truth be told, everyone was most wary of the people from Yun City.","Each of them was incredibly strong-willed and acted on their own whims, often disregarding reason.","Yet, at critical moments, these individuals played decisive roles.","It was impossible not to admire them.","Especially this little girl.","Despite her young age, her ideas were sharper than anyone else’s.","Many of her plans were unexpected, yet highly effective.","In the end, everyone unanimously decided to use Yun Xiaoxiao’s method.","To maximize the explosion’s impact, Jiang Huai urgently arranged for people to dig a large pit outside Gong City.","The others stayed at the camp, taking the evolution serum to enhance their abilities.","The night was exceptionally cold.","Yet everyone’s hearts burned with anticipation for the battle the next day.","The following morning,","everyone got up early and had breakfast.","“Pack up and get ready to move out!”","After breakfast, one of Jiang Huai’s subordinates picked up a loudspeaker and shouted.","Everyone quickly got to work, packing equipment and supplies into the vehicles.","The large group was soon ready to go, braving the snow and wind as they headed toward Gong City.","When they arrived outside the city, they saw a pit about ten meters deep.","This was what Nie Yizhou and the others had dug the previous afternoon.","Once the vehicles stopped, Yun Xiaoxiao and Lu Chen carried out the twenty-plus drones.","Everyone helped tie the phones and fresh meat to the drones.","Then, Yun Xiaoxiao selected twenty-five people and had them test-fly the drones.","She herself flew into Gong City to scout the area.","Meanwhile, Jiang Huai and his team began planting bombs in the pit.","Lu Chen and Wang Dahai led others in setting up barricades on both sides of the exit to prevent the zombies from scattering.","Thus, thousands of meters of earthen walls and metal barriers sprang up like mushrooms after the rain.","Eventually, they formed two massive, impenetrable barriers.","Once everything was ready, Yun Xiaoxiao and Nie Yizhou escorted the remaining twenty-four people to their designated locations.","These locations weren’t chosen randomly.","They were spots Yun Xiaoxiao had scouted earlier, ensuring they covered every major and minor street in Gong City.","This would make it more effective to lure the zombies using the drones.","At the sound of a sharp whistle, twenty-six blaring music tracks erupted simultaneously, echoing across the city.","At the same time, twenty-six drones ascended into the sky.","They soared like majestic eagles, cutting elegant arcs through the air.","The battle had officially begun!"]},{"number":268,"title":"Chapter 268: Yun Xiaoxiao Was Hugged","paragraphs":["The moment the drone took off, the zombies below raised their heads in unison.","Their pale, colorless faces twisted grotesquely as they let out earth-shaking roars.","They howled and thrashed wildly...","In the next second, the entire city of zombies began to move.","They darted out from streets and alleys of all sizes, chasing after the drone in the sky, screeching and snarling.","The thunderous sound of their footsteps seemed as if it would tear the entire city apart.","Some ran on the ground, some climbed walls, and others leaped into the air.","A few even smashed through windows from high-rise buildings, plummeting to the ground in unison.","As soon as they landed, they scrambled to their feet and sprinted madly.","Their momentum was overwhelming, unstoppable.","From above, it looked like countless streams converging into a main artery, all surging toward the city's entrance.","Many zombies were trampled to death by their own kind.","But they didn’t care in the slightest.","At that moment, all they knew was that something was making noise ahead, and the scent of blood was in the air. If they chased it down, they could feast.","They were starving...","Desperate to tear apart whatever was making that sound...","“Huh? What’s going on? The zombies outside seem to have gone crazy!”","At the far-right window on the fifth floor of a university laboratory building, a short-haired boy stood there, staring in shock at the zombies running wildly through the streets.","In the next moment, he grabbed the window ledge, pressed his feet against the wall, and climbed up like a gecko, scaling the building with all four limbs.","Before long, he returned to the window and leaped back into the room with ease.","“Hey, come take a look! The zombies have gone mad! They’re all running in the same direction!”","He excitedly ran to a corner of the room.","There, three young girls in white lab coats were focused on tinkering with a gun-like device, holding pliers and clamps in their hands.","As soon as the boy approached, a girl with a bright red high ponytail slapped the back of his head.","“Get out of here, you’re so noisy!”","Her action was rough, showing no mercy.","The boy immediately clutched his head and cried out, “Yang Meng, can’t you hit a little softer?”","“Call me ‘manly’ one more time and see what happens!”","The red-haired girl, Yang Meng, twisted her wrist, her threat unmistakable.","The boy quickly put on a flattering smile. “I won’t, I won’t. Yang Meng, you’re the most gentle and beautiful girl in the world, okay?”","“Ow!”","To his surprise, as soon as he finished speaking, Yang Meng punched him again.","“Hey, why are you hitting me even when I’m complimenting you?”","The boy looked aggrieved and began to defend himself.","The two immediately started trading blows in the room.","The other two girls glanced at them and then looked away.","They were used to scenes like this.","Hearing the commotion outside, the two walked over to the window.","“Wow, Chong Ming was right. The zombies really are acting strange,” said a girl with freckles, pushing up the thick black-framed glasses on her nose.","“Liu Xiaohui, didn’t your eyesight recover a long time ago? Why are you still wearing those ugly glasses?” asked a short-haired, tall girl with a crescent-shaped earring in her right ear, eyeing Liu Xiaohui’s glasses with disdain.","“Heh, I forgot,” Liu Xiaohui chuckled sheepishly. “But I’m so used to wearing them that I just leave them on.”","Just then, she suddenly gasped and pointed toward a tall building.","“Why is there a little kid over there?”","As soon as she spoke, the tall girl, Han Bing, followed her gaze.","Even Yang Meng and Chong Ming, who were still “sparring,” stopped and looked in that direction.","Chong Ming found it fascinating. “Hey, there really is a little girl!”","“Oh no, look over there! A big one is heading straight for her!” Liu Xiaohui exclaimed urgently.","The moment she finished speaking, Han Bing quickly turned and went to the research table, picking up a formidable-looking cannon.","Then, in three swift steps, she leaped onto the windowsill.","In the next second, her figure blurred as she moved at incredible speed, jumping from one high-rise building to another.","Yun Xiaoxiao, who was controlling the drone, suddenly heard a strange noise behind her.","She quickly turned around and saw a Level 3 mutated zombie climbing over the wall and landing on the rooftop where she stood.","A faint smile curled her lips.","A cute little thing had come to her doorstep.","Just as she was about to take action, she noticed a blurry figure rapidly approaching from a neighboring building.","It felt as if the person was running through the air.","But the speed was so fast that the figure was almost invisible.","Yun Xiaoxiao frowned. It was clear this person was coming for her.","Unable to tell if they were friend or foe, she decided to treat them as an enemy.","Yun Xiaoxiao prepared to eliminate the mysterious figure as soon as they got close.","But at that moment, the Scumbag Detection Panel popped up.","It showed that the person not only had no hostility toward her but also had a 60-point affinity.","Though not high, it at least proved they meant no harm.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s gathered energy dissipated somewhat.","But she didn’t let her guard down completely.","“Boom!”","The moment the figure appeared, a cannon blast instantly hit the Level 3 mutated zombie.","The once-ferocious zombie was instantly decapitated.","Yun Xiaoxiao stared in surprise at Han Bing, who now stood before her.","And at the black, unassuming cannon she held in one hand.","She had clearly noticed that this cannon was different from the usual ones.","Just as she was staring at the cannon with interest, she felt herself being pulled into a warm embrace.","“Little girl, it’s too dangerous here. I’ll take you to a safe place.”","With that, Han Bing swiftly carried Yun Xiaoxiao away.","Yun Xiaoxiao: ......","What just happened?","She was picked up?","And taken away?","In the blink of an eye, she found herself in a room filled with bottles, jars, scissors, pliers, wrenches, and other tools. It was clearly a research lab of some sort.","“Wow, this little girl is so cute up close! I just want to pinch her cheeks!”","A cheerful voice rang out.","In the next moment, a flash of red appeared in front of Yun Xiaoxiao.","Before she could react, a hand reached out and touched her face.","Yun Xiaoxiao: ......","Was she just molested?","Seeing Yang Meng about to pinch her again, Yun Xiaoxiao quickly broke free from Han Bing’s hold and jumped to the ground.","“Calm down, you’re scaring the little girl,” Chong Ming chided.","Yang Meng immediately kicked at him. “None of your business!”","Her demeanor was a far cry from the adoring, affectionate look she had given Yun Xiaoxiao earlier. Now she was a full-on hot-headed sister.","“Hah, missed me!” Chong Ming taunted as he dodged."]},{"number":269,"title":"Chapter 269: Brothers and Sisters, Want to See a Mushroom Cloud","paragraphs":["\"Didn’t kick you, did I?\"","Yang Meng narrowed her eyes, clenched her fist, and swung at Chong Ming.","Chong Ming dodged while pleading for mercy.","\"Not scared, are you? Those two are always like this, the classic love-hate duo.\"","Liu Xiaohui smiled, pushing up her thick glasses.","She then pulled out a crumpled candy from her pocket, unsure if it had gone bad.","\"Here, have this.\"","She couldn’t help but add a compliment.","\"You look just like a doll!\"","\"Thank you, sister. You’re very pretty too.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao thanked her politely, her dimples deepening.","\"Really?\"","Liu Xiaohui touched her face, instantly delighted.","It was the first time anyone had ever called her pretty!","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at the four of them. Though she was curious about many things, now wasn’t the time for chit-chat.","She had more pressing matters to attend to.","\"Sisters, I’ll catch up with you later. I have something to take care of.\"","\"Something to do? What is it?\"","Hearing this, Yang Xue immediately stopped her assault and ran over to Yun Xiaoxiao.","With a beaming smile, she asked, \"Need any help? I’m pretty good at beating people up.\"","Her voice, which had just been gruff and angry, instantly turned sweet and high-pitched when talking to Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"Crash!\"","At that moment, a glass window shattered.","Several mutated zombies crawled in.","They stared at the group like hungry wolves.","Han Bing quickly scooped Yun Xiaoxiao into her arms.","\"Little one, don’t be scared. We’ll protect you.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao’s lips twitched. She wanted to say she could protect herself.","But before she could speak, the zombies lunged at them.","The moment the zombies moved, Han Bing and the others sprang into action.","Yang Xue and Chong Ming were both skilled fighters with supernatural abilities.","Working together, they swiftly took down four of the mutated zombies.","Meanwhile, Han Bing wielded her massive cannon, blasting the remaining three to pieces.","Among the four, only Liu Xiaohui didn’t possess an offensive ability.","But when the zombies broke in, she showed no fear.","She simply stood quietly behind Han Bing, as if this were a familiar routine.","\"Xiaohui, that cannon you invented is seriously amazing!\"","Yang Xue gave Liu Xiaohui a thumbs-up in admiration.","Liu Xiaohui adjusted her glasses and smiled modestly.","\"It’s alright. It could still be improved.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, the entire building began to shake violently.","It felt like a sudden earthquake.","The group staggered, nearly losing their balance.","\"Holy crap, is this building about to collapse?!\"","Chong Ming stared at the heavily tilting structure, his eyes wide.","\"Hold on for a bit. I’ll take the little one and Xiaohui to that building over there!\"","Han Bing shouted, ready to carry Yun Xiaoxiao and Liu Xiaohui to safety.","\"Wait.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao quickly broke free from her grip.","In the next second, the group felt something pull at them.","Their heads spun.","When they regained consciousness, they found themselves back on the rooftop where Yun Xiaoxiao had been standing earlier!","The group: !!!","The building they had just been in had completely collapsed.","\"There were rumors on the forum that the contractor for our school’s lab building cut corners. I didn’t believe it!","But now it’s clear—it’s a total death trap!\"","Yang Xue fumed.","\"Look, all the other buildings are still standing, but our lab building collapsed.","If this had happened before the apocalypse, with students inside, how many would have died?!\"","After venting their frustration, the four noticed Yun Xiaoxiao nearby.","She stood at the edge of the rooftop, focused, holding something in her hands.","The group exchanged curious glances and leaned in to see what she was holding.","\"Is that... a drone controller?\"","Chong Ming tilted his head, muttering softly.","\"Don’t pretend you know what you’re talking about,\" Yang Xue snapped.","Chong Ming shot back, \"Who’s pretending? I’ve played with these before with my uncle. It’s definitely one—no, not just similar, it *is* one!\"","Just then, Liu Xiaohui pointed in a direction.","\"Look!\" she exclaimed.","The three looked up and saw over twenty drones hovering in the sky toward Gong City’s eastern gate.","Their eyes then fell on the horde of zombies rushing in that direction on the streets below.","Their expressions froze in shock.","\"Holy crap, are those drones luring the zombies?!\"","\"Seems... like it.\"","\"Then the little one is...\"","All four turned to Yun Xiaoxiao.","They were stunned.","Just who was this little girl?","Chong Ming poked Han Bing, whispering behind his hand,","\"I think you were a bit too quick to act. This little one might be even stronger than us.\"","Yang Xue rolled her eyes. \"Oh, shut it. Like we didn’t notice?!\"","Earlier, they hadn’t thought much about it.","But now, it was clear they’d made assumptions.","Seeing someone so young, they’d immediately assumed she needed protection.","But in this world, things could no longer be judged by conventional standards.","Age meant nothing.","Still, they were curious—where was Yun Xiaoxiao leading the zombies?","Seeing her focused expression, they wisely stayed quiet and didn’t disturb her.","Instead, they stood by and watched.","Yun Xiaoxiao could sense their thoughts.","After a while, she put away the controller and turned to the four with a smile.","\"Brothers and sisters, want to see a mushroom cloud?\"","Before they could process her words...","\"Boom! Boom! Boom!\"","A series of deafening explosions erupted.","Black smoke rose in rings over the eastern part of the city.","\"That’s...\"","The four stared in disbelief.","\"Little one, did you just lure all the zombies there and blow them up?!\"","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled leisurely. \"Yep.\"","\"But not just me—us.\"","The group ignored the second part of her sentence, focusing only on the first.","She really blew up the zombies?","Not just a few, but the entire city’s horde?!","How could a child do something like that?","No way!!!","As they stood in shock, the explosions continued for a full twenty minutes.","\"Want to go kill some zombies?\"","Once the explosions subsided, Yun Xiaoxiao turned to the four, inviting them enthusiastically.","Though many zombies had been wiped out,","there were surely stragglers left in the city.","If they were going to clean up, they couldn’t leave a single one behind.","The group: ......","Kill zombies?","Did they hear that right?","As they hesitated, they heard the sound of countless clashes coming from the eastern part of the city.","There were a lot of people fighting!","The four were utterly bewildered.","It felt like they’d just woken up to a world gone mad.","Before, they’d been avoiding zombies at all costs.","But now, this little girl and the people over there were boldly charging into the city to slaughter them!"]},{"number":270,"title":"Chapter 270: The Hostile Little Zombie","paragraphs":["The four of them stood frozen for a moment.","Until Yun Xiaoxiao vanished from the spot.","By the time they snapped out of it, a burst of intense flames erupted at the base of the building.","It was then they realized that Yun Xiaoxiao had already descended to the ground level to kill zombies.","Her formidable strength made them acutely aware that the little girl they thought needed protection was actually a powerhouse far more capable than any of them!","The decisiveness and precision with which she dispatched the zombies suggested she must have killed tens of thousands of them to hone such skills.","At that moment, their hearts were in turmoil.","They were both shocked and inspired by Yun Xiaoxiao’s fervor in killing zombies.","“I’m going too! I’ve never had a proper chance to kill zombies before.”","Yang Xue’s eyes gleamed with excitement.","“Yeah, I’m itching to give it a try too.”","Chong Ming chimed in, equally eager.","“Then let’s go,” Liu Xiaohui said, adjusting her glasses.","In the next instant, a pile of equipment appeared at their feet.","She smiled and said, “These are upgraded versions. Just channel your abilities into them, and the attack power will double.”","Yang Xue immediately bent down and picked up a peculiarly shaped gun.","“Xiaohui, you’re a genius inventor!”","Yang Xue was so thrilled she could have hugged and kissed Liu Xiaohui.","Despite her quiet and unassuming appearance, Liu Xiaohui was a fervent enthusiast of firearms and ammunition.","While others in the dormitory spent their time binge-watching shows and snacking, she preferred buying gun parts and assembling them herself.","She shared a dorm room with Liu Xiaohui and Han Bing.","When the zombie virus broke out at their school, it was Liu Xiaohui’s guns that enabled the three of them to escape their dormitory.","Though Yang Xue had grown up in a martial arts family and was skilled in combat, trying to escort two defenseless people from the eighth floor of a zombie-infested dormitory to the ground floor would have been an impossible task.","As soon as they left the dormitory building, they ran into Chong Ming, who had come looking for them.","The four of them then fled the school together.","But by then, the campus was in chaos.","Hordes of students-turned-zombies were lunging at them.","Forced into a corner, the four of them took refuge in a laboratory in the science building.","Fortunately, all of them had awakened supernatural abilities.","With their powers and Liu Xiaohui’s guns, they managed to survive in this brutal post-apocalyptic world.","Liu Xiaohui was a genius because her already sharp mind had evolved further after the apocalypse, and her vision had also improved, allowing her to see through objects.","Even tiny components inside a gun were visible to her.","This made the guns she developed increasingly powerful.","Not only did these guns amplify the attack power of those with abilities, but they also allowed ordinary people to fight zombies like those with supernatural powers.","Instead of firing bullets, these guns shot energy spheres condensed by those with abilities.","For example, if an electricity-based ability user channeled their power into a specially designed gun barrel, an ordinary person could fire it like a regular gun to attack zombies.","The effect would be several times stronger than that of a conventional firearm.","Most importantly, the guns were energy-efficient.","A single charge in the gun barrel could sustain over thirty shots.","For ordinary people, this meant they could fight like those with abilities.","Though not as powerful as true ability users, it was far better than facing zombies unarmed or with melee weapons.","After all, not everyone was a martial arts expert or a combat specialist.","Most people had no skills to speak of.","Under Han Bing’s protection, the four of them made it to the ground level.","“Little sister, we’re here to help.”","Yang Xue grinned as she rushed to Yun Xiaoxiao’s side and took down a zombie lunging at her.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s lips curved into a smile. “Great.”","With the four of them assisting her, Yun Xiaoxiao was unstoppable.","The remaining zombies on the street were quickly cleared.","Just as they were about to move to another street, a scream suddenly rang out from that direction.","Hearing it, Yun Xiaoxiao instantly teleported to the scene.","There, she saw a man being bitten on the thigh by a little boy, who had torn off a chunk of flesh.","The wound was gruesome, blood and mangled flesh everywhere.","Yun Xiaoxiao vaguely recognized the victim as one of Wang Dahai’s subordinates.","The man was screaming in agony.","The people around him rushed to his aid, attacking the little boy together.","“Roar!”","The boy suddenly threw his head back, and Yun Xiaoxiao caught a glimpse of his pale, lifeless face.","It was a child zombie!","It moved with incredible speed, dodging the others’ attacks and leaping onto the roof of a black car, where it stared fixedly at Yun Xiaoxiao.","Its gaze was unnerving.","It was as if Yun Xiaoxiao was its sworn enemy.","Even Yun Xiaoxiao expected it to attack her directly.","But to everyone’s surprise, it turned and fled in the next second.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s eyes darkened, and she immediately gave chase.","She couldn’t let it escape!","She was certain she had never seen it before, but the way it had looked at her made her deeply uncomfortable.","It felt as if there was some deep-seated animosity between them.","Clearly, this was a zombie that had developed intelligence.","The child zombie moved at an astonishing speed, its path erratic—darting into buildings one moment and disappearing into alleyways the next.","Yun Xiaoxiao pursued it relentlessly, attacking as she went.","The distance between them gradually closed.","Just as Yun Xiaoxiao was about to catch it, Wang Dahai’s son, Wang Qingdong, suddenly appeared from around a corner and collided with her.","Although Yun Xiaoxiao dodged him, she lost her chance to catch the zombie.","When she looked up again, the child zombie was gone.","“Bang!”","Yun Xiaoxiao angrily kicked Wang Qingdong, sending him sprawling.","“Ouch!”","Wang Qingdong had no idea what had just happened, but he found himself flat on the ground.","“Are you taking your grudges out on me, kid?”","He struggled to his feet and, seeing it was Yun Xiaoxiao, was instantly furious.","“You’re ugly.”","Yun Xiaoxiao left him with a scathing remark before vanishing.","Wang Qingdong: !!!","Who could understand his pain...","Ever since the conflict with Xiao Feng and the others, his father had sternly warned him to steer clear of anyone from Yun City.","He had taken his father’s advice to heart, making sure to avoid Yun Xiaoxiao and her group whenever he saw them.","If they went left, he stayed far to the right.","If they took the middle, he hugged the edges.","But this time, it wasn’t intentional.","He hadn’t meant to bump into her—it was just bad timing.","Yet she not only attacked him but also insulted him.","Life was unbearable...","As he lamented his misfortunes, a drooling zombie approached him.","The foul-smelling saliva nearly dripped onto him.","“Holy crap!”","Wang Qingdong scrambled to his feet.","“Get lost! You’re too disgusting to even get near me!”"]},{"number":271,"title":"Chapter 271: The Arrival of Extreme Cold Weather","paragraphs":["Yun Xiaoxiao searched around but still couldn’t find any trace of the little zombie.","In the end, she had no choice but to give up.","However, her heart felt as if a fishbone was stuck in it.","Although the little zombie wasn’t particularly powerful yet, intelligent zombies are potential candidates to become zombie kings.","Once it grows stronger, it would be much harder to deal with.","Most importantly, this zombie harbored hostility towards her.","Though she had no idea where this hostility came from.","With a heavy heart, Yun Xiaoxiao returned to where Han Bing and the others were.","Since they had used bombs to kill a large number of zombies earlier, the remaining zombies in the city weren’t too numerous.","In total, there were probably only about thirty thousand left.","By evening, the entire city had been cleared of zombies.","This time, the number of casualties was the lowest.","Apart from Han Bing and her three companions, there were over a thousand other survivors scattered throughout the city.","When they heard that all the zombies in the city had been wiped out, they were overjoyed.","Originally, Jiang Huai had planned to arrange for them to be sent to a safe location the next day.","Thinking that with more people, they could support each other better.","But they were unwilling.","Over forty people chose to join the zombie-slaying army.","The rest decided to stay in the city.","Jiang Huai naturally respected their wishes.","“Who are these?” Nie Yizhou asked, raising an eyebrow as he looked at Han Bing and the others following Yun Xiaoxiao.","Lu Chen and the others also turned their attention towards them.","“Hello, everyone! I’m Chong Ming, and this is Yang Xue, who has a temper that’s explosive.”","“Are you asking for a beating?!” Yang Xue immediately raised her fist upon hearing Chong Ming’s introduction.","Chong Ming quickly dodged to the side and pointed at Liu Xiaohui.","“This is our great inventor, Liu Xiaohui.”","He then looked at Han Bing, “This is...”","Before he could finish, Han Bing introduced herself.","“I’m Han Bing.”","Short and to the point.","“Hey, buddy, you’re really handsome!” Nie Yizhou complimented Han Bing.","Han Bing glanced at him coolly, “I’m a woman.”","Nie Yizhou: ......","Now that’s what you call awkward!","“Ahem... sis... sister, you’re really pretty.”","Nie Yizhou immediately corrected himself, scratching the back of his head sheepishly.","Xiao Feng, standing behind him, gave him a disdainful look, “Idiot.”","“Hey, Xiao Feng, who are you calling an idiot!”","He immediately hooked his arm around Xiao Feng’s neck.","Liu Xiaohui pushed up her thick glasses and let out a soft ‘hmm.’","“So, there’s a pair of bickering lovebirds here too.”","“Girl, you’ve got it wrong. There’s no love, only bickering.”","Nie Yizhou quickly retorted.","That night, Gong City, which had been desolate for a long time, became lively again.","To ease everyone’s fatigue and tension, Jiang Huai had someone organize a simple bonfire party.","Some told ghost stories, some sang at the top of their lungs, others tried to tell jokes but failed to make anyone laugh...","In the end, led by a few lively individuals, everyone sang some familiar songs together.","The atmosphere was electric, and many couldn’t help but laugh and cry at the same time.","They didn’t know why they were laughing or crying.","It was just that emotions ran high, and they needed to let it out.","Everyone gathered together, laughing and chatting, their enthusiasm undiminished even in the icy weather.","Seeing the joyful expressions around her, Yun Xiaoxiao also felt a sense of relief.","After the party, she found Liu Xiaohui and the others.","She shared her thoughts with them.","She felt that Liu Xiaohui’s talents shouldn’t be wasted.","Moreover, since Liu Xiaohui didn’t possess any offensive abilities, staying with the team would be quite dangerous.","The best solution was to send her back to the base to develop more powerful weapons.","Those that had already been invented could be mass-produced.","This way, more people could join the fight.","And the battle could be ended sooner.","This proposal received strong support from Liu Xiaohui.","But Han Bing and the others were worried about her going alone.","So, after some discussion, it was decided that Han Bing would accompany her back to Yun City.","Meanwhile, Yang Xue and Chong Ming, who were more combat-capable, would stay behind to join the fight.","Thus, when Mu Yang sent people to deliver evolution serum and supplies again, Han Bing and Liu Xiaohui boarded the helicopter back to the base.","For the next half month, everyone continued to fight the zombies.","They traversed countless territories and killed countless zombies.","Everyone’s strength improved significantly during this period.","The number of casualties in battle also decreased.","Compared to the beginning, there was undoubtedly a qualitative leap.","According to Peng Shaowei’s message, apart from the Northern Base, the Eastern and Southern Bases had also coordinated with major bases in their regions to start clearing out zombies.","Only the Central Base remained unresponsive.","Throughout this time, the only constant was the endless snowfall.","Since Gong City, the snow hadn’t stopped.","It fell day and night.","Fortunately, the snow wasn’t heavy, and much of it melted during the day.","However, it still caused significant obstacles to travel.","On the bright side, the snow also slowed down the zombies, making them more sluggish.","This brought some relief to everyone.","But on this particular day.","When everyone woke up, they noticed that the weather had changed again.","The light snow had turned into a heavy blizzard.","The snow fell thick and fast, blanketing the world in white.","After a whole night, the ground was covered in a thick layer of snow.","Two cars couldn’t even start due to the extreme cold.","Seeing the scene outside, Yun Xiaoxiao knew.","The extreme cold had begun.","The zombie-slaying campaign would have to be put on hold for now.","Sure enough, not long after, Jiang Huai called an emergency meeting with the leaders of the major bases.","“Everyone, this extreme weather is likely the precursor to the extreme cold that the anonymous source warned us about.","I’ve called you here to hear your thoughts.","While the weather has slowed down the zombies, which works in our favor, I’m concerned that if the snow continues or worsens, we might not even be able to find our way when we try to fight the zombies.","If we get stranded in the wilderness due to the snow, it would put everyone in grave danger.","So, my suggestion is that we all return to our respective bases with our people and supplies.","Let’s weather this extreme cold first.","After all, the zombies will be frozen and won’t be able to move around.","Once the snow melts, we can regroup and continue our mission.","What do you all think?”"]},{"number":272,"title":"Chapter 272: Deception","paragraphs":["As soon as Jiang Huai finished speaking, everyone began to chatter and discuss.","Wang Dahai was the first to stand up.","\"Brother Jiang Huai, I agree with you. Given the current weather conditions, it’s indeed not suitable to continue fighting the zombies.\"","Another person chimed in, \"That’s right. Besides, it’s been over a month since we’ve returned to our respective bases. We have no idea what’s going on there. It’s about time we head back.\"","While killing zombies was one thing, collecting supplies was another.","After all their efforts during this period, everyone had managed to secure a fair share of supplies.","If they used them sparingly, it would be enough to feed their base for a long time.","\"Exactly. Let’s wait until the weather warms up and the ice and snow melt before continuing.\"","\"Yeah, there’s no need to rush.\"","Zheng Xin'er shrugged. \"We’re fine either way. Whether we fight or go back, it doesn’t matter to us.\"","Everyone continued to voice their opinions, but the general consensus was to stop the fight and return home.","Noticing that only Yun Xiaoxiao and her group hadn’t spoken, Jiang Huai turned his gaze toward them.","\"What do our friends from Yun City think?\"","Lu Chen and Nie Yizhou remained silent.","When it came to making decisions, they followed one simple principle:","Whoever was the youngest would have the final say.","And that youngest person was, of course, their precious little sister, Yun Xiaoxiao.","So, Nie Yizhou naturally nudged Yun Xiaoxiao’s shoulder.","\"Kid, he’s calling you.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao: \"......\"","It didn’t seem like he had called her name, did he?","But since she did have something to say, she didn’t dwell on it.","She swept her gaze across the group and spoke up clearly.","\"Actually, I think it’s a bit of a waste to retreat and go home now.\"","\"How so?\" Jiang Huai asked.","His eyes were fixed on Yun Xiaoxiao, filled with anticipation.","Over the past few days, he had noticed that although this little girl didn’t speak much, whenever she did, her words were always impactful.","Despite her young age, her mind was sharper than many adults decades older than her.","It was impossible not to admire her.","So, her opinion was the one he most wanted to hear.","Yun Xiaoxiao didn’t beat around the bush and directly shared her thoughts.","\"Everyone knows that the colder the weather, the slower the zombies move.","Right now is the best time for us to kill them.","Although the weather seems harsh at the moment, it will take at least another month before it becomes completely unsuitable for travel.","Even if we factor in the heavy snowfall and the time it takes for everyone to return to their respective bases—be it a few days or even half a month—we still have at least half a month left to kill zombies.\"","She based this one-month estimate on her past-life experience, considering the worst-case scenario.","As the saying goes, you can’t become a big fatty in one bite.","A global ice age couldn’t happen overnight.","It was a gradual process.","And this process was like a big loophole that they could take advantage of.","\"Little girl, how do you know it’s a month and not half a month or even sooner?\" someone asked.","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at the person and spoke with an air of mystery.","\"Of course, it’s based on the thickness of the snow and my observations of the weather.\"","\"You can predict the weather?\" the person exclaimed in surprise.","Yun Xiaoxiao touched her chin. \"You could say that.\"","She couldn’t very well tell them it was based on her memories from her past life.","That would either get her labeled as a lunatic or a monster.","To avoid further discussion on the topic, she deftly shifted the conversation.","\"Besides, haven’t you noticed that this snow isn’t ordinary?","During the time it’s been snowing, the zombies seem to be evolving faster.\"","She wasn’t making this up.","It was just that the change wasn’t very noticeable yet, and most people wouldn’t have picked up on it.","If it weren’t for her past-life memories, she wouldn’t have noticed such a subtle difference either.","In her past life, after the ice melted, the zombies had indeed become much stronger than before.","Their resistance to damage and their mutation levels had evolved significantly.","She brought this up because people tended to believe in the unknown rather than dismiss it.","Sure enough, as soon as she said this, everyone’s expressions changed.","\"Really? I haven’t been paying much attention.\"","\"I think so too. The zombies do seem to be getting stronger.\"","\"Yeah, I’ve noticed that as well.\"","Listening to the murmurs, Yun Xiaoxiao pursed her lips slightly.","\"So, none of us can guarantee that by the time the ice and snow melt, the zombies won’t have quietly evolved to a point where we can no longer handle them.","While we may not be able to kill all the zombies before the extreme cold sets in, we can do our best to kill as many as possible.","That way, when the weather warms up, we won’t be too overwhelmed.\"","Her words made many people nod in agreement, finding her reasoning sound.","Jiang Huai smiled knowingly.","He had expected nothing less from this little girl. She always had unique insights.","Wang Dahai immediately stood up.","\"Brother Jiang Huai, I think what little Xiaoxiao said makes sense. Let’s stay and kill more zombies.\"","After speaking, he turned to Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"By the way, if our base runs out of food later, can we still use crystal cores to buy supplies?\"","As soon as he asked, everyone else also looked at Yun Xiaoxiao.","This was something they were all concerned about.","After all, the strange weather was undeniable.","Winter hadn’t even officially begun, yet the snow was already this heavy.","No one knew how long this bizarre weather would last.","Although they had collected some supplies, there was no guarantee it would be enough.","Moreover, they weren’t sure how much stock Yun City still had.","They’d already sold so much—was there any left?","Under everyone’s expectant gazes, Yun Xiaoxiao’s lips curved into a smile.","\"Of course, you can.\"","Back at the base, both the farms and the livestock pens had been equipped with cold-proof measures.","Not only had they built shelters, but they had also installed air conditioning and dug large holes around them specifically for burning charcoal.","As a result, neither the crops nor the livestock would be affected by the extreme cold.","Besides, in her space, the vegetables, fruits, and livestock raised by Bai had multiplied so much due to the time difference between the inside and outside of the space that they couldn’t finish them all.","Even supplying all the western bases with food for several years wouldn’t be a problem.","What she lacked wasn’t food or supplies—it was crystal cores.","With Yun Xiaoxiao’s assurance, everyone’s spirits lifted instantly.","\"Let’s go, time to kill more zombies!\"","\"That’s right, let’s put in more effort and kill as many zombies as we can before winter sets in.\"","\"Hahaha, you’re missing your wife, aren’t you?\"","\"Get lost! I’m still a virgin bachelor!\"","During this time together, everyone had unknowingly developed a sense of camaraderie.","Compared to the initial awkwardness, they had all grown much closer.","Now, they joked around without reservation.","After all, they had been through life-and-death situations together."]},{"number":273,"title":"Chapter 273: The Big Surprise","paragraphs":["\"Everyone, hold on. I have one more thing to say.\"","Just as everyone was filled with enthusiasm, Yun Xiaoxiao spoke up again.","Everyone stopped and turned to look at her.","\"Little sister, go ahead. What is it?\"","A female base leader in her thirties smiled warmly at Yun Xiaoxiao.","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded and continued, \"Here’s the thing. Since time is limited, we can abandon some smaller villages or towns and focus our efforts on attacking larger cities.","First, larger cities have more zombies, which will save us a lot of time traveling and searching for them.","Second, larger cities have more high-level zombies, and there’s a greater chance of them evolving into even more powerful ones.","If we eliminate them now, even if the snow covers everything later, we won’t have to worry about facing too many uncontrollable mutated zombies.\"","\"Little sister, what’s going on in that brain of yours? How do you come up with so many ideas?\"","The female base leader teased with a smile, her affection for Yun Xiaoxiao evident.","\"Actually, I was just thinking the same thing, but I didn’t get a chance to say it yet,\" Wang Qingdong muttered under his breath.","But the next second, he received a sharp smack on the head from his father, Wang Dahai.","\"You thought of it? With that brain of mush? You’d better think twice before lying!\"","\"Dad, am I really your son? How can you talk about me like that?\" Wang Qingdong complained, looking aggrieved.","Wang Dahai snorted, \"I wish you weren’t my son.\"","Wang Qingdong: \"...\"","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at the horizon and smiled meaningfully.","\"Later, there’s going to be a big surprise.\"","Her mention of a \"big surprise\" immediately perked everyone up.","Just as the large team was braving the snowstorm to head to the nearest big city, they heard a familiar roaring sound overhead.","\"It’s the evolution serum and supplies from Yun City!\"","Someone exclaimed, looking up at the sky.","Every time supplies arrived, it meant everyone could enjoy a feast.","But this time, in addition to the familiar helicopters, there were more than a dozen other helicopters of different models following behind.","\"Why are there so many helicopters?\"","\"Are they all from Yun City?\"","\"I seriously suspect they own an airport.\"","Everyone looked up at the sky, curious.","Soon, the helicopters landed nearby.","The doors opened, and a stream of people jumped out.","\"It’s Ci Wan and the others!\" Nie Yizhou excitedly patted Xiao Feng.","Xiao Feng rolled his eyes, \"I can see that, I’m not blind!\"","He moved closer to Lu Chen, distancing himself from the overly excited Nie Yizhou.","This time, not only did Ci Wan, Sun Xiaoming, and Wei Qian come, but Lei Ming’s companions also arrived.","Others included Han Bing, Liu Xiaohui, the twin brothers, Aunt Long and some of her subordinates, Qin Zhi, Fat Uncle, Nan Yi, and more.","As soon as they landed, Liu Xiaohui waved her hand.","In the next moment, a large number of strangely shaped guns, cannons, and crates of bombs appeared out of thin air on the snowy ground.","After Liu Xiaohui demonstrated how to use the guns, everyone finally understood what Yun Xiaoxiao meant by the \"big surprise.\"","Not only had Yun City sent so many reinforcements, but they had also brought such powerful weapons and bombs!","Everyone was instantly energized, their excitement palpable.","They couldn’t wait to reach their destination and get to work.","Yun Xiaoxiao, however, wasn’t surprised at all.","When Mu Yang had delivered supplies last time, he had told her about it.","A while ago, while Ci Wan was leading a team to kill zombies, they had accidentally discovered an underground black factory.","It was filled with explosives.","Lei Ming’s team had also managed to find some helicopters and bring them back.","Liu Xiaohui had overseen the production of many guns.","So, Yun Xiaoxiao had asked Mu Yang to bring these guns, bombs, and the base’s superhumans this time.","She wanted to end the battle as quickly as possible.","Previously, only she, Lu Chen, and a few others had come from Yun City because the base still needed people to guard it.","But after so much time, the base’s guards had improved significantly.","Now, with the superhuman guns Liu Xiaoxiao had made, even ordinary guards could handle the task of protecting the base.","Given the special circumstances, Ci Wan and the others could now join the mission.","What Yun Xiaoxiao hadn’t expected was that the snowstorm had arrived even sooner than she had anticipated.","This time, Yun Xiaoxiao was unusually generous, offering the guns and bombs without asking for anything in return.","Of course, the guns were only loaned out and would be reclaimed after use.","Her generosity was simply a way to kill more zombies and collect more crystal cores.","She had also shared her plans with Jiang Huai and asked Mu Yang to pass the message to Peng Shaowei when he delivered supplies.","She had also sent some guns and bombs with Mu Yang.","If Peng Shaowei agreed to continue killing zombies, they would leave the supplies with him.","After Mu Yang and his team left, Yun Xiaoxiao looked at the helicopters still parked nearby.","She walked over to Jiang Huai.","\"I’m planning to take some people and head to another city.\"","Strangely, Jiang Huai didn’t seem surprised at all.","It was as if he had expected Yun Xiaoxiao to make this decision.","He pulled out a map.","\"Are you planning to go to Yi City?\"","He pointed to a small dot on the map.","Yun Xiaoxiao pursed her lips, \"Exactly.\"","Their original plan was to attack a place called Ya City.","To the southwest of Ya City was another similarly sized city called Yi City.","Yun Xiaoxiao pointed to a few other dots on the map.","\"I’ll take my team to Yi City first, then follow this long route to attack Liang City and Ren City.","You’ll take this shorter route and attack Ya City, Da City, and An City.\"","She had chosen the longer route because the helicopters were fast and wouldn’t need to take detours.","\"If everything goes smoothly, we’ll meet up with Base Leader Peng and his team in Rong City in about twelve or thirteen days.","Then, we’ll launch a joint attack on Rong City.\"","Rong City was the largest city in the western region, teeming with countless zombies.","If they could take it down, it would eliminate a major threat for the survivors in the western region.","\"You’re not planning to take on three cities with just your team, are you?\"","Jiang Huai opened his mouth to speak.","Although he knew Yun Xiaoxiao and her team were incredibly capable, Yun City only had about forty people in total.","Was it realistic to think such a small group could wipe out the zombies in three entire cities?","Yun Xiaoxiao, however, smiled and said, \"That’s right. Special circumstances call for special measures. Besides, how will we know if we don’t try?\"","\"Why don’t you take some more people with you?\"","Jiang Huai was still a bit worried.","Yun Xiaoxiao pointed at the helicopters and chuckled helplessly.","\"There’s not enough room for more people.\""]},{"number":274,"title":"Chapter 274: Attack on Yicheng","paragraphs":["Finally, the entire team watched as the helicopter departed.","The two groups headed towards their respective destinations.","Since the helicopter could travel directly without detours, it saved a significant amount of time on the road.","In less than fifty minutes, they arrived at their destination.","Yi City.","It was located at the confluence of three major rivers, with a vast bamboo forest to the northwest.","From a distance, the city looked like it was situated on an ink painting, breathtakingly beautiful.","But upon closer inspection, one could see the swarming heads of zombies below.","It resembled a massive man-eating den, just waiting for people to walk into its trap.","Yun Xiaoxiao and her team hovered above the city, thoroughly observing its layout.","Then, they landed on a large open area in the western part of the city.","Yun Xiaoxiao instructed Nie Yizhou to take some people and dig a pit.","Nie Yizhou was puzzled, \"But kid, we don’t have any drones left. How are we going to lure the zombies out of the city?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao had already sent half of the drones to Peng Shaowei’s side, delivered by Mu Yang.","Along with the drones, some phones and power banks were also sent over.","The remaining half was left with Jiang Huai and his team.","So, they didn’t have a single drone left with them.","\"Don’t worry, even without drones, the zombies will obediently leave the city,\" Yun Xiaoxiao said with a mischievous wink.","\"Do you have another brilliant idea?\" Nie Yizhou asked excitedly.","\"You’ll find out soon enough.\"","\"Alright, kid, you’ve learned to keep us in suspense,\" Nie Yizhou laughed and then led the group to a green lawn on the right side of the city gate road to start digging.","With the help of earth-based ability users, digging the pit wasn’t difficult.","Before long, a massive pit appeared.","It was as large as a football field, with a depth of at least fifty meters.","Nie Yizhou wiped the sweat from his forehead and rushed back to Yun Xiaoxiao, panting.","\"Kid, is it time to set up the explosives now?\"","Although he knew that half of the explosives had been sent to Peng Shaowei’s side and the other half left with Jiang Huai’s team, he assumed Yun Xiaoxiao must have hidden some in her space without telling anyone.","But to his surprise, Yun Xiaoxiao tilted her head and said, \"Explosives? We don’t have any.\"","Nie Yizhou: ???","\"Without explosives, how are we going to blow up the zombies?\"","Previously, it had always been a pit paired with explosives.","Lu Chen and the others were also confused.","The next moment, Yun Xiaoxiao started pulling out items from her space.","Huge oil barrels were neatly arranged in a row.","They stood tall and proud, like a group of soldiers, exuding an imposing aura.","\"What’s inside these?\" Hua Bai asked curiously.","\"Oil,\" Yun Xiaoxiao replied.","Hearing this, the expressions of the forty or so people present changed.","Lu Chen and the others were unaware of when Yun Xiaoxiao had collected such a thing.","Aunt Long, Han Bing, and the rest were equally astonished, not only because Yun Xiaoxiao was a spatial ability user but also because she had stockpiled so much oil.","Yun Xiaoxiao took out all the oil they would need.","She also placed several large speakers and a generator on the ground.","Then, she calmly scanned the group.","Seeing that everyone was shocked but no one harbored any ill intentions, she smiled faintly.","\"Everyone, please keep it a secret that I’m a spatial ability user. If I find out that this information has been leaked to outsiders, I won’t be happy. And if I’m not happy, the consequences will be severe,\" she said, half-jokingly and half-seriously.","If it weren’t for the special circumstances, she wouldn’t have revealed her spatial ability in front of so many people.","However, these people were all from her base and were bound by the system’s restrictions.","Any action that harmed her interests would be punished by the system.","Moreover, if she didn’t reveal her ability now, their efforts to take over the city would be severely limited.","Time was money, and time was life.","They couldn’t afford to waste any more of it.","After weighing the pros and cons, she decided to reveal her ability.","Besides, she could monitor their thoughts in real-time.","If she detected any malicious intent, she wouldn’t hesitate to eliminate the threat immediately!","\"Don’t worry, Sister Xiaoxiao, we’ll definitely keep this secret,\" Ci Wan was the first to pledge her loyalty.","\"That’s right, if anyone dares to spill the beans, I’ll be the first to object,\" Lei Ming added with a hearty laugh.","Everyone chimed in, expressing their commitment.","Only Lu Chen and Ling Jing remained silent.","There was no need for them to speak.","They treated Yun Xiaoxiao like a younger sister and would never do anything to harm her.","\"Of course, I trust all of you,\" Yun Xiaoxiao said with a sweet smile.","From her appearance, no one could guess that she had just been contemplating killing someone.","Next, everyone started pouring the oil from the barrels into the pit.","However, they didn’t pour all of it—only half was used, and the other half was kept in reserve.","The oil was mainly applied to the walls of the pit to ensure it would burn quickly.","Lu Chen and Ling Jing busied themselves with starting the generator and connecting the large speakers.","Meanwhile, Yun Xiaoxiao, Mu Yang, and a few other ability users went to set up the barrier walls.","Once everything was ready, Yun Xiaoxiao signaled everyone to cover their ears and then played a song on her phone.","The ten large speakers erupted in unison.","\"The great river flows eastward, the stars in the sky follow the Big Dipper, cough cough, follow the Big Dipper, life and death are sealed with a bowl of wine...\"","The deafening sound pierced the sky, and the ground seemed to tremble beneath their feet.","\"Roar!\"","A thunderous roar erupted from the city.","In the next moment, a series of footsteps echoed in unison.","It sounded like the charge of a thousand horses, overwhelming and heart-stopping.","Soon, the vanguard of zombies rushed out of the city at full speed.","\"They’re coming!\"","A glint of excitement flashed in Sun Xiaoming’s eyes.","Ci Wan and the others also showed eager expressions.","This was their first time participating in a zombie extermination battle.","When they had returned to the base from the farm, they learned that Yun Xiaoxiao and her team had already left.","They had wanted to join but had to stay behind to guard the base.","They had always felt a sense of regret about it.","Now that they finally had the chance to participate, they felt a mix of nervousness and excitement.","The zombies on the other side of the pit howled ferociously as they charged forward.","But they had no idea that a massive pit awaited them ahead.","One by one, the zombies tumbled into the pit.","They fell into the dark oil, covering themselves in it.","They kept trying to stand up but slipped repeatedly, some even being knocked down by the zombies falling on top of them.","More and more zombies surged forward.","The pit was gradually being filled.","As the number of incoming zombies dwindled and the pit was nearly full, Yun Xiaoxiao instructed the others to pour the remaining oil into the pit.","\"Alright, light it up!\"","She nodded to Xiao Feng and two others.","In the next moment, flames erupted around the pit.","The fire spread uncontrollably, crackling and roaring.","Soon, thick smoke billowed into the air.","A mix of oil fumes and the stench of decay filled the surroundings..."]},{"number":275,"title":"Chapter 275: Master Zhan, Where is Your Might and Your Aura","paragraphs":["The sky was ablaze with fire, and thick smoke filled the air.","It was like a massive pillar of flames, burning fiercely.","The zombies below let out continuous screams of agony.","Inside the city, zombies were still occasionally emerging.","Except for some intelligent mutated zombies, the others were like moths to a flame, leaping into the fiery pit.","Lei Ming and a few others were stationed here to hold the line, while the rest quickly made their way into the city.","\"Alright, alright, stop messing around, I’ll let you out now,\" Yun Xiaoxiao said with a sigh as she ran.","In the next moment, Little Cutie and Big Beauty appeared out of thin air on the ground.","\"Oh my god, a giant scorpion! And a huge tiger!\"","Chong Ming, who was following Yun Xiaoxiao, was startled and slammed on the brakes, his face filled with terror.","\"Where did these come from?!\"","The twin brothers, Hua Ye, quickly grabbed Hua Bai, who was about to crash into them.","\"Wow, such a majestic tiger!\"","Hua Bai didn’t mind being pulled back. Instead, he widened his eyes, full of curiosity.","\"This scorpion is huge too! I’ve never seen one this big before! Brother, look!\"","Hua Bai excitedly nudged Hua Ye.","Hua Ye rolled his eyes and pulled his hand back. \"Don’t call me ‘brother,’ you only came out a few minutes before me!\"","He gritted his teeth in annoyance. \"And do you even act like an older brother?!\"","\"What kind of creatures are these? They’re amazing!\"","Hua Bai wasn’t listening to him at all, instead muttering to himself, his eyes sparkling.","Others who hadn’t seen Little Cutie and Big Beauty before were equally shocked.","They had never seen such a massive scorpion and tiger!","Seeing everyone’s stunned expressions, Nie Yizhou felt a bit smug.","See? It wasn’t just him who got scared.","Being around Yun Xiaoxiao meant being prepared for these sudden surprises.","He had already been...","\"Holy crap, where did this giant trumpet flower come from?!\"","Nie Yizhou had just been thinking that he had gotten used to it.","But the next second, an enormous trumpet flower suddenly appeared in front of everyone.","Clearly, his training wasn’t complete.","He was still shocked!","The trumpet flower’s green leaves and vines swayed in the wind.","Its pink blossom was larger than a water vat.","It slowly turned and moved toward Yun Xiaoxiao.","Except for Ling Jing, Lu Chen and the others quickly stepped forward, worried that the flower might harm Yun Xiaoxiao.","But the next moment, they froze.","The flower actually nuzzled Yun Xiaoxiao’s shoulder in a very human-like manner.","It looked like it was acting coquettish.","Nie Yizhou and the others were utterly bewildered.","This flower... it’s become a spirit, hasn’t it?","Everything’s gone crazy, the world’s completely turned upside down.","Not only is the scorpion bigger than a person, the tiger’s twice its size, but even a trumpet flower can act cute!","They didn’t have time to be shocked for long, as zombies were already charging toward them.","Most of these zombies were intelligent mutated ones.","They hadn’t been lured by the earlier commotion.","Now, they were staring fiercely at Yun Xiaoxiao and the others, letting out frenzied roars.","\"Here we go, guys!\"","Sun Xiaoming shouted excitedly, rushing forward first.","The others quickly grabbed the guns and cannons invented by Liu Xiaohui and aimed them at the oncoming zombies, blasting away.","Little Cutie, Big Beauty, and Little Flower (the new name Yun Xiaoxiao had given the trumpet flower) all charged into the zombie horde with great vigor.","A new round of slaughter had officially begun!","Liu Xiaohui’s guns and cannons were indeed effective.","Their power was at least twice that of using abilities alone.","The accuracy was also much better.","Although most of the zombies in the city had already been lured out and burned to death, the remaining zombies were still a lot for a team of around forty people.","Moreover, most of the remaining zombies were mutated ones.","So, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others couldn’t afford to let their guard down.","They continued to adopt the strategy of fighting while blocking.","They built high walls around the area they were clearing.","After killing the zombies in the enclosed area, they would release more and continue the fight.","The battle was intense, and no one dared to lose focus.","When high-level zombies appeared, Yun Xiaoxiao, Lu Chen, and Ling Jing would handle them.","The others were responsible for taking down the lower-level zombies.","The team worked in perfect harmony, and not a single person was injured throughout the entire fight.","Just as everyone was fully focused on killing the zombies, Hua Bai suddenly stopped, frowning.","The next second, his expression changed drastically, and he shouted,","\"Something’s wrong! There’s trouble outside the city!\"","His hearing was extraordinary, allowing him to hear things others couldn’t.","\"Big brothers, keep going here. We’ll go check it out.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao furrowed her brow and, along with Ling Jing, instantly teleported over.","As soon as they arrived, they saw three charred, flaming mutated zombies near a massive pit.","Two of them were attacking Lei Ming and his group.","The third had just pounced on one of Lei Ming’s companions, pinning him to the ground.","The man’s body was immediately engulfed in flames.","\"Ah Hao!\"","Lei Ming shouted anxiously.","He wanted to help, but he was blocked by the two zombies in front of him.","\"Ahhhh!\"","The man named Ah Hao let out a series of agonized screams.","\"Boom!\"","Suddenly, an ice pillar shot over, instantly knocking the flaming zombie away.","Yun Xiaoxiao quickly rushed to Ah Hao’s side.","She swiftly released spiritual water, extinguishing the flames on his body.","In the blink of an eye, the flaming zombie lunged again.","Yun Xiaoxiao frowned slightly.","Ice didn’t work on this zombie?","She conjured another thick layer of ice and hurled it at the flaming zombie.","But the flames on the zombie only dimmed for a moment before reigniting.","So that’s how it is!","Yun Xiaoxiao’s brows furrowed tighter. She tried fire attacks and green vines next, but none of them could kill the flaming zombie.","Even Ling Jing’s dark and psychic attacks were ineffective.","They could only hinder its movements, not destroy it.","Yun Xiaoxiao couldn’t help but grumble internally.","How the hell did this thing even come into existence?!","Who would’ve thought that burning zombies would produce such bizarre creatures.","Yun Xiaoxiao pulled out Lord Slasher, dragging it along the ground before mustering all her strength to swing it at the flaming zombie.","Truthfully, she didn’t have much hope.","After all, even more destructive abilities hadn’t worked.","But the next moment, she was stunned.","Lord Slasher actually cleaved the previously indestructible flaming zombie in two!","She looked at Lord Slasher in delight.","As expected of the lord that slays all!","You’re truly mighty, truly awe-inspiring!","She affectionately stroked Lord Slasher, then hoisted it onto her shoulder, her spirits high as she turned to the other two flaming zombies.","She leapt into the air, swung Lord Slasher, and brought it down with a mighty slash.","The scene froze...","The blade got stuck in the zombie’s hard skull, failing to cut through...","Yun Xiaoxiao: ......","What’s going on?","Why didn’t it work this time?!","Lord Slasher, where’s your might, where’s your awe-inspiring power?"]},{"number":276,"title":"Chapter 276: Why Are You Still Biting","paragraphs":["Yun Xiaoxiao was puzzled. Just moments ago, with nearly the same strength and technique, she had managed to kill the Blazing Zombie.","Why wasn’t it working now?","What had gone wrong?","“Roar~”","The Blazing Zombie was enraged by Lord Slasher. It frantically tugged at the weapon, trying to pull it away.","Yun Xiaoxiao kicked out.","Though the kick wasn’t enough to kill the zombie, it did manage to push it back.","Due to the force of the recoil, she was flung several meters into the air.","At that moment, her gaze caught sight of a puddle of water on the ground nearby.","It was the spiritual spring water she had released earlier to extinguish the flames on Ah Hao.","Before killing the first Blazing Zombie, she had dragged Lord Slasher along the ground.","The blade seemed to have been soaked in the spiritual spring water.","Could it be... that the reason she had been able to kill the Blazing Zombie earlier was because Lord Slasher had been coated with the spiritual spring water?","Skeptical, Yun Xiaoxiao released some spiritual spring water and drenched Lord Slasher with it.","Then, she swung the weapon again, aiming for the Blazing Zombie not far away.","“Crack!”","Bones shattered, and the Blazing Zombie’s head was cleanly split in two.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s eyes lit up.","It really worked!","With renewed determination, she swiftly dealt with the remaining mutated zombie.","What had once seemed indestructible, impossible to kill, now shattered like fragile glass at the slightest touch.","Yun Xiaoxiao could hardly believe it herself.","She never would have thought that the spiritual spring water had such an effect.","“Ah Hao, are you okay?”","Lei Ming rushed over to Ah Hao, who was barely clinging to life.","Hearing his voice, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others gathered around.","Though Yun Xiaoxiao had quickly extinguished the flames on Ah Hao, he had still suffered severe burns.","“Boss, Ah Hao... he seems to have been scratched by a zombie!”","Suddenly, one of Lei Ming’s companions pointed at the back of Ah Hao’s neck, his eyes widening in shock.","Everyone immediately followed his gaze.","There, on the right side of Ah Hao’s neck, was a horrifying gash.","At first glance, it looked like it was smeared with something dirty and black.","But upon closer inspection, it was clear that it was a deep wound.","It had been cauterized by the fire, so no blood was flowing.","“Will Ah Hao turn into...”","The companion’s voice was hoarse, unable to bring himself to say the word.","Lei Ming’s expression was heavy with sorrow.","No one who had been scratched or bitten had ever escaped that fate.","It was only a matter of time.","The mood among the group instantly plummeted.","Yun Xiaoxiao crouched down and used the spiritual spring water to clean Ah Hao’s wound.","She even roughly pried open his mouth and poured some of the water inside.","But... it was no use.","Soon, Ah Hao began to writhe in discomfort.","He opened his eyes, struggling to use the last bit of his consciousness to shout, “Get away from me! Don’t come near!”","“I’m done for. When I die... you have to... kill me. Don’t let me turn into some... inhuman monster!”","Ah Hao arched his neck in agony, letting out a painful roar.","Some couldn’t bear to watch, turning away with tears in their eyes.","Everyone knew what was coming next.","At that moment, Ling Jing’s eyes flickered.","Without warning, he grabbed Ah Hao’s hand and bit down on it.","“What are you doing?!”","One of Lei Ming’s companions immediately tried to pull Ling Jing away.","“Why are you biting him?!”","Lei Ming frowned. “Ah Hao’s infected with zombie poison. If you bite him, you’ll get infected too. You shouldn’t have done that.”","Ling Jing didn’t explain. He simply wiped the blood from the corner of his mouth and stood up lazily.","Yun Xiaoxiao walked over to him, frowning as she looked up at him.","“Little one, frowning isn’t good. You’ll age quickly.","Don’t end up becoming a little old lady before you’ve even grown up.”","Ling Jing chuckled, pinching Yun Xiaoxiao’s chubby cheek.","Yun Xiaoxiao slapped his hand away.","“This isn’t funny!”","“Don’t worry, I won’t die. Maybe fighting poison with poison will cure me.”","“Can you speak seriously? Why did you do that?” Yun Xiaoxiao’s face was stern, her expression serious.","She knew Ling Jing hadn’t meant to harm Ah Hao.","But she couldn’t understand what he was trying to do.","Ling Jing looked down at Ah Hao on the ground, his brow furrowed.","“An experiment.”","“An experiment?” Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow.","“What’s going on? Why isn’t Ah Hao moving?!”","At that moment, the same companion exclaimed again.","Everyone immediately turned their attention back to Ah Hao.","The man who had been writhing in pain, seemingly on the verge of turning into a zombie, was now lying still, his eyes closed as if he were asleep.","Lei Ming quickly bent down to check his breathing.","After a moment, he sighed in relief.","“He’s still breathing.”","Hearing this, the others also relaxed.","But they were still puzzled.","“Strange, why did Ah Hao suddenly pass out?”","“Yeah, will he still... turn into a zombie?”","“...I’m not sure.”","Yun Xiaoxiao lowered her head, deep in thought.","Suddenly, as if she had figured something out, she turned sharply to look at Ling Jing.","Could it be because of that bite he had just given?","Was his experiment...","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao’s shocked expression, Ling Jing smiled and tapped her smooth forehead with his index finger.","“Little one, don’t overthink it. I won’t do anything to harm you or the others.”","Since Ah Hao’s condition was still uncertain, Yun Xiaoxiao told Lei Ming and the others to stay put and keep watch.","She just reminded them not to get too close.","If anything unexpected happened, they needed to be ready to act.","After giving her instructions, she and Ling Jing returned to Lu Chen and the others, busy clearing out the zombies in the city.","It was a dangerous and exhausting task.","But fortunately, Yun Xiaoxiao and her team didn’t rush in recklessly. They adopted a strategy of fighting while taking breaks.","Plus, Yun Xiaoxiao had plenty of evolution fluid and spiritual spring water to replenish their energy.","So, their strength was quickly restored, and they were ready to fight again with full energy.","“As expected, real combat is the best way to improve your abilities.”","Mu Yang laughed as he killed a zombie, glancing at Liu Tao and Tao Mi’er not far away.","“Look at them. At first, they could barely run a kilometer without gasping for breath. Now, they’re killing zombies like pros.”","“Yeah, before we met the kid, forget killing zombies—I’d have wished for eight legs just to run away from them.” Nie Yizhou chuckled self-deprecatingly.","“Hah, at least you admit you were weak back then.”","Xiao Feng blasted a howling Level 2 mutated zombie into ashes with a fireball.","Nie Yizhou gritted his teeth. “Don’t act all high and mighty! You weren’t much better yourself! Remember when the kid hung you upside down...”","Xiao Feng: !!!","The two of them couldn’t help but recall the “good times” they’d shared outside that little country house, the four of them together.","It felt like so long ago.","Time really flies..."]},{"number":277,"title":"Chapter 277: What the hell did you do to him","paragraphs":["The battle in Yicheng.","Yun Xiaoxiao and her team, with just over forty people, two beasts, and one plant, managed to take on nearly half a million zombies.","Although most of the zombies fell into pits and were burned to death, many of the remaining ones were mutated zombies.","There were quite a few of them, at least forty thousand.","Among them, many were level three and level four mutated zombies.","If it were ordinary superhumans, they would have probably been overwhelmed by these zombies.","But unfortunately for the zombies, they encountered Yun Xiaoxiao and her team.","Though their numbers were small, their bodies had been enhanced by spiritual spring water, making them far superior to ordinary humans.","On top of that, they had been drinking evolution fluid like it was water.","Their strength was not something ordinary superhumans could match.","Moreover, they had specially crafted gun barrels made by Liu Xiaohui.","It was like adding wings to a tiger.","Furthermore, with Yun Xiaoxiao, Lu Chen, and Ling Jing—these three powerhouses—present, mutated zombies below level six were no match for them.","Even if they encountered a level six mutated zombie, the three of them could still fight it together.","So, it only took them about two days to completely clear the city of zombies.","They rescued the remaining two thousand or so survivors in the city.","The survivors were in a daze when they learned that the zombies were all dead.","After confirming that the zombies were truly gone, everyone’s eyes welled up with tears of joy.","\"Wuwuwu, you’ve finally come! I used to weigh 180 pounds, but I’ve been starved down to 90 pounds. If you hadn’t come, I might have really starved to death, wuwuwu...\"","\"Thank you for risking your lives to save us. We’re so grateful!\"","\"You must be gods! How did you manage to kill so many zombies? It’s unbelievable!\"","\"...\"","Everyone expressed their gratitude in a flurry of words.","Yun Xiaoxiao wasn’t stingy. Seeing that some people were dressed thinly, she let them go to the clothing wholesale market to find some warm clothes to change into.","Although it was still spring when the apocalypse broke out, and the clothes being sold weren’t thick, the warehouses of such wholesale markets usually had last year’s stock.","Some even sold off-season clothes.","So, everyone managed to find plenty of new down jackets, thermal underwear, and the like.","Next to the market was a shoe wholesale area.","Everyone also went to pick out warm cotton shoes that fit them.","Not only that, but afterward, Yun Xiaoxiao took them to a large supermarket.","She let them eat and drink to their heart’s content.","At the same time, for those who were injured or sick, Mu Yang used his healing abilities to help them recover.","While deeply moved, they also couldn’t help but feel a sense of regret.","\"If only they had come earlier, my wife wouldn’t have died in agony from illness without any medicine.\"","\"I’m the only one left from my class. There were two of us who survived at first, but she thought life was hopeless and ended up taking her own life. If only she had held on a little longer, wuwuwu...\"","\"Sigh...\"","Watching them alternate between crying and laughing, Yun Xiaoxiao could fully understand their emotions.","Although in this life, everything had gone smoothly for her and seemed easy, in her previous life, she had been one of them.","She had also experienced all kinds of despair and helplessness.","However, these were things they had to process on their own. There wasn’t much outsiders could do to help.","She had done all she could. The psychological scars would have to heal over time.","She turned her gaze away and walked to a corner, where Ah Hao was still lying unconscious on a cotton quilt.","\"Has he not woken up yet?\"","Lei Ming shook his head. \"No, there’s been no change.\"","It had been over a day, and he was still in a coma, with no signs of waking up.","The mood among the group was heavy.","\"Don’t worry too much. No change might actually be a good sign. As long as he hasn’t turned into a zombie, there’s still hope.\"","Mu Yang and the others gathered around, offering comforting words.","\"Yeah,\" Lei Ming responded. Just as he was about to say something, he suddenly noticed Ah Hao’s eyelids twitch.","He immediately sat up straight, a hint of excitement in his expression.","\"What’s wrong?\"","His companions asked, following his gaze to Ah Hao.","Then, they immediately pointed at Ah Hao in excitement.","\"He moved! He moved!\"","Everyone looked at Ah Hao on the ground.","Lei Ming stopped his companions from rushing forward.","\"Wait, let’s see what happens first.\"","Everyone understood what he meant.","He was worried that Ah Hao might have turned into a zombie.","The joy they had felt moments ago quickly faded.","Ling Jing leaned against the wall, his hands in his pockets, one foot propped against the wall, slowly watching as Ah Hao’s eyes began to open.","The others also watched nervously.","Seeing that Ah Hao’s eyes hadn’t turned the grayish-white of a zombie, and that no black veins had appeared on his face, everyone breathed a sigh of relief.","His companions were so excited they were almost in tears.","\"He didn’t change! Ah Hao didn’t change!\"","\"Wait!\" Yun Xiaoxiao suddenly frowned.","In the next moment, Ah Hao, who had seemed fine just moments ago, suddenly had veins bulging on his face and neck.","His eyes also began to change color.","Though they didn’t turn completely grayish-white, the black part of his eyes shrank significantly, leaving only a small dot-like pupil.","\"Ah!\"","He threw his head back and let out a roar like a wild beast.","He looked almost indistinguishable from a zombie now.","Just as everyone thought he was about to attack, he stood up and walked over to Ling Jing.","He then stood straight in front of Ling Jing, like a devoted subordinate.","Everyone: !!!","\"Ah Hao?\"","Lei Ming tried calling out to him.","But Ah Hao showed no reaction.","\"Go sit over there.\"","Ling Jing pointed to a spot, and Ah Hao obediently went and sat down.","\"What’s going on? Why is he listening to Ling Jing like that?\" Nie Yizhou muttered under his breath.","Yun Xiaoxiao also frowned.","She remembered the bite Ling Jing had given Ah Hao earlier.","Was this the experiment he had mentioned?","\"What did you do to Ah Hao?!\"","One of Lei Ming’s companions immediately rushed up to Ling Jing, wanting to grab him and demand an explanation.","But before he could get close, Ah Hao quickly stepped in front of him, as if protecting Ling Jing.","The companion, seeing Ah Hao no longer recognizing him and even treating him as an enemy, was instantly enraged.","He clenched his fists, his entire body trembling.","\"What the hell did you do to Ah Hao? Why is he like this now?!\"","Ling Jing lazily looked up at him, a faint smile playing on his lips.","\"I saved him. I stopped him from becoming a flesh-eating monster. Shouldn’t you be thanking me?\""]},{"number":278,"title":"Chapter 278: Look How Kind I Am","paragraphs":["\"But the way he is now, he can’t even recognize people, isn’t that...\"","The person wanted to say more but was stopped by Lei Ming.","\"Enough, San Tiao, what he said isn’t entirely unreasonable.\"","Lei Ming’s voice grew heavier.","He glanced at Ah Hao, whose eyes were vacant, and sighed.","\"At least he hasn’t completely turned into a zombie yet. Once Elder Zhong and the others develop the vaccine, there might still be hope.\"","Hearing this, the others calmed down.","Yes, just yesterday outside the city, Ah Hao was on the verge of transforming.","It was Ling Jing who suddenly bit him, causing him to pause his transformation and fall unconscious.","Though he’s now half-human, half-zombie and has lost his previous consciousness, it’s still better than becoming a mindless, incurable zombie that attacks anyone in sight.","\"Sorry, I was just too worried earlier, and I acted impulsively. Please forgive me.\"","Realizing his recklessness, San Tiao sincerely apologized to Ling Jing.","Ling Jing shrugged indifferently, not taking it to heart.","He did what he wanted to do, and whether others were grateful or resentful wasn’t his concern.","He lived by his own rules.","With that matter settled, everyone went about their business—some eating, others resting.","The night passed quietly.","The next morning, after breakfast, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others began gathering supplies in the city.","In such a large city, there was no shortage of resources.","Most of the survivors volunteered to help.","Seeing that they didn’t have any space-type ability users, Yun Xiaoxiao agreed.","She divided them into more than a dozen groups, led by people from Yun City, and they began scavenging through the streets.","All the usable supplies they found were gathered in the center of the streets.","Finally, Yun Xiaoxiao and Liu Xiaohui took turns collecting them.","Liu Xiaohui’s spatial ability had already been revealed, so it was natural to make use of it.","The supplies they had previously allocated with Jiang Huai and the others were all stored in Liu Xiaohui’s space.","Now, with so many outsiders present, Yun Xiaoxiao still needed her to help cover up.","As everyone was busily moving supplies, the flower petal next to Yun Xiaoxiao suddenly lifted its head.","\"There are a lot of footsteps over there!\"","\"How many?\" Yun Xiaoxiao asked.","Hua Bai shook his head, \"The sounds are chaotic, hard to tell, but it’s clear there are quite a few people.\"","\"Roughly estimated, at least over three hundred,\" Liu Xiaohui adjusted her glasses, her expression calm.","\"Let’s go check it out.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao quickly headed in that direction.","Behind her were Hua Bai and Hua Ye, Liu Xiaohui, Han Bing, as well as Ling Jing and Ah Hao.","Meanwhile, at the intersection of a main street in the west of the city.","\"Boss, see? I wasn’t wrong. The zombies in the city have all been killed.\"","A small, sharp-faced man grinned proudly at a large, dark-faced man beside him, as if seeking praise.","\"Now all the supplies in the city are ours. There’s so much stuff here, it’ll last us a long time. Plus, we can move into the city. Just thinking about it feels amazing.\"","The Black Face Man gave the small man an approving look.","\"Good job, Earth Traveler Sun.\"","Earth Traveler Sun beamed, \"It’s my duty to solve problems for you, boss.\"","The Black Face Man patted his shoulder, then waved his hand.","\"Brothers, let’s go, move the supplies!\"","The people behind him immediately cheered.","\"Let’s go, let’s clear it out!\"","\"Haha, I want to grab a cigarette first. It’s been so long since I’ve had one.\"","\"Today we’ll feast!\"","The three hundred or so people chattered excitedly, their faces filled with anticipation.","\"Uncles and aunties, where are you all going?\"","At that moment, a childlike voice, tinged with amusement, suddenly rang out.","Then, a small figure slowly emerged from a street corner.","She was wearing a white down jacket, with a pink bunny hat on her head, revealing only a round, adorable face.","Her cheeks were soft and fair, and her cherry-red lips curled into an innocent smile.","\"Where did this brat come from? Mind your own business, kid. Scram.\"","Earth Traveler Sun waved his hand dismissively.","\"Taking without asking is stealing. You’re stealing my things. How can I not care?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao’s lips curved into a smile, her tone slightly exasperated.","\"Your things?\" Earth Traveler Sun scoffed, \"Ha, such big talk for a kid. What makes you think these things are yours?\"","\"The zombies in this city were all killed by my people. According to the rules of the apocalypse, these supplies belong to me.\"","She could choose to give the supplies away if she felt like it.","But if anyone dared to covet her things, well, she could tolerate a lot, but being taken advantage of wasn’t one of them.","\"Ridiculous. Your people? How old are you? Who do you have?\" Earth Traveler Sun sneered.","The people behind him burst into laughter.","\"Haha, exactly!\"","\"Even if the zombies in the city were killed by your people, we’re taking these supplies anyway!\"","\"Yeah, that’s right.\"","\"Kid, go home and ask your mom for milk. You’re not even grown up yet, and you’re trying to compete with us for stuff. Do you even know your own weight—ahhh!\"","Before the man could finish his sentence, a black mist wrapped around his neck, lifting him off the ground.","\"Boom!\"","The next second, he was flung into the air and slammed into an abandoned car by the street.","He bounced off and hit the concrete ground, instantly spitting out a mouthful of blood.","Everyone stared in shock at the scene.","\"Is my little one someone a lowlife like you can insult so casually?\"","A cold, lazy voice rang out.","Everyone turned to see a few more people walking out from the street corner.","The leader was a young man with a devilishly handsome face.","Though young, his languid aura was striking.","In his hand was a swirl of black mist that hadn’t yet dissipated.","Clearly, he was the one who had just attacked.","Ling Jing’s power, displayed in that single move, immediately intimidated the group.","Earth Traveler Sun and the others, who had been so bold moments ago, now shrank back, not daring to speak.","\"See? We could have talked this out nicely, but you had to force us to act. That’s not very friendly.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao spread her hands helplessly.","\"Since you’re so eager to move things, go ahead.","But everything must be brought to this street. If even one item is missing, I’ll cut off one of your hands.","If anyone tries to hide something, I’ll chop off a leg.","How’s that for a proposal?","See? I’m being so kind.\"","The Black Face Man and Earth Traveler Sun: !!!","Kind?!","Kind enough to turn them into laborers?","Kind enough to chop off hands and legs?!","Is this your idea of kindness?!"]},{"number":279,"title":"Chapter 279: Let You Go Seems Like It's Not Possible","paragraphs":["\"They’re going too far! Boss, there are only a few of them, and we’ve got so many people. What’s there to be afraid of? I refuse to believe that our three hundred men can’t handle a handful of them!\"","\"Exactly! They’ve pushed us to the limit. I can’t take it anymore!\"","\"But didn’t they say they were the ones who wiped out all the zombies in the city? They must be incredibly strong. And that man’s moves earlier were so bizarre. What if we can’t beat them?\"","\"You believe that nonsense? It’s obviously a lie. How could they possibly have cleared out all the zombies in the city? There are so many of them, and they’re just a small group!\"","\"Right! Maybe the zombies just left the city on their own!\"","The black-faced man was already seething with anger, and now, hearing his subordinates’ furious voices, his rage reached its peak.","These supplies were his for the taking.","There was no way he was going to let go of what was already in his grasp!","So, there was only one option...","He glared furiously at Yun Xiaoxiao and her group.","\"Brothers, charge! Capture them, and the supplies are ours!\"","With his command, the three hundred men behind him surged forward with overwhelming momentum, charging straight at Yun Xiaoxiao and her companions.","Yun Xiaoxiao sighed and shook her head.","\"Sigh, why won’t they listen? I really didn’t want to do this, but they’re forcing my hand.\"","\"Come out, you three.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, Little Cutie, Big Beauty, and Little Flower lined up in a row, standing imposingly in front of the three hundred men.","Yun Xiaoxiao casually instructed, \"Have fun, but don’t kill anyone.\"","\"Oh my god, what are those?!\"","\"A giant tiger, a huge scorpion, and... a massive trumpet flower?!\"","The overwhelming visual impact made some of the men stop in their tracks.","The sight of these three creatures was simply too terrifying.","Those who didn’t stop charged straight ahead.","Little Cutie’s long tail stinger rose high and lashed out with a powerful strike.","One man was immediately sent flying.","Big Beauty let out a roar, opening its massive jaws filled with sharp teeth, and clamped down on a man’s shoulder, flinging him sideways.","Little Flower, on the other hand, seemed to be playing a game of bowling, sucking people into its large blossom and then quickly spitting them out.","The ejected men would fly out like bowling balls, crashing into others who were charging forward.","With each strike, a large group of men would fall to the ground, groaning in pain.","In no time, the once-mighty group of three hundred was reduced to a disorganized mess, with cries of agony echoing all around.","Hearing the commotion outside, Earth Traveler Sun, who had burrowed underground, immediately broke through the stone pavement and poked his head out to see what was happening.","But as luck would have it, he emerged right in front of Big Beauty.","Big Beauty immediately swiped at him with its paw.","\"CRACK!\"","\"OWWW!\"","Earth Traveler Sun’s head, still stuck in the ground, was instantly twisted ninety degrees, causing him to grimace in pain. He quickly retreated back underground.","\"What the hell was that?!\"","He gasped, still shaken.","He hadn’t even had time to see what hit him before he was struck.","He steadied himself and focused, heading straight for his target.","His goal was clear: Yun Xiaoxiao.","He figured that Yun Xiaoxiao, being the youngest, would be the easiest to handle.","Once he captured her, he would have a hostage.","Moreover, he had noticed that Ling Jing seemed to care a lot about Yun Xiaoxiao, so if he could control her, he could force Ling Jing and the others to surrender.","Calculating Yun Xiaoxiao’s position, he broke through the stone pavement, aiming to grab her ankle and drag her underground as quickly as possible.","But just as his hand emerged, a short blade swiftly descended, piercing the back of his hand.","Blood immediately gushed out, dripping onto the ground.","\"AAAAHHHH!\"","A scream of agony erupted.","He looked up in terror, only to meet the gaze of an incredibly cute little face.","The girl smiled slightly, \"Uncle, does it hurt?\"","Earth Traveler Sun: !!! What do you think?!","\"Seems like it’s not painful enough.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao pouted in mock disappointment, then, without hesitation, pulled out the short blade and swiftly stabbed it into his other hand, even twisting the handle for good measure.","\"OWWWW!!!\"","Earth Traveler Sun’s face contorted in pain, his voice nearly breaking from the scream.","An unknown liquid began to stream down his legs.","He stared at Yun Xiaoxiao, who was still smiling sweetly, with sheer terror in his eyes.","A devil!","She must be a demon reincarnated!","At this moment, he regretted his decision so much that his intestines were practically turning green.","Of all the people to target, why did he have to pick the youngest one?","She might be the youngest, but she was also the most ruthless!","The worst part was that she kept smiling at you, making you think she wouldn’t do anything harmful, leaving you completely unprepared.","And when she did strike, the pain was ten times worse.","When Lu Chen and the others heard the commotion and rushed over, they thought Yun Xiaoxiao and her group were in trouble.","But when they arrived, they saw over three hundred men lying sprawled on the ground, groaning in pain.","\"Pfft~\"","Nie Yizhou couldn’t help but burst out laughing.","\"I knew it. It’s always the little devil bullying others. No one can ever bully her.\"","Over there, Yun Xiaoxiao was sitting casually on the hood of a jeep, swinging her little legs.","\"Have you rested enough? If you have, then hurry up and start moving the supplies.","I’ll count to three, and if I catch anyone not working, don’t blame me for being harsh.\"","She smiled sweetly, but the black-faced man and his crew felt like they wanted to die.","This is just unfair!","They beat us up so badly, and now they’re making us haul supplies with our injured bodies!","AAAAHHHH! This is downright inhumane!","\"You, you, and you guys don’t need to go.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at Earth Traveler Sun and a few others.","Finally, she gave Earth Traveler Sun a particularly disdainful look.","\"You stink.\"","Earth Traveler Sun: ......","Waaah, it’s not like I wanted to wet myself! It’s not something I can control!","The others also looked like they wanted to burrow into the ground out of sheer embarrassment.","Under Yun Xiaoxiao’s menacing gaze, the black-faced man and his crew grudgingly hauled all the supplies from the entire street out into the open.","Once they were done, everyone collapsed to the ground, utterly exhausted.","\"Still want to steal supplies?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao leisurely scanned the group.","Everyone immediately shook their heads like mad.","\"No, no! We won’t dare! We’ll never dare again!\"","\"Please, Miss, spare us!\"","\"Spare you?\" Yun Xiaoxiao rubbed her chin, then shook her head, \"That doesn’t seem possible.\"","Everyone: !!!","Yun Xiaoxiao’s lips curved into a smile, \"Don’t be so tense. Don’t worry, I won’t kill you.\"","Everyone: ???","\"However, there are some zombies that need to be dealt with. Whether you survive or not will depend on your own skills.\"","With so many people, and some of them even having special abilities, it would be a waste to just kill them off.","Might as well put them to use by having them fight zombies. It’s a good way to make the most of their abilities.","Everyone: !!!","Our silence speaks volumes!"]},{"number":280,"title":"Chapter 280: Please Save My Mother and Brother","paragraphs":["It took most of the day to gather supplies.","That afternoon, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others set off for Liang City.","The more than two thousand survivors were left behind in Yi City.","With the zombies gone from the city, Yun Xiaoxiao had also left them with plenty of supplies.","If they were frugal, the provisions should last them about a year.","After that, their journey would be up to them.","With limited helicopters available, not everyone could be accommodated.","Earth Traveler Sun and over three hundred others had to travel by bus.","Apart from Lu Chen, who took the Hua Brothers and Han Bing in a helicopter to Liang City to scout the situation ahead,","the rest of Yun Xiaoxiao’s group followed the bus by plane.","Along the way, the roar of the helicopter overhead kept the three hundred or so people as quiet as quails, not daring to cause any trouble.","After more than six hours, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others finally crossed into Liang City.","On the ground, Lu Chen and his team heard the helicopter and lit fireworks to signal their location.","The two groups finally reunited.","However, Lu Chen had a few more people with him.","They were dressed in ethnic attire, with dark skin and sharp features—clearly from a minority group.","“Brother Chen, who are these people?”","Nie Yizhou looked at them curiously.","Lu Chen calmly introduced them, “This is Uncle Almu.”","He pointed to a man in his forties or fifties standing in the center.","The man had a full beard and a warm, simple smile.","“These are Uncle Almu’s daughters, and behind them are his brother and nephew.","They noticed us while we were circling the city.","When they learned we wanted to eliminate the zombies inside, they offered to help.”","After Lu Chen’s introduction, Uncle Almu and his family nodded kindly at Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","“It’s getting dark, and it’s snowing. Why don’t you all come with us to our place?”","Uncle Almu looked up at the sky, his voice carrying a local accent.","Though a bit difficult to understand, it was still comprehensible.","“Our place is just down this road, about a fifteen-minute drive.”","He pointed to a tree-lined asphalt road ahead.","“Is this... safe?”","Nie Yizhou muttered under his breath.","In this post-apocalyptic world, could there really be such kind-hearted people?","He quietly moved closer to Yun Xiaoxiao and tugged at her sleeve.","“Kid, what do you think?”","Yun Xiaoxiao subtly observed the group for a moment but found nothing suspicious.","Still, it was better to be cautious.","She smiled slightly, “No need, Uncle. We have our own tents. We’ll manage here for the night.”","Seeing this, Uncle Almu didn’t insist.","“Alright then.”","He paused before adding, “By the way, I mentioned to this young man earlier that if you want to go into the city to kill the zombies, we might be able to help.","Not far from where we live, there’s a gas factory with many gas canisters.","If you need them, we can take you there.”","Yun Xiaoxiao studied him carefully before smiling.","“Alright, we’ll take you up on that offer.”","After the group left, Lu Chen approached Yun Xiaoxiao.","“Is there something off about them?”","Yun Xiaoxiao chuckled, “Didn’t you notice it too?”","“I sensed something was off, but I couldn’t pinpoint what.”","He glanced in the direction they had left.","“It’s nothing major, just some ulterior motives. Let’s not dwell on it. I’m starving. Let’s go eat.”","Yun Xiaoxiao patted her empty stomach, looking like a little foodie.","Meanwhile, in an old pickup truck.","“Dad, do you think they’ll come with us to the gas factory tomorrow?”","Ayi, Uncle Almu’s daughter, sounded worried.","“I don’t know. We’ll see tomorrow,” Almu replied, frowning.","The night was hazy, and the snow fell heavily, making the air feel especially cold.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s group set up their tents and lit several bonfires for warmth.","The task of setting up the tents and lighting the fires naturally fell to Earth Traveler Sun and his three hundred men.","No labor should go to waste.","“We get some too?”","Earth Traveler Sun and the others were surprised when Xiao Feng handed them a box of instant noodles.","They thought the little demon would only exploit them and not even provide food.","“Take it or leave it.”","Xiao Feng was about to take the box back when Earth Traveler Sun quickly grabbed it with a smile.","“We’ll take it, thank you, big bro.”","Xiao Feng: ...","You’re older than me, though...","The night was quiet, and the snow fell endlessly. Everyone ate their noodles, savoring the warmth in the icy wilderness.","With a tough battle ahead in the next two days,","they finished their meals and quickly retreated to their tents to sleep,","leaving only a few to keep watch.","Early the next morning, Almu and his group returned.","“So... have you decided?”","Uncle Almu seemed anxious, quickly adding, “The gas factory isn’t far from here. It’s about a twenty-minute drive, very close.","And if you take the gas canisters, you can head straight to the city outskirts from another route.","It’s only about a ten-minute trip from there.”","Seeing their urgency, Yun Xiaoxiao deliberately feigned regret.","“Uncle, we’ve decided not to go.”","Hearing this, Uncle Almu and his daughter Ayi turned pale.","“However...” Yun Xiaoxiao’s voice rose, “if you tell us the real reason you want us to go to the gas factory, we might reconsider.”","Their hearts sank.","They stared at Yun Xiaoxiao in shock.","Could this child have figured something out?","Suddenly, Ayi dropped to her knees, tears welling in her eyes.","“Please, save my mom and brother! They’re trapped in the gas factory, and we don’t know if they’re alive or dead!”","Ayi pleaded through sobs.","From her words, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others pieced together the story.","Ayi’s mother and brother, Uncle Almu’s wife and son, had been employees at the gas factory.","One worked in the cafeteria, and the other drove trucks to transport gas canisters.","After the apocalypse, they lost contact.","Seeing the factory overrun with zombies, the family assumed they were dead.","But not long ago, they discovered that the two were still alive.","Father and daughter tried many times to rescue them,","but all attempts failed.","Then, two days ago, the mother and son, who had been signaling from a window, suddenly disappeared.","Almu and Ayi were frantic but couldn’t get past the hordes of zombies.","Just then, Lu Chen arrived.","Seeing the helicopter in the sky, they felt a glimmer of hope."]},{"number":281,"title":"Chapter 281: Yun Xiaoxiao Looks Just Like a Quack Selling Fake Medicine","paragraphs":["“I’m sorry. I know it was wrong of us to hide the truth before.","But we really had no other choice.","If you can save my mother and brother, I’ll do anything you ask!”","Ayi’s voice choked with emotion as she desperately promised.","“Anything?” Yun Xiaoxiao asked with a smile.","Ayi nodded vigorously, her expression resolute.","Originally, she had been an abandoned infant left by the roadside.","It was her mother who had kindly picked her up and taken her in.","At that time, her mother hadn’t yet given birth to her brother.","Her grandmother, who favored boys over girls, insisted on throwing her out since she wasn’t a biological child of the family.","But her mother refused adamantly and insisted on keeping her.","Even after her brother was born, her parents’ love for her never wavered; they treated her as their own.","Her brother wasn’t like other siblings who were selfish and demanded all their parents’ attention.","Even though he knew she wasn’t his biological sister, he still respected and cared for her.","He always shared good food and fun things with her.","When he earned his first paycheck as an adult, he bought necklaces for both her and their mother.","When she was deceived by a scoundrel, her brother nearly crippled the man to avenge her.","He even sacrificed his own promising future for her sake.","So, she was willing to pay any price to save them.","But she was helplessly weak, and her own strength alone couldn’t save them.","She could only pin her hopes on Yun Xiaoxiao and her group.","Even if it cost her life, she had no regrets.","In other words, if she could trade her life for her mother and brother’s, she would have done so long ago.","But in that situation, even if she wanted to exchange her life, it wouldn’t work.","It would be like a moth flying into a flame—she’d only end up sacrificing herself without saving anyone.","Yun Xiaoxiao looked at Ayi. “Sister, even if we’re willing to go, you shouldn’t get your hopes up too much.”","They had already been missing for two or three days; it was likely they were no longer alive.","“I know, but I don’t want to give up even the slightest hope.","Don’t worry, no matter the outcome, I won’t back out of my promise. I’ll do whatever you ask.”","“Alright, lead the way,” Yun Xiaoxiao said, raising an eyebrow.","Truthfully, when they mentioned the gas factory yesterday, she had already been intrigued.","Although she still had plenty of oil, it was a resource that would eventually run out, so it was best to conserve it.","Moreover, the explosive power of gas canisters was terrifying.","With such a great alternative available, she naturally couldn’t pass it up.","The reason she had asked earlier was simply because she didn’t like being used as a tool.","If someone wanted to use her, they’d have to pay a price, right?","When Yun Xiaoxiao said to lead the way, Uncle Almu and Ayi’s group immediately became excited.","“Right away!”","They couldn’t wait to rush to the gas factory.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s group split into two teams.","One team, led by Lu Chen, Ling Jing, and Nie Yizhou, took the three hundred or so people to dig pits and set up traps.","Meanwhile, Yun Xiaoxiao, along with Mu Yang, Xiao Feng, Zheng Yuner, Han Bing, and Liu Xiaohui, flew in a helicopter with Uncle Almu and his group to the gas factory.","At first, Ayi and the others were puzzled and worried when they saw only Yun Xiaoxiao and a few others going to the gas factory.","They were concerned that such a small group wouldn’t be able to handle the zombies inside.","But when they saw how effortlessly they killed the zombies, as if they were slaughtering chickens, the four of them were completely convinced.","Although all four of them were ability users, only Uncle Almu’s nephew had a combat-related ability.","The other three’s abilities were practically useless in a fight.","For example, Uncle Almu’s ability was air purification.","His brother’s ability was night vision.","And Ayi’s ability was vitality.","When she used her ability on someone, their life would be extended.","For instance, if someone was on the verge of death and had only three minutes left, Ayi’s ability could extend their life to four or five minutes.","At first glance, it might not seem particularly useful.","But upon closer thought, this ability could be life-saving for some people.","If they managed to hold on for that extra second or two and received treatment from a high-level healer or a skilled doctor, they could escape death and survive.","Moreover, as Ayi’s ability level increased, the amount of life she could extend would grow beyond just a few seconds.","So, this vitality ability was like the legendary life-extending elixir.","In the end, Yun Xiaoxiao’s group found the mother and son in a room, on the brink of death.","They had been without water and food for days, their faces pale and lips cracked, already unconscious.","“Mom! Brother!”","Ayi cried as she rushed over to them.","“They’re still breathing,” Yun Xiaoxiao said calmly, withdrawing her hand and standing up.","“But they won’t last much longer without treatment.”","After hearing this, Ayi and the others panicked.","“What should we do?”","“Dad, let’s go find a doctor!”","Clearly, Ayi hadn’t realized the potential of her own ability.","Yun Xiaoxiao wanted to see the uniqueness of this ability in action, so she didn’t immediately ask Mu Yang to heal them.","Since the two were unconscious but their breathing wasn’t too weak, delaying treatment for a few minutes wouldn’t make much difference.","So she reminded Ayi, “Sister, you can save them yourself.”","“Me?”","Ayi pointed at herself in surprise.","“But I’m not a doctor. How can I save them?”","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled and explained how to use her ability.","“Give it a try.”","Ayi nodded seriously.","Following Yun Xiaoxiao’s instructions, she placed her hand on her mother’s chest.","“Is that it? I don’t feel any changes. My mom hasn’t woken up.”","After trying, Ayi looked confused.","Yun Xiaoxiao was also puzzled.","The ability panel couldn’t be wrong.","The only explanation was that the effects of the ability weren’t visibly apparent.","In the end, it was Mu Yang who stepped in, and Ayi’s mother and brother slowly regained consciousness.","Leaving the family to reunite, Yun Xiaoxiao and her group headed downstairs.","The gas factory was sizable, filled with numerous gas canisters already filled with gas.","Some of them were even loaded onto trucks, seemingly ready to be transported.","But the situation at the time hadn’t allowed it.","With the others providing cover, Liu Xiaohui began storing the gas canisters in her spatial storage.","“I can’t fit any more,” she said after a while, pushing her glasses up and speaking matter-of-factly.","Yun Xiaoxiao looked at the remaining two-thirds of the canisters and felt a headache coming on.","That was it? She couldn’t store any more?","She took out a few bottles of evolution serum and looked at Liu Xiaohui with eager eyes.","“Sister Xiaohui, try drinking this and see if your storage space can expand a bit.”","Her expression was reminiscent of a salesman promoting their miracle cure.","Liu Xiaohui’s lips twitched as she took the bottles.","“...I’ll give it a try.”"]},{"number":282,"title":"Chapter 282: Absolute Territory Zhang Piaopiao","paragraphs":["Finally, Liu Xiaohui’s storage space had only expanded a little.","The rest had to be handled by Yun Xiaoxiao.","Just as they were preparing to meet up with Lu Chen, Mu Yang and Ayi’s group emerged.","Knowing that Yun Xiaoxiao and the others were about to handle serious business, Ayi and her companions offered to help.","But Yun Xiaoxiao refused.","For one, their offensive abilities were few and weak, so they wouldn’t be of much practical help.","Secondly, Ayi’s mother and younger brother had just recovered and were still very weak, needing someone to care for them.","As for helping, there would be plenty of opportunities in the future.","It’s just that the occasions for their assistance would be different.","“Then we’ll go home and pack up, waiting for you at the spot where you set up the tents before.”","“Alright.”","After Uncle Almu pointed them in a direction, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others immediately flew the plane that way.","Soon, they saw the full view of Liang City.","The buildings here weren’t particularly tall, mostly just a few low-rise floors.","The highest was only about eleven or twelve stories.","However, the city covered a vast area.","From a distance, they spotted Lu Chen and the others outside the city.","The pit had already been dug, waiting for Yun Xiaoxiao’s arrival.","Due to geographical reasons, Lu Chen had led people to dig pits in all four directions—east, south, west, and north—of Liang City.","Liu Xiaohui took out some gas canisters, and Lu Chen immediately started arranging them with the others.","The following process was similar to what they had done in Yi City.","Play music, lure the zombies, blow them up, kill them...","Earth Traveler Sun and the three hundred or so people were initially terrified, hesitating to move forward.","But under the pressure of Yun Xiaoxiao’s ferocity, they reluctantly entered the city in the end.","Faced with the oncoming horde of zombies, they had no choice but to grit their teeth and fight for their lives.","As the saying goes, you never know your true potential until you’re pushed to the brink.","To avoid being bitten to death by zombies, they all performed far beyond their usual limits.","Of course, Yun Xiaoxiao didn’t completely abandon them.","If they were truly in danger, she would step in to help.","After all, having so many “helpers” was valuable, and losing them would be a shame.","However, if anyone harbored ill intentions or tried to escape, she wouldn’t hesitate to send them for a “close encounter” with the zombies.","By the end, the survivors couldn’t even count how many times they had teetered on the edge of death.","When it was all over, they all collapsed to the ground, gasping for air.","They sighed: It’s good to be alive!","The battle for Liang City ended earlier than expected.","That was because, around 3 PM that afternoon, a large group of people arrived to help.","There were about five or six hundred of them.","After the battle, they learned that these people were survivors from a base near Liang City.","They had been hiding in a large mountain behind the city.","Initially, they had come to investigate after hearing explosions.","But upon seeing Yun Xiaoxiao and the others slaughtering the zombies in the city, they decided to join in.","The zombies in the city had always been a threat to them.","Now that someone was dealing with their biggest problem, they naturally stepped forward.","Upon learning that Yun Xiaoxiao and the others had formed a Zombie-Slaying Army, traveling from city to city to kill zombies, they were filled with admiration.","Their base didn’t have communication equipment like radios, so they had no idea what was happening in the outside world.","“Can we join? The... Zombie-Slaying Army?”","A girl suddenly stepped forward.","“Are you crazy!”","Another quickly grabbed her.","“Do you know what that means?”","The girl broke free. “What could it mean? I think they’re cool, really cool! I want to be like them, going to different places to kill zombies.”","“You think this is a game? People could die at any moment! Are you stupid?”","“So what if people die? People die every day now. Even if I die, I want to die gloriously, die with purpose.”","The girl’s face was full of longing, her eyes shining.","“You’ve watched too many war movies! This isn’t the time for heroism.”","“I’m not advocating heroism. Aren’t they doing something great and meaningful?","Look, the massive horde of zombies that’s been troubling us in the city has been wiped out by them.","We can return to the city and live again.","We won’t have to live in fear every day when we go out.","Isn’t that good?","I’m sure there are many places where people are living under the shadow of zombies. If I can follow them and kill those zombies, saving those people, I’d feel amazing!","Even if I die, it’s fine. Eighteen years later, I’ll be back as a hero!”","The girl’s eyes sparkled, and she smiled as she spoke.","The other person seemed convinced, pursing their lips.","“A hero? You’re a girl!”","“Hehe, I was just using that as a metaphor. It’s not important.”","The girl blinked playfully, then looked in Yun Xiaoxiao’s direction.","“Look, even a little girl has such courage, caring for the world, selflessly contributing, unafraid of death.","I’m so much older than her. Shouldn’t I join too?”","Yun Xiaoxiao, standing nearby: ...Not necessarily...","Yun Xiaoxiao took a closer look at the girl.","Her name was Zhang Piaopiao, and she was very cute, with a lively appearance.","Her eyes always seemed to be smiling, naturally cheerful.","Just looking at her made you feel full of energy.","Her ability was special—Absolute Domain.","Within her domain, the enemy’s attack power would weaken.","The stronger she was, the more the enemy’s abilities would diminish.","Meanwhile, she could use the power granted by her domain to attack.","Yun Xiaoxiao raised her eyes slightly.","She remembered that in her past life, there was a powerful user of Absolute Domain, and it was indeed a woman.","However, she had never met her.","People with such abilities were rare.","Could this Zhang Piaopiao be the one who almost made it into the top ten of the Apocalypse’s Wolf Rankings in her past life?","The argument between Zhang Piaopiao and the other person was loud enough for everyone to hear.","Soon, quite a few people stepped forward, expressing their desire to join the Zombie-Slaying Army.","The growth of their team was naturally welcomed by Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","Just as everyone was preparing to head to Ren City, Zhang Piaopiao walked up to Yun Xiaoxiao, her eyes smiling.","“Little sister, I saw how amazing you were earlier. Though I’m not very strong, I’d like to spar with you. What do you say?”","Yun Xiaoxiao paused for a moment, then didn’t respond.","Instead, she looked toward Earth Traveler Sun and the others, then strode over.","As Yun Xiaoxiao approached, Earth Traveler Sun shrank back, quickly explaining.","“Uh, I... I wasn’t planning to run, I just...”","“Lend me your axe.”","“Huh? What? The axe?”"]},{"number":283,"title":"Chapter 283: Can I Fight with You Every Day","paragraphs":["\"Unwilling?\" Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow.","Earth Traveler Sun quickly shook his head, \"No, no, I’m willing, of course I’m willing!\"","He hastily handed the axe to Yun Xiaoxiao with a smile.","Yun Xiaoxiao, holding the seemingly heavy axe, walked toward Zhang Piaopiao.","Then, she handed it over.","\"Sister, would you like to try fighting me with this?\"","Zhang Piaopiao tilted her head, staring at the axe for a couple of seconds.","Then, she flashed a bright smile.","\"Sure, although I’ve never used one before, this axe looks so majestic.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded, a faint smile on her lips.","\"Yes, very majestic.\"","If Zhang Piaopiao was indeed the person from her past life, then she must have an extraordinary talent for wielding an axe.","Perhaps... now was the time to test that theory.","It was evening, and they wouldn’t set off until the next day.","Seeing that there was some entertainment to be had, everyone gathered excitedly.","After all, in this post-apocalyptic world without electricity or internet, entertainment options were almost nonexistent.","Everyone formed a large circle around the square, leaving the center empty.","Yun Xiaoxiao and Zhang Piaopiao stood on opposite sides.","\"Little sister, can we start now?\" Zhang Piaopiao called out.","\"Yes.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao’s eyes narrowed, glinting with a hint of battle readiness.","Up until now, she had never fought someone like this.","She was curious about what it would feel like to battle someone with an absolute domain ability.","\"Alright, then I’ll really start now.\" Zhang Piaopiao smiled cheerfully.","As soon as she finished speaking, an invisible semicircle appeared out of thin air, blocking the falling snowflakes and creating a vacuum that enveloped both her and Yun Xiaoxiao.","The crowd below immediately started murmuring.","\"What is that?\"","\"It’s amazing! Look, the snowflakes are avoiding it!\"","Nie Yizhou rubbed his eyes, \"There’s such an ability? Is this what they call ‘closing the door to beat the dog’?\"","\"Hey, Zhou, you’re calling the little base leader a dog? I’ll tell her later.\"","Liu Tao, standing nearby, chuckled and winked.","\"Hey, kid, looking for a beating?\"","Nie Yizhou raised his fist, pretending to hit him.","Liu Tao quickly begged for mercy.","Zheng Xin'er linked arms with Zheng Yun'er, \"Yun'er, who do you think is stronger?\"","Zheng Yun'er pulled down her hat, \"Xiaoxiao.\"","\"Haha, we’re thinking the same thing. But I quite admire that girl. It makes me want to fight Xiaoxiao too.\"","\"You’d probably get crushed.\"","Zheng Xin'er pouted, \"Yun'er, see through but don’t say it. Sisters can still be friends.\"","Zheng Yun'er: ......","Wasn’t that the truth?","Of course, she didn’t say that out loud.","While everyone was talking, Zhang Piaopiao had already launched her attack on Yun Xiaoxiao.","In the blink of an eye, she appeared right in front of Yun Xiaoxiao.","The heavy axe was raised high and then brought down with full force.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s brow furrowed.","So, within the absolute domain, the opponent could move freely to any location.","This was somewhat similar to her system space, where she could also move anywhere she wanted.","The moment the axe came down, Yun Xiaoxiao activated her teleportation ability.","But she forgot that within the opponent’s absolute domain, her abilities were significantly weakened.","So, while she managed to dodge the axe, she didn’t end up where she intended.","This made Yun Xiaoxiao acutely aware that her power had been suppressed.","At least to 70% of her original strength.","And this was with the opponent’s ability level still relatively low.","If their ability level increased, it would be terrifying.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s sudden disappearance also startled Zhang Piaopiao.","However, her alertness was good, and the moment she realized Yun Xiaoxiao was gone, she quickly turned around, fearing an attack from behind.","In fact, Yun Xiaoxiao had indeed intended to attack from behind, but her teleportation was only partially successful...","Now that she knew the extent to which her power was suppressed, Yun Xiaoxiao had a clear understanding.","Even with her strength reduced, dealing with Zhang Piaopiao at this stage was still easy for her.","But she wasn’t in a hurry to end the fight. Instead, she kept provoking Zhang Piaopiao to attack her with the axe.","Sure enough, Zhang Piaopiao became more and more skilled with the axe.","Using the power of the domain, she unleashed more and more moves.","\"The little one is fighting effortlessly.\"","Mu Yang’s lips curled into a warm smile.","Lu Chen raised an eyebrow.","It wasn’t just effortless—it was more like Yun Xiaoxiao was trying to unlock the other’s potential.","Finally, seeing that it was about time, Yun Xiaoxiao quickly ended the fight.","The outcome was obvious.","Zhang Piaopiao excitedly approached Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"Little sister, did you see? I’m getting better with the axe!\"","Yun Xiaoxiao smiled slightly, \"I saw.\"","\"Hehe, fighting you is so great! I feel like I’ve improved so much!","Can I fight you every day from now on?\"","Zhang Piaopiao’s face was full of excitement, as if she genuinely wanted to spar with Yun Xiaoxiao daily.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s lips twitched, \"...You should find someone else.\"","This kind of ‘honor’ wasn’t something she particularly wanted.","\"Really not possible?\" Zhang Piaopiao blinked.","\"No.\"","\"What about once a week?\"","\"No.\"","\"Once a month then?\"","\"...\"","After that, Yun Xiaoxiao often found herself under Zhang Piaopiao’s longing gaze.","It was as if she were some heartless scoundrel.","This made her deeply regret her decision to agree to the fight today.","If heaven gave her another chance, she would definitely, absolutely, resolutely refuse!","The next morning.","Around a hundred people from Zhang Piaopiao’s former base chose to join Yun Xiaoxiao’s group.","The rest, along with those rescued from the city, decided to stay in Liang City.","As for the supplies, Yun Xiaoxiao allocated one-third of the city’s resources to them.","After sorting everything out, Yun Xiaoxiao and her group set off for Ren City.","However, they encountered an unexpected incident along the way.","While passing through a mountain road, due to the slippery surface, a bus carrying Earth Traveler Sun and others skidded. As it approached a sharp turn, it veered off the cliff.","\"Ahhhhhh!\"","\"Damn! I’m flying!\"","\"Mom! I don’t want to die! Ahhhhh!\"","\"I didn’t get bitten by a zombie, only to die from a fall? King Yama, I’m not done with you!\"","The empty mountain echoed with screams.","The situation was too urgent, and no one had time to react.","This was the first time they’d encountered something like this!","Just as the bus was about to plummet, several vines suddenly appeared, wrapping around the entire vehicle."]},{"number":284,"title":"Chapter 284: Rencheng Base","paragraphs":["The bus trembled for a moment before stabilizing.","The front half of the vehicle was dangling in mid-air, with only a small portion of the rear still grounded.","If it weren’t for the green vines holding it back, the entire bus would have plunged into the abyss the next second, shattered into pieces, leaving no trace behind.","Standing at the helicopter’s cabin door, Yun Xiaoxiao controlled the vines with both hands, slowly moving the bus.","She held her breath, veins bulging on her neck, her eyes filled with determination.","Thanks to her efforts, the bus finally landed safely on the ground.","“I really thought I was going to die just now,” someone sobbed.","“Yeah, that was way too close. I was terrified!”","“Thank goodness that little witch... no, that girl acted in time to save us. Otherwise, none of us would’ve survived.”","“Exactly! She might have a temper, but she didn’t abandon us when it mattered.”","“I’ve decided to follow her from now on. I owe her my life.”","“Same here!”","“Me too!”","“Wait, hold on. Did you all forget she forced us to kill zombies as punishment? She didn’t care about our lives.”","“You can’t say that. Given her ruthlessness, the fact that she didn’t kill us after we stole from her shows she’s merciful.","Besides, it’s not just us killing zombies—they’re doing it too.","And haven’t you noticed? Forcing us to kill zombies has actually made us stronger.”","“You’re right! I never knew I could be this powerful before.”","“......”","After the near-death experience, everyone on the bus was still shaken, their emotions running high.","For most of them, their attitude toward Yun Xiaoxiao had completely changed.","Some even vowed to follow her to the death.","Feeling the sudden surge in their closeness, Yun Xiaoxiao was momentarily stunned.","Then she pursed her lips, a hint of surprise in her expression.","Because of the earlier incident, the convoy drove much slower afterward.","Although Mu Yang had organized the installation of snow chains on every vehicle before departure, caution was still necessary.","Snow chains couldn’t guarantee absolute safety.","Liang City was a bit farther from Ren City, and along the way, they encountered a few small zombie hordes, delaying their progress.","“Hey, isn’t that Brother Chen?”","As they neared Ren City, Nie Yizhou pointed at a helicopter flying toward them and asked curiously.","Mu Yang looked up. “It does look like him.”","Lu Chen had gone ahead with a team to scout Ren City earlier.","No one knew why he was suddenly returning.","Nie Yizhou turned on the intercom and, as soon as they were close enough to communicate, hurriedly asked,","“Brother Chen, why are you back?”","“No need to go to Ren City. The zombies there are gone,” Lu Chen’s deep voice came through the intercom.","“Gone? What happened?”","Nie Yizhou sounded as if he’d just heard some juicy gossip.","“Not sure. A third of the city is surrounded by tall earthen walls.","There are many survivors inside.","There’s no sign of zombie activity in the rest of the city either.”","“Did they kill all the zombies?”","“Probably. The buildings in the eastern part of the city were completely destroyed, and there’s a large blackened area in the western outskirts, as if something was burned on a massive scale.”","He suspected that the survivors had killed the zombies and disposed of them collectively.","Nie Yizhou’s voice became cheerful.","“That’s great! We don’t have to rush anymore.","But I’m really curious about that Ren City base.","Their leader must be a decisive and formidable figure, having the foresight to wipe out all the zombies in advance.","Oh, by the way, Ren City didn’t send anyone to the meeting held by the Western Base earlier.","Do you think we should try to persuade them to join us?","If they participate in the siege of Rong City, we could finish earlier than expected.","Everyone would have more time to return to their own bases.”","“I think it’s worth a try,” Yun Xiaoxiao nodded.","The weather was getting worse by the day. If they could eliminate the threat of Rong City sooner, everyone could return to their bases earlier.","After making the decision, Mu Yang instructed everyone to take a break.","The convoy stopped on a wide stretch of road.","The helicopter also landed slowly.","It was already close to 6 p.m., and even if they wanted to head straight to Rong City, it wasn’t the right time.","So Yun Xiaoxiao and the others decided to spend the night there and set off again in the morning.","They could also use this opportunity to visit the Ren City base and see if they could persuade them to join.","As for why they didn’t bring everyone to Ren City, the reason was simple: it’s always wise to be cautious.","They didn’t know what kind of person the Ren City base leader was.","If they brought too many people, it might give the wrong impression, making the other side defensive and ruining the negotiation.","On the other hand, if the leader was hostile or had ill intentions, it could lead to unnecessary casualties.","Although their team was strong—arguably unmatched among anyone they’d encountered so far—it was still necessary to maintain a degree of caution when dealing with strangers.","Throughout history, many had underestimated their opponents, thinking they were stronger, only to meet their end in confusion.","This wasn’t about fear but about being prudent.","Some began clearing the snow from the road, others set up tents, a few scouted the area for zombies to eliminate any threats, and the rest started preparing food.","Since someone needed to stay behind to oversee things, Yun Xiaoxiao left Lu Chen, Ling Jing, Xiao Feng, and Lei Ming behind.","She only took Mu Yang, Zheng Yuner, Nie Yizhou, and Ci Wan with her.","With her and Nie Yizhou there, they could escape quickly if anything went wrong.","Then, Mu Yang piloted the helicopter, carrying the group toward Ren City.","It wasn’t far, and within ten minutes, they could see the entire city.","Meanwhile, in a high-rise building surrounded by earthen walls in Ren City...","“That helicopter is flying back!”","Someone in a large room on the top floor exclaimed, pointing at the helicopter approaching through the floor-to-ceiling windows.","He quickly turned to the person behind him.","“Base Leader, should we shoot it down?”","At the desk, a stern-faced man was reviewing some documents.","Hearing the question, he slowly looked up."]},{"number":285,"title":"Chapter 285: The Base Commander Who Fears His Wife","paragraphs":["The man appeared to be in his late thirties, approaching forty.","He was burly, with a scar etched across his brow.","His muscular frame exuded toughness from every angle, making him the epitome of a hardcore man.","Anyone timid might have been intimidated by his naturally fierce demeanor, perhaps even trembling or crying.","He furrowed his brow as he glanced at his subordinate.","\"Stop being so jumpy. You’re not a kid anymore. Calm down when something happens.\"","The subordinate immediately lowered his head.","\"Let’s wait and see what they’re up to. We don’t want to kill the wrong people.\"","He pushed back his chair and stood up.","Just then, the door to the room opened.","A woman in her thirties walked in.","She wore a beige coat, a white scarf, and a beret. Her face, though marked by age, was strikingly beautiful.","She had the allure of a mature woman, her every smile captivating.","Her presence was elegant and commanding.","\"You, go outside and use the loudspeaker to warn them. See how they react. If they show any hostile intent, shoot them immediately.","But if they mean no harm, let them leave,\" the man instructed his subordinate.","\"Yes, sir!\"","The subordinate nodded and quickly left.","As he passed the woman, his gaze briefly lingered on her face.","But he quickly averted his eyes.","Once the subordinate was gone, the rugged man’s stern expression softened entirely.","\"Honey, why did you come out in this cold weather?\"","He smiled warmly, grabbing the coat hanging by the table and draping it over her shoulders.","He then handed her a hot water bottle to warm her hands.","\"Still cold?\" he asked with concern.","The woman shook her head, her delicate brows lifting slightly.","\"Not anymore. By the way, what were you talking about earlier? Something about killing the wrong people?\"","The man immediately took her hand and led her to the floor-to-ceiling window, pointing toward the sky in the distance.","\"That helicopter flew over us earlier, then left, but now it’s back.","Shi Dong asked if we should shoot it down.","But we don’t know their purpose or whether they’re friend or foe.","So I told him to investigate first and see what they’re up to before making any rash decisions.","Anyway, why did you come here all of a sudden?\"","The woman raised an eyebrow. \"What, don’t want me here? Or... is there another woman in your room?\"","\"Absolutely not!\"","The man immediately raised his hand in a vow.","\"Honey, my loyalty to you is as solid as the earth and sky. I’d never betray you!","I’m just worried you’ll catch a cold.","If you don’t believe me, search the room right now.","If you find even a single strand of another woman’s hair, I’ll castrate myself!\"","His expression was deadly serious, as if he feared she might leave him over this.","\"Alright, I’m just teasing you,\" the woman said with a light laugh, her eyes exuding a mix of mature charm and boldness.","She turned her gaze to the window.","At that moment, the helicopter slowly descended onto the roof of a low-rise building.","Shi Dong and his team quickly moved toward it.","Soon, the two groups faced each other.","\"Who are you? What’s your purpose for coming here so boldly?\"","Shi Dong frowned, his expression guarded.","His companions also watched Yun Xiaoxiao and her group warily.","Several of them held guns.","\"We’d like to speak with your base leader about something,\" Mu Yang said politely.","\"Whatever it is, say it now. Our base leader is too busy to meet with you,\" Shi Dong flatly refused.","\"Hey, you...\"","Nie Yizhou, annoyed by the other side’s attitude, was about to argue, but Mu Yang pulled him back.","Mu Yang smiled politely at Shi Dong. \"Here’s the situation. A Zombie Extermination Army has been formed in the western region of Hua Country. Its goal is to eradicate the zombie threat across the west and restore a safe living environment for humanity.","So far, we’ve cleared multiple cities of zombies.","Passing through Ren City, we noticed that the zombies here have already been eliminated. This shows you must have exceptional capabilities.","We’d like to invite you to join the Zombie Extermination Army and head to Rong City with us to continue the fight.\"","After hearing Mu Yang’s explanation, Shi Dong’s expression remained sour.","\"Get out of here! We’re not interested in joining your so-called Zombie Extermination Army!\"","What a joke. Travel all the way to Rong City to kill zombies?","They’d have to be bored out of their minds or have a death wish.","\"Hey, your attitude is really asking for a beating. My brother Mu Yang has been nothing but polite to you. At least go and relay the message.","You’re not the base leader. How do you know he’s not interested?","Or are you making decisions for him?","Are you trying to take over as base leader?\"","\"Just leave already! Stop wasting our time!\"","As if his secret had been exposed, Shi Dong’s face darkened.","\"If you don’t leave now, don’t blame us for opening fire!\"","He waved his hand, and his men immediately aimed their guns at Yun Xiaoxiao and her group.","But in the next second, he felt two small feet step onto his shoulders, and something cold pressed against his forehead.","\"Take us to your base leader, or I’ll pull the trigger,\" a soft yet icy child’s voice rang out.","Shi Dong’s pupils dilated. He forced himself to stay calm and gritted his teeth.","\"Aren’t you afraid my men will turn you into Swiss cheese?!\"","Yun Xiaoxiao smirked faintly. \"You’re welcome to try. Let’s see if their guns are faster than mine.","Don’t worry, even if I’m turned into Swiss cheese, I’ll make sure to blow your brains out first.\"","Shi Dong: !!!","\"Who are you? How dare you cause trouble on my turf!\"","Just then, a stern voice sounded from behind them.","\"Base leader, they’re here to cause trouble! Save me!\"","Hearing the voice, Shi Dong immediately cried out for help.","Nie Yizhou couldn’t help but laugh at the absurdity.","\"Hey, are you serious? We’ve already explained our intentions clearly. How is that causing trouble?","Meanwhile, you’re the one deceiving your leader, making decisions without authorization, and now you’re trying to shift the blame.\"","Nie Yizhou pursed his lips and looked at the man across from him.","\"You’re the base leader of Ren City, right? Let me tell you, this subordinate of yours has issues—big ones.\"","The man frowned.","\"Lower your weapons!\"","At his command, his men immediately complied.","Yun Xiaoxiao also holstered her gun and hopped off Shi Dong, landing back on the ground.","\"Now, who’s going to explain what’s going on here?\" the man asked sternly.","\"What a lovely little girl!\"","Suddenly, a light chuckle broke the tension.","\"Honey, why did you come down? Put on your coat. You’ll catch a cold.\"","But the woman ignored him and walked up to Yun Xiaoxiao, smiling warmly.","\"Little one, I’ve got some soup at home. Would you like to come and have some?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao: ???","The man’s lips twitched. \"Honey, we’re in the middle of something important.\"","\"What, is soup not important? Then don’t bother having any of the lamb soup I made today!\"","The man: ......"]},{"number":286,"title":"Chapter 286: When I Grow Up, I Will Marry Her","paragraphs":["\"Darling, I didn't mean it that way.\"","The man walked over, tugged at the woman's sleeve, trying to appease her.","The woman snorted, then turned her attention back to Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"Sigh, I’ve always wanted a daughter, but ended up with a boy instead.","He’s like a rocket, impossible to rein in, giving me a headache every day.","A daughter would be so much better. Look at her, so adorable. Holding her would surely melt my heart.","She’s exactly how I imagined my ideal daughter would be.\"","The woman’s gaze at Yun Xiaoxiao was filled with affection.","Nie Yizhou, standing nearby, struggled to suppress his laughter.","Adorable?","Melting hearts?","Hahahaha...","If only she’d seen her killing people.","As he laughed, he caught a deathly glare.","Nie Yizhou’s expression froze.","She knew his thoughts again!","Ahhh! This is unbearable!","This little ghost knows everything!","The silent exchange of glances went unnoticed by the woman, or perhaps she noticed but didn’t care.","She smiled warmly at Yun Xiaoxiao, \"Come, let’s go have some soup with Auntie.\"","Then she glanced at the man, \"Whatever you need to discuss, we’ll talk about it at home.\"","The man chuckled, \"Yes, yes, it’s freezing, and it’s getting dark. Home is the best place to be.\"","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others were slightly taken aback.","So, the base leader is afraid of his wife.","With his burly build and fierce appearance, and being the leader of the base, he didn’t seem like the type to be henpecked.","But reality was quite the opposite.","Truly, you can’t judge a book by its cover.","After that, Yun Xiaoxiao and the group were led to their home.","Along the way, they got a glimpse of the base’s interior.","It was a section of the original city, with high-rises and streets, all surrounded by walls.","Likely the work of earth-type ability users.","The city had electricity, and streetlights lined the roads.","Perhaps due to the snow and the approaching night, there weren’t many people on the streets.","Only a few hurried passersby could be seen.","When they saw the man and woman, they respectfully greeted them as “Base Leader” and “Madam.”","Their home wasn’t far, located in a villa area within the city.","The entire six-story villa belonged to them.","In front of the villa was a large courtyard, brightly lit.","As soon as they entered, a soccer ball came flying straight at them.","And, as luck would have it, it was headed directly for Yun Xiaoxiao.","The ball was fast and forceful, but Yun Xiaoxiao reacted quickly, punching it away just before it hit her.","The ball flew off instantly.","\"Ouch!\"","A cry of pain came from not far away.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others turned to see a boy, about seven or eight years old, sitting on the grass in the courtyard’s left corner, holding his right cheek and groaning in pain.","\"You little rascal, I told you to be careful when playing soccer! You almost hurt Xiaoxiao!\"","Jin Zhuyan walked over, grabbed the boy’s ear, and yanked him up.","Her once gentle demeanor vanished, replaced by a fierce, scolding tone.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others were momentarily stunned.","The couple’s contrast was just too stark.","\"Jin Zhuyan, I’m the one who got hit by the ball! You’re not even concerned about me, and you’re pulling my ear. Where’s the logic in that?\"","The boy wailed loudly.","\"Jin Zhuyan? I’m your mother! Call me by my full name again, and I’ll spank you till you can’t sit!\"","\"Dad, aren’t you going to stop your wife? She’s hitting your son!\"","Shen Yan flailed around, looking for backup.","\"Darling, the boy does need some discipline. If you’re tired of hitting him, I’ll take over,\" Shen Tianlei said with a chuckle.","Shen Yan: !!!","\"Are you even my real parents?\"","\"No, we found you in the trash,\" Jin Zhuyan retorted irritably.","Shen Yan: ......","He was utterly speechless.","Then he noticed Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","\"Jin Zhuyan, who are they?\"","He tugged at Jin Zhuyan’s sleeve.","But before his mother could answer, his eyes lit up, and he dashed over to Yun Xiaoxiao.","\"Wow, this little sister is so kawaii! Mom, when I grow up, I’m going to marry her!","She’s so cute, she must be gentle, not like you, so rough.\"","\"The ball that hit you was punched away by her~\"","Nie Yizhou couldn’t help but tease, revealing the truth.","Shen Yan: ......","After the little incident, everyone went inside.","\"Why is the air conditioner off?\"","Nie Yizhou asked, noticing the air conditioner in the living room.","The indoor temperature was about the same as outside, clearly indicating the air conditioner wasn’t on.","They had electricity here, didn’t they?","Shen Tianlei smiled, \"The power grid was just repaired. We’re short on electricity now, and it’s already tight for daily use. We can’t afford to run the air conditioner.","We only have electricity three times a day—morning, noon, and evening, for an hour each time.","Once the time’s up, it’s cut off.\"","His words made Zheng Yuner and Ci Wan appreciate the advantages of Yun City even more.","There, electricity was unlimited!","\"Please, have a seat. I’ll have Aunt Liu bring out the lamb stew and prepare some side dishes.\"","Jin Zhuyan smiled and headed to the kitchen.","Shen Tianlei invited Yun Xiaoxiao and the others to sit on the living room sofa.","Then he walked to the door and called in Shi Dong and another subordinate.","He pointed at the subordinate.","\"Tell me, what exactly happened earlier?\"","As the base leader, he exuded a certain authority just by standing there.","Hearing this, Shi Dong’s eyes flickered.","He subtly lowered his head, but a shadow passed through the corner of his eye.","The subordinate glanced at Shi Dong, then at Shen Tianlei, and began recounting the events truthfully.","As he spoke, Jin Zhuyan brought out some snacks and placed them on the coffee table for Yun Xiaoxiao and the others to enjoy.","She then sat beside Shen Tianlei, listening as the subordinate finished his account.","\"Everyone, is that what happened?\"","After the subordinate finished, Shen Tianlei looked at Mu Yang and the others.","Mu Yang nodded, \"Pretty much.\"","Hearing this, Shen Tianlei frowned and turned to Shi Dong.","\"Do you have anything to say for yourself?\"","Shi Dong quickly explained, \"Base Leader, I wasn’t making decisions on your behalf.","I just thought that even if what they said about the zombie-killing army is true, we can’t risk sending our people all the way to Rong City to fight zombies.","It’s too dangerous, and lives could be lost.","We’re safe here in the base. There’s no reason to take such a risk.","And even if we wiped out the zombies elsewhere, what good would it do us?","Ren City is already zombie-free. We’re secure here.","What happens to the zombies in other places is none of our concern.","Everyone’s finally settled down. We shouldn’t get involved in this mess.\""]},{"number":287,"title":"Chapter 287: The Clever Kim Joo-yeon","paragraphs":["Shen Tianlei fell silent for a moment.","He felt that although Shi Dong's previous actions were inappropriate, there was some truth to his words.","He had led his team to exterminate all the zombies in Ren City, and during that time, many lives were sacrificed to bring about the current peace. It really wasn’t wise to take unnecessary risks now.","Besides, he had a wife and children to think about.","If something were to happen to him, what would become of them?","“You can’t look at it that way.”","Just as Shen Tianlei was deep in thought, Jin Zhuyan, who was sitting nearby, spoke up with a smile.","Her eyes sparkled with wisdom.","“Zombies are everywhere in the world now; there’s no place that’s truly safe.","If there is, it’s only temporary.","Zombies aren’t lifeless objects—they’re living entities.","They’re constantly on the move.","They might be far from Ren City today, but who’s to say they won’t wander close to us tomorrow?","Our current safety is just an illusion.”","“Isn’t that the same as ‘when the lips are gone, the teeth will be cold’?” Shen Yan tilted his head.","“Smart!” Jin Zhuyan gave Shen Yan an approving look.","“See, even my son understands this logic.","Besides, hasn’t this zombie-killing army already wiped out zombies in many cities?","That’s indirectly helping us eliminate a lot of potential threats.","We can’t just let others risk their lives to kill all the zombies while we sit back, do nothing, and then smugly enjoy the fruits of their labor, can we?","That would be too dishonorable, too cowardly.”","“So, Jin Zhuyan, what’s your suggestion?” Shen Tianlei looked at his wife.","Jin Zhuyan smiled. “Of course, we should join them. What else is there to think about?”","“But ma’am, if we really join, many people might die,” Shi Dong tried to dissuade her.","Jin Zhuyan raised an eyebrow and stared directly at Shi Dong.","“If we hadn’t made up our minds to kill all the zombies in the city before, how many people do you think would still be alive in our base today?”","This question left Shi Dong speechless.","He opened his mouth but couldn’t find the words to respond.","If it hadn’t been for Jin Zhuyan and Shen Tianlei’s decisive actions back then—rescuing people and organizing teams to kill zombies—the number of survivors would likely be less than one-twentieth of what it is now!","Everyone wouldn’t be enjoying this relatively peaceful and stable life either.","Zombies would have been like locusts, devouring humans one by one, until humanity was completely destroyed.","“Alright, we’ll do as Jin Zhuyan says. After all, I’m just a rough man—making decisions is your forte.”","Shen Tianlei laughed heartily and finalized the matter.","“It’s settled then. No more discussions. We’ll gather everyone tomorrow morning and select people for the mission.”","Shi Dong’s brow twitched, but in the end, he could only nod and leave the room with another subordinate.","Watching them leave, Yun Xiaoxiao’s gaze narrowed.","Hmm, this person is quite interesting.","“Alright, everyone, come over and have some soup to warm up.”","Seeing the nanny bring the soup pot to the table, Jin Zhuyan immediately called everyone over to sit down.","“What’s your name?”","Shen Yan plopped down next to Yun Xiaoxiao and asked with a grin.","Despite his young age, he already had fox-like eyes, and when he smiled, two dimples appeared on his cheeks.","There was no doubt about it—if he didn’t grow up to be a handsome man, it would be a miracle.","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at him coolly and replied indifferently,","“Yun Xiaoxiao.”","“Do you want to stay and be my child bride?” he chuckled.","“Smack!”","Jin Zhuyan slapped the back of his head.","“You little rascal, where did you learn such words? Sit still, or you’ll be out in the cold!”","Shen Yan pouted. “Jin Zhuyan, you’re getting meaner. Be careful, or Shen Tianlei might leave you!”","“You little brat!” Shen Tianlei immediately threw a chopstick at him. “I’d sooner leave you than your mom!”","“Hah, missed me~”","Shen Yan dodged the chopstick and stuck out his tongue triumphantly.","Shen Tianlei was so angry his chest heaved.","This son was nothing but trouble!","And so, the house descended into chaos.","Shen Tianlei chased Shen Yan around the room, trying to catch him.","Shen Yan occasionally fought back.","Father and son were completely absorbed in their “love-hate” battle.","“Don’t mind them. Come, have some soup—it’s delicious.”","Jin Zhuyan smiled and handed out bowls of soup to everyone.","“Thank you.”","Ci Wan took a bowl and took a sip.","“Mmm, it really is good. It’s been a while since I’ve had such authentic lamb soup.”","Zheng Yuner didn’t say a word but was busy slurping down the soup.","Clearly, the soup was a hit.","Yun Xiaoxiao, Nie Yizhou, and Mu Yang also started drinking.","“Mmm, it’s full of flavor!”","“Here’s some fermented tofu and flatbread to go with it.”","Jin Zhuyan pushed the dishes toward them.","“By the way, Jin Zhuyan, you mentioned earlier that you and your husband were the ones who killed all the zombies in the city. Can you tell us more about it? I’m really curious.”","Nie Yizhou asked while munching on a piece of flatbread.","“Well...” Jin Zhuyan pursed her lips. “I suppose there’s no harm in telling you.”","She pulled up a chair and sat down.","“Your brother Shen Tianlei and I used to be involved in arms smuggling.”","The first sentence left everyone stunned.","“Are you surprised?” Jin Zhuyan chuckled.","Nie Yizhou quickly waved his hands. “No, no, it’s just... not what we expected.”","“If we looked like arms smugglers, wouldn’t we have been arrested the moment we stepped outside?”","Hearing Jin Zhuyan’s joke, everyone couldn’t help but laugh.","She continued,","“When the zombie virus broke out, Ren City was thrown into chaos.","The police and government systems collapsed, and everyone was living in misery.","At first, we didn’t think about anything as ambitious as killing all the zombies in the city.","We just wanted to protect ourselves.","So, I discussed it with my husband, and we started clearing the zombies around our living area.","That way, we could ensure our own safety.","During this process, we saved a lot of people.","As our group grew, we needed more space.","So, we decided to take over the entire city.","Since we were already involved in arms smuggling, we had a lot of weapons in our warehouse that we could use.","So, we gathered capable people and systematically cleared the city of zombies.”","“I see.”","Nie Yizhou nodded in understanding.","Then he winked and asked curiously, “Jin Zhuyan, how did you and Shen Tianlei end up together?”","“Are you trying to say we don’t look like a good match?” Jin Zhuyan laughed.","Nie Yizhou grinned. “No, no, I’m just... genuinely curious.”"]},{"number":288,"title":"Chapter 288: Are You Coveting Your Sister-in-law","paragraphs":["Jin Zhuyan was adding soup to everyone’s bowls while reminiscing.","“Actually, I was just a college student at first.","During a trip to the border, I met my husband.","We stayed in rooms across the hall from each other at the same hotel.","At the time, I didn’t know he was involved in the dangerous world of smuggling, and we ended up arguing over some trivial matters.","He’s quite an interesting person—looks intimidating but isn’t good at arguing. Every time, I’d leave him speechless.","He’d get angry, but he never hurt me.","In fact, he saved me.","Once, terrorists stormed the hotel, and I was taken hostage. I was on the verge of losing my life when my husband risked everything to save me. He even got a big scar on his forehead because of it.","You know, I used to be someone who cared a lot about looks. Someone like my husband? I wouldn’t have even glanced at him before.","But after he saved me from those thugs, I suddenly thought he was ten thousand times more handsome than any pretty boy out there.","I took the initiative to confess my feelings to him, and he was so shocked he just froze.","Can you imagine a big guy like him, with his ears and face turning bright red?","Clearly, he’d never been confessed to by a woman before.","Or at least, not by someone as bold and beautiful as me.”","As if recalling the scene of her confession, Jin Zhuyan couldn’t help but chuckle.","“What happened after that? Did you get together?”","Ci Wan looked over curiously.","Jin Zhuyan shook her head with a smile. “No, I got rejected.”","“What?”","Nie Yizhou paused mid-sip, clearly in disbelief.","“No way, Brother Tianlei rejected you?”","“You don’t believe it either, right? I didn’t believe it either at the time. I thought I must have misheard him.”","Jin Zhuyan gave a bitter smile.","“I was the campus belle at my university. So many handsome, wealthy guys pursued me, and I turned them all down.","And yet, the first time I confessed to someone, I got rejected.”","“So how did you two end up together?”","“After he rejected me, I just couldn’t let it go.","So, I camped outside his door.","I told him whether he agreed or not, he was going to be my boyfriend.”","Nie Yizhou and Yun Xiaoxiao both gave her a thumbs-up.","Impressive!","Bold!","Jin Zhuyan laughed heartily. “Right? I never thought I’d be so fierce in chasing a man.","But he still wouldn’t agree. He said we weren’t a good match.","That I should find a normal boyfriend to be happy.","I wasn’t having it, so I kept pressing him for a reason.","Finally, he told me about his profession.”","Nie Yizhou: “Were you scared when you found out?”","Jin Zhuyan shook her head. “Scared? I thought it was pretty cool.","I told him I didn’t mind, but he still flat-out rejected me.","I have my pride, so I told him if he didn’t agree, I’d never see him again.","I didn’t care what expression he had on his face. I just walked away.","After that, even if I saw him, I ignored him.","About two days later, he couldn’t take it anymore and came to find me.”","Ci Wan and the others couldn’t help but admire her.","That move? Genius!","“Later, I found out that he had actually liked me for a while.","He was just worried that I’d get hurt because of his enemies, which is why he initially refused to be with me.","After we got together, our relationship was always great.","Six months later, I graduated and told my family I was going abroad for work, but I was actually with him.”","Just then, Shen Tianlei returned, dragging a struggling Shen Yan behind him.","He added with a smile, “Back then, I was just a small-time arms dealer in the underworld, not very powerful.","But after Zhuyan joined me, she became my strategist.","She’s incredibly smart, and with her help, I gradually became the largest arms dealer in Hua Country.”","Shen Tianlei’s gaze was full of affection as he looked at Jin Zhuyan.","Shen Yan shuddered. “Ugh, so mushy. Dad, you’re always feeding me dog food, but could you at least remember there are guests here?”","Shen Tianlei looked embarrassed as he glanced at Yun Xiaoxiao and the others.","“Ah, sorry, I forgot.”","The dinner was filled with laughter and warmth.","Yun Xiaoxiao asked if they had any zombie crystals, since they had wiped out all the zombies in Ren City.","But Shen Tianlei and the others said they hadn’t found a single one.","They didn’t even know what crystals were.","Their base also didn’t have a radio, so they were unaware of the recent meeting held by the Western Base.","After dinner, they offered to let the group stay and rest.","But Yun Xiaoxiao and the others declined.","They said there were people waiting for them, and if they didn’t return, those people would worry.","Jin Zhuyan reluctantly let them go, promising to send a team to meet up with them the next day.","Yun Xiaoxiao advised that the number of people didn’t matter as much as their strength.","They should also leave some people at the base to guard against any unexpected incidents.","Just before leaving, Yun Xiaoxiao seemed to remember something and turned back to look at Jin Zhuyan and Shen Tianlei.","“Oh, by the way, it’s best if you don’t keep that person around anymore.”","“Who?”","The couple looked confused.","Yun Xiaoxiao said, “The one named Shi Dong.”","“Why?” Shen Tianlei was puzzled. “He acted out of line earlier, but he’s been with me for a long time. I doubt there’s any real issue.”","“There’s a big issue,” Yun Xiaoxiao said, looking at Jin Zhuyan. “Because he has his eyes on Auntie Zhuyan.”","“What?!”","Shen Tianlei’s pupils dilated in shock.","“Xiaoxiao, why do you say that? Did you notice something?”","“Kid, is that true?” Nie Yizhou also leaned in curiously.","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded. “Not only that, but he also harbors a lot of resentment toward Uncle Tianlei.","If you don’t believe me, call him over and ask.","Whether it’s true or not, he’ll slip up eventually.”","Yun Xiaoxiao’s words made Shen Tianlei frown.","Shi Dong was a trusted subordinate who had been with him since he was just a small-time arms dealer.","Though impulsive at times, he had always been loyal.","Shen Tianlei had never doubted him before.","But this involved his beloved wife, so he couldn’t ignore it.","If Shi Dong really had such intentions, he would not let it slide!","So, he immediately sent someone to summon Shi Dong.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others weren’t in a hurry to leave, so they stayed to see it through.","After all, she was the one who brought it up, so she felt responsible to see it to the end.","She wasn’t usually one to meddle, but Jin Zhuyan had really clicked with her, and she liked her a lot.","She couldn’t just stand by.","Not long after, Shi Dong arrived.","Seeing everyone’s eyes on him, he looked confused.","“Boss, did you need me for something?”","Shen Tianlei stared at him and asked directly in a serious tone,","“Do you have your eyes on my wife?”"]},{"number":289,"title":"Chapter 289: Sorry, I couldn't help it.","paragraphs":["Hearing this, Shi Dong’s heart immediately panicked.","He tried to calm himself, wanting to say he hadn’t done anything.","But his flustered reaction in that moment, when his secret was exposed, had already betrayed him.","Seeing this, Shen Tianlei’s expression darkened.","“So, it’s true that you hold a grudge against me?”","Shi Dong: !!!","How does he even know that?!","“No! Brother Lei, you know me better than anyone. How could I possibly hold a grudge against you?”","He hurriedly defended himself.","He knew that if he didn’t smooth over these two matters today, his fate would be dire.","Seeing his nervous demeanor, Shen Tianlei understood everything.","Disappointment spread across his face.","“Hmph, I used to know you, but now... I can’t seem to understand you anymore.”","This statement made it clear that he had completely lost trust in Shi Dong.","Shi Dong, of course, understood this as well.","Suddenly, he burst into maniacal laughter, his eyes filled with resentment and bitterness.","“Shen Tianlei, who do you think you are? You were just a street thug sleeping on the streets before.","Why is it that we were both thugs, but you ended up marrying a woman like Jin Zhuyan?","If it weren’t for her, what would you even be?","Would you have the status and power you have now?","Why should I always be beneath you, watching you two lovebirds while you order me around?","What exactly am I lacking compared to you?!”","The more he spoke, the more twisted his expression became, as if he were on the verge of exploding.","His demeanor only made Shen Tianlei’s heart grow colder.","From the very beginning until now, he had never mistreated Shi Dong.","In all honesty, he had always treated him fairly.","And he had never once doubted him.","But now, that trust seemed laughable.","Shi Dong’s jealousy had turned into hatred.","He could no longer keep him by his side.","“Just leave.”","Shen Tianlei let out a heavy sigh.","Shi Dong was stunned. He had thought Shen Tianlei wouldn’t let him go.","Hmph, maybe this was for the best.","He still had a chance.","Today, Shen Tianlei had humiliated him in front of everyone, showing no regard for his dignity.","This humiliation, he would definitely repay!","And... Zhuyan...","Once Shen Tianlei was dead, she would be his!","Shi Dong lowered his head and prepared to turn and leave.","“Wait.”","But in the next second, a small figure blocked his path.","When he saw who it was, Shi Dong clenched his fists.","It was that damn girl again!","He glared at Yun Xiaoxiao as if his gaze could pierce through her.","“What do you want?” he asked in a hostile tone.","Yun Xiaoxiao wagged her little finger. “You can’t leave yet.”","Then, she turned to Shen Tianlei, who looked confused, and smiled. “Uncle Tianlei, have you ever heard the phrase ‘letting the tiger return to the mountain’?”","Hearing this, Jin Zhuyan’s brows furrowed.","She glanced at Shi Dong, who had his back to them.","Shen Tianlei wasn’t a fool either. Though he was a rough man, he had risen to his current position not just because of Jin Zhuyan’s help—he had some brains of his own.","Yun Xiaoxiao had already proven right about the two things she had accused Shi Dong of earlier.","Now, at this critical moment, she mentioned “letting the tiger return to the mountain.”","Wasn’t it obvious that she was saying Shi Dong’s hatred remained, and he would later strike back like a ferocious tiger, harming them?","Glancing at his wife and son, Shen Tianlei’s eyes darkened.","Anyone who posed a threat to them could not be allowed to live!","“I understand.”","He spoke in a low voice, his gaze fixed on Shi Dong.","As soon as these words were spoken, Shi Dong’s expression froze.","He knew exactly what this meant!","He glared viciously at Yun Xiaoxiao.","Now he understood why Shen Tianlei had suddenly become suspicious of him and had so accurately uncovered his secrets.","It was all because of this damn girl!","She must have been the one stirring up trouble!","With a ferocious look in his eyes, before Shen Tianlei could act, Shi Dong suddenly pulled out a gun and aimed it at Yun Xiaoxiao.","“You little brat, if you’re not going to let me live, then you’re not going to live either.","Even if I’m destined to die, I’ll take you down with me!”","Without hesitation, he pulled the trigger.","“Xiaoxiao!”","“Be careful, sis!”","“Shi Dong, what are you doing?! Stop!”","The family of three was frantic, rushing forward immediately.","On the other hand, Mu Yang, Nie Yizhou, Ci Wan, and Zheng Yuner, though initially worried, quickly calmed down the next second.","Who was Yun Xiaoxiao?","This kind of amateur move couldn’t possibly harm her.","Yes, they were that confident.","Sure enough, just as Jin Zhuyan and her family rushed forward, Yun Xiaoxiao, who had been standing in place, suddenly disappeared.","The bullet missed, hitting the wall of the courtyard instead.","Before anyone could react, Yun Xiaoxiao appeared behind Shi Dong in the next second.","She raised her right hand, summoning a thin, elongated vine.","The vine shot out, piercing straight into Shi Dong’s heart.","“Pfft!”","The vine pierced his heart with pinpoint accuracy.","Blood gushed from his chest.","His chest heaved, and he spat out a large pool of blood.","The crimson blood splattered onto the snow-covered ground, staining it red.","Shi Dong looked down at the vine protruding from his chest, his eyes wide with shock.","He opened his mouth, trying to speak, but no words came out.","In no time, he closed his eyes for good.","Yun Xiaoxiao retracted the vine.","Turning around, she saw the stunned family of three.","She shrugged. “Sorry, I couldn’t help myself.","If you’re still not satisfied, you can stab him again.”","She gestured toward Shi Dong’s lifeless body lying on the ground.","The family of three all twitched their lips in unison.","“Haha... no need, no need,” Jin Zhuyan said with an awkward laugh.","But then, her eyes lit up even more as she looked at Yun Xiaoxiao.","“Xiaoxiao, how about you become my goddaughter?”","She really liked this little girl.","“No way! I’m going to marry her when I grow up. If you make her your goddaughter, I won’t have a wife anymore!” Shen Yan immediately protested.","“You brat, get lost. Take a look at yourself—do you even deserve Xiaoxiao?”","Shen Tianlei smacked him on the head.","Shen Yan: ......","He was definitely not their biological son!","With Shen Yan’s interruption, Jin Zhuyan’s plan to make Yun Xiaoxiao her goddaughter was cut short.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others then boarded a helicopter and returned to where Lu Chen and the others were.","The next morning, around 9:30, Shen Tianlei arrived with his team.","Jin Zhuyan and Shen Yan were among them.","Shen Tianlei chuckled. “This troublemaker insisted on coming along. It’s good for him to get some experience.","The world’s different now. Being a sheltered flower will only harm him.","Better for him to adapt early.","Otherwise, he’ll stay naïve like a fool.”","Shen Yan: !!!","Who’s naïve?","Who’s a fool?!"]},{"number":290,"title":"Chapter 290: Zombie Pigs on the Attack","paragraphs":["Shen Tianlei arrived with over six hundred people.","They were all carefully selected by him.","Half of them were supernaturals, and those without supernatural abilities were skilled in martial arts.","In addition to the people, Shen Tianlei also brought a large amount of firearms and ammunition.","The new team had grown even larger.","Together, they set off toward Rong City.","Since they had to wait for the teams of Jiang Huai and Peng Shaowei to join them before taking action, Lu Chen decided not to lead the group ahead this time but instead moved forward with the main force.","\"Boom!\"","While everyone was speeding along a road with no guardrails and tall trees on both sides, an unknown creature suddenly burst out of the woods without warning.","It crashed head-on into the lead vehicle.","The collision produced a deafening sound.","The convoy was forced to stop.","Immediately after, the unknown creature, which had been flung several meters away, twisted its body and quickly stood up, letting out a horrifying screech.","\"Holy crap! What the hell is that?!\"","\"It looks like... a pig?\"","\"It is a pig, but... a zombie pig!\"","\"Look over there!\"","Someone shouted, pointing toward the woods where the zombie pig had emerged.","The sound of rumbling footsteps could be heard coming from that direction.","Then, one after another, more zombie pigs ran out.","They were massive, grotesque, with blackened, rotting flesh infested with maggots.","Upon seeing the humans, they charged forward as if they had found a feast, their numbers overwhelming and their presence terrifying.","Shen Tianlei immediately ordered his people to open fire.","But before the bullets could hit the zombie pigs, they had already dashed away.","Even when hit, only a few were affected.","The zombie pigs continued to charge uncontrollably toward them.","At that moment, a wall of ice rose from the ground, blocking the path between the convoy and the zombie pigs.","\"Boom! Boom! Boom!\"","A series of collision sounds followed.","It was clear that the zombie pigs, which had been charging at full speed, had slammed into the thick ice wall.","Then, several figures suddenly appeared atop the ice wall.","It was Yun Xiaoxiao and Lu Chen.","While Lu Chen and the others attacked the zombie pigs, Yun Xiaoxiao and Nie Yizhou quickly disappeared.","When they reappeared, more people stood atop the ice wall.","Finally, the entire group from Yun City stood on the ice wall, launching a fierce assault on the zombie pigs.","Shen Tianlei and the others watched in awe.","At that moment, they truly witnessed the might of Yun Xiaoxiao and her companions.","\"We made the right choice coming here!\"","Shen Tianlei's eyes gleamed with determination.","Only by following the strong could one become stronger.","Otherwise, they would remain stagnant, confined to their own limited world.","\"Kid, take a good look. This is what real power looks like!\"","He spoke earnestly to Shen Yan beside him.","\"You’ve always been saying you want to marry Xiaoxiao when you grow up. Do you think you’re capable of that now?","To be with someone, you don’t necessarily have to be stronger, but you must be their equal. Only then are you truly matched.\"","Listening to Shen Tianlei’s words, Shen Yan’s eyes burned with a fiery determination.","But that calm and wise light in his eyes flickered briefly before vanishing.","The next second, he put on a cheeky grin and chuckled.","\"Who says I can’t be a freeloader? I think Xiaoxiao and I are a perfect match. She handles the outside world, and I take care of the home. Isn’t that great?\"","Shen Tianlei: \"......\"","Jin Zhuyan: \"......\"","\"Damn, did these things escape from some pig farm? How are there so many of them?\"","Nie Yizhou, after killing one zombie pig, saw hundreds more rushing toward them and immediately felt overwhelmed.","At that moment, he noticed Yun Xiaoxiao wasn’t killing the pigs but instead turning her back and continuously releasing ice.","\"Kid, what are you doing?\" he asked.","Yun Xiaoxiao: \"Building steps so everyone can join the fight.\"","With so many zombie pigs, it wasn’t feasible for them to handle everything alone while the others did nothing.","Working together would save time.","For others, using energy to build steps might not be worth it, but Yun Xiaoxiao had an endless supply of evolution liquid and spiritual spring water to replenish herself, so she didn’t mind.","Soon, she had built several layers of steps.","Shen Tianlei, Zhang Piaopiao, Earth Traveler Sun, and others also made their way to the edge of the ice wall.","The row of ice walls was now filled with people.","Everyone used their unique abilities to deal with the zombie pigs.","Amidst the dazzling display of supernatural powers, bullets flew, creating a chaotic but effective scene.","Watching Shen Yan, who was now focused and seriously killing zombies, Shen Tianlei and Jin Zhuyan exchanged a knowing smile.","This kid, though he talks tough, his actions speak louder than words.","Finally, under the group’s relentless assault, nearly a thousand zombie pigs were wiped out.","Afterward, Yun Xiaoxiao and the others began cracking open the zombie pigs’ heads to retrieve their cores.","\"Is this the core?\"","Shen Tianlei looked at the shiny object inside a zombie pig’s head, his eyes filled with surprise.","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded. \"Yes, whether it’s a zombie or an animal infected with the zombie virus, their brains will form this kind of crystal. This is the core.","I told you yesterday, as long as you have cores, you can exchange them with me for evolution liquid.","The evolution liquid can enhance your supernatural abilities.\"","Hearing this, Shen Tianlei’s expression grew serious.","The night before, after Yun Xiaoxiao asked if he had any cores, she gave him, his wife, and their son each a bottle of evolution liquid to try.","They were utterly shocked by the results.","After drinking the small bottle, he felt his body’s power surge significantly.","The sensation was incredible.","Looking at the crystals Yun Xiaoxiao had extracted, he decided that he would definitely seek out more of these in the future to exchange for evolution liquid and boost his strength.","In the end, Yun Xiaoxiao collected all the zombie pig cores and distributed evolution liquid to everyone based on their contributions and the number of people.","Most of them had low-level supernatural abilities, so they only needed first or second-level evolution liquid.","Yun Xiaoxiao had plenty of these.","However, the cores collected from the zombie pigs were mostly second and third-level.","No matter how you calculated it, Yun Xiaoxiao came out ahead.","Many people drank the evolution liquid as soon as they received it, especially Earth Traveler Sun and his group.","At first, when Yun Xiaoxiao gave them the evolution liquid, they thought it was poison and that she was trying to kill them.","But after being forced to drink it, they realized how valuable it was.","After this small incident, the group continued their journey.","Along the way, they encountered many other dangers, such as small groups of zombies, zombie cats, and zombie sheep.","But they dealt with each one.","Through these battles, the group not only grew more united but also significantly improved their strength.","On the morning of the third day, they finally entered the territory of Rong City."]},{"number":291,"title":"Chapter 291: Look, What's That in the Sky","paragraphs":["Rong City is the largest city in the western region.","The urban area covers a vast expanse.","Eliminating all the zombies within it is no easy task.","As is well known, areas with more zombies are also more likely to spawn powerful mutated zombies.","Back when Yun Xiaoxiao and her team first arrived in Rong City, they had encountered mutated zombies.","That was during the early days of the apocalypse.","Most zombies were still at their lowest tier back then.","After so much time had passed, who knows how many formidable creatures had evolved within the city?","This time, they were traveling on the highway.","The road was flanked by hills on both sides.","“Once we pass that tunnel ahead, we’ll be close to Rong City,” Nie Yizhou said with a smile.","He had traveled this road before and still had some recollection of it.","“The road’s blocked up ahead.”","No sooner had he spoken than Lu Chen’s voice rang out.","Lu Chen was piloting the lead helicopter, so he was the first to see the road conditions ahead.","At that moment, a massive landslide had occurred in front of the tunnel.","Mud and branches from the hillside had tumbled onto the road, piling up like a mountain and completely blocking the tunnel’s exit.","This was likely the result of the heavy rainstorm that had struck earlier.","The convoy came to a halt.","All the earth-element ability users went to assist.","It took about half an hour to clear the roadblock before the convoy could resume its journey.","However, at the highway exit, the convoy was forced to stop once again.","The exit, as well as the service road leading off the highway, was completely blocked.","Countless vehicles were scattered haphazardly, some rear-ended, others overturned, creating a chaotic mess.","Most of them were vehicles trying to leave the city.","It was clear how desperately those people had tried to flee the city.","But in the end, their hopes were dashed.","Everyone got out of their vehicles to deal with the zombies that were lunging at them.","“This exit is blocked. Should we try another one?” Nie Yizhou asked.","Mu Yang shook his head. “It’s no use. The other exits are probably the same.”","Everyone was trying to escape, so every road and exit would likely be in the same state.","“Then we’ll have to clear these vehicles blocking the way.”","Everyone turned their gaze to the service road that snaked like a serpent along the viaduct.","All the strength-based ability users sprang into action. The stronger ones could flip a small car on their own.","For larger vehicles like trucks, two or three people worked together to lift them.","Of course, the others weren’t idle either, using their own methods to clear the obstructing vehicles.","And the zombies that occasionally emerged.","As they cleared the road, the convoy inched forward.","“Wait!”","Hua Bai suddenly spoke up.","Everyone stopped what they were doing and looked at him, puzzled.","Hua Bai twitched his ears, staring into the distance.","“Something’s coming from over there!”","Everyone followed his gaze.","Ahead, aside from the mountain of cars and a few zombies running toward them, there was nothing.","“It’s in the sky!”","Liu Xiaohui adjusted her glasses, looking toward the distant sky.","The falling snow made the sky appear hazy, making it hard to see clearly.","Everyone focused their attention.","Soon, small black dots appeared in the sky.","Then, the sound of countless flapping wings and piercing screeches broke through the mist.","The noise grew louder, and the creatures gradually came into view.","“Birds!”","“So many birds!”","“No.”","Hua Bai frowned.","“Those aren’t ordinary birds. They look like... zombie birds!","Their eyes are red, their feathers dull and lifeless, and some even have wounds on their bodies.”","Hearing this, everyone’s expressions turned grave.","Looking at the dense swarm of ‘birds’ flying toward them, they couldn’t help but feel a sense of dread.","These were not as easy to deal with as zombie pigs.","The number of zombie birds was at least three times that of zombie pigs.","What’s more, they were small, fast, and airborne, with sharp claws and beaks.","This made fighting them much riskier.","It would be extremely difficult to defend against them.","“Everyone, get back in the vehicles and close all the windows!”","As the zombie birds drew closer, Lu Chen called out in a calm but firm voice.","Everyone snapped out of their daze and hurried back into their cars or helicopters.","Once everyone was inside, Lu Chen channeled his energy and quickly erected a pristine barrier, enveloping everyone.","The next moment...","‘Bang! Bang! Bang!’ A series of collision sounds rang out, mixed with the unique screeches of the zombie birds, sending chills down everyone’s spines.","Everyone sat quietly in their seats, nerves on edge.","They stared intently out the windows, worried that the barrier might not withstand the onslaught of the zombie birds.","“There’s a breach over here!”","Suddenly, someone cried out in alarm.","Hearing this, Lu Chen furrowed his brow and swiftly repaired the gap with a wave of his hand.","The zombie birds outside clearly knew there were many ‘delicious’ treats inside, so they continued to frantically collide with the barrier.","They were tireless and fearless.","Gradually, more and more breaches began to appear.","A pitch-black zombie bird slipped through the barrier and darted toward one of the buses.","‘Smack!’ It hit a window.","“Ah!”","The person sitting by the window was startled.","Fortunately, the window held.","Though Lu Chen kept repairing the breaches, more and more zombie birds managed to squeeze through.","The zombie birds, now seeing live prey, became even more frenzied, flapping their wings and slamming into the windows.","The collision sounds grew louder and more frequent.","It was hard to imagine how much longer the windows could hold if the zombie birds continued to gather.","“We should go out and fight. If we let these zombie birds surround us, it’ll be even harder to kill them later,” Jin Zhuyan’s voice came through the walkie-talkie.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s brows furrowed.","This situation couldn’t continue.","She picked up the walkie-talkie with a serious expression.","“All earth, ice, and metal ability users, head out first and build walls around us to block them.","Make sure the walls are sturdy.","Big brother, you focus on guarding the top.","You can open a small gap to let some zombie birds in.","Also, fire and other aerial combat ability users, stand by and prepare to attack. Once the zombie birds get in, focus your firepower on them!","Everyone else, stay in the vehicles!”","Her young voice was steady and commanding, like a general issuing orders.","Having spent so much time with her, everyone knew that despite her age, she was decisive.","Her judgments and actions had always been correct.","So, as soon as she finished speaking, everyone sprang into action."]},{"number":292,"title":"Chapter 292: So, are you my girlfriend now","paragraphs":["Barriers continued to rise all around.","Lu Chen focused on defending most of the sky, intentionally leaving a small gap untouched.","The zombie birds, eager and relentless, would swarm through that gap.","Once they appeared, the fire-type ability users would launch their fiery attacks first, while others provided support.","Everyone followed Yun Xiaoxiao’s earlier plan, sticking to their assigned positions and working together to fend off the overwhelming tide of zombie birds.","The process was long and tedious, but no one complained or showed signs of exhaustion.","All eyes were fixed on the movements of the zombie birds, not daring to let their guard down for even a moment.","Finally, after an intense battle lasting an hour and a half, silence fell outside the barriers.","“It seems... they’re gone?”","Everyone looked around, scanning the sky.","Only after confirming that no zombie birds remained did Lu Chen slowly withdraw the white barriers.","“That was close. If a small team had encountered those birds, I can’t imagine how devastating it would have been.”","Once the danger had passed, everyone began discussing the ordeal with lingering fear.","“Yeah, those things are sometimes even scarier than zombies.”","“Thankfully, we had numbers on our side.”","“I think it’s because the people from Yun City acted decisively and were incredibly strong. Even though there were fewer of them, they took out almost 90% of the zombie birds.”","“Exactly, they’re unbelievably powerful!”","After dealing with the zombie birds, the group continued clearing obstacles on the road.","By the time they reached the end of the circular service road, it was almost dark.","Ahead lay the exit of the highway.","Beyond the toll booth was a four-lane road.","The two lanes leading out of the city were packed with abandoned vehicles.","“We’ll spend the night on the overpass. Tomorrow, we’ll clear the road ahead while waiting for the other teams to arrive.”","Yun Xiaoxiao instructed everyone to return to a safe area and then sealed off the entrance.","Afterward, they began setting up tents, though some chose to sleep in their vehicles.","Dinner was a simple affair of biscuits and bread.","They were already on the outskirts of Rong City, and with zombies wandering below the bridge, it wasn’t safe to start a fire for cooking.","Once their stomachs were full, many turned in early.","The day had been exhausting, and the constant tension had left them too tired to keep their eyes open.","Those assigned to night watch diligently patrolled the area, while others who couldn’t sleep gathered in small groups to chat.","“The snow’s getting heavier...”","“Yeah, I really hope the battle for Rong City ends soon. It’s been so long since I’ve seen my son.”","“It’s almost over. Once the other two groups arrive, we’ll be ready for the final push!”","Earth Traveler Sun was also chatting with his companions.","“By the way, I heard that after they take Rong City, they’ll return to their respective bases. Where will we go then?”","“Brother, don’t overthink it. It’s not like we get to decide where we go.”","“...True.”","“Wherever we end up, as long as that little demon doesn’t kill us, it’s fine.”","“She saved us before. Why would she kill us?","Actually, I think that little girl’s pretty good.","Not only did she save us, but ever since we’ve been following her, I feel like I’m not as lost or helpless as before.","Now, every day has a purpose. We have food, water, and our strength keeps improving.","Seeing the zombies being wiped out and the cities gradually reclaimed by humans—it feels like there’s hope for the future.”","“Same here. I don’t even feel like the same person anymore!”","“+1!”","“......”","While the conversation was in full swing, Nie Yizhou, who had been yawning and about to head to bed, suddenly stopped when he passed by Ling Jing.","He stared curiously at Ling Jing’s reddened eyes.","“Hey, Ling Jing, why are your eyes so red?”","Ling Jing paused for a moment. “...Probably just tired.”","“Oh, then get some rest. I’m off to sleep.”","“Mm.”","Once the carefree Nie Yizhou left, Ling Jing’s gaze deepened.","He glanced toward the edge of the overpass and lazily walked over.","With one hand on the railing, he vaulted up and lay down on his side, his head resting on his arms, one leg stretched out and the other bent.","His posture was casual and unrestrained.","Snowflakes landed on his long lashes, adding an air of mystery to his already striking appearance.","Beside him stood Ah Hao, his eyes vacant, like a loyal servant quietly standing guard.","Not far away, Lei Ming and his companions all turned their attention to Ling Jing.","“Sigh, Ah Hao doesn’t recognize us at all anymore.”","“Yeah, he only listens to Ling Jing now.”","“Why do you think Ling Jing made him like that?”","“No idea.”","“I’ve noticed that Ling Jing seems different from ordinary people. I’ve been observing him—he never eats when we do.”","“Maybe he’s not hungry, or he eats when we’re not looking.”","“I get what you mean, but once or twice is understandable. Every single meal? That’s strange.","And have you noticed? His eyes have been a bit red these past few days.”","“Enough. Stop gossiping about others,” Lei Ming frowned, cutting them off.","“Regardless, Ah Hao didn’t fully turn into a zombie because of him. We owe him our gratitude.","Let’s stop talking behind people’s backs.","Get some sleep. We’ve got a tough battle ahead tomorrow.”","“Got it.”","“Understood, boss.”","After they left, Yun Xiaoxiao and Lu Chen emerged from behind a car.","Both of them looked in Ling Jing’s direction.","“Worried about him?” Lu Chen asked.","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded slightly.","“A little. After spending so much time together, it’s hard not to care. I don’t want anything bad to happen to him.”","“If it really comes to the worst...”","“Hey, Xiaoxiao, so this is where you’ve been!”","Before Lu Chen could finish, Shen Yan suddenly appeared.","He grinned at the two of them, then focused his attention on Yun Xiaoxiao.","“Ta-da!”","He pulled out a skewer of candied hawthorns from behind his back and handed it to her.","“Want some?”","His smile was dazzling.","Yun Xiaoxiao raised an eyebrow. “You came all this way just to say that?”","“Of course. Why else?”","Yun Xiaoxiao took it. “Thanks.”","“That’s it?”","“What else?” she shot back, echoing his words.","“So, does this mean you’re my girlfriend now?” Shen Yan teased with a grin.","Yun Xiaoxiao: ......","Girlfriend?","What kind of nonsense was this kid thinking?","In her eyes, he was just a little boy who hadn’t even grown up yet."]},{"number":293,"title":"Chapter 293: What is the Meaning","paragraphs":["Still thinking about a girlfriend?","You’ve been watching too many dramas.","Yun Xiaoxiao handed the candied hawthorn back.","Shen Yan looked puzzled, “What’s wrong?”","Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at him, “At such a young age, focus on studying and practicing martial arts. Don’t waste time on trivial matters.”","Shen Yan: ...","Aren’t you younger than me?","Why does it sound like a senior scolding a junior?","“Alright, alright, let’s not talk about this for now. There’s plenty of time in the future, no rush.”","Shen Yan grinned carelessly.","Then he shoved the candied hawthorn back into Yun Xiaoxiao’s hand.","“Don’t worry, it’s on the house.”","After saying that, he whistled and walked away.","Yun Xiaoxiao looked down at the candied hawthorn in her hand, momentarily stunned.","The next morning, everyone got up early one after another.","After breakfast and getting ready, the group continued clearing the zombies on the road outside the highway toll station.","This time, they didn’t need to clear every vehicle on the road.","They only had to clear a small section and then move the convoy to another road leading into the city.","Compared to the gridlock on the outbound side, the inbound road was completely clear.","While the main group was busy, Lu Chen, along with Hua Bai and Liu Xiaohui, flew a helicopter over Rong City.","On one hand, they were observing the current state of Rong City and mapping out the zombie distribution.","This would help them better formulate their plan for taking the city.","On the other hand, they were checking if Jiang Huai and Peng Shaowei’s teams had arrived.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s group had arrived almost a day earlier than the planned meeting time.","This meant the other party was likely to arrive within the next day or two.","Sure enough, that evening, Peng Shaowei and his team arrived.","They came from the northwest of Rong City, while Yun Xiaoxiao’s group was in the southeast.","Completely opposite directions.","Compared to Yun Xiaoxiao’s group, whose numbers had increased more than tenfold, Peng Shaowei’s situation wasn’t as good.","Their numbers had decreased by at least a third since the start, even after recruiting people along the way.","As a result, the overall atmosphere in their camp was rather somber and tense.","That night, Yun Xiaoxiao, along with Shen Tianlei, his wife, and Zhang Piaopiao, went to meet Peng Shaowei and his team.","It was a chance for everyone to get acquainted.","At the same time, they were there to discuss the next steps in their plan to take the city.","Many tents were set up on the snowy outskirts, with several bonfires lit.","As soon as Yun Xiaoxiao’s group walked in, they could feel the heavy atmosphere.","Many people were sighing, their spirits low.","Nie Yizhou nudged Xiao Feng and whispered, “Just like Lu Chen said, their morale is really low.”","Xiao Feng nodded in agreement.","Soon, they met Peng Shaowei.","Compared to when they last parted, Peng Shaowei still had his commanding presence, but he looked more weathered, with stubble on his face.","From what he said, Yun Xiaoxiao’s group learned that their numbers had dwindled because they had faced several life-threatening situations, even coming close to total annihilation.","The first time was in Ta City.","There, they encountered a highly aggressive mutated zombie.","That single zombie cost them nearly thirty people.","It was only after Peng Shaowei and Tang Jun teamed up that they managed to kill it.","The second time was during their journey.","While passing through a tunnel, they encountered a swarm of zombie bats hiding inside.","Although Peng Shaowei ordered everyone to speed through without stopping, some of the bats managed to cling to the roofs of the vehicles. By the time they noticed, it was too late.","Two bats had gotten inside one of the vehicles.","The situation was too urgent, and the space was confined.","Everyone panicked.","That time, nearly two-thirds of the people in the vehicle were killed or injured, with only a few escaping.","The third time was on their way to Rong City.","This was also the time they suffered the most casualties.","They were sleeping when it happened.","Only a few people were on watch around the tents.","Around one or two in the morning, a massive horde of zombies suddenly stormed their camp, catching them completely off guard.","Although everyone reacted quickly, many lives were lost in that battle.","Just hearing about it was enough to imagine how dire the situation had been.","After such setbacks, it was no wonder their morale was so low.","“Hey, why are you staring at Xiaoxiao so much?”","Suddenly, Shen Yan raised an eyebrow at Tang Yanchi, who was sitting across from him.","Tang Yanchi lifted his chin, denying it.","“I wasn’t!”","“Yes, you were! I saw you glancing over here several times.”","“You’re mistaken!” Tang Yanchi snapped, clearly annoyed.","Shen Yan laughed and waved his hand, “Come on, no need to be shy. It’s fine to look. I like looking at Xiaoxiao too...”","“I said I wasn’t looking!”","“Wow, getting defensive now, huh? Mmm... mmm!!!”","“Enough, Shen Yan! Keep it down!”","Jin Zhuyan covered Shen Yan’s mouth with her hand, effectively silencing him.","Then she smiled apologetically at Tang Yanchi.","“Sorry about that, young man. My son has no filter and says whatever comes to mind.”","Tang Yanchi didn’t take it out on Jin Zhuyan, but he glared at Shen Yan and snorted.","Just then, a commotion broke out not far away.","Peng Shaowei frowned and looked in that direction.","Hao Ren walked over.","“What’s going on?” Peng Shaowei asked.","Hao Ren’s expression was grim. “Someone’s stirring up the crowd, trying to convince them not to participate in the plan to take Rong City.”","Hearing this, Peng Shaowei’s brow furrowed.","“Let’s go check it out.”","He stood up immediately.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others followed.","They saw a large crowd gathered around two men in their thirties.","The men were passionately expressing their opinions.","“Everyone, we’ve been too naive. Look at how many of our brothers and sisters died last night!","Their deaths have left us heartbroken.","But they’ve also served as a wake-up call.","I don’t need to remind you how many people live in Rong City.","The number of zombies there will be terrifyingly high.","And with so many zombies, the chances of encountering high-level mutated zombies are much greater.","What does that mean?","It means the risks we face will increase dramatically.","After taking Rong City, our numbers might be halved, or even worse.","Among the casualties could be your friends, your family, or even yourselves.","So I have to ask, what’s the point of this war against the zombies?","Is it just to send so many of us to our deaths for nothing?”"]},{"number":294,"title":"Chapter 294: Little Flower, Devour Him","paragraphs":["\"Who says it’s meaningless?\"","Zhang Piaopiao stepped forward.","\"If we exterminate all the zombies, the world’s dominance will return to humanity.","Sacrificing a small number of people now will ensure a safer living environment for all remaining humans in the future.","Isn’t that meaningful?\"","\"But why do we have to kill all the zombies?\"","The man scoffed and immediately retorted.","\"Can’t we just find a safe place and live peacefully?","We can coexist with the zombies, each minding our own business.","But now, we’re taking enormous risks, expending vast resources, and braving blizzards to travel to the most dangerous places to kill zombies.","Isn’t that putting the cart before the horse?\"","\"Do you think there’s still a safe place anywhere?\"","As soon as the man finished speaking, a young voice chimed in.","Everyone turned to look, and some automatically made way.","As the crowd parted, a small figure stood calmly, gazing intently at the man who had been passionately speaking in the center.","The man was taken aback. He had joined the group later and didn’t know Yun Xiaoxiao.","Seeing his argument refuted by a child, he frowned.","Although he had witnessed Tang Yanchi’s prowess, not every child was that extraordinary.","He assumed Yun Xiaoxiao was just someone’s kid.","He couldn’t help but feel annoyed.","A child, daring to challenge him.","At that age, could she even count to five?","Really, what kind of environment is this, bringing a child along?","Are they not burdened enough, or do they want to die faster?","To what he was thinking, Yun Xiaoxiao just wanted to laugh.","Another fool judging by appearances.","\"You haven’t answered my question yet.\"","Seeing that he hadn’t responded, Yun Xiaoxiao pressed directly.","Though the man was reluctant to answer, under the gaze of so many people and with something he wanted to express, he spoke his mind.","\"You just asked if there’s a safe place. Now I’ll tell you.","There are plenty of safe places. We can hide in a mountain—zombies aren’t likely to follow us deep into the wilderness.","Or we could head east to the sea and find an uninhabited island, staying far away from the zombies.\"","\"How would we get there? Would there be dangers along the way? Would people die if we encountered them?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao fired off questions one after another.","The man raised an eyebrow. \"Yes, I admit, getting to these places would involve a long journey.","But we could also find helicopters to fly there.","Taking a helicopter would minimize the dangers.","Even if we had to search for helicopters first, the risks wouldn’t be as great as attacking a city.\"","\"Alright, let’s assume everyone makes it to the mountains or the island. How would they survive?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao stared at him, her eyes sharp and imposing.","\"Would they farm or fish?","Let’s not even discuss whether the mountains are suitable for farming. Just look at this freezing blizzard—it’s not going to stop anytime soon.","That means, for a long time to come, the entire world might remain frozen.","The plains are already unbearably cold, let alone the depths of the mountains.","The temperature there would be unimaginable.","Even if people brought supplies with them, how long would those last?","Once the supplies run out, what would they eat?","In the snow-covered mountains, even digging for tree bark might be extremely difficult.","In other words, hiding in the mountains would likely lead to freezing or starving to death.","And let’s not forget, earthquakes are quite possible in the mountains.","When disaster strikes, no matter how skilled you are, survival would be a miracle.","Now, let’s talk about the island.","Would you dare to eat the fish in the sea now?","Who knows if one of them is infected with the zombie virus but hasn’t turned yet.","Eating a fish with the zombie virus—do I even need to explain the consequences?","Fine, you might say, we’ll just avoid fish and farm instead.","An island isn’t the mountains; surely farming would be possible.","Alright, let’s say that’s true. Farming is possible.","But everyone remembers that massive rainstorm, right?","Even though we can’t check the news now, we can imagine how many islands were submerged.","Fine, let’s say you find an island that’s still intact.","But with the bizarre weather patterns lately, who can guarantee there won’t be a massive tsunami or something in the future?\"","Many people found Yun Xiaoxiao’s words convincing.","But the man remained unimpressed, even finding them laughable.","\"Little girl, everything you’re saying is hypothetical. No one knows when the blizzard will stop—it might end in a couple of months.","Earthquakes and tsunamis are just your imagination; they might not actually happen.\"","Seeing how stubborn he was, Yun Xiaoxiao calmly looked at him.","\"Alright, let’s say the heavens are on your side, and none of these disasters occur.\"","Of course, Yun Xiaoxiao knew that was impossible.","Disasters would come one after another, striking different places, never giving humanity much time to recover.","Hearing Yun Xiaoxiao’s sarcastic yet polite retort, Nie Yizhou couldn’t help but chuckle softly.","Haha, the kid’s still the same.","Her words are just so... refined.","Yun Xiaoxiao tapped Little Cutie, who was perched on her shoulder.","\"Little Cutie, show them your might.\"","Hearing her name, Little Cutie immediately perked up.","She obediently crawled down from Yun Xiaoxiao’s shoulder and landed on the ground.","Not only the man but also many others who hadn’t seen Little Cutie before were stunned.","They had thought it was just a decorative piece on Yun Xiaoxiao’s shoulder, but... it was alive!","What happened next left them even more shocked.","The tiny scorpion, no bigger than a finger, began to expand rapidly.","In moments, it grew taller than a person!","Little Cutie even took a few proud steps, causing those nearby to scramble back in fear, wanting to run as far away as possible.","For a moment, everyone’s expressions were a mix of astonishment and terror.","But that wasn’t all.","Next, they saw Yun Xiaoxiao touch her wrist.","A flower was wrapped around it.","Everyone had assumed it was a plastic flower, just for decoration.","But to their surprise, the flower affectionately nuzzled Yun Xiaoxiao’s hand.","Then, before their eyes, it rapidly extended.","Green stems swayed in the wind, and a dazzling trumpet flower bloomed, swaying gracefully.","Just as everyone was gaping in shock, Yun Xiaoxiao suddenly raised her hand and pointed at the man standing in the center.","\"Flower, eat him.\""]},{"number":295,"title":"Chapter 295: You Are So Awesome","paragraphs":["As soon as Yun Xiaoxiao finished speaking, Little Flower turned its head towards the man.","To everyone's astonishment, the stem of the flower rapidly lengthened.","The enormous flower lunged fiercely towards the man.","Man: !!!","Others: !!","Not only could this flower understand human speech, but it could also attack!","But in the next moment, they realized they had been too naive.","This flower not only attacked, but its attack power was incredibly strong!","When the man first heard Yun Xiaoxiao's words, he was shocked and froze for a moment.","But that shock was only due to Yun Xiaoxiao's arrogant tone.","He didn’t believe that the morning glory would actually eat him.","But when he saw Little Flower coming towards him, he knew she wasn’t joking.","He quickly launched an attack, thinking to strike first.","A flower, right? Surely it couldn’t be immune to fire?","As luck would have it, he was a fire-based ability user!","It was just a big flower—how could he not handle it?","What a joke!","Confidently, he conjured a ball of fire and hurled it at Little Flower.","But in the next instant, he was utterly stunned.","Not only did the fire fail to burn the morning glory, but it was blown back by a sinister gust of wind!","The man frantically tried to defend himself, barely managing to avoid being burned.","Before he could fully recover, he was seized by a powerful suction force.","Then, his body flew uncontrollably through the air.","The moment the man was swallowed by the morning glory, the scene fell into dead silence.","Only the sound of the howling wind and the friction of snowflakes against the air could be heard.","It seemed as if everyone’s breathing had stopped.","“Alright, Little Flower, spit him out now.”","Yun Xiaoxiao’s voice broke the silence at just the right moment.","The man was spat out by the morning glory like a discarded mouthful of saliva, landing on the ground.","Since he hadn’t been inside for long, he was still conscious and hadn’t passed out.","At that moment, his face was filled with terror and confusion.","It seemed he hadn’t yet processed what had just happened.","“Now that you’ve seen Little Flower’s power, would you like to try Little Cutie’s?”","Yun Xiaoxiao ‘politely’ asked.","The man hastily shook his head.","No way!","Who would want to try something so deadly!","Yun Xiaoxiao curled her lips slightly, her expression calm, and then slowly scanned the others.","“As you all just saw, both animals and plants, like humans, have been affected by this virus.","This means they, too, can develop abilities and begin to mutate.","Although it’s only a small number now, who can guarantee it won’t become more widespread in the future?","The deep mountains are home to the most forests and animals.","If we move in there, regardless of the issues I mentioned earlier, what will we do if we encounter a large-scale outbreak of these mutated plants and animals?","And let’s not forget about islands.","Do you think there are no plants or animals on islands?","And what about the fish in the sea—either mutated or turned into zombies?","Who’s to say they won’t grow legs and come ashore?","When we’re surrounded on all sides, where will we run?","So, are these places really safe?”","Yun Xiaoxiao asked with a smile.","“And you haven’t even considered that zombies can mutate too. Some of them might develop intelligence—smart zombies.","These intelligent zombies could even control zombie hordes.","When they run out of fresh meat, do you think they’ll try to find humans and devour them?”","This is why she firmly supported Peng Shaowei’s plan to eradicate the zombies.","She knew the challenges humanity would face in the future would only grow, not diminish.","The zombies were just the first wave.","At this critical moment, as they were about to attack Rong City, she couldn’t allow anyone to undermine morale.","“Yeah, there’s really no safe place anymore.”","After hearing Yun Xiaoxiao’s words and witnessing the power of Little Cutie and Little Flower, everyone’s mood turned heavy.","Especially those who had experienced the zombie siege at the Western Base—they understood exactly what Yun Xiaoxiao was trying to convey.","“If plants and animals really start mutating, won’t humanity even have a chance to catch its breath?”","“That’s why we need to go back to the original point—the significance of this war against the zombies.","We must take advantage of the fact that the plants and animals haven’t yet mutated on a large scale, and the zombies haven’t developed highly intelligent leaders. We need to eliminate as many zombies as possible to give humanity a slight chance to breathe.","This isn’t just for others—it’s for ourselves too.”","“Exactly. Even with so many of us together, fighting zombies is already so difficult.","When that time comes, trying to survive alone won’t be easy.","Only by uniting can humanity have a chance to survive.”","“Right!”","“That makes sense!”","Amid the chorus of agreement, Yun Xiaoxiao walked up to several people.","“You, you, and you—come out.”","Those she called out exchanged glances, their faces filled with confusion.","The others also looked on, puzzled, unsure why Yun Xiaoxiao had singled them out.","“Uncles and aunties, were you planning to sneak away when you had the chance?”","Yun Xiaoxiao asked with a smile, her big eyes wide and innocent.","But there was no warmth in that smile.","Hearing this, the hearts of the few skipped a beat.","How did this little girl know?","They tried their best to hide their panic, waving their hands frantically.","“No, no, absolutely not!”","“Why would I want to run away? You can’t just accuse people like that.”","“Yeah, don’t make baseless accusations.”","Yun Xiaoxiao lightly pursed her lips. “But weren’t you thinking of sneaking away, letting others go out and risk their lives fighting zombies, while you enjoy the fruits of their labor?”","Having been exposed, the expressions of those few crumbled.","Everyone immediately realized Yun Xiaoxiao was telling the truth.","These people really were planning to sneak away!","And this was after Yun Xiaoxiao had explained the stakes.","Wasn’t that the same as desertion?","How shameless!","As everyone glared at them, Yun Xiaoxiao wasn’t idle. She walked up to a few others and called them out.","“I wasn’t planning to run!”","One of them immediately raised his hand.","He was terrified Yun Xiaoxiao would pin that label on him.","“Me neither!”","“Same here, I’ve always been with the group. Don’t slander me!”","The others quickly chimed in.","But Yun Xiaoxiao smiled. “Yes, you weren’t planning to run.”","“Then why did you call us out?”","One of them frowned, clearly annoyed.","He realized that no one who had a conversation with Yun Xiaoxiao ended up well.","This feeling was particularly unpleasant.","Sure enough, in the next moment, Yun Xiaoxiao said something that shocked everyone.","“Because... even though you didn’t run, you’re the slackers in the group.”"]},{"number":296,"title":"Chapter 296: Eerie Atmosphere","paragraphs":["Upon hearing this, the expression in everyone's eyes changed immediately.","Without intending to let them off, Yun Xiaoxiao continued, \"While everyone is rushing forward, struggling to kill zombies, you guys hide behind others.","This way, you will not have to face any danger and will still get distributed living resources.","You guys are really clever, such good jobs!\"","The others: !!!","Could this sarcasm be any more obvious?!","\"No wonder, I was wondering why I was always so tired after the battles, while you looked as if nothing had happened. Turns out you were shirking, not contributing anything!\"","Someone quickly reacted, recalling the previous behaviors of these individuals.","\"Heh, so shameless. It's fine not to contribute, but you are the first ones to distribute the resources every time!\"","\"Exactly, they even eat more than others every day. Aren't they the typical parasites?\"","\"I can't believe they turned out to be such people.\"","\"It's horrifying to imagine, if real danger comes, these cowards afraid of death might push us out to die for them.\"","Facing the public condemnation, none of the accused dared to retort, bowing their heads low in shame.","\"I do have a good suggestion, how about you guys take the frontline in the upcoming battles?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao squinted her eyes, laughing innocently.","Yet that smile oddly felt full of malice.","Hearing her words, both the would-be deserters and the slackers looked up in shock.","Them, taking the frontline?","What a joke!","\"Pfft~only our Xiaoxiao could come up with such a rotten idea. She sure knows how to deal with the disobedient.\"","Nie Yizhou covered his mouth, chuckling softly.","In the end, Peng Shaowei gave the final decision, agreeing with Yun Xiaoxiao's suggestions.","Before their attack on Rong City, they even assigned someone to guard these individuals.","These people were the survivors they rescued after conquering various cities, who joined them temporarily.","But who would have thought, they would harbor such intentions.","Initially, Peng Shaowei thought that since these individuals were unwilling to contribute, it was better to just let them leave.","But on second thought, it would greatly impact the morale.","Whether in ancient or modern times, those who wanted to desert before a battle are considered deserters.","The law shouldn't be bent just because the circumstances are different now.","And, a deserter must never be tolerated!","Everyone is an adult, so you have to be responsible for the choices you made.","If you choose to give up halfway, then be prepared to face penalties.","He thought Yun Xiaoxiao's decision was excellent.","It could establish authority, act as a deterrent, and it doesn't seem overly ruthless.","Instantly, his admiration and affection for Yun Xiaoxiao increased.","This little girl was indeed unlike ordinary people.","Despite her young age, she was thoughtful and clear-headed.","The future world would be a stage for this little girl to show her colours!","After discussing more details with Peng Shaowei, Yun Xiaoxiao and others went back.","They would discuss the details of attacking the city after Jiang Huai arrived.","On the way back, Yun Xiaoxiao was comforting Da Piaoliang.","Because, it felt left out seeing Xiao Keai and Xiao Huahua showing their strength.","It felt extremely wronged.","\"Isn't it great? The two of them can shrink down, easy to carry around, and their appearance is natural and logical, right?","Now, now, next time if there's a situation like this, I'll let you come out, okay?\"","Yun Xiaoxiao tried to appease them with patience.","It took her a mix of coaxing and tricking, and the expenditure of a fat lamb, to finally placate the beautiful creature.","The next morning, Jiang Huai and his crew arrived.","However, their luck wasn't so great. They walked right smack into an attack by a large group of zombies.","Lu Chen noticed that Jiang Huai and his team were having an intense battle with the zombies on the outskirts of the city.","So, several helicopters took off at once.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others went to provide assistance.","Upon seeing the line of helicopters appearing in the sky, the eyes of Jiang Huai and others, who were fiercely battling the zombies, lit up.","\"Look at that! It's Yun City's people!\"","\"It's little sister Xiaoxiao and the others!\"","\"Great, reinforcements have arrived!\"","Everyone was thrilled.","With Yun Xiaoxiao and the others' assistance, the battle was soon over.","\"Sister Xiaoxiao!\"","Long Zhe walked towards Yun Xiaoxiao with a joyful expression and a few traces of amazement on his face.","Not much time had passed, but his aura had gotten stronger.","Though he wasn't old, his overall aura was mature and steady.","\"Lil' sister, who is this guy?\"","While walking, Long Zhe noticed that there was a person appearing suddenly behind Yun Xiaoxiao.","The person had a smiley face, but for some reason, Long Zhe felt that the way the person was looking at him was a bit strange.","Long Zhe furrowed his brows.","This young boy seemed to be very close to sister Xiaoxiao.","As Long Zhe was sizing Shen Yan up, Shen Yan, too, was openly observing him.","There was an invisible confrontation between the two young boys.","When they got close, Yun Xiaoxiao introduced them.","\"This is Rongsheng Base's commander's nephew, Long Zhe.\"","\"This is Ren City Base's commander's son, Shen Yan.\"","\"Nice to meet you.\"","\"Nice to meet you too.\"","Both of them nodded but did not shake hands.","The atmosphere... was somewhat odd.","Jiang Huai and Lu Chen and the others exchanged greetings.","Subsequently, he explained the reason for their late arrival.","During the attack on An City, they encountered many troubles, which delayed them.","Fortunately, the crisis was eventually averted, and no excessive casualties occurred.","After the brief warm exchange, Jiang Huai suggested that everyone set up camp and rest.","He and the other base commanders followed Yun Xiaoxiao to meet Peng Shaowei.","After such a long time, the commanders of the zombie-slaying army gathered once again.","Together, they discussed the details of the final attack.","In the end, Rong City was divided into five sectors, each led by Lu Chen, Peng Shaowei, Jiang Huai, Zheng Xin'er, and the Tang Brothers, respectively.","Yun Xiaoxiao, leading a small team, was assigned as a mobile unit, patrolling from the sky.","If any area was in danger, they would provide help there.","Suffice to say, Zheng Xin'er had been more powerful than an average person due to the evolution liquid made by her 'father'.","Moreover, coupled with her innate talent and her solid efforts in killing zombies, she made significant advancements over the period.","In fact, she stood out as braver and smarter than many male base commanders from other bases.","Therefore, she could take charge of one of the five directions on her own.","After deliberating over tasks allocation and detailed strategies, everyone began their operation.","The helicopters from Yun City were requisitioned out.","They were used to transport the personnel that needed to be relocated to their designated areas.","On Lu Chen's side, he and Ling Jing commanded, along with Shen Tianlei, Zhang Piaopiao, Earth Traveler Sun, and others who joined later. They formed a team and remained at their original location.","On Peng Shaowei's side, all the military personnel and supernaturals from his western base, along with other supernaturals that joined later, formed a squad and remained at their original location.","On Jiang Huai's side, Rongsheng Base and several other small bases formed a unit and remained at their original location.","On Zheng Xin'er's side, Yangcheng Base, Wang Dahai's base, and another ten or so small bases comprised a group and relocated.","On the Tang Brothers' side, their Xiangrui Base, along with the remaining bases formed a unit, and they relocated."]},{"number":297,"title":"Chapter 297: The Battle of Rongcheng","paragraphs":["The urban area of Rong City was vast, and the number of zombies was overwhelming.","After some discussion, everyone agreed to first clear the zombies in the surrounding areas before moving inward.","Like the rings of a tree, they would eliminate the zombies layer by layer, gradually advancing toward the center.","Thus, Yun Xiaoxiao and a group of barrier-summoning ability users took the lead, piloting helicopters to hover above the city and continuously dropping barriers from the sky.","These barriers formed concentric rings of obstruction, effectively dividing the zombies into layers.","Meanwhile, others stayed behind, led by earth-ability users, and began digging large pits.","Xiao Feng, on the other hand, flew a plane carrying Liu Xiaohui and Han Bing, delivering gas canisters, oil, speakers, and charged phones to various locations.","More than three hours later, all preparations were complete.","\"Commander Zheng's side is ready,\" Han Bing nodded to Yun Xiaoxiao.","This time, she accompanied Yun Xiaoxiao as part of the mobile team, staying airborne in the helicopter on standby.","With them were Xiao Feng, Mu Yang, Liu Xiaohui, Zheng Yuner, and Nan Yi.","Upon hearing Han Bing's words, Yun Xiaoxiao nodded.","In the next moment, she pulled out a flare gun and fired a shot in five different directions.","This had been agreed upon beforehand.","Once each location was ready, they would notify Yun Xiaoxiao, who was circling above in the helicopter, via walkie-talkie.","When all five locations were set, Yun Xiaoxiao would fire the flare gun as a unified signal.","The loud gunshot served as the war horn for the five factions to commence their battle!","The moment the flare gun fired...","*Boom!*","A deafening explosion erupted.","Then...","*Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom!*","Several more earth-shattering explosions followed in quick succession.","The thunderous noise was like the roars of colossal beasts unleashed, shaking the heavens and the earth.","Massive gray-black mushroom clouds rose from five locations, their imposing presence expanding as if threatening to engulf the entire world.","At the same time, the pounding footsteps of tens of thousands of zombies echoed, accompanied by their ear-splitting roars.","Hordes of zombies surged toward the five outposts outside the city.","Their momentum was overwhelming, as if they were about to trample the ground into collapse.","From the ground, the scene might not have been as striking, but for Yun Xiaoxiao and her team flying above, the view was nothing short of breathtaking.","The outermost zombies in the city resembled a dense swarm of wild beasts, frantically rushing toward the outskirts.","The zombies closer to the outer ring also grew restless upon hearing the massive explosions.","They tried to flee but were blocked by towering barriers.","The innermost zombies, however, remained largely unaffected. Upon hearing the noise, they merely looked around in confusion.","After all, the sound had weakened significantly by the time it reached them, and their reaction was far less intense than that of the outermost zombies.","The subsequent process was similar to what Yun Xiaoxiao and her team had experienced before: burning the zombies and then entering the city to eliminate them.","The first layer went smoothly, with no major incidents.","Everyone had been through numerous battles and had honed their skills.","Moreover, the zombies in the outermost layer of the city weren't particularly powerful variants, so dealing with them wasn't too difficult.","However, problems began to arise during the second layer.","The Tang Brothers' side suddenly faced dozens of level three and four mutated zombies, along with two level five mid-tier advanced zombies.","Chaos immediately broke out.","The team's rhythm was disrupted, and several people were severely injured.","Upon observing the situation, Yun Xiaoxiao quickly led her team to assist.","At that moment, most of the team was hastily dealing with the level three and four zombies.","The scene was chaotic.","The Tang Brothers and a few others were battling one of the level five zombies.","Although their fight wasn't entirely smooth, they weren't at a disadvantage and even had the upper hand.","Barring any unforeseen circumstances, it was only a matter of time before they defeated the zombie.","However, the situation with the other level five zombie was far worse.","That side was composed of skilled individuals from other bases.","But no matter how skilled they were, the strongest among them was only at level four initial-tier, making the fight against a level five zombie quite challenging.","Just as one of them was about to be injured by the zombie, a vine suddenly appeared and yanked the person away.","The level five zombie lunged at empty air and let out a furious roar.","The appearance of the vine stunned the group momentarily, but they soon broke into relieved smiles.","Reinforcements had arrived!","\"Go deal with the other zombies. Leave this one to me,\" Yun Xiaoxiao said to Mu Yang and the others, as well as the group she had just rescued.","\"Be careful,\" Mu Yang cautioned before leaving.","Yun Xiaoxiao nodded, keeping her eyes on the level five zombie. \"Got it.\"","Mu Yang then led the others back into the fray.","The mutated zombies were fierce and powerful, and the team's abilities were uneven, making this a formidable enemy.","With Mu Yang and the others joining the fight, the situation was instantly revitalized, like a shot of adrenaline.","Except for Liu Xiaohui, the rest of the team was highly capable.","Mu Yang, Xiao Feng, and Zheng Yuner were no exception.","Metal blades, flames, and explosives—each attack was more destructive than the last.","As for Nan Yi, he was even more impressive.","Thanks to the treatment provided by Zhong Mingsheng and his team, his withdrawn condition had improved.","Coupled with the enhancement of his abilities, he could now control his sonic attacks effectively.","No longer did his attacks indiscriminately wipe out everything in their path.","Now, his attacks could specifically target zombies, and the results were remarkable.","If he screamed at a level two or lower zombie, its head would explode within three seconds.","For higher-level zombies, it took a bit longer.","Given that his ability was purely offensive and his personal condition, Lu Chen had taught him some evasion skills back at the base.","He had a natural talent and learned quickly.","So, when facing higher-level zombies that he couldn't immediately kill, he would use the evasion skills Lu Chen had taught him to dodge while continuously attacking.","Thus, level three and four zombies were like ripe watermelons waiting to be split open in front of him.","Yun Xiaoxiao released Little Cutie and Little Flower to assist Mu Yang and the others.","Big Beauty, however, protested loudly, demanding to be let out as well.","Unable to withstand the noise, Yun Xiaoxiao discreetly released it when no one was looking.","These mutated plants and animals were immune to the zombie virus.","Even if they bit open a zombie's head and consumed its crystal core, they would remain unharmed and even grow stronger.","The three of them charged excitedly toward the nearby zombies.","In the few seconds it took for this to happen, the level five mutated zombie had already closed in on Yun Xiaoxiao."]},{"number":298,"title":"Chapter 298: Big Beauty is Missing","paragraphs":["Yun Xiaoxiao immediately drew out Lord Slasher, not forgetting to coat it with spiritual spring water.","She remembered well that Lord Slasher combined with spiritual spring water was the ultimate weapon against zombies.","Her gaze was firmly locked on the charging zombie, a fierce fighting spirit blazing in her eyes.","The zombie opposite her was unusually small, perhaps about her size.","But from its facial features, it was clear that this wasn’t a child but rather an adult in their thirties or forties.","Moreover, unlike other zombies that walked upright, this one moved on all fours, crawling like an animal.","It bared its teeth, letting out a shrill screech as it lunged at Yun Xiaoxiao with terrifying speed.","It was agile and fast, closing the distance in the blink of an eye.","Yun Xiaoxiao’s eyes darkened as she raised her hand, sending Lord Slasher slicing through the air with a sharp, whistling sound.","“Screech!”","The zombie reacted quickly, dodging the attack, but not fast enough to avoid having a bone in its shoulder severed.","Enraged, it let out a furious roar, its entire body radiating a menacing aura.","In the next moment, it moved!","It began circling Yun Xiaoxiao at incredible speed, waiting for the perfect moment to pounce.","Its sharp claws extended, aiming to tear into her flesh.","The strength of a mid-tier Level 5 zombie was no joke, and Yun Xiaoxiao narrowly avoided being hit several times.","Yet, each time, she managed to evade at the last possible moment.","The intense battle between the two lasted several minutes.","At first, Yun Xiaoxiao was testing the waters, holding back somewhat.","But once she realized the zombie’s limits, she unleashed her full power, increasing the speed and ferocity of her attacks.","The mutated zombie was now riddled with severe injuries.","“Screech!”","After being struck yet again, it let out a deafening roar and leaped onto the roof of an abandoned truck. Crawling to the edge, it crouched low, its eyes darting around as if searching for the perfect opportunity to strike.","But suddenly, it began pounding the truck’s roof in frustration.","Because...","Yun Xiaoxiao had disappeared!","Then, it sensed an unusual presence.","It turned around quickly, only to be met with Yun Xiaoxiao’s sly smile and the descending blade of Lord Slasher.","!!!","Realizing it couldn’t dodge in time, it jumped off the truck, landing with a sickening crunch as bones broke.","Despite the injury, it stubbornly got up and fled, running for its life.","It knew it was no match for Yun Xiaoxiao; staying meant certain death.","Zombies that reached Level 5 or higher often retained some level of consciousness.","Unlike Level 1 or 2 zombies, which were driven solely by an insatiable hunger for flesh and sound, higher-level zombies could sense danger and act accordingly.","When faced with a lethal threat, they would flee rather than fight.","And so, it darted between cars, climbed walls, and scrambled up and down the pipes of tall buildings, desperately trying to escape.","Yun Xiaoxiao sheathed Lord Slasher and gave chase, launching attack after attack.","Sharp ice spikes shot out one after another, relentlessly pursuing the fleeing zombie.","The two engaged in a tense and thrilling chase through the towering streets of the city.","Finally, as the zombie climbed up a pipe to reach the rooftop, a massive block of ice fell on it, freezing it solid against the wall.","Its limbs were still wrapped around the pipe, frozen in place.","Yun Xiaoxiao stood at the edge of the rooftop, a faint smile playing on her lips. She raised Lord Slasher and brought it down with a decisive swing, cleaving the frozen zombie’s head in two.","“Crack!”","The ice shattered, and the zombie’s head split cleanly down the middle.","Yun Xiaoxiao dug out the brightly colored zombie crystal core, a satisfied smirk on her face.","She stood alone on the high rooftop, the world stretching out around her.","Above, the sky was shrouded in a hazy mist.","Below, the snow-covered buildings gleamed white.","A gentle breeze stirred the strands of hair on her forehead, making her appear bold and unrestrained, radiating confidence.","She didn’t linger long. After stashing the crystal core in her backpack, she quickly descended to help clear out the remaining mutated zombies.","But gradually, she began to feel that something was off.","She couldn’t quite put her finger on it, though.","Suddenly, her expression turned grim.","She realized what was wrong!","Big Beauty was missing!","Anxious, she scanned her surroundings. Little Cutie and Little Flower were still enthusiastically taking down zombies.","Mu Yang and the others were also present.","But Big Beauty was nowhere to be seen!","The situation on the ground was under control, and even without her, things wouldn’t spiral out of hand. Yun Xiaoxiao quickly made her exit.","She stood atop various rooftops, searching for Big Beauty.","But despite combing the area, she couldn’t find any trace of it.","Just as she was about to expand her search, Mu Yang approached in a helicopter.","As they drew closer, Xiao Feng used a loudspeaker to inform her that something had happened on Jiang Huai’s side, and they needed her help immediately.","Yun Xiaoxiao gazed into the distance, her brows furrowed.","Big Beauty, you better be safe!","She turned away and quickly boarded the helicopter, heading toward Jiang Huai’s location.","With no sign of Big Beauty, she had no idea where to start looking.","Moreover, the situation with Jiang Huai was urgent, and delaying could cost more lives.","After weighing her options, Yun Xiaoxiao made the most practical decision.","By evening, the first wave of the siege had finally ended.","The group had managed to eliminate two layers of zombies, totaling around a hundred thousand.","Among them were numerous Level 3, 4, and 5 mutated zombies.","Yet, Yun Xiaoxiao felt no joy.","Because...","Big Beauty still hadn’t returned.","“Has anyone seen a big tiger?”","After assisting Jiang Huai and his team, Yun Xiaoxiao returned to the Tang brothers’ side.","She asked everyone if they had seen Big Beauty, hoping someone might have noticed where it had gone.","But no one had any answers.","Some hadn’t even noticed a tiger had been present.","Just as Yun Xiaoxiao was about to give up and search on her own, Tang Yanchi approached.","“You’re looking for a tiger?”","He spoke with his chin raised, his eyes seemingly fixed on the sky.","(PS: Sorry, everyone! With the New Year approaching, things have been hectic, and I really didn’t have time to write yesterday (cries—).","Also, I haven’t been checking the comments and messages much.","It’s not that I don’t want to, but I’m trying to avoid anything that might affect my mood.","I know many of you are kind and love this book, but as they say, a thousand readers mean a thousand Hamlets. With any book, there are bound to be some negative voices.","Seeing negative comments really dampens the creative spirit, so I’ve decided to stay away from the comments until the book is complete. Then, I’ll go through them and respond to everyone.","Even though I’m not reading the comments, I still hope you’ll leave a five-star review if you’re enjoying the book. Love you all~)"]},{"number":299,"title":"Chapter 299: Tang Yanchi Gets Embarrassed","paragraphs":["Yun Xiaoxiao glanced at him but didn’t reply, turning to leave.","\"Hey, wait! I know where that tiger is.\"","Seeing Yun Xiaoxiao about to leave, Tang Yanchi panicked.","Afraid she wouldn’t believe him, he added, \"Really, I saw it! The tiger seemed to have run off into that alley.\"","Tang Yanchi pointed to a narrow alleyway sandwiched between two tall buildings, with a utility pole at the entrance.","\"You really saw it?\" Yun Xiaoxiao stared at Tang Yanchi intently.","Tang Yanchi lifted his chin proudly. \"Of course! I never lie. If I say I saw it, I saw it. If it weren’t for the fact that you helped us earlier, I wouldn’t even bother...\"","\"Thanks.\"","\"Hmph.\" Tang Yanchi snorted arrogantly, but in the blink of an eye, Yun Xiaoxiao was already running toward the alley.","He shouted after her, \"Hey! Where are you going?!\"","Tang Jun had just finished inventorying supplies and walked over.","\"Have you seen Yanchi?\" he casually asked one of his subordinates.","The subordinate shook his head.","Another chimed in, \"Young Master Tang followed the leader of Yun City’s small base. They went that way.\"","He pointed toward the alley.","Hearing this, Tang Jun frowned.","\"Do you know what they’re doing?\"","\"Seems like... they’re looking for a tiger?\"","\"A tiger?\"","\"Yeah. As soon as the leader of Yun City’s small base arrived, she started asking everyone if they’d seen a big tiger. No one knew anything, but Young Master Tang said he saw it. She followed his directions, and he tagged along after her.\"","Tang Jun: \"...\"","\"Young Master Tang is back!\"","Just then, the same subordinate exclaimed.","Tang Jun followed the direction of the pointing finger and saw Tang Yanchi emerging from the alley.","Behind him, there was no one else.","Tang Jun raised an eyebrow.","Didn’t he leave with someone? Why is he back alone?","Judging by his expression, he didn’t look happy. In fact, he looked like someone owed him a fortune.","Could he have been dismissed?","Tang Jun’s intuition was spot-on.","A few minutes earlier.","Yun Xiaoxiao noticed faint footsteps behind her. Though the sound was subtle, she heard it clearly.","She suddenly stopped and turned to face Tang Yanchi, who was trailing her.","\"Why are you following me?\"","Tang Yanchi was caught off guard.","He didn’t even know why he had followed her.","The atmosphere turned awkward for a moment.","\"Uh... I wasn’t deliberately following you. I just... you helped us earlier, so I’m repaying the favor.\"","As if finding a reasonable excuse, he repeated, \"Yeah, I’m repaying the favor. I came to see if I could help.\"","His tone sounded more like he was trying to convince himself.","Yun Xiaoxiao gave him a sidelong glance. \"You’ve already helped. I’ll handle the rest myself. You should go back.\"","With that, she vanished.","Her departure was swift and unceremonious, leaving Tang Yanchi standing there, utterly bewildered.","In the end, he had no choice but to return alone.","Though Tang Jun had his suspicions, he decided not to embarrass his younger brother.","\"I’ve been looking for you. Let’s go eat.\"","\"Okay.\"","The two brothers walked toward a tall building, one after the other.","Meanwhile, after Tang Yanchi left, Yun Xiaoxiao returned to the end of the alley.","She crouched down, carefully examining the snow-covered ground.","After searching for a while, her eyes lit up.","She found it!","The paw prints of Big Beauty in the snow!","Though the prints were partially covered by fresh snow, they were still visible upon closer inspection.","By now, the sky was growing dark.","She had to find Big Beauty before nightfall.","Otherwise, it would be nearly impossible to follow the tracks in complete darkness.","And if the prints were completely buried by new snow, she’d lose her direction entirely.","So, she had to hurry!","Yun Xiaoxiao crouched low, swiftly moving forward while keeping an eye on the tracks.","At first, it went smoothly. She followed the prints through several streets that had already been cleared of zombies.","But then, the tracks disappeared!","They ended at a subway entrance.","Staring at the tracks leading into the subway, she furrowed her brow.","Did Big Beauty go down there?","Her expression grew tense.","Earlier, to clear out zombies in batches, they had dropped barriers from the air.","But those only blocked zombies on the surface.","Zombies in the subway stations were another matter.","So, when clearing out the remaining zombies, they had sealed off subway entrances to prevent zombies from other areas sneaking in and causing trouble.","If Big Beauty had entered before the entrance was sealed, the only way to find it would be to reopen the entrance.","Without hesitation, Yun Xiaoxiao took out Lord Slasher and struck the earthen wall.","The barrier’s creator was clearly of a lower level than her, so it only took a moment to break through.","Behind the earthen wall was a metal barrier.","For added security, each barrier had at least two layers.","Of course, the metal wall posed no challenge for Yun Xiaoxiao either.","Once both barriers were breached, she stepped inside and resealed the entrance with two new layers.","Next, she pulled out two mini flashlights and attached them to her backpack straps.","This way, even if her hands were full, she’d still have light.","She also tied one to Little Cutie’s head and another to the stem of a small flower.","The area around her instantly brightened.","She aimed a handheld flashlight at the ground and spotted Big Beauty’s paw prints in the dust.","Her eyes lit up with excitement, but just as she was about to move, the ice wall behind her trembled.","Hearing the sound, she froze.","The ice wall shook violently again.","With a *crack*, a small hole appeared in the center.","Then, accompanied by a sharp *screeching* sound, the hole split into several cracks that spread outward, growing thicker and longer.","Finally, the entire ice wall crumbled into small chunks, scattering across the floor.","Footsteps echoed from the stairs above.","Someone was coming down.","By now, it was completely dark outside.","Inside, it was pitch black.","Yun Xiaoxiao aimed her flashlight at the staircase, her brow furrowing.","She didn’t know who was coming.","Soon, several long legs came into view.","\"Little one, running off on your own without calling us? That’s not very considerate.\"","Ling Jing’s lazy, amused voice drifted down.","Hands in his pockets, he looked at the bewildered Yun Xiaoxiao with a smirk.","His striking, pale blue eyes gleamed with mischief."]},{"number":300,"title":"Chapter 300: Subway Zombies","paragraphs":["“Yeah, kid, even if you’re really strong, you can’t just sneak off like that. We’d be worried, you know.”","Nie Yizhou crossed his arms and laughed carelessly.","“Don’t run off alone and make people panic.”","Xiao Feng pouted, his tone harsh and impatient, but his words were full of concern.","Lu Chen stood alone to the side, arms crossed.","Though he didn’t say a word, his icy aura was impossible to ignore.","“Oh, by the way, Brother Yang and Yun’er wanted to come too, but since someone had to stay back and hold down the fort, only a few of us came.”","Nie Yizhou added.","These few, of course, included Ling Jing’s sidekick, Ah Hao.","Not long ago, they had noticed that Yun Xiaoxiao had gone missing.","When they asked around, no one had seen her.","It was Mu Yang who remembered that when they had rushed from the Tang brothers’ place to Jianghuai’s side earlier, Yun Xiaoxiao’s emotions had been off, and her location had been strange.","At the time, the situation was urgent, so he hadn’t thought much of it.","But after Yun Xiaoxiao disappeared, he began to wonder if there was a connection between the two.","That’s why Lu Chen and the others had come here to try their luck.","Unexpectedly, Yun Xiaoxiao had indeed come this way.","Xiao Feng had been using his ability to light the way the entire time, and they had followed Yun Xiaoxiao’s footprints.","But the footprints disappeared at the entrance to the subway station.","There were also some bits of dirt and metal shavings nearby, and the barrier was made of ice. The group immediately knew it was Yun Xiaoxiao’s doing.","They hurriedly broke through the ice barrier.","“By the way, kid, why did you come here alone?”","Nie Yizhou looked around, completely baffled as to why Yun Xiaoxiao had run into the subway station.","Yun Xiaoxiao was surprised by their sudden appearance.","Although she had gotten to know them after the apocalypse,","and they got along quite well,","she was still used to acting alone.","Even with her big brother, she wasn’t as clingy as she had been at the beginning of her past life.","In her past life, after he passed away, she had developed the habit of going solo.","Seeing them appear here so suddenly, aside from being shocked, she also felt a twinge of emotion.","Actually, this wasn’t so bad.","She had family now.","She unconsciously curled the corners of her lips.","Remembering the matter at hand, she quickly said, “Big Beauty is missing. I came to look for it.”","“Uh, Big Beauty is... your big tiger?” Nie Yizhou twitched the corner of his mouth.","He really couldn’t get behind the kid’s naming skills.","Little Cutie, Big Beauty, Little Flower—what kind of names were those?","A complete naming disaster.","Why not just call it Big Black Scorpion, Big Strong Tiger, or Man-Eating Flower? That would’ve been so much better.","Yun Xiaoxiao, who had overheard his thoughts, immediately felt two big black lines forming on her forehead.","Who was the one with bad naming skills here?!","Just as Yun Xiaoxiao was about to speak, a strange noise suddenly came from behind her.","“Something’s coming.”","Lu Chen stared ahead, his voice cold.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others immediately turned to look.","The flashlight beams illuminated the empty passage ahead.","Suddenly, a zombie, almost entirely stripped down to its bones, charged out of the shadows.","The little flesh left on its body hung loosely from its bones, its stomach completely hollow, allowing them to see right through to its back.","Behind it, several more zombies came rushing forward, baring their teeth.","The common trait among these zombies was that they were covered in mold.","Black and foul-smelling, they reeked even worse than regular zombies.","“Damn, dude, you need a bath!”","Nie Yizhou swung his blade at the zombie in front of him.","He fought while complaining.","“It must be from the heavy rain earlier. The water flowed in here and didn’t drain in time, so the zombies inside grew mold.”","Ling Jing elegantly plunged a blade into a zombie’s head.","With practiced ease, he twisted the handle and pulled out a crystal core.","He wondered what color the core in his own head would be.","Aside from being smelly, this wave of zombies had no other notable traits.","Yun Xiaoxiao and the others quickly dealt with them.","To prevent any zombies from escaping after they left, Nie Yizhou reinforced the barrier with two additional layers.","Once that was done, the group moved forward.","Big Beauty’s paw prints had been partially destroyed by the earlier wave of zombies, but they could still make out the general direction it had gone.","Inside the subway station, it was pitch black and eerily quiet, with no signs of movement.","Xiao Feng, impatient, conjured a flame and lit up the entire hall.","The once bustling, bright, and clean hall was now covered in grime and dust.","The walls bore dried bloodstains in the shape of handprints, dragged from top to bottom.","The thickness of the prints showed just how desperately those people had clung to life in their final moments.","Unfortunately, the cruel reality had offered them no hope.","Warning signs lay covered in dust, toppled over and scattered haphazardly.","On the ground, there were occasional remnants of limbs and torn clothing.","The entire space was suffocating to behold.","However, there wasn’t a single zombie in the hall.","It seemed the earlier wave had been the last of them here.","Some must have escaped before the entrance was sealed, while others had likely made their way down to the subway platform.","Yun Xiaoxiao kept searching for Big Beauty’s paw prints.","Judging by the direction of the prints, it had run toward the ticket gates, likely heading to the lower levels.","Once they had their bearings, the group hurried downward.","The subway platform was equally horrifying, with dried bloodstains everywhere.","On one side, there was no train, just an empty tunnel.","On the other side was... a subway car packed with zombies!","As Yun Xiaoxiao’s flashlight beam swept over it, countless zombie faces pressed against the windows, mouths wide open, screaming madly.","Their scarred faces were more terrifying than ghosts at midnight.","They shoved themselves against the windows, their already twisted faces contorting even further.","One zombie’s face was squeezed so hard by the others behind it that half of its face was torn off and stuck to the glass.","All that remained was a blur of rotting flesh and bone.","It was truly nauseating to look at.","Of course, there was something even more disgusting.","In the next car over, another zombie had its left eye popped out by the pressure from the zombies behind it.","Black fluid oozed down the window.","“Oh man, even though I’m used to seeing gross stuff by now, I didn’t think it could get worse! Good thing I didn’t eat much earlier, or I’d be puking everything out right now.”","Nie Yizhou shuddered and pretended to gag.","“If you’re gonna puke, stay away from me. You’re grosser than they are.”","Xiao Feng took two steps back, disgusted.","“Hey, I’ll puke if I want to. What’s it to you?”","The more Xiao Feng retreated, the closer Nie Yizhou got to him."]}]);
